śāntiricchāhvayā (....)vati śivapurāṇoktaḥ bhagavata icchāśaktirūpayā bhagavatyā hai(...)vatyāsahitatvenānantakalyāṇa(-)
guṇanidhitvena ca <l3.> bhagavantamanusandhānaṃ sakṛdamanaskasaṃkīrtanenāpi duritanikarabhañjanārthaṃ pa(....)paśca(...)laḥ śiva iti 
