tatra pañcākṣarī tasyāṃ śiva ityakṣaradvayamityādiśrutipurāṇābhiyuktasūktisamarthitasa<l5.>kaladuritasaṃharaṇasāmarthyotkarṣeṇa 
nāmnā viśeṣyaṃ nirdiśati śivamiti| dhotoricchā yatna ityasminarthe varṇavyatya(.....)śāderākṛtigaṇatvāt śivaḥ 
kalyāṇaguṇanikaro<l6.>tyasminnarthe ca pratyayāntatvena ca vyutpannaṃ śabdarūpamityanusandheyaṃ tathāhyādye vyutpādane śabdā(-)
bhiyuktavacanaṃ hiṃsi(-)dhātoḥ siṃhaśabdo vaśa(-)kāntau śivasmṛtaḥ| varṇa<l7.>vyatyayataḥ siddhau paśyakaḥ kaśyapo yathā iti| 
dvitīye vāyavīyavacanam| athavānantakalyāṇaguṇaikaghana īśvaraḥ| śiva ityucyate sadbhi(dbhiḥ) jīvatatvārthavedibhiḥ ityevaṃ 
samedha<l8.>yati yannityaṃ samarthānāmupakramam| śivamicchanmanuṣyāṇāṃ tasmāddevaḥ śivasmṛtaḥ| ityādibhāratādivacanasiddhāni 
vyutpannāpīha vivakṣitāni draṣṭavyāni| vāvakṣānusārāllaukikaśa<l9.>bdānāṃ yuktamanekārthaparatvam| prasannavadanaṃ 
cāruhārakeyūrabhūṣitamityādidhyānaguṇavidhimanusṛtya viśeṣayati manojñeti niveśya cetaḥ pratyagamāpādāgramanukramāt| 
dhārayedva<p12a., f6b., l1.>nāmbhoje prasannasmitakomala iti guṇavidhimanusṛtya viśeṣayati mandasmiteti| 
iṣyamāṇaśivamahimabodhasiddhaye gurumūrtyātmanānusandhatte sarveti sarveṣāmapi <l2.> śivajñānavatāṃ gurūṇāṃ 
guruparamparāviśrāntibhramimityarthaḥ| uktaṃ hi pātatañjale| īśvaraṃ prastutya sa pūrveṣāmapi guruḥ kāle nānāvacchedāditi uktaṃ ca 
śivapurāṇe| pratisargaṃ prasūtānāṃ brahmaṇāṃ <l3.> śāstravistaram| upadeṣṭā sa evādau kālāvacchedavartinām| kālāvacchedayuktā 
tāṃ guṇāmapyasau guruḥ| sarveṣāmeva sarveśaḥ kālāvacchedavarjita iti| īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ sa evādiguru<l4.>rbudhaḥ| tasya 
śiṣyā mahānviṣṇuḥ sarvajñānamahodadhiriti ca śvetāśvataraśākhināṃ mantropaniṣadi ca| yo brahmāṇaṃ vidadhāti pūrvaṃ yo vai vedāṃśca 
prahiṇoti tasmai| iti yadyapyayaṃ <l5.> mantraḥ śivaparaspaṣṭaṃ na pratīyate| tathāpi mantropaniṣadaḥ kārtsnyena śivaparatvasya 
vyavasthāpayiṣyamāṇatvāt| kaurme nivedayitaścātmānaṃ yo brahmāṇamitīśvaraḥ iti śivapūjāyāmā<l6.>(...)rpaṇe viniyojanāt 
yo'gre māṃ vidadhe putraṃ jñānaṃ ca prahiṇoti me| yatprasādānmayā prapataṃ prājāpatyamidaṃ padam| brahmāṇaṃ munayaḥ pūrvaṃ sṛṣṭvā tasmai 
maheśvaraḥ| <l7.> dattavānakhilānetānviprā ātmani saṃsthitān| ityādi śaivamātsyādiśruta(-)brahmādivacanairupabrahmaṇāccāsyāḥ 
śivaparatvaṃ bodhyam| uktamevārthaṃ tattanmahānubhāva(-)śiṣyaviśeṣopanyā<l8.>sena sphuṭīkaroti śrīkāntetyādinā śrīkāntādaya(-)
śrivajñānina upadeṣṭāraḥ prasiddhāḥ| mahābhāratakaurma(-)śaivasauraskāndalaiṅgyaśivadharmādiṣu ādiśabdena 
svāyambhuvavāyava<l9.>siṣṭhaparāśaravyāsajaiminika(....)pādayo (....) mukti(-)cihnena viśeṣayati| cinmudreti| pāṇirnalina(-)
mivetyupamitasamāsaḥ| cinmudrā(...)na <p12b. f7a/3a., l1.> (…)sambandhasya rūpa(...........)tte(.....)dhyāyāt| 
atra ktvāntetyādinā viśeṣaṇena stotreṇa vyavasthāpayiṣyamāṇaṃ śivasya viśvādhikatvaviśvasevyatvo(-) <l2.>karmatvaṃ 
draṣṭavyam| evaṃ(............)sthāpayiṣyamāṇa(...)lārthapramāṇabhūtāṃ paravidyānusandhatte||1||

paraśivaparotkarṣī prakhyānaikaparāpaṇāpavanatapana<l3.>(....)dyutkarairu(...........) ta(......)rthanibandhanā yajati 
nitarāmādyā vidyātmanasya hi (.....)|| mūrtitrayātīto māyī śivamaparaḥ śivaḥ 
tadīyaniratiśayotkarṣapra<l4.>khyāyanaikaprava(.......) noktirvāyusuhitā mahāpurāṇa(ṇā)nāmupalakṣaṇaṃ 
tapanoktirādityapurāṇamupapurāṇānāmupalakṣaṇaṃ vyāsoktirmahābhārataṃ ādiśabdena <l5.> smṛtikalpasūtraśivāgamānāṃ 
praṇetārāmanuyājñavalkyabodhāyano'śvalāyanopamanyukumbhasambhavādayo gṛhyante| tathā ca sakalapurāṇetihāsa(-)
smṛtikalpasūtra<l6.>śivāgame upabrahmitā eta eva śabdasvārasyopabrahmaṇābhyāmananyathāsiddhatayānyathānayaneyatamā nānāḥ 
vaidikānāṃ hṛdayasaṅkulitārthasandarbhā sanmārgopa<l7.>deśo sakalajanahitāvahā paravidyātharvaśikhādirūpāle(lo)ke sarvotkarṣeṇa 
pracaratvityarthaḥ| anena stotreṇa vyavasthāpayiṣyamāṇaṃ sarvaṃ śrutimacalaṃ vyaiva vyavasthāpa<l8.>yiṣyate| śrutivākyānāṃ ca kudraṣṭuṃ 
nītārthāntaraparatvanirāsaḥ śabdasvārasyodāhṛtī te vāpabrahmaṇavirodhābhyāṃ kariṣyata iti sūcitam| atha yamādityo na 
vedetyādiśravaṇā<l9.>damarairapyaparicchedyavaibhavasya para(-)brahmaṇastutau svasyānadhikāra ityākṣipya samādhatte||2||

prabhāvaṃ tenālaṃ paraśivaparīcchettumamarānara stotuṃ <p13a., f7b/3b., l1.> vāñchā na kathamapahāsva tvamayata| tathāpi 
tvannāmasmṛtiguṇanikā puṇyabhajanaṃ kuto'pyastu durāditi matiriha prerayati mām|| ātmīpyavaidagdhyasphuṭīkaraṇāya neyaṃ 
śivastotranirmāṇe pravṛttiḥ| yo na brahmādibhi<l2.>rapyaparicchedya vaibhave tatra mandānāṃ matiskhalatyasyā varjanīyatve 
nāvaśyamapahāsyatā bhavediti tatparihārāya yadi tavyaṃ syāt| kiṃtu saṃsāracakre paribhramatāṃ vividhadurvyāpāravikṣiptacetasāṃ 
<l3.> vinā kiñcha(ñchid) dvāraṃ śiva tannāmacintanānuvṛtti(ttiḥ) durlabheti| yena kenāpyupāyena śivacittaṃ 
niveśayedityādismṛteryathākathañcana śivacintanatannāmasaṅkīrtanānuvṛttaye ataḥ sarvathā svahitamityādinyāyama<l4.>nusarato 
na sā doṣāyeti samādhyabhiprāyaḥ| atha stotrapratipādyārthaviṣayaśivotkarṣāsahiṣṇūnāṃ śivanindāvyasanināmavaidikānāṃ 
vimatimupanyasya teṣāṃ sadbhirbahiṣkā<l5.>ryatvaṃ karmavaiphalyaṃ ca śāstrasiddhaṃ tāvaddarśayati||3||

