bhavam| purīṣameva <p13b., f8a/4a., l1.> (..)yā tena (..........)rtho darśitaḥ| dvitīyyena gamyo'rthaḥ sa(...)ha 
svayaṃ bādhitatvātteṣāṃ garhitamuktatve paryavasyati| mahābhārate ca darśito<l2.>'yamarthaḥ| dhik teṣāṃ (.....) dhigastu teṣām| 
(...) vasati hṛdaye kumatipathavimokṣato rudra iti| ayamevārtho bhāgavate evaṃ prastutya hasanti yadyācaritaṃ hi <l3.> durbhagā 
iti darśitaḥ| tatra du(.........)bhago(.......)ka kukṣetrotpannā ityarthaḥ| evaṃ sāṃkarya(.....)meva va(.....)nidhāyoktaṃ 
nāgarakhaṇḍa| mā yuktatra kule janma(...)sya śambhuṃ na <l4.> devatamiti| evaṃ (.....)javanatvoktyā (...........) 
hiṣkāryatvameva sūcitam| tacca bahudhā prapañcitaṃ kaurmādiṣu nihata(.......) viphalitamityarthaḥ iha bahiṣkāryatvāt paratra ca 
sarva<l5.>śaivāśiveriti bhāvaḥ| uktamevārtha (......)nyāyenāpi vyavasthāpayati| yaduktiriti| uktaṃ hi bhāgavate 
karṇa(...)vidhāya nirayādyadakalya īśe dharmāvitayasraṇibhi<l6.>ndra(?...)sya māne| chindyāt prasahyaruśatī setāṃ 
prabhuśce(...)hvāmasūnapi tato visṛjetsadharma iti| asyārthaḥ dharmagoptarīśe niraṅkuśairlambitamaryādairnarādhamai<l7.>rdūṣyamāṇeya 
yai(e)kasyāpi dūṣaṇavākyasya śravaṇaṃ na bhavati tathā karṇau pidhāya satvaraṃ nirgacchet| tannigrahe yadyaśaktaḥ 
śaktaścetteṣāmasatā dūṣaṇaniratānāṃ prasa<l8.>hya bhindyāt| buddhipūrvaśivadūṣaṇaśravaṇaśīlastu prāṇānapi visṛjet sa ca 
prāṇatyāgaḥ surāpānādinimittaprāṇatyāgavaddharma eveti| evaṃ śivadūṣaṇaśrotrāṇāṃ maraṇāntaprāya<l9.>ścittamiti sthite svayaṃ 
śivadūṣaṇaratānāṃ prāyaścittaṃ na saṃbhavatīti te sarvadhā(dā) sadbhirbahiṣkāryāḥ viphala(-)jīvitāśceti kiṃ vaktavyam uktaśca 
spaṣṭaḥ kaurme| brahmahatyādisakala<p14a., f8b/ 4b.,l1.>pāpaprāyaścittavidhānaprakaraṇe devatāntaraṃ 
nindāprāyaścittavidhānānantaraṃ śivanindāyāḥ prāyaścittābhāvaḥ|

yaḥ sarvabhūtavanitaṃ viśveśaṃ tu vinindati|
na tasya niṣkṛtiḥ śakyā kartuṃ varṣaśatairapi|| <l2.>

yadyapyanayā bhaṅgyā śivadūṣaṇe maraṇāntameva prāyaścittaṃ sūcitaṃ bhavati| kāmato brāhmaṇavadhe niṣkṛtiṃ na vidhīyata ityādau 
maraṇāntaprāyaścittaviṣayeṣu smartṝṇāṃ <l3.> niṣkṛtyabhāva(-)vyavahāradarśanāt| tathā yaddūṣaṇaśravaṇe yat prāyaścittaṃ taddūṣaṇakaraṇe 
tato'dhikanyāyamiti maraṇāntaprāyaścittāsviha kleśātiśayayuktamāpatīti draṣṭavyam| <l4.> yattu kaurva eva śivanindāyāṃ 
prāyaścittāntavidhānam| cāndrāyaṇaṃ caret pūrvaṃ kṛcchraṃ caivātikṛcchrakam| prapannaḥ śaraṇaṃ devaṃ kṛtvā pāpāt pramucyata iti| 
yacca <l5.> (.....) aṣṭamūrtiparvaṇi tacchravaṇe prāyaścittāntaravidhānam| śivanindāparamūrkhaṃ yadi śāsitumakṣamaḥ| 
svakarṇa(...) todayetto(…)<l6.>dakaṃ sarvamadhikāriviśeṣaviṣayatve(...) yathā nyāyaṃ vyavasthāpanīyam||
evamavaidikān bhagavadveṣiṇo mūrkhānvi(....) eṣa hyevā sādhukarma kārayati| ajño 
jantura<l7.>nīśoyamityādiśrutismṛtya(.....)nivacanabhaṅgyā(...)nevopālabhate||4||

varākairetaiḥ kiṃ dvipadapaśubhiḥ kāryamathavā na khalvīṣṭe <l8.>(...)janturnijahatatadanyā cara(....)mī paraśivaya(....)prerayasi yaṃ 
tathā kurvannighanaḥ sa kathamiva nindyaṃ paśupate||  uktamevārthamupapatyā daḍhayati||5|| 
 
<l9.>(...)lokya hyaikaikaṃ śra(......)te śā(....)saṃ nikhilanigama(....)ṣu vaditai| tavaiśvarye tārādhipaśakalacūḍālabhagavan kathaṃ 
kuryurnaite <p14b., f9a/5a., l1.> yadiha na bhaveyuḥ pāvaśāḥ|| śivatatvasya niravadhāraṇatve karmavailakṣaṇyādvā muhyanti 
madabhāgyā iti pratipādayan duravadhāraṇatvaśaṃ(.....)takanyāyena vyavasthāpayati||6|| <l2.>
 
