     mā cājñāsītvatsthitire sutāyāḥ śatamakhaḥ| 
kimanyairvikaṇṭhastavavidhiyutastatra vimatā 
     kathākaiva svāmiṃ jaḍataravarākasya bhavati||

yama(...)(śre)ṣṭvāpi <l3.> vimūḍha iti viśeṣaṇaṃ śatamakhavaikuṇṭhayorapaśriyākaraṇayorapyuttaravākyayoranuṣaṅgaḥ| purā kila 
nārāyaṇanābhinalinasthitaḥ prajāpatiḥ bhuvana<l4.>sṛṣṭyā tantryābhimānavivaśasvānugrahārthamāyāntamaprākṛtāpamahādevaṃ 
dṛṣṭvāpyanavagatatanmahimāvabodhaḥ śrīnārāyaṇopadeśāt kathañcittanmahimānamajñāsīditi <l5.> laiṅgyakaurmasaurādipurāṇeṣu 
śrūyate| indraḥ kadācidantaryāmi balāyattenāsurabhujayena sahāmṛtyairdṛptastaddarpaśamanena tadanugrahāyāvirbhūtaṃ yakṣarūpaṃ <l6.> mahādevaṃ 
dṛṣṭvāpyanpetamohastatkālasannihitayā haimavatyā upadiṣṭaḥ śivamahimānamavaiditi talavakāriṇāmupaniṣadi| 
skāndalaiṅgyaśaivapurāmeṣu copā<l7.>khyāyate| hariḥ kadācana kamalāsanena śraiṣṭhye vivādamānastayostatvodbodhāya madhye 
mahāliṅgarūpeṇa prādurbhūtamanupalabhyamānamūlāgraṃ śivamākalayyāprāpta<l8.>tanmahimavilāsaḥ mahākāruṇikasya 
tasyaivopadeśātsarvātiśāyi tadaiśvaryaṃ vaidhasā saha niracaiṣīditi śaivakaurmādiṣu paṭhyate tadidamupākhyātatrayamiha nibaddham| 
<p15a., f9b/5b., l1.> athavā śivaprasādekalabhyastanmahimaviśvāsaḥ atastadvaidhuryātteṣāṃ tadanudaya ityamumarthaṃ 
nāyamāttetyādimantramanusṛtyāha||7||

tvayi śraddhānāthapravacanabalā(*)nnaiva sulabhā(*) <l2.>
     na medhābāhulyānna ca vividhaśāstreṣu ghaṭanāt| 
prasādādaivaināṃ bhavatavalabhante kṛtinata(-)
     ste durdāntāḥ kathamiva labheran kumatayaḥ||
 
athavā śivabhakternikhilā<l3.>narthanivṛttihetutayā sakalapuruṣārthaprāptihetutayā ca paraśreyo rūpatvāt kṣudreṣvapi śreyaḥ 
subahutaravighnānāṃ janānāṃ devakṛto vighnastatrāvaśyambhāvīti tatpratibandhā<l4.>ttannivartata 
kṣamānekabhavasañcitasukṛtanikarahīnānāṃ tattatphalopadhānaniyataśivamahimaviśvāsānudaya ityāśayenāha||8||

tava śrīpādābje kathamapi ca bhakti(*)rnisu(...*) <l5.>
     hā nihantrī duḥkhānāṃ nikhinapuruṣārthaikā satiḥ| 
vinā(...)ṇḍajanmāntaraśatasahasreṣu vihitai(-)
     rjanaśreyo mātraṃ khalu bahulavighnaṃ na labhate|| 

kathamapi ca <l6.> yatkiñcitphalābhilāṣeṇāpītyarthaḥ yadyapi phaloddeśena deveśa laghurmamasamāśrayaḥ phalārthī tadabhāve māṃ 
parityaktuṃ kṣamo yata iti phaloddeśena <l7.> pravṛttirlaghūkṛtā tathāpi sāpi pratibandhakā hi tasya puṃsaḥ phalasaṃpādanena 
viśvāsātiśayajananadvārā uktarūpāṃ samagracihnāṣṭakopetāṃ sārthakabhaktiṃ <l8.> prasūta iti sāpi durlabhetyuktaṃ 
dadhīcyādiśāpa(-)nirapavādakalidoṣābhāyāṃ (...) teṣāṃ śivotkarṣaviśvāsānudaya ityāha(.......)rtadhvāntā vividhabhavasaṃpa<p15b., 
f6a/10a., l1.>nnasukṛtā yatante boddhuṃ tvāṃ yamaniyama(-)satkarmaniratāḥ| dadhīcā(.....)girīśānusūnu(-)prakṛtayaḥ kṛtvā 
jña(jā)nīyuḥ kalimalinacittāha tadhiyaḥ|| ahiṃsā satyāsteyabrahmacaryā <l2.> parigrahāpamāḥ śaucasantoṣatapasvādhyāye(-)
śvarapradhānidiniyamāḥ anyāni (....) karmāṇi kalidoṣāṇāmapavādakāni evaṃ vidhe kaliyuge doṣāṇāmekaśodhanam| 
mahādevanama<l3.>skāro dhyānaṃ dvāramiti śrutirityādivyāsa(-)vacanapratipāditāni teṣu nirata ityarthaḥ| dadhīciśāpaḥ kaurme 
darśitaḥ| evamuktvā (.......)śāpeśvaravidviṣaḥ| samāgatān brāhmaṇān <l4.>stāndakṣasāhāyyakāriṇaḥ| yasmāt bahiṣkṛtā 
vedāhavadbhiḥ para(.......)vinindito mahādevaḥ śaṅkaro lokavanditaḥ| bhaviṣyadhvaṃ trayī bāṇyāḥ sarvepīśvaravidviṣaḥ| nindanto 
<l5.> hyaiśvaraṃ ma(....)śāstrāsaktamānasāḥ| mithyādhīta(-)samācārā mithyā jñānapralobhinaḥ| prāpya ghoraṃ kaliyugaṃ kalahaiḥ 
kalipīḍitāḥ| tyaktvā tapovanaṃ kṛtsnaṃ gacchadhvaṃ <l6.> narakān punaḥ| bhaviṣyati hṛṣīkeśastvāśra(śri)topi parāṅmukhaḥ iti 
tatraiva kalidoṣakīrtanaprakaraṇe| kurvanti cāvatārāṇi brahmaṇānāṃ kuleṣu vai| dadhīciśāpa<l7.>nirdagdhāḥ purā dakṣādhvare dvijāḥ| 
nindanti ca mahādevaṃ tamasāviṣṭacetasa iti tānevā(-)bhipretya saurapurāṇe paṭhyate| puruṣottamamśra(śri)tya śivanindāparā 
dvijāḥ| kalau yuge <l8.> bhaviṣyanti trātā teṣāṃ na mādhavaḥ iti skānde śaṅkarasaṃhitāyāṃ śivapūjāprakaraṇe nekṣeta(-)
pūjāvelāyāntaraṃ vatsa bahiṣkṛtamityuktvā ko'sau bahiṣkṛta iti jijñāsā<p16a., f6b/10b., l1.>yāmuktaḥ| 
dadhīcinā gautamamunaye śaptā brāhmaṇādhamāḥ| kalāvavatariṣyanti nindakāste bahiṣkṛtāḥ| ityevaṃ skāndādipratipāditā 
bhṛgvādiśāpā api draṣṭavyāḥ| danusūnviti tamoguṇānviṣṭatayā kalidoṣā<l2.>pavādakāni karmāṇyanādīyamāṇā ityarthaḥ 
kalīti kalau rudro mahādevo devānāmīśvaraḥ paraḥ| na devatā bhave nṝṇāṃ daivatānāṃ ca daivatam iti kalidoṣapratipādanāt 
tadāpāditamohāndhīkṛtā ityarthaḥ| <l3.> nanu kimevaṃ sarvātmanā śiva(-)mahimni viśvāsastadanuguṇabhaktyārādhanaṃ 
taducitaphalalābhaśca kasyāpi nāsti asti bhagavato nārāyaṇasyeti vadan parisaṃkhyayā śivamahimaviśvāsādīnāḥ 
ti(ati)viralatvaṃ <l4.> sūcayati||10||

