ityādikamuktamevaṃ śaiva<l2.>liṅgādipratipāditamapi draṣṭavyam|| atha śivasya viśvādhikatvavyavasthāpanāya tadupādhiṃ 
tatprayuktaguṇādikaṃ ca didarśayiṣurupādhivinirmuktaṃ tātvikaṃ tāvadrūpamāha||11||

anantaṃ yat <l3.> prāhurniratiśayasaccitsukhavapuḥ parābhūtadvaitaprakaraviśadaṃ pratyaguditam| akhaṇḍārthairvedyaṃ 
vacananikarairaupaniṣadairmahādevajyotistadasi paramātmeti viditam|| vividhā(-)stāvadvedā<l4.>ntāḥ paraṃ brahmapratipādayanti 
kecitpadārthaniṣṭhāḥ yathā satyaṃ jñanamanantaṃ brahmā sthūlamanaṇvityādayaḥ tatpadārthaniṣṭhāḥ yo'yaṃ vijñānamaya ityādayastvaṃ 
padārthaniṣṭhāḥ| <l5.> kecit padārthaniṣṭhā bhedaniṣṭhā mahāvākyarūpā yathā tatvamasyahaṃ brahmāsmī ayamātmā brahmā prajñinaṃ 
brahmetyādayastadī(di)ti manusṛtya tvaṃpadārthaḥ pratyagityanena darśitaḥ| <l6.> tenātmā(-)bhimānaviṣayeṣu dehendriyādiṣvidantayā 
bahirbhāvamāpādyamāneṣu prātilomyenāntarmukhatayā gacchatīva cittavṛttestadā(-)gamanāditi niṣkṛṣṭāhaṃkāro jīva <l7.> ucyate| 
avaśiṣṭaviśeṣaṇai(-)statpadāke darśitaḥ| tatrāpi saccitsukhavapurātmānantamiti viśeṣaṇairānandādayaḥ pradhānasyeti sūtre 
upasaṃhartavyatvena <l8.> pratipāditānāṃ pañcānāmupasaṃhāro darśitaḥ| parābhūtetyādinā akṣaradhiyām ityādisūtre upasaṃhartavyatvena 
nirṇītānāmasthūlatvādīnāmiti vivekaḥ|| <p17b., f8a/12a., l1.> upasaṃhāraścai(...)ṣāṃ 
niṣprapañcabrahmapratipatyatvāpatayeti nipuṇataramupapāditamācāryaiḥ| anye pipāsanārthamiti manyante| pratya(....)rūpaṃ jyotiriti 
<l2.> sāmānādhikaraṇyena mahāvākyārtho darśitaḥ| niṣprapañca(...)māsu sargaparaiḥ pramāṇaiḥ sidhyedityata uttamakhaṇḍā cairthariti| 
evaṃbhūtasyāpi brahmaṇo lokānugrahaikarasikatayā <l3.> kalpitaguṇādivibhāgamayopādhikaṃ sarvottaraṃ saguṇaṃ rūpaṃ nirūpayati||
