ivakāreṇa guṇānāṃ kalpitatvena tatvā<l5.>nupraveśābhāvaṃ dyotayati| ita eva nāmarūpasaṃbandhasyāpi kalpitatvalābha iti na 
pṛthak taduktiḥ sārvajñādiraṅgasaṃjñai jñānavairāgyādibhi(-)ravyaya<l6.>saṃjñairaiśvaryādibhirbhagasaṃjñairanyaiśca satyakāmādibhirguṇairalaṅkṛta 
ityarthaḥ nirguṇasyāpi guṇānāmupapādakamupādhimāha| māyeti citpratibimbopādhi<l7.>bhūtayā vidyātmikayā māyayā 
bimbasthānīyatvenāpahitaḥ vimalasatvapradhānenāvidyopādhibhinnayāmāya yā pratibimbabhāvenopahita iti vārthaḥ śiveti 
tadguṇa<l8.>saṃjñānena śrutismṛtipurāṇakośādiprasiddhāni sarvāṇi śambhorabhidhānāni gṛhyante| yadvā 
śivādibhiraṣṭābhirbhavādibhiścetyarthaḥ| yadyapyanyānyapi śambhuśaṅkarādīni bhagavataḥ paraḥ <p18a., f8b/12b., l1.> 
śatāni santi nāmāni tathāpi|

