rahasyaṃ sarvaśāstrebhyaḥ sārabhūtaṃ (*)samuddhṛtam||(*) <l2.>

ityādinā rahasyāmaiṣu śivadināmāṣṭakasya vaiśiṣṭyapratipādanāt| bhavādināmāṣṭakasya cāpastambīyānāṃ mantreṣvātmā 
nādāpastambasūtre īśānabalau bodhāyanāśvalāyanasūtrayoḥ <l3.> śūlagavihomabodha(.....)sūtre mahādevasya pratiṣṭhāvidhau 
nityapūjāvidhau pradoṣapūjāvidhau ca homatarpaṇārcanādiṣu viniyogavarṇane ca vaiśiṣṭyāvagamāt prādhānyamabhipretya viśiṣya <l4.> 
grahaṇam| atra kecit guṇamūrtibhyaḥ paraṃ sakala(-)kāraṇabhūtaṃ tatvāntaraṃ necchanti| anye tu māyāmātropahitaḥ śarīraṃ 
śārīrakasūtravyavahṛtaparabrahmādiśabdā mātṛvācyaṃ taditi manyante|| <l5.> tadubhadṛṣṭyo māsā hityamuktarūpavigrahagrahaṇaṃ 
śivabhavādiśabda(-)vācyatvaṃ ca trimūrtyantargatasya guṇarudrasyeveti tenaiva rūpeṇa stotrapratipādyaṃ brahmanirduṣṭamiti syānmatiḥ 
<l6.> tadarthaṃ viśeṣayati sa harihareti| ayamāśayaḥ brahmopaniṣadi tāvat athāsya puruṣasya catvāri sthānāni bhavanti| 
nābhirhṛdayaṃ kaṇṭhaḥ mūrdhā tatra catuṣpādaṃ brahma vibhāti jāgarite brahmā svapte <l7.> viṣṇuḥ suṣuptiḥ| rudraḥ 
turīyamakṣa(....)āditye(?) viṣṭapaśceśvaraśceti brahmādibhyaḥ paramakṣaraśabditaṃ sarvadevātmakaṃ tatvāntaraṃ darśitam| tasyaiva (.....) 
tatra devā ṛṣayaḥ pitaraṃ īśata <l8.> ityananyeśvaratvam eko devaḥ sarvabhūteṣu bhramaraḥ ityādinā sarvāntaryāmitvaṃ 
sakalakarmaphalapradatvaṃ ca darśitaṃ ta(...)pa/va nīyopaniṣadi(?) ca a(.....)(kāraṃ) brahmāṇaṃ  nābhau, ukāraṃ viṣṇuṃ hṛdaye, 
<l9.> makāraṃ rudraṃ bhrūmadhaya iti nābhihṛdayabhrūmadhyeṣu akārādimātrātrayavācyānāṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāmupāsanāvidhi(...-)
nantara(.....)sarveśvara(.......).samaṣṭipramāṇavācyaṃ <p18b., f9a/ 13a., l1.> dvādaśāntopāsyaṃ sarvaiśvaryaśālitebhyaḥ 
paraṃ tatvāntaraṃ darśitam| (…..)(kaivalyo)yopaniṣadi namo vā idamekatra (......)re(.......)me prayātyetadvai rajaso 
rūpamityādinā tamo'dhiṣṭhā<l2.>tumaparasya saṅkalpenāvidyākhyasya tamaso guṇavibhāgaṃ nirūpya tasya proktā 
a(.....)stāvo brahmāviṣṇurityadha(yāda)yo ha(....)lyuvā vāsya rājasāsoṃ'śo sa yo'yaṃ brahmātha yo ha khalu vā 
vāsyatāma<l3.>(...)sāṃśo'sau sa yo'yaṃ rudro'tha (.....) vā vāsya sātvikoṃśo sarva so'yaṃ viṣṇuriti tamo'dhiṣṭhātuḥ 
parasya rajoguṇādyupahitā aṃśabhedāt brahmādaya iti pratipādanena tebhyaḥ <l4.> paraṃ tatvāntaraṃspaṣṭīkṛtam| yogayājñyavalko 
praṇavatanmātradaivatanirūpaṇe| akṣaratrayametattu kāratrayamiṣyate| trayāṇāṃ kāraṇaṃ brahmabhā(bhāga)rūpaṃ sarvakāraṇam| ekākṣaraṃ 
<l5.>paraṃ jyotistadāhuḥ praṇavaṃ budhāḥ| iti mātrāmayadevatābhyo'haṃ brahmā ca śarvaśca jagataḥ 
kāraṇatrayamityādibhāgavatādipaṭhitabhagavadvacanādibhiḥ kāraṇatrayamiti prasiddhebhyaḥ <l6.> guṇamūrtibhyaḥ paraṃ praṇavadaivatatvāntaraṃ 
sphuṭīkṛtam| bhāgavataviṣṇupurāṇādiṣu ca satvaṃ rajastama iti prakṛterguṇāstairyuktaḥ paraḥ puruṣa eva ihāsya dhatte(?)| sthityādayo 
<l7.> hariviriñca hareti saṃjñāṃ (....)yāṃsi tatra khalu satvādinā nṝṇāṃ svayaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivā brahman pradhānā brahmaśaktaya 
ityādivacanairmūrtitrayātītaṃ paraṃ brahmavibhāvitam| api ca jagatkāra<l8.>ṇaṃ brahma tāvanmāyopāyacaitanyamityavivādaṃ 
brahmaviṣṇurudrāstu tadīyaguṇaviśeṣopādhicaitanyarūpā ityudāhṛtamaitreyopaniṣadvākye saiṣā citrāsu dṛḍā(ḍhā)<p19a., 
f9b/13b., l1.> bahvaṅkurāsva(ssva)yaṃ guṇabhinnāṅkureṣvapi guṇabhinnā sarvatra brahmaviṣṇuśivarūpiṇīti 
tāpanīyopaniṣadisakalapurāṇādiṣu cāvivādena pratipannaṃ tataścopādhibhede upahitabhedasyauci<l2.>tyāt guṇamūrtibhyaḥ 
paramāyopādhikaṃ jagatkāraṇaṃ brahmeti vajralepāyate tasya comāsāhityamuktarūpaṃ vapuśca umāsahāyaṃ paraṃ parameśvaraṃ prabhuṃ ṛtaṃ satyaṃ 
paraṃ brahmetyādikai<l3.>valyopaniṣadādimantrebhyaḥ pratipannaṃ śivaśambhurudreśānamaheśvaramahādevadiśabdavācyatvaṃ cātharvaśikhādidṛṣṭa(-)
prayoganirvacanābhyāṃ nirṇītam| na codāhṛtopaniṣanni<l4.>kurumbapratipādyo guṇi rudra iti śaṅkanīyam| tatra sarvatrāpi 
tadvibhūtiṣu brahmanārāyaṇayoriva guṇi rudrasyāpi pāṭhāt na ca tatra vibhūtimadhyā(-)mnātarudraparaśabdo 
guṇiru<l5.>drāṃśabhūtarudrāntaraparo'stviti vācyam| brahmaviṣṇusannidhyāmnātarudraśabdasya saṃhāramūlarudraparatvasyaucityāt prāyeṇa 
śrūyate| yacca tattādṛgavagamyata <l6.> iti nyāyāt| nanu tathāpi kaivalyādimantrāṇāṃ (....) sadā 
paratvādāropitavigraheṇāpi upāsanopapatteḥ na parasya varṇitavigrahasiddhiriti cet upāsanāpare<l7.>bhyopyavirodhe 
devatādhikaraṇanyāyena pratīyamānārthavadheranivāryatvāt na cāpāṇipādamiti śrutivirodho'stīti śaṅkanīyam| evaṃ hi 
nirguṇaśrutiviro<l8.>dhāt satvakāmādiguṇānnāmapyata(.......)pagaḥ| iṣṭa(.......)ta vadatāṃ yathā ca cepi 
satyakarmādiguṇopadeśe tadguṇa īśvaraḥ prasidhyatīti <p19b., f10a/14a., l1.> 
vyatihārādhikaraṇabhāṣyavirodha(...)māyā(......)tatva te(...........)ghnantīti samādhānanyāyastvihāpi tūhyam| yattu 
(....)popanyāsācceti sūtre viro(....)panyāsaparatvena <l2.> sūtravyākhyānānantaraṃ brahmaṇo vigrahābhāvāt tadavyākhyānamayuktaṃ 
martya(...)nāṃ pareṣāmanyathāvyākhyānamupanyastaṃ bhāṣyakāraiḥ tanmuṇḍakaśruta(....)viśeṣaparabrahma(-)paropakramavirodhānna 
<l3.>vigrahopanyāsamasaṃgacchata ityabhiprāyeṇa uktaṃ ca tairevānyatra vigrahasadbhāvasyāt (ssyāt) parameśvara(-)syāpīcchāvaśāt 
māyāmayaṃ rūpaṃ sādhakānugraha(....)sūtrakāreṇa <l4.> ca bhogamātrasāmyaliṅgā cetyahaṃ grahopasakānāṃ brahmaṇaśca bhogasāmyaṃ 
vadatā sphuṭīkṛtaṃ śarīrasāpekṣe vaiṣayikānande bhogaśabdaprasiddheḥ nanvasati <l5.> 
mānāntaravirodhe'nyaparaśabdebhyo'kṣarārthasiddhinastu iha viriñcādivigrahatrayavyatirekeṇa brahmaṇaścirantanaturīyavigrahābhyupagame 
śrutyantaravirodhaḥ maitreyopani<l6.>ṣadi māyopādhikaṃ paraṃ brahma prastutya tasya proktā agryāstanavo brahmārudro viṣṇuriti 
paravigrahāṇāṃ madhye viriñcādivigrahatrayasyaivāgryatvaśravaṇāt yadiha <l7.> tato'pi prācīnaṃ mūrtyanantaraṃ syāt brahmaṇaḥ kathaṃ 
teṣāmagryatvaṃ bhavet agre bhavāhyagryā ucyante ato brahmādimūrtitrayātirekeṇa na parasya turīyāmūrtirasti 
tadavalambane<l8.>naiva ca vṛddhānāṃ brahmaṇo vigrahavatvavyavahāra ityavasīyate| amumevārthamupodbalayantyatritapaścaryāyāṃ 
bhāgavatavacanāni tatra hyatrestapaścaryāṃ prastu<p20a., f10b/14b., l1.>tya śaraṇaṃ taṃ prapadye'haṃ ya eva jagadīśvaraḥ| 
prajāmātmasamāṃ mahyaṃ prapacchatviti cintayan| iti bhagavān tasya phalābhisandhiṃ coktvātha cirādvarapradānāya 
brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ trayāṇāṃ tatra sannidhāne <l2.> sati stutipraṇāmā(-)dyupacārādanantaraṃ tān pratyatre(mre) 
rejomayehavidhapradhānaścitte kṛtaḥ prajananāya kathaṃ nu yūyamatrāgatāsmanubhṛtāmanaso'pi dūrābrūta prasīdata mahāniha vismarapāti 
<l3.> iti praśne yathā kṛtaste saṅkalpo bhāvyaṃ tenaiva nānyathā sat saṅkalpasya  te brahman yadvai dhyāyasi te vayamiti 
teṣāṃ prativacanopanyāsena viriñcādimūrtitrayātirekeṇa <l4.> parasya sarvaiśvaryābhivyaktisthānabhūtaṃ turīyamamūrtyantaraṃ nāstīti 
vyakti(ktī)kṛtaṃ tat satve tenaiva rūpeṇa parasya tatra prādurbhāvāpatteḥ anyathā ṛṣeḥ satsaṅkalpatvavirodhāt <l5.> 
gajendramocanasthala iva dhyātṝnmāvagṛhītena rūpeṇa prādurbhāva ityapīha vaktumaśakyatvāt tathāsatyekomayetyādi(-)praśnayogāt 
tasmānna turīyasya vigrahābhyupagamo <l6.> yukta iti| atrābhidhīyate| pratīyate tāvadumāsahāyamityādimantravarṇebhyasturīyā 
umāsahāyatvādiviśiṣṭā mūrtiḥ sāpi na dhyānārthamāropiteti śakyaṃ <l7.> vaktuṃ chāndogye samānaprakaraṇe guṇe (....) 
hāranyāyena upāsyabrahmaṇa udāhṛda(ta)mantravarṇasiddhavatkāreṇa eṣa ātmā pa(....)pāpmetyādīnā<l8.> śarīravatve sāmānyena 
prasaktānāṃ jarāmaraṇajīvita sāpi pāsā(śā)dīnāṃ pratiṣedhadarśanāt anyathā neṣṭāma prasaktaḥ pratiṣedha(.......) na ca mūrtatva 
va jaratvā<p20b., f11a/15a., l1.>dayo'pi (.........) ropitā evetyupa(......)ityapi tatraivāsmin kāmāḥ 
samāhitā ityādiguṇatvasphuṭīkara(......) <l2.> nanvajaratvāno'nugrahaṇatvenopāsyam eṣa ātmāpahatapāpme(-)
tyādinātmaguṇatvokteḥ tadguṇaiḥ satya(mya)(.......)prasaktyabhāve'pi <l3.> svatassiddhā jaratvādyastyeveti 
tadevopāsyatvena nirguṇa(...)ṇāt śrutā jaratvādi sadā ti(tī)rthyā(kṣyā)dā vā nṛdhājādi niṣedhavacca stutya(...)tvena vā 
(............)iti cet na| sarva<l4.>vedāntapratyayanyāyena tatra sa vigrahasyaiva brahmaṇa upāsyatve sthite 
aucityāttasyopari śivaṃ dhyāyet samba sarvamanoharaṃ sarvalakṣaṇa<l5.>sampannaṃ gāḍhayauvanaśobhitamityādyupabrahmiṇānurodhācca 
ajatvāde(-)rvigrahaguṇatvenaivānvayāt tathātve'pi tadvārātmaguṇatvasaṃbhavena tadvyapa<l6.>deśasya tadguṇaiḥ sahapāṭhasya ca 
buddhimān nītimānvāgmī śrīmānchatrunibarhaṇaḥ vipulāṃ somahā bāhurityādāvivopapatteśca tasmin 
nyadantastadanveṣṭavyami<l7.>tyādinā vidhānāyānūdyamānasya stutyarthatvāyogācca 
tasmādvigrahaguṇasyājaratvādesva(ssva)rūpato vidyamānatvena nirdiśyena pāsyatayā vidhāne nānāropitatvā<l8.>vasāyāt 
dharmiṇo vigrahasyāpyanāropitatā niścīyata itītyupagantavyaiva turīyasyāpi mūrtiruktaṃ ca sūtasaṃhitāyām umā (...) vigrahā 
śuddhā triṇetrā <p21a., f11b/15b., l1.> candreśakharā nīlagrīvā parānandā pramodāttāṇḍavapriyā 
brahmaviṣṇumahādevairupāsyā guṇamūrtibhiḥ sarvamūrtivihīnasya sarvabhūtādhipasya ca brahmaviṣṇu tathāpyeṣā <l2.> parāmūrtirityeteṣā 
śāśvatīśrutiḥ|| iti parāśaropapurāṇe||

sākṣātparatarasyaiva vastunaḥ sarvasākṣiṇaḥ|
asti mūrtiḥ parā śuddhā svatantrā pāpanāśinī||
tasyāsādhāra(*)ṇīmūrtiḥ sāmbā candrārdhaśekharā|(*) <l3.>

ityārabhya brahmaviṣṇumaheśānāstaddhyāyanti nirantaramityantenoktam evaṃ ya eṣo'ntarāditye hiraṇmayaḥ puruṣo dṛśyata iti 
ravibimbamadhyavarti<l4.>tvena prasiddhavanni(...)daśastalavakāriśrutāvatharvaśirasi śrutasya ca brahmaṇo devaiḥ saṃvādasyānupapattiḥ 
ajātamimamevaikamamatvājanmanībhiravaḥ| rudrasyāsya pravadyante <l5.>rakṣārthaṃ dakṣiṇā(-)mukhamiti vāyu(...)tapabrahmita 
itaravyavacchedena janmarāhityapratipādanena sphuṭīkṛta(-)vigrahānāditvatāt paryāvadhīḥ ajāta ityeva kaściddhīraḥ <l6.> 
pradya(pūjya)te rudra yatte dakṣiṇaṃ mukhaṃ tena mā pāhi nityamiti śvetāśvataropaniṣadi mantraśca bhagavato divyavigrahasadbhāve 
pramāṇam eṣāṃ ca turīya(-)vigrahaviṣayatvaṃ <l7.> tatra tatra sphuṭī(.....)| kiṃ ca purāṇe (.....)..tra paramaśivarūpaṇaprakaraṇe 
tasya mūrtimatvena pratipādanādvi(........)ddhiḥ na ca tatra guṇi rudraviṣa<l8.>yake nānyathāsandhiḥ śaṅkārhase (...)ṣvapi 
śivamahi(..........)ṣu purāṇe paraśivasya kāraṇatraye paratvopavarṇanadarśanāt tadatrāpi pinasturīyasya <l9.> 
vyatirekakalpanāyāṃ praṇā(............)thā hi (.........) pūrvabhāge brahmaviṣṇurudrān prastutyena (.......)ro devaḥ 
tasyāsti paramā tanuḥ <l10.> māheśva(...) tvāgini (......)nti dā(......)uttara(......)śaktaṃ sarvaśaktīnāṃ 
brahmaviṣṇuśi(.......) devā(vāḥ) śaktayaḥ (.....) <p21b., f12a/16a., l1.> tmanaḥ (.....) mātmārtha(…..) 
ṇirmaheśvaraḥ|
e(.....)ke vada(.....)ṇamatha(...)re(.....)kapare(....) prāṇā(...) <l2.>(...)ṇāmapare viduḥ (....)gni(...)sarvadevāstadviṣayaḥ 
ekasyaivātha rudrasya bhedāste parikīrtitā| iti śivapurāṇe||
sṛṣṭe pravartako brahmā <l3.> sthi(.............)mo sattārasya (....)rudraḥ tayorni(...)nnayāmakaḥ| tasmāttrayaste 
kathyate jagataḥ kāraṇatrayam| kāraṇatrayahetuśca śivaḥ paramakāraṇamiti skānde|| <l4.> (..........)tatvavibhūtayaḥ eṣāṃ 
trayāṇāmadhikaḥ sarvakāraṇamīśvara iti liṅgasaurapādmagāruḍabrahmāṇḍaśivayamimādiṣvapi vacanāni draṣṭavyāni| <l5.> 
vistaratayā tatra tatra (.........)hariṣya(-)māṇatvāt sarvaikamatyasya sphuṭatvācca neha likhyante| tasmādanekaśrutyādisiddhatvāt 
parabrahmaṇo vigrahavatvasya tadavi<l6.>rodhāya maitrāyaṇaśrutau tanuśabdo rājaśoṃśa ityadivacanasvārasyādaṃśaparo'gryaśabdaḥ sādi 
brahmamūrtyantarāpekṣayāgryatvapara iti vā vyākhyeyam| <l7.> yadvā agryākhyāyāmurasa ityādāvagraśabdasya pradhāne prasiddheḥ| 
pradhāne paramaśivavigrahabhavā iti vyākhyeyam| trimūrtīnāṃ paramaśivavigrahe jananāt yadyapi bhavecchandasītya<l8.>dhikāre 
agrādyaditi yat pratyaya(yaḥ) smṛtaḥ| bhavārthaśca sattā na janma tatra jātaḥ| tatra bhavati pṛthagadhikārāt| namaḥ kāṭyāya ca 
nīpyāya ca namaḥ sūdyāya ca sarasyāya cetyādau <p22a., f12b/16b., l1.> parameśvarasya sadbhāvamātreṇa 
bhavārthapratyayadarśanācca tathāpi nāsato vidyate bhāvati iti smṛteḥ janmasthale sata eva kāryasyotpattiriti jāte'pi halayo 
na <l2.> virudhyate| ūravyā ūrujā iti jāte bhavārthapratyayasyānyatrāpi darśanāt darśitaṃ ca tisṛ(sṝ?)ṇāṃ mūrtīnāṃ 
paramaśivavigrahe jananaṃ śivarāghavasaṃvāde (..........)śāśvato devo <l3.> brahmavandyaḥ sadāśivaṃ trilocano guṇādhāro 
guṇātīto'kṣaro'vyayaḥ jātā sisṛkṣā tasyātha vīkṣyātmasthaṃ guṇatrayaṃ vedatrayamida(daṃ) jñeyaṃ guṇatrayamidaṃ hi yat| pratha<l4.>k 
kṛtyātmastaddhi tatra sāraṃ vibhajya ca| dakṣiṇāṃ dahṛjat(?) putraṃ brahmāṇaṃ vā tau harim| pṛṣṭhadeśe maheśānaṃ trīn putrātasrajat 
prabhuriti| yattu bhāgavatava<l5.>(.......)tadapi(...)maśivamūrteratirahasyatvenālabhyadarśanatayā atreḥ kathañcit 
saṅkalpitārthaprāptaye somādyavatāratrayeṇa prādurbhāvanye <l6.> (.......)pra(......)ti na vi(.....)(rodhaḥ)| 
ala(.....)natvaṃ ca paramaśivamūrte darśitaṃ śivapurāṇe| aprākṛtavapuśrīmān lakṣyalakṣaṇavarjita ityādinā tanmahimavaśe(...) 
<l7.> (...) nupavarṇa(-)tayatā kamalāsanenā hariśca (....) rudraśca tathātye ca surāsurāḥ| tapobhirugrairadyāpi tasya 
darśanakāṅkṣiṇa iti| nabhastvaṃ parasya vigrahasat <l8.> (.......)stathāpi śivabhaktādiśabdamā(.........)bhe dṛṣṭyā 
tatrāpi prayogopapatteḥ na tasya tacchabdakramaṃ śrīkaraṇāyamiti cet na nīla<p22b., f13a/17a., l1.>kaṃ bhūtvā divi 
śiṣṭamūrtiśabalite brahmaṇi teṣāṃ (.....)patteḥ prasiddhatvāt atharvaśikhādiṣu (.....)śvat mahādevādiśabdānāṃ tannāmatvena 
nirvacanācca <l2.> (....)sya śivādiśabdavācyasyāpyabhyu(-)pagantavya(.....)tanu yadyumā hi 
sahāyasmṛ(..........)mūrtiśabalitaḥ śivapareṣu purāṇeṣu vivadhama(....) <l3.> (....)tvena liṅgādiṣu (.........)tve na 
ca pratipādyamānaḥ pariṣastrimūrtyatītaṃ parameva brahma kiṃ nāma rūpastarhi sraṣṭrapālakayo(yoḥ) brahmanārāyaṇayostritīyaḥ saṃhatiḥ| 
kiṃ ca tasya <l4.> (....)pratipa(ba)ndhakaṃ purāṇādi(....)te yadyevaṃ paramaśivasya rūpaṃ (....)ni ca nāmāni tādṛśameva 
tasyāpi rūpaṃ ta(tā)nyeva nāmāni| taduktaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyām| taptāya(yaṃ) piṇḍava<l5.>t vipra rudramūrtiḥ parasya tu| 
mūrtyātulyānyamūrtibhyo lakṣaṇairmunisattamāḥ| paratatvasya nāmāni pratyāsatyā munīśvarāḥ| trimūrtīnāṃ tu rudrasyāpyabhidhānāni 
suvratā iti śiva<l6.>purāṇe'pi saṃhārarudramahātmyaṃ prastutyoktam|
 
sa eṣa bhagavānīśastejorāśiranāmayaḥ|
anādinidhano dhātā bhūtasaṃkocako vibhuḥ||
parameśvaryasaṃyuktaḥ parame<l7.>śvarabhāvitaḥ|
tacchakyaviṣṭhitaḥ śaśvat taccihnairapi cihnitaḥ||
tannāma nāma tadrūpastat kāryakāraṇakṣaṇaḥ|
tattulyavyavahāraśca tadājñā paripālaka||

ityādi yadyapi <l8.> tasyāsādhāraṇyena pratipādakaṃ purāṇavacanaṃ nāsti tathāpi pratyāśatyatiśayāt paramaśivapareṣveva 
purāṇeṣa tatpratipādanaṃ yathānupadamevo<p23a., f13b/17b., l1.>dāhṛda(ta)m| 

śivapurāṇe (–) 
māheśvarapurāṇāni samastāni mahāmune|
asādhāraṇayā mūrtyā nāmnā sādhāraṇena ca||
vadanti paramaṃ tatvaṃ śivaṃ sāmbaṃ trilocanam|
trimūrtīnāṃ (*)haraṃ cāpi tadaṃśaṃ tasya vaibhavam||(*) <l2.>
tadaṃśasyābhimānaṃ ca vadanti ca mahāmune|

iti evamārādhanamapi tasya paramaśivābhivyaktisthāneṣveva liṅgādiṣu evaṃ paramaśivasya guṇirudrasya ca nāma <l3.> 
rūpādisāmyādeva sphuṭaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivābhyāṃ pratyanisatyatiśayāvagamāt viśiṣya paramaśivābhedena guṇirudrasya vyavahāraḥ 
purāṇādiṣu śaivānāṃ ca tatrābhimānātiśayo <l4.> guṇācaritādisādhāraṇyavyapadeśaśca ata eva keṣāñcidadyāpi 
tayorvivekāgrahaḥ| atha purāṇādiprasiddhā suśaivīṣu mūrtīṣu kāḥ paramaśivamūrtayaḥ kāśca <l5.> guṇi rudramūrtayaḥ| kecidāhuḥ 
ānandatāṇḍavavigraho dakṣiṇāmūrtivigrahastāṇḍavaparo mārdhavigrahaśceti vigrahatrayameva paramaśivasya| anye tu 
guṇirudra<l6.>syeti| tanna rocayāmahe|
 
yogayājñavalkye (-)
pṛthivyāṃ vāyumāropya lakāreṇa samanvitam|
dhyāyāścaturbhujākāraṃ brahmāṇaṃ parameṣṭhinam||
dhārayet<l7.> ghaṭikādhāraṇāt siddhimāpnuyāt| 
varuṇo vāyumāropya vakaraṇe samanvitam||
smarannārāyaṇaṃ saumyaṃ caturbāhuṃ kirīṭinam|
śuddhasphaṭika(*)saṃkāśaṃ pītavāsasamacyutam||(*) <l8.>
dhāraye caiva ghaṭikaṃ sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate|
(.......)vā nīlamāropya rekhākṣarasamanvitam||
triyakṣaṃ (*)varadaṃ rudraṃ taruṇādityasannibham|(*) <p23b., f14a/18a., l1.>
bhasmoddhūlya(........)sarvāṅgaṃ suprasannamanu(........)tyādyuktvā 
ākāśe vāyumāropya vikāreṇa samanvitam|
bindurūpaṃ mahādevaṃ vyomākā<l2.>raṃ sadāśivam||
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ bālendukṛtaśekharam|
pañcavaktradharaṃ saumyaṃ daśabāhuṃ trilocanam||
sarvāyudhodyatakaraṃ sarvabhūṣaṇabhūṣitam|
umārdhadehaṃ varadaṃ sarvakāra(*)ṇakāraṇam||(*) <l3.>
cintayancintayānyastaṃ muhūrtamapi dhārayet|

sa eva (...) ityuktastāntrikeṣvapi śikṣitairiti paramaśivasya pañcavaktrasadāśivamūrterapi pratipādanādvā(...)saṃ<l4.>hitāyāṃ 
ca yogeśvarākhyapūjāvidhāne tathaiva tasyāḥ pratipādanāt kūrmapurāṇe ca| nīlalohitakāritabrahmapañcamaśirolavanaprastāve| 

athānupaśyat (*)girīśaṃ maṇḍalāntarasaṃhitam|(*) <l5.>
samāsīnamahādevyā mahādevaṃ sanātanam||

ityādinā ekāsane sthito mā sahāyaśūla(...)ramūrterapi tadīyāyāḥ pratipādanāt| tasmādyathāgamā<l6.>cāryopadeśam anye'pi 
vigrahāḥ paraśivasya pratipattavyāḥ teṣāṃ tu paricchedo'tirahasyatvāt gurūpadeśaikagamyo nātra pradṛśyate| evaṃ 
māyāvapurbrahma<l7.>(-)turīyaṃ viśvakāraṇam| umāsahāyo bhagavānindumauliriti sthitam| na tu mūrtitrayā(-)tītaṃ māyopādhikaṃ 
brahmanārāyaṇa ityapi kebhyaści(-)dvacanebhyo'vasīyate| tathā hi viṣṇupurāṇe <l8.> tāvat| 

brahmadakṣādayaḥ kālamathaivākhilajantavaḥ|
vibhūtayo hareretājagataḥ sṛṣṭihetavaḥ||
viṣṇurmanvādayaḥ kālastathaivākhilajantavaḥ|
sthiternimittabhūtasya viṣṇo(*)retāvibhūtayaḥ||(*) <p24a., f14b/18b., l1.>
rudraḥ kālontakādyāśca samastāścaiva jantavaḥ|
caturthapralayāyai te janārdana vibhūtayaḥ||

ityevaṃ bhāgavatabṛhannāradīyādiṣvapi vacanāni <l2.> kvacit kvacidupalabhyate prapañcasāropakrame ca| trimūrtīnāṃ śeṣaśāyitaḥ 
puruṣottamasya ca praśnottaranibandhanena sphuṭīkṛto'yamarthaḥ| uttaratāpanīye nṛsiṃhasya turīyatvena vyapadeśāt <l3.> 
pūrvatāpanīye brahmaviṣṇurmaheśvaraḥ puruṣīśvaraḥ sarasvatī śrīgaurī prakṛtirvidyetyārabhya sarvaṃ yo vai nṛsihmo devo bhagavānityatra 
sarvaṃ tasmai te nama ityantena brahmādīnāṃ nṛsihma<l4.>vibhūtiṣu pāṭhācca pratyakṣaśrutimūlatāpyasyārthasya pratīyate tathā ca 
kathaṃ turīyaḥ paraśiva iti nirṇayaḥ| atrābhidhīyate| 
pādo vaiśvānarādīnāṃ turīyo nirguṇaśrutaḥ|
uttarasmin tāpa<l5.>nīyena guṇībhyaḥ paro hariḥ pūrvatāpanīyaḥ astu atharvaśikhādyanekaśrutyantaraprasiddham| mamaiva sā 
parāśaktirdevī vidyeti saṃjñiteti śivavacanasiddhavidyābhidhānapāṭhasādeśyaga<l6.>myasambandho mā vallabhasyeśvarasya 
trimūrtibhyo yojayāmi prakṛtya taṃ puruṣaṃ pañcaviṃśakamiti kaurmokteḥ prakṛtyānvitāt pañcaviṃśācca pṛthakparigaṇanena svānumataṃ 
ca śambhostri<l7.>mūrtyatītamāyopahitabirahma(-)rūpatvaṃ pratikṣipaṃ viṣṇostu tathā avidhānakṣamaḥ| atastrimūrtyantargatasyaiva 
vastukṛtasarvākyakhyāpanāya pravṛttassanṛṣīṇāṃ vāsudevo'smīti kṛśṇavacana<l8.>vaktumapi tadvibhūtimadhye gaṇayatīti vā atha 
kai(....)stu tadeva prīto bhavati etairmantraistu (...)(ddha)mityupakramopasaṃhārābhyāṃ stutiparatva(.....)sā yat 
tadavatā(.......)nṛsihme <p24b., f15a/19a., l1.> viriñcanārāyaṇa(........)stutyarthaṃ 
brahmātmatva(........)tītayā netavyam| evaṃ ca (.......) taratvatātparyeṇāpi ca (.......)mūrtitraya<l2.>paratvaṃ 
vyavasthāpayituṃ kṣamante| tathā hi śiva(...)rudraviṣṇuvo sa iva teṣāmapi santi vyūhāḥ agatāṃ haraṇabharaṇasamutpādaneṣvapi 
kṛtāḥ| vāyusaṃhitādiprasiddha(....)ṇo virāṭ <l3.>kālapuruṣākhyāstrayaḥ viṣṇoḥ saṃkarṣaṇā(-)niruddhapratyuttākhyāḥ rudrasya 
haramṛḍabhavākhyāḥ ete ca dakṣamanvantakādivat sṛṣṭyādiṣu vāntarādhikā(.......)ñca viṣṇo(.....)mūrtiparatvavacanāni <l4.> 
svavyūhatrayaparatvaparāṇi upapadyante tadvirūhānāmapi sṛṣṭyādyadhikārasāmānyāt brahmādivyapadeśopapatteḥ|

ekā bhāgavatī mūrtirjñānarūpā śivā malā| 
vāsudevā(*)bhidhānā sā guṇātītā suniṣkalā||(*) <l5.>
dvitīyā rudrasaṃjñā syāttāmasī śeṣasaṃjñitā|
nihanti sakalaṃ cānyā vaiṣṇavī paramā tanuḥ||
sa(...)driktā tri(tṛ)tīyānyā pradyuteta ca saṃjñitā| <l6.>
jagat sthāpayate sarvaṃ sa viṣṇuprakṛtirdhruvā||
caturthī vāsudevasya mūrtirbrahmeti saṃjñitā|
rājasī cāniruddhākhyā puruṣaḥ sṛṣṭikārike||

iti kaurme teṣāṃ tadvyapa<l7.>deśadarśanācca evaṃ brahmaṇastrimūrtiparatvavacanānāmapyupapattirunneyā| vāyusaṃhitāyām| 
tadāṇḍe'smin pravṛtto'bhūt kṣetrajño brahmasaṃjñita iti brahmāṇaṃ <l8.> prastutya tridhā vibhajya cātmānaṃ traile(lo)kye 
saṃpravartate| sṛjate grasate caiva rakṣate ca tribhi(bhiḥ) svayamityādinā tadvyūhān pradarśya satvaṃ rajaśca brahmatve kālatve ca 
tamora<p25a., f15b/19b., l1.>rajaḥ| viṣṇutve kevalaṃ satvaṃ guṇavṛttistridhā vibhoriti| tadvyūhānāṃ guṇavibhāgaśloke 
teṣvapi brahmādiśabdaprayogācca| nanu tarhi śivasya trimūrtiparatvavacanānyapi saṃhārarudravyūhabhūtabhavamṛḍahara<l2.>paratvaparāṇīti 
saṃhārarudra evatva tadabhimataḥ śivo'stu tasya guṇamūrtibhyaḥ paratvena mānamiti cenna| sṛjatyaśeṣamīśasya śāsanāccaturānanaḥ| 
tisṛbhirmūrtibhiścāpi pāti cānte nihanti ca| viṣṇuḥ pāla<l3.>yate viśvaṃ viśvayogeti yogataḥ| sṛjate grasate cāpi 
svakābhistābhistribhiḥ| haratyetajjagatsarvaṃ harastasyaiva śāsanāt| sṛjatyapācca viśvātmā tridhā bhinnastu rakṣatīti śivapurāṇe 
<l4.> sva sva vyūhasahitānāṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ śivaniyogena sva sva kṛtye pravṛtyupanyāsena tatraiva yogeśvarākhyapūjāvidhau 
sva sva vyūhāvaraṇakānāṃ teṣāṃ śivāvaraṇe <l5.> pūjāvidhānena yogayājñya(-)valkye tadrūpopanyāsena prasiddhāneva brahmādīn 
prastutya sadāśivasya tebhyaḥ paratvakathanena ca tasya trimūrtyatirekasiddheḥ| evaṃ tasya <l6.> viṣṇupurāṇe| yasya prasādā(-)
dahamacyutase(....)brahmavacādviṣṇostrimūrtyatirekaḥ kuto na siddhet| na hi brahmavaktrake vākye aniruddhe ahaṃ brahmaprayoga 
upapadyata <l7.> iti cenna ahaṅkārā(-)bhimāntvāditi ruddha(dra)sya (...)kārikaḥ taijasaśca tāmasaścetyahaṃ triketyatraiva 
tatrāpi nāmaikadeśatvenā (......)papatteḥ| tasya <l8.> vaktraparatve'pi yasmācca madhye puruṣaḥ purāṇa ityatra puruṣapadasya 
pradyumnaparatvenāpyupapatyātataśrutyananu(.......)viṣṇostrimūrtiparakasya siddheḥ| <p25b., f16a/20a., l1.> viṣṇupurāṇa 
eva purāṇādipratipādyaṃ nā(.....)(-)ṇa(......)tya sa para (...)śaktīnāṃ brahmaṇatvamanantara iti tasya 
jagatkāraṇabrahmaparatvokte bhāgavatopakrame ca tasmādekena manasā bhagavān <l2.> sātvatāṃ patiḥ| śrotavyaḥ kīrtitavyaśca 
dhyeyaḥ pūjyaśca (.......)detyādi(.....)śravaṇādapi vidhāyako'sau bhagavāniti jijñāsāyāṃ satvarajastama ityādiślo(lo)ke 
tatvaguṇopa(....)paramapuruṣāṃśaṃ <l3.>śreyaskaratvādena prāgupakṣiptaniyata(-)rajanīya(....)pāpa(...)napūrvakaṃ bhagavantaṃ vidhāya bhejire 
munayo yathāgra ityādinā tadbhajanasya kramamuktiphalamupapādya tasya sakala<l4.>vedapratipādyatvādikatvamuktvā jagrahe pauruṣaṃ 
(....)pamityādinā tasya līlā vigrahasadbhāvaṃ pratipādya etannānāvatārāṇāṃ nidhānaṃ bījamavyayamiti tasya 
sakalavaiṣṇavāvatā<l5.>re mūlamūlavigrahatvapradarśano satvopahataḥ paramapuruṣāṃśa eva paraṃ viṣṇutatvamiti sphuṭīkaraṇāt 
parāśarapurāṇe maheśvarapurāṇānītyādinā <l6.> śaivapurāṇānāṃ śivasaṃhāratvamohayaparatvamuktvā vaiṣṇavāni purāṇāni samastāni 
mahāmune| trimūrtīnāṃ harernāmnā mūrtyā tasya paraṃ padam| pravadanti purāṇe dve <l7.> brāhme caivānayā da(....)ti 
vaiṣṇavapurāṇānāṃ trimūrtyantargata eva viṣṇau paryavasānoktyā sa eva paraṃ viṣṇutatvamiti sphuṭīkaraṇācca tasmādyuktasturīyaḥ 
paramaśiva eveti <l8.> nirṇayaḥ athavā astu turīyakoṭāvapi nārāyaṇamūrtiḥ na hi turīyakoṭāvekaiva mūrtibrahmaṇa iti 
niyamaḥ| tatraiva sagītasakalaśaivapurāṇaprasiddheḥ girāmāhu<p26a., f16b/20b., l1.>rdevīṃ druhiṇagrahīṇīmāgamavido 
harerityādyabhiyuktokteśca bhavānī mūrterapi sadbhāvāt ihāpi pariṣkurvan sāmbaṃ vapuriti tathaivāpyupagamācca kiṃ tu 
para<l2.>śakterbhavānyā eva puṃ rūpo vilāsaḥ ekaiva śaktiḥ parameśvarasya bhinnā (....) viniyogakāle| bhoge bhavānī puruṣeṣu 
viṣṇuḥ kope ca kālī samareṣu durgetyādyāgamiko<l3.>padeśāt| umāyā sa hariḥ sākṣādyo hariḥ sā śivā 
smṛtetya(....)vacanāt| prakṛtistvaṃ pumānrudrastvayi tadvīryamāhitam| tvannābhipaṅkajājjātaḥ pañcavaktraḥ pitāmaha iti 
brahmāṇḍapu<l4.>rāṇe| nāvayorvidyate bhedocchaktistvaṃ na tvaṃśayaḥ| tvaṃ candramā ahaṃ sūryaḥ śarvarī tvaṃ ahaṃ 
dinamityādyapurāṇe ca viṣṇoḥ śivaśaktitvavyapadeśāt kaurmavāsiṣṭhalaiṅgyādityapurāṇādiṣu <l5.> 
śivanārāyaṇayorbhatṛ(rtṛ)bhāryābhāvena devadāruvanapraveśopavarṇāt tatprakaraṇe| yā tasya pārśvagā bālā sā pārvatyaṃśajo 
harirityādyukteḥ| 

liṅga<l6.>purāṇe (-)
eṣa bījī bhavān (.....)yoniḥ sa(......)naḥ| 
sa e(....) (vamukte) viśvātmā brahmā viṣṇuḥ pṛcchate|| 
bhavānyo nirahaṃ bījaṃ kathaṃ bījī maheśvaraḥ| 
ena me sūkṣmamavyaktaṃ saṃ<l7.>(…)chettumahya(....)jñātvā||
 vivi(...)ktiṃ lakṣaṇo(....)tantriṇaḥ| 
(....) paramasūkṣmārthe praśnamabhyavadaddhariḥ|| 
asmānmahattaraṃ bhūtaṃ guhya(.....)te|
mahataḥ paramā śivamadhyā(*)tmināṃ padam||(*) <l8.>
dai(....)vaina cātmānaṃ pravibhajya vyavasthitam|
niṣkalasūkṣmavyaktaṃ sakalastu maheśvaraḥ||
asya māyavidhijñasya agaṇyagaganasya ca|
parā liṅgādabhūt vī(....)pra(...)mātvādi sargikam|| <p26b., f17a/21a., l1.>
mama yonau (....) tadbījaṃ kālaparya(....)t|

hiraṇya (.....) pā(.....)..rayonyā ma prajāpateti viṣṇoḥ śivakṣetratvasphuṭīkaraṇāt śivakeśavayoḥ śivaṃ nābhiśilāyāṃ 
li(.....)yoḥ sannidhānena <l2.> hariharātmake(........)pahare(-)
rvārdha(.......)liṅgenāsārthasya(.......)raṇā(........)yāya(....)kāsti gaganārṇavaratna(....)ryo'yaṃ surāsuraguruḥ puruṣaḥ 
purāṇa(......)mardhamidandhakasūdanasya devitva<l3.>meva taditi pratipāda(-)yantītyabhuyuktokteśca evaṃ turīyake(…)
viṣṭasa(....)nārāyaṇasya bhavānīvadeva śivopasarjanatvādiha vyavasthāpanīyasya śivamūrteḥ sarvataḥ paratvasyāvirodhaḥ| 
matadva<l4.>yamupanyastaṃ viṣṇutatvavinirṇaye| yadatra yuktaṃ tat grāhyaṃ vimṛśya vibu(....)ttamaiḥ| matadvaye'pi 
bhagavānambikāramaṇaḥ śivaḥ aśeṣabrahmamūrtīnāmādibhūto jagatpatiḥ| bhairavādyāhara<l5.>syaiva matsyādyā śrīpateriva 
brahmaviṣṇuharāstasya kalābhedāditi sthitam||
 
sa vañcayadyapīśasya candrakhaṇḍaśikhāmaṇeḥ|
utkarṣaḥ sarvadevebhyastata eva prasidhyati||
tadāśrayāṇāṃ (*)vacasāṃ śiṣṭā kopoditāṃ nayāt|(*) <l6.>
sarveṣāmāśrayabalāt balavatvāvadhāraṇāt||
itareṣāṃ ca devānāṃ śrutiṣu smaraṇeṣu vā|
tatsāmyādhikyavacasāṃ guṇavādatvakalpanāt|| <l7.>
kimagni(-)ṣṭomatulyatve śrute'pi sati tatsamaḥ|
agnihotraṃ bhavedasya karma bhūyastvanirṇaye||
bhārataṃ sarvavedāśca tulāmāropitā purā|
devairbrahmādibhistatra atiricyata bhāratam||
iti vedebhya (*)utkarṣe bhāratasya smṛte'pi ca|(*) <l8.>
kiṃ vā bhavettassarvebhyo vedebhyo balavattaram||
matimandhānamāveśya yena vedamahārṇavāt|
prakāśo janito loke mahābhāratacandramāḥ||
ityādivaca(*)nairnyāyairvedamūlatvanirṇaye|(*) <p27a., f17b/21b., l1.>
bhāratādhikyavacasāmarthavādatvakalpanāt||
tathāpi bhavati bhrāntiḥ keṣāñcinmandacetasām|
avaidikamathābhyāsadhṛṣṭānāṃ vā durātmanām||
satvādupahitebhyo(*)ya māyī bhinnostu śaṅkaraḥ|(*) <l2.>
tathāpyaiśvaryaviśrāntiranyatraiva bhavatviti||
uktaiṣā prakriyātharvaśikhādiśrutimūlikā|
tasāmanyārthakatve tu naiveyaṃ sidhyatīti vā||
ata śrutīnāṃ sarvāsāṃ saha sarvo(*)pabrahmaṇaiḥ|(*) <l3.>
parabhāve bhagavatastātparyaṃ kathyate kramāt|| 

apāsya brahmādīnamaravarasarvānapi surān 
     prasūtā bhūtādyaiḥ pramitavibhavāste paramiti|
nidānaṃ (*)tvāṃ sarveśvaramapi ca nirdhārya vidadhe(*)<l4.>
     śakhāsadbhirdhyeyaṃ śiva tadapi mahyatīti laghu||

atharvaśikhāyāṃ kiṃ taddhyānaṃ ko vā dhyātā kaśca dhyeya ityupakramasthapraśnānuro<l5.>dhena dhyānadhyātṛnirūpaṇānantaraṃ 
dhyeyanirdhāraṇārthamāmnāyate| dhyāyiteśānaṃ pradhyāyitavyaṃ sarvamidaṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrendrāste sarve saṃprasūyante sarvā<l6.>ṇi 
cendriyāṇi sahabhūtairna kāraṇaṃ kāraṇānāṃ dhātā dhyātā kāraṇaṃ tu dhyeyaḥ sarvaiśvaryasampannaḥ sarveśvaraśca śambhurākāśamadhyaga 
ityādi śiva ekodhye<l7.> yaḥ śiva ekaḥ sarvamanyat parityajya samāptātharvaśi(......)jam| atra yogarūḍyā(ḍhyā) 
paramaśive vartamānasyeśānaśabdasya tācchīlyārthe ca na śaktatayā yogena 
svābhāvikaniratiśayai<l8.>śvaryapa(.....)drajaḍāparamaśivavāci (....)cca sarvotkṛṣṭaphalārthabhiḥ sarvātiśāyyaiśvaryaḥ paramaśiva eva 
dhyātavya iti bhāvena īśānaśabde (...)śeṣya nirdeśaḥ <p27b., f18a/22a., l1.> kṛtaḥ| pradhyāpitasya 
mityā(thyā)dhikyāt dhyānaṃ hīnatvena stutiḥ kimanyena tāmaśāḥ yenaivamadhāraṇaṃ balamiti (............)davamāṣṭyādirūpe 
samaprapañce brahmādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ prāmukhya<l2.>muktvā teṣāmapyaiśvaryapariccheda(....)vanāya tada(....)pattitayā dīpakena sahoktyā 
ca bhū(...)dandriyāditaulyena teṣāmutpattimatvaṃ darśitam| sarvamidamityārabhya sarvabhūtairityaṃ <l3.> tena yadyetat 
paramaśivasyāpi syānasyāttasyāpi tadvadeva dhyeyatvamityāśaṅkyoktam| na kāraṇaṃ kāraṇānāndhātā dhyātā iti prasūyata iti 
vacanavipariṇāme<l4.>nānuṣaṅgaḥ| tathā cāyamarthaḥ brahmādīnāṃ prasūtyuktisāmarthyādyatteṣāmarthasiddhaṃ kāraṇaṃ tadrūpaḥ kāraṇānāṃ 
brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ mantropaniṣaduktānāṃ <l5.> kālādīnāṃ vā dhātā sraṣṭā dhyātā ādi sargasaṅkalpakartā evaṃbhūta īśānaḥ 
kuto'pi na saṃprasūyata iti yadyapyanena brahmādīnāṃ yadarthalabdhaṃ kāraṇaṃ tanna prasū<l6.>yata ityetāvadeva pratīyate| na tvīśāna 
iti tathāpi tasya dhyeyatvaṃ vidhāya brahmādīnāṃ dhyeyatvavyavacchedāya teṣu doṣodbhāvanānantaram| tarhi taddoṣasadbhā<l7.>ve 
tasyāpi dhyeyatvaṃ tasyādityavasaraprāptaśaṅkā(-)vyavacchedāya tatraiva tasya doṣasya pratyākhyātavyatvādanyathāntarālavākyaṃ 
parityajya viṣṇurupāṃśu(śuḥ) yaṣṭavya ityādivākyā<l8.>nāṃ yāgavidhāyakatvasvīkāre 
upakramasaṃkīrtitapuroḍāśadvayanairantaryaprayuktajāmitādoṣaparihārālābhāt tatra vākyacchāyāyā ivehāpyasaṅgatyā<p28a., 
f18b/22b., l1.>patteḥ prāgeva vākyapravṛttibhaṅgyā īśāne brahmādiṣūdbhāvitadoṣaparihāre tātparyāvasāyāt 
brahmādīnāmarthalabdhe kāraṇe tatparihārasāmarthyādīśāna eva brahmādīnāṃ <l2.> kāraṇamiti gamayatīti tasyai tatra prasūtyabhāva 
upanyasta iti nirṇīyate| kiṃ ca kevalayaugikatveneha prayuktayoddhātṛdhyātraśabdayorna kāraṇaṃ tvityatra tu śabdasvārasyena tatra 
vākyārambhapratīte<l3.>rihaiva vākyena tayo(yoḥ) svato liṅgavyavasthāśūnyatayānyaliṅgagrāhiṇo 
svasamānādhikṛtavyavasthitaliṅgakāraṇaśabdaliṅgagrāhitve napuṃsakaliṅgāpatteḥ śrutapulliṅganirvā<l4.>hāya 
pulliṅgaviśeṣyāpekṣā paramākāṅkṣitārthasaṅghaṭanā(-)nukūlasannidhiśrutaśabdānuṣaṅge bhavati a(atha) 
tādṛśabdāntarādhyāhārayogādīśānaśabdānuṣaṅga<l5.>syāvaśyakatvena śiva(....)yavasāmadhyasiddhabrahmādikāraṇatvasiddhavat kāreṇa 
tatra prasūtyabhāva upanyasta iti niścīyate| ata evānantaravākye kāraṇamitya<l6.>syaśambhupadasāmānādhikaraṇyaṃ dṛśyate| tatra 
cākāśamadhya ityupāsanāsthānakathanaṃ paramākāśarūpaparama(-)śivalokābhiprāyaṃ tena hṛdayakamalaravibimbā(-)<l7.>diṣu yatra yatra 
śivasya dhyānaṃ tatra sarvatrāpi jyoti(......)paṃ kailāsaṃ(.....)vyatamadhyavartitvena śivo dhyeya iti viditaṃ bhavati| sarveśvara 
iti śivanāmatvena prayogaḥ| oṃ<l8.>kāraṃ sarveśvara(-)dvāda(........)iti tāpanīyaprayoge (.........) prasidhyā 
(....)tasya tannāmatva(...) vasāyāt na tu sarvaiśvaryaparatvena prācīnaviśeṣaṇena paunaruktyā<p28b., f19a/23a., 
l1.>tte(......-)katve(.....)padena rūḍhatve uttarapadena yogarūḍhimatve padadvayena ca (....) tat vācyatvaṃ lakṣayatā 
vikiraṇānugrahītāni bha(.....)kamalānītyatra <l2.> dvitīyakamalapadamiva kamala(....)jātam| tataśca śambhurnakevalaṃ 
prasūtirahitabrahmādi(...) raṇātmatvādaparicchannai (.....) api tvananyasādhāraṇasarveśvaraśabdavācatvādapīti 
sarveśvaraśce<l3.>tyasyā(...)prāya iti sopapattika(-)sarvaiśvaryānuvādaḥ evamuktibhaṅgyā brahmādīn parityajya śiva eva dhyeya 
iti darśitaṃ bhavati| amumevārthamādarārthaṃ kaṇṭhoktyāpi sphuṭayati śrutiḥ| śiva <l4.> eko'dhyeya ityādinā 
evamapyāśruterthamupabrahmaṇānyeva sphuṭayanti| tathā hi śivapurāṇe tāvat śivasya sarvotsakarṣanirdhāraṇaprakaraṇe paṭhyate|
 
yasmātsarvamidaṃ (*)brahmaviṣṇurudrendrapūrvakam|(*) <l5.>
sahabhūtendriyaiḥ sarvaiḥ prathamaṃ saṃprasūyate||
kāraṇānāṃ ca yo dhātā dhyātā paramakāraṇam|
na saṃprasūyatenyasmāt kutaścana (*)kadācana||(*) <l6.>
sa sarvaiśvaryasaṃpūrṇo nāmnā sarveśvarasva(ssva)yam|
sakhirvamumukṣubhirdhyeyaḥ śambhurākāśamadhyaga||

iti atra sarvamidamityārabhya sahabhūtairityantasyārtha<l7.>pradarśake prathamaśloke mūlavākye aśabdagṛhīto'pi śivādutpadyanta 
ityasyāyamartha uttaravākyaparyālocanayā sāmarthyātsiddha iti siddhaṃ kṛtvā yasmāditi <l8.> nirdiṣṭaṃ dvitīyaślokena na 
kāraṇaṃ kāraṇānāṃ dhātā dhyāteti etāvadekaṃ kriyānuṣaṅgaśceti darśitam| tṛtīyaślokena nāmnā sarveśvarasvayamiti 
sarveśvaraśabdasya <p29a., f19b/23b., l1.> vanāmatvopanyāsena svayaṃ sarveśvaraśabdavācya ityananyasāmānyaṃ nāmaiva 
tasya sarveśvaratvaṃ khyāpayatītyetadarthaparatvapradarśanena vā punaruktiḥ parihṛtā| harivaṃśe kṛṣṇakṛstotre paṭhyate| <l2.> ahaṃ brahmā 
kapilo yopyanantaḥ putrāḥ sarve brahmaṇaścātivīrāḥ| tvattaḥ sarve deva deva prasūtāḥ tvaṃ sarveśaḥ kāraṇātmā tvamīḍya iti atra 
kapilādigrahaṇaṃ ṛṣiṃ prasūtaṃ kapilaṃ yastamagre ityādi<l3.>śrutītyantarārthopasaṃhāreṇa evaṃ kāraṇātmetyanvayaḥ| 
kāraṇatvaprakāśasyaiva pradarśanāttathā ca brahmādikāraṇātmakatvāt tvaṃ sarveśvaraḥ tataśca sarvairīḍya iti 
kāraṇatvādīnāmupa<l4.>pādyopapādakabhāvenānvayaḥ sphuṭīkṛtaḥ evaṃ brahmaviṣṇvagnīśakrāt jalabhūmipurogamāḥ| surāsurāḥ 
saṃprasūtāstvattaḥ sarve maheśvara ityādīni brahmāṇḍapurāṇādi draṣṭavyā<l5.>nyapyupabrahmaṇānyudāhartavyāni tadevaṃ śrutāveva 
brahmādinikhiladevatāvyavacchedena śivasya sarveśvaratva(-)vyavasthāpanāt tadadhikadevatāntarajalpanaṃ bāliśānāṃ 
vyāmo<l6.>havilāsa evetyarthaḥ| nanu hiraṇyagarbhaḥ samavartatāgrebhūtasya jātaḥ patireka āsīt| indro yāto vasi tasya rājā| 
