ityādyabhidhānakośa(-)smṛterlaukikivaidikaprayogabāhu<l5.>lyāt ātmasāmānye tasya śakterāvaśyakatvena tama eva tadupapatteḥ 
na viṣṇu tasya viśiṣyāpi śaktiḥ kalpayituṃ śakyā barhirājyādhikaraṇe virodhāt| <l6.> tatra hi mlecchaistṛṇaghātādi 
jātimātre āryaiḥ saṃskṛtatṛṇādāveva prayujyamānānāṃ bahirājyādiśabdānāṃ yavavarāhādhikaraṇanyāyena śāstrastha<l7.>prasiddhe(-)
rbalavatvāt saṃskāranimittatvamāśaṅkya śāstrasya prayogasya jātyavyabhicārājakā(...)mātravyavahārasya ca 
saṃskāravyabhicārādavyabhicāri<l8.>jātiśaktimādāya sarvaprayogopa(...)danasahavena (...) bhāvājjāti vācitaiveti siddhaśaktiḥ| 
uktaṃ ca tantravārtike| ekadeśo'pi yena <p34b., f25a/29a., l1.> dṛṣaḥ śabdo jātinibandhanaḥtadatyagānna tasyāsti 
nimittāntarakalpaneti evaṃ ca mlecchagatayāpi sāmānyaprasidhyā sāmānyaśaktisiddhau tadvārair vyavahārasiddhaviśeṣa<l2.>lābha 
iti na viśeṣaśaktikalpanaṃ tadā kā(...)thā prakṛtaviṣaye iha sāmānya(...)ddherapyāryagatatvena daurbalyaśaṅkāyā anavakāśāt 
nityastu prayogāntarāṇāmanyathā śuddhiḥ ihai<l3.>va brahmadevatyā viṣṇudevatyā rudradevatyeti mahātrayadevatāvidhānāntaraṃ 
puruṣadevatyeti ardhamātradevatāvidhāne puruṣasāmānyasya devatāprayogāt trimūrtisyaḥ parasmide<l4.>vatāviśeṣe 
puruṣaśabdaprayogastattadvāci śabdairdevatāvidhānaprāyapāṭhabalāt ruruṣaśabdasya tatra viśiṣyāpi śabdaṃ kalpayan 
aneśrutyādipratipannanārā<l5.>yaṇaparaprayogānurodhāttatraivaṃ taṃ paryavasāyayiṣyatīti cet na 
sāmānyaśaktyāpyabhimataviśeṣaparyavasānasaṃbhave prāyapāṭhamātrasya <l6.> gauravaparāhataśaktyantarakalpakatvāyogāt ekā deyā 
dvādaśa(....)dayā caturviṃśatirdeyā sahasraṃ deyamaparimitaṃ deyamityādhānadakṣiṇākalpabhedaśrutau aparimita<l7.>śabdasyāparimāṇe 
śiṣṭasyetyādyavikaraṇe ekāditulyakalpāntaraparatvena sthitasyādhikaṃ vā syāt bahvarthatvāditaraiḥ sannidhānāditi 
vidhitsitasaṃkhyāviśeṣa<l8.>vāciśabdaprāyapāṭhe'pi bahutvasāmānyaśaktyaiva nyāyalakye(kṣye) sahasrādhikabahutve 
paryavasānanirṇayāt nanvastveva prayogamātrasyānyadhāsiddhiḥ tathāpi puruṣa<l9.>saṃjñe śarīre'smin śayanāt puruṣo haririti 
paurāṇikānāṃ tasya tannāmatvena nirvacanamananyathāsiddhaṃ viśiṣyāpi śaktiṃ kalpayiṣyatīti cet| na 
sāmānyaśaktasyā<p35a., f25b/29b., l1.>pi puruṣaśabdasya śrutyādiṣu kvacit prakaraṇādisāmarthyāt nārāyaṇe 
paryavasānamastītyetāvat jñāpanena caritārthatayārthavādapradhānapaurāṇi<l2.>kanirvacanasya citrādhikaraṇe stotraviśeṣanātvena siddhasya 
puṣaśabdasya kvacit pṛṣṭhairupatiṣṭhata ityādau tatsādhane rathantarādāvapi lakṣaṇayā prava(vṛ)ttirastīti tannirvāheṇa <l3.> 
caritārthasya rathantarādau puṣṭhaśabdapravartinimittapratipādanaparasyāpo vā ṛkvi tāsāṃ vāyupuṣṭhe vyāvartatetyāde 
śrotārthatvatadasyevānyathāsiddhatvenānyathā<l4.>siddhābhidhanvī kośasmṛtyādikliptaśaktyopapādanīyaprayogaviṣaye 
śaktyantarakalpakatvāyogāt na hi stotranāmatvena siddhasya puṣṭhaśabdasya ranta(thanta)rānāvapi lakṣaṇā <l5.> yogye 
pravṛttinimittapratipādanaparo'rthavādo'stītyetāvatā tatrāpi śakyasamāpayate bhagavatā jaimininaiva saptamatṛtīyānte puṣṭhairupatiṣṭhate 
ityatra <l6.> puṣṭhaśabdo mahendrastotraparaḥ rathantarādiparo veti vicāre karmaṇeḥ puṣṭhaśabdasyāttathābhūtopadeśāditi pūrvapakṣasūtreṇa 
puṣṭhaśabdo(-)papade<l7.>śasāmānyāt stotrakriyāparatvamiti tasmādraparasyautsargikatvakathanena siddhānte abhidhāropapadeśādvāpi 
