nāra<l6.>siṃhapurāṇavacanena tadasādhāraṇyavacanānāṃ puṃśa(sa)vyāpārasya sphuṭīkaraṇācca| tasmānna puruṣaśabdasya 
viṣṇāvasādhāraṇaprayoganirvacanā sādhāraṇya<l7.>vacanerviśiṣyaśaktiḥ| yadi syāt tadā puruṣasya vidma sahasrākṣasya mahādevasya 
dhīmahi| puruṣaṃ kṛṣṇapiṅgalaṃ tamīśānaṃ puruṣaṃ devamīḍhyamityādiśrutyādiṣu śūdrāḥ pādāt <l8.> pinākina iti prastutya puṃsāṃ 
tu puruṣaśrīmān jñānagamyo na cānyatheti laiṅgya ca śive tasya lalāṭātryakṣaḥ śūlapāṇirajāyatetyādiśrutiṣu ca saṃhā<p36a., 
f26b/30b., l1.>rudre aṅguṣṭhamātraḥ puruṣo'ṅguṣṭhaṃ ca samāśrita ityādipiṇḍāṇḍamūlāṅguṣṭhasamāśrayaṇaliṅgopasthāpite 
brahmāṇḍamūlabhūtādhāralokavāsini kālāgnirudre<l2.> yat puruṣeṇa haviṣetyādiśrutiṣu tadvisṛṣṭasthapuruṣo loke brahmeti 
kīrtita iti manusmṛtau ca brahmaṇi ca prayogāt| yasmāt puryanuśete ca tasmāt puruṣa ucyate <l3.> iti laiṅgye 
jīvanāma(-)nirvacanaprastāve ca nirvacanādvedānteṣu yamāhurekaṃ puruṣaṃ vyāpya sthitaṃ rodasītyabhuyuktaiḥ śivasya vedānteṣu puruṣatvena 
pratipādyatayā<l4.>bhidhānāt sa yat pūrvo'smāt sarvasmāt sarvān pāpmana uṣastasmāt puruṣa iti bṛhadāraṇyake 
brahmanāmatvena nirvacanāt sa vai śarīri prathamaḥ sa<l5.>rvai(rvaiḥ) puruṣa ucyate| ādikartā sa bhūtānāṃ brahmāgre samavarta(-)
