gauṇānītyu<l9.>pakrame (....)ma(-)liṅgasamavāyānyatareṇa nāmnāṃ gauṇatvoktyā tu paraśyenādināmavat gauṇanāma eva prāyeṇa 
vā nāmasahasramadhye anekadevatāntaraparigaṇanadarśa<p38b., f29a/33a., l1.>nena tasya tadvācitve pramāṇābhāvāt 
anyathā bhārate laiṅgyādityapurāṇādipaṭhitaśivanāmasahasreṣvanantarbhūtaviṣṇunāmāsambhavāt| nāmāni tava <l2.> 
govindayāniloke mahānti ca| tānyeva mama nāmāni nā(....)kāryā vivā(va)raṇe (......) kailāsayātrāyāṃśakavace tena 
sarveṣāṃ viṣṇunāmnāmanyeṣāṃ cotkṛṣṭanāmnāṃ himakaranāmnāṃ ghanasāranāmavat <l3.> śivanāmatvasya siddheśca kvacidapi nāmnāṃ 
viṣṇuparatvanirṇayo na syāt kiṃ ca śivaṃ prastutya sarvāhavā etasya nāmadheyānītyā(....)smaraṇāt abhidhāna śrutvā 
vastvantaranirṇaya eve<l4.> lupyeta tasmādudāhṛtaśabdānāṃ kośeṣu śivanāmasuparigaṇanāt laukikavaidikavyavahāra(...)matyācca 
tannāmatvācca ye vyavasthitārthopasaṃhārānirodheno<l5.>pakrame ardhamātrāvācyatvena pratipannaḥ puruṣaḥ śiva eveti yuktam ata 
etasārdhamātrāvācyatvaṃ pratipāditaṃ śivadharmottareṇa| athavānyaprakāreṇa brahmavi<l6.>ṣṇumaheśvarāḥ| kramānmātrāḥ 
samuddiṣṭāstatparaścārdhamātrayā| bhāvanāmātragamyatvādvicintyaḥ paramaśśiva iti vāyusaṃhitāyāmapi praṇavamātrātrayasya 
vedaguṇamū<l7.>rtitrayavibhāgaṃ pradarśyā(ya)nirastara(-)mabhihitam| evaṃ tisṛbhirevaitanmātrābhirakhilaṃ tathā| abhidhāya śivātmānaṃ 
bodhayantyardhamātrayeti| tadevamupakramamavalambya pratyavasthānaṃ <l8.> nirākṛtam| kāraṇaṃ tu dhyeya ityatra yaccoditaṃ tatrāhati 
ayaṃ bhāvaḥ abhyāsaḥ sāmidhenīnāṃ prāthamyāt sthānadharmasyādityatra triḥ prathamāmanvāha triruttamāmiti prathamottamaśabdayoḥ 
pratha<l9.> mopasthitaprādharmyādi(-)sthānānatikrameṇa tadupalakṣitapravo vājīyādiṛgviśeṣaparatve syevātra kāraṇaśabdasya 
prathamopasthitakaraṇatvadharmāni krameṇa <p39a., f29b/33b., l1.> tadupalakṣita(-)devatāviśeṣādiparatvasyābhāvāt 
kāraṇatvamātraparatvasthitau tasya pratiyogasopekṣārthasya sahasraṃ deyamaparimitaṃ deyamityatrāparimitaśabdasya 
sannihitasahasrāpe<l2.>kṣabahutvavat sannidhyupavarṇitakāryabhāvānāṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrādīnāṃ kāraṇe paryavasānāt brahmaviṣṇurudraśabde 
svataḥ pratīyamānānāṃ guṇamūrtīnāṃ trayāṇāṃ kāraṇatvena śrutyantare'pi śivādanyasya <l3.> pratipādanādarśanāt 
kathañcitsarvakāraṇatvādipratipādanāntarbhāvena tatra tatsidhyupagame ihaiva brahmādīnāṃ prasūtyuktyanrbhāvena siddhasya 
tatkāraṇasāmānyasya satvāt samanantara(-)vākyasiddhasyaivānuvā<l4.>dasaṃbhavena śrutyantaramukhanirīkṣaṇāyogāt| dhyāyī te 
śānamiti dhyeyaviśeṣasya prāgeva nirdhāritatvena sopapattikaṃ punastadarthopasaṃhārapare'sminvākye dhyānaviṣayaparasya <l5.> 
śabdasya devatāntaraviṣayatva(-)kalpanasyātyantānucitatvāt katha(....)syaiva vākyasya dhyeyaviśeṣaṇaparatvakalpane'pi 
samānādhikṛtaśambādipada(-)svārasyāvirodhāya samanantaravākya<l6.>siddhakāraṇānuvādasyaiva yuktatvāt abhyudayeṣṭivākye 
carutvasyeva sāmarthyasiddhasyaivāpyanuvādasaṃbhavāccodāhṛtaśrutyarthakathanaprastā(-)vopavarṇitena sāmarthyena śiva<l7.>rūpeṇāvagamitaṃ 
samanantaravākyasiddhameva kāraṇamiha kāraṇaśabdenānūdyate na śrutyantarasiddhamiti| kiṃ ca yadi kāraṇamātrānya(.......-)manūdya 
tena pūrvavākyasāmarthyapariprāptamiti grahaḥ| tathāpi <l8.> na kudṛṣṭīnāṃ saphalāpyavyavasthitiḥ| śrutyantare śivasyaiva 
kāraṇatvavyāhṛterityāśayenāha||16||

jaḍānīśau naiva prabhavata iti brahma jagatāṃ nidānaṃ niścitya tvathavimṛśatāṃ kiṃ nu <l9.> taditi| mahādevyā dṛṣṭyā 
tvamiti matirāsīdyamavata(...)miti tvāha yenāśvatā nirgamāntaḥ śivaparam| śvetā(........)ṇāmantropaniṣadupakrame 
brahmavādino vadanti kiṃ kāraṇaṃ <p39b., f30a/34a., l1.> brahma kuto jātā tvadhiṣṭitāḥ kena sukhetareṣu vartāmahe 
brahmavido vyavastheti keṣāṃcit (......)ṣīṇāṃ brahmajaganmūla<l2.>kāraṇamitītyetāvantiśchatavatāṃ kāraṇabhūtaṃ brahma ko 
deva(...)ti viśiṣṭyā budhya(.....)nāṃ kāraṇaṃ brahma kimityādirūpān (....) pān pradarśya yaḥ kāraṇāni tāni khalāni tāni 
kālātmayuktānyadhitiṣṭhatyeka <l3.> ityārabhya kṣaraṃ pradhānamamṛtākṣaraṃ harakṣarātmānā viśate deva ekaḥ saṃyuktamatakṣaramakṣaraṃ ca 
vyaktāvyaktaṃ bharate viśvamīśaḥ ityarthi(....) starnirnītamarthaṃ pradarśadbhirmantraiḥ kālādyavāntara<l4.>kāraṇabṛndasyādhiṣṭhātā 
hareśādiśabdavācyo bhagavān paramaśiva eva kāraṇaṃ brahmeti sphuṭīkṛtam| nanu kṣaraṃ pradhānamitimagre haraśabdasya na 
kṣarākṣareśvaradevatāviśeṣaṇa<l5.>samarpaṇaparatvenānvayaṃ kiṃ tu saṃyuktametat kṣaramakṣaraṃ cetyādiśrutakṣarākṣaraśabdārthabubhutsāyāṃ kṣaraṃ 
pradhānamiti kṣaraśabdārthavivaraṇānantaramakṣaraśabdārtha<l6.>varaṇavākye vidheyamiva paratvenānvayaḥ athavā tadvākyaparipūrteḥ na 
cāmṛtā(-)kṣaramiti padadvayasatvādamṛtapadenākṣarapadavivaraṇaṃ kriyata iti tatpūrṇamiti vācyaṃ <l7.> samāsapadasyaikaprasaraṇena 
viśiṣṭaikārthabodhanasvabhāvasyoddeśyavidheyo bhayaparatve prasarabhedena sāmarthyavighātāt samāsāsambhavaprasaṅgādata eva paśau <l8.> 
tryaṅgai sviṣṭakṛtaṃ yajatītyatra tryaṅgapadasya samastasya pradhānahavirbhūtahṛdayādyaṅgānuvādena tritvavidhāyitvaṃ na saṃbhavatīti 
tritvaviśiṣṭāṅgāntaravidhāyitvaṃ nirṇītamityaśeṣāt <l9.> sviṣṭakṛdijyate prakṛtiviharaṇe ucyate amṛtākṣaramiti nedaṃ 
samāsapadamekārthayoḥ padayorviśeṣaṇaviśeṣya(-)bhāvāyogena samāsasyaiva tallakṣaṇaviruddha<p40a., f30b/34b., 
l1.>varaṇīyānavādoyuktaḥ sannihitamantrāntaraśrutākṣaraśabdārthasyaiva bubhutsitatvāt nāpi haraśabdena tadvivaraṇaṃ yuktaṃ tasya 
śive rūḍhatvāt jīvapratipādanakṣameṇa hiśabdena hi <l2.> vivṛru(ru?)tavyaṃ niyamyayoḥ pradhānapuruṣayorniyanturīśvarasya ca pūrve 
haramantrasandarbhe upanyāsadarśanāt kṣaramāyā cākṣaraṃ jīvarūpaṃ kṣarātmānāvīśate deva eka iti brahmagītopabrahmaṇācca na ca 
<l3.> haraśabdo jīve dṛṣṭaprayogaḥ kathañcidavayavārthakalpane'pi uttaratrānvayena śakyamarthatāyārūḍheḥ tyāgāyogāt 
tasmādasaṃbandho'yaṃ pralāpaḥ amṛtākṣaraṃ hara ityudyeśyavedheyābhāvenā<l4.>nvaya iti kiñcāmṛteti bhinnaṃ padaṃ nārāyaṇaparaṃ 
brahmetyatra nārāyaṇapadamiva tri(tṛ)tīyā tat kṛdarthena guṇavacaneneti sūtre tatkṛtapadamiva ca supāṃ sulugityādisūtreṇa <l5.> 
luptavibhaktikaṃ jīvaparaṃ kṣaraṃ tvavidyāhyamṛtaṃ tu vidyāvidyā(.....)raṃśateyaṃ tu so'nya ityasyāmeva śrutau tatra tasya 
dṛṣṭaprayogatvājjīvāpetaṃ vāvakiledamṛyate na jīvo <l6.> mṛyata iti śrutyantare tatra tadarthasadbhāvokteśca te ca 
bubhutsitākṣaraśabdārthavivaraṇaṃ kriyate haraśabdastu kṣarākṣareśvaradevatāviśeṣanirdhāraṇaparatvena <l7.> uttaratrānvetīti yuktaḥ 
paddha(......)brahmaṇamapi vāyusaṃhitāyāṃ tathaiva dṛśyate| yaccedamakṣaraṃ vyaktaṃ yadapyamṛtamakṣasātāvubhau ca kṣarātmā nāveko deva 
svayaṃ haraḥ| īśate <l8.> tadabhidhyānādyojanāttatvabhāvata ityādi yadi cāmṛtākṣaramiti samāsapadaṃ tathāpi 
amṛtaśabdenaivākṣaraśabdavivaraṇamiti na tatra haraśabdānvayaḥ saptadaśā ratnirvā jape yasya yūpa <l9.> ityatra 
yūpapadamukhyārthatānurodhāt samāsapadepyaratnyuddeśena sāptadaśya(....) svamārādihāpi harapadamukhya(....)nurodhāt jagatkāraṇe 
brahmaviṣṇūpakṣitpa<p40b., f31a/35a., l1.>viśeṣasaṃśayavyudāsalābhāya harapadasyottaratra devatāviśeṣaṇa(-)samarpaṇānvaya 
(....) vākyatatvārcāgamyāsamarthasamā(....)pyupagamya(...)doṣaḥ| syādetannātra kāraṇaṃ brahma brahmādidevānāṃ <l2.> madhye ko 
deva iti saṃśayaṃ pradṛśya devatā(-)ntarakāraṇatvavādanirāsapūrvakaṃ śiva eveti nirdhāraṇaṃ kriyate kiṃ tu jagatkāraṇaṃ vastu brahma vā 
tato'nyatkādikaṃ veti prathamamantreṇa saṃśayaṃ <l3.> pradarśyānantaraṃ brahmaiva kāraṇamiti eva tāvannirṇīyate| kālasvabhāvo 
niyatiryadṛcchābhūtāni yoniḥ puruṣa iti cintyam| saṃ(....)ṣāṃ tvātmabhāvādātmāpyanīśaḥ sukhaduḥkhahetoriti <l4.> 
dvitīyamantre kālādikāraṇavādinirāśadarśanādanyathā devatāntarakāraṇavādasyaiva koṭyantarasya nirasanīyatayā tadasaṅgatyāpatteḥ 
tasmāt brahma jagatkāraṇaṃ nākālādika<l5.>mityetāvatā eveha vyavasthāpanena kāraṇasya brahma(....)devatāviśeṣarūpatvasya 
nirdhārayitvāttadanurodhenottaratra haraśabdānvayā siddhirucyate nātra yatkābhūtaṃ <l6.> vastu tat brahmakā prādikaṃ veti vimṛśo 
darśitaḥ dvitīyakoṭeraśravaṇāt saṃśayavākyaṃ hi sāmānyataḥ saṃbhāvitayāvatkoṭyupasthāpanakṣama kiṃ śabdamātraghaṭitaṃ vā syāt 
<l7.> yathā ko'yaṃ vṛkṣa iti viśiṣya tattatkoṭiparaśabdaviśeṣaghaṭitaṃ vā yāthāyaṃ vṛkṣaścūtaḥ panaso veti 
viśiṣyaikṛkoṭimātropanyāsastu vyutpattiviruddha iti samabhivyā<l8.>hṛtabrahmapadānvayalābhāya koṭyantarā(-)
dhyāhārastāvadavarjanīyaṃ kiṃ yajñadatta iti vadutkaṭakoṭikasaṃśayavākyarūpatve kutasmajātā 
ityādikoṭyutkaṭaśūnyāgrimavimarśavākyā nāmnāṃ janasyāpatteḥ api cātra kiṃśabdaḥ ko'yaṃ purovartī sthāṇuḥ puruṣo vetyatraiva 
tathā vikalpamānadharmīparyanto vā kimayaṃ sthāṇurutapuruṣa ityatraiva <p41a., f31b/35b., l1.> vikalpamātraparo vā 
ādye sāmānyato vimarśavākyamekaṃ viśiṣya vimarśaparaṃ vākyamanyaditi pratītaikavākyatābhaṅgaḥ viśiṣyapradarśitakoṭidvayasya 
vaikalpikatvapratyāyakavākyādyadhyāhārāpattiśca dvitīye kutasmā<l2.>tā ityādidharmaparyantakiṃśabdāntaraprāyapaṭhanānurodhaḥ 
pakṣadvaye'pi viśeṣavimṛśavākyasyātādṛśa(.....)vākyāntarānanurodhaśca agre kālādikaraṇavādanirāsā(-)nyathānupapattibalāt 
kāraṇaṃ <l3.> brahmakālā(.......)vimarśavākyasya kalpanīyatayā sarvamidaṃ na doṣāyeti cenna tasyaiva 
tatkalpanāparibandhitvāt tathā hi te dhyānayogānugatā apaśyantītyādi tadanantarapaṭhitamantrasvato nirṇīyottānāṃ <l4.> 
teṣāṃ tannirṇayāya devatādhyānānuṣṭhānaṃ śrāvayatīti tataḥ prāgeva saṃśayaviṣayakoṭyantaradūṣaṇasphuraṇe kathaṃ tatsaṅgaccheta na ca sa 
nānānirṇayārthadhyānakoṭyantaranirāsayoḥ <l5.> paurvāparyaniyamāt kramikāyādhikaraṇanyāyena pāṭhakramādardhakramasya 
balavatvādetasmājjāyate prāṇā ityādimantrai prāṇādijanmamahābhūtajananadivevadevatādhyānāt paraṃ <l6.> koṭyantaranirāsaḥ 
kalpya iti vācyam anyonyāśrayāpatteḥ na hi kālādikāravādasya koṭyantaratvaṃ tannirāsasya dhyānānantaratvakalpanaṃ vinā 
sidhyati kiṃ ca yadi kāraṇadharmīka<l7.>viśeṣasaṃśayakoṭyantaranirāsārthaḥ kālasvabhāva ityādimantraḥ tadā 
yadṛcchāpakṣanirāsānupapattiḥ na kiñcit kāraṇamastīti pakṣo hi yadṛcchāpakṣaḥ kiṃ ca kāraṇasya <l8.> saṃśayāt prāgeva 
cetanatvasaṃpratipatyabhāve acetanasyādhiṣṭhātṛtvāsaṃbhavādadhiṣṭhitāḥ keneti vimarśā(-)nupapattiḥ tasmāt sāmānyato 
brahmakāraṇamityetāva(-)nniścitavatāṃ kiṃ <l9.> kāraṇaṃ brahmeti saṃbhāvitasakalakoṭivikalpaviśeṣitadharmipareṇa kiṃśabdena 
kāraṇaṃ brahma(-)viṣṇvādidevatānāṃ madhye ko deva iti (...)darśanāt jagataḥ kāraṇatvasyānyakāraṇasya <p41b., 
f32a/36a., l1.> copapattau brahmakāraṇamityetāvadevāsiddhamiti saṃśayasya nirālambanatvaprasaṅgo mā bhūditi 
pakṣadvayasyāpi nirāso nirṇayārthadhyānāt (.....)vati tadabhiprāyanirṇayaṃ yuktaṃ tadetatsarvaṃ manasi <l2.> kṛtvā 
kālādikāraṇatva(-)nirāsasya saṃśayadharmyupapadānaparānvayo darśitaḥ jaḍānīśau prabhavata itīta nanu yuktametadevaṃ kālādikāraṇavādaṃ 
nirāsābhiprāyavarṇanaṃ tathāpi kāraṇaṃ <l3.> brahma ko deva iti na vimarśaḥ kiṃ tvadvitīyasya sakalasahakārividhirasya 
brahmaṇaḥ kathaṃ kāraṇatvaṃ samarthanīyamityabhiprāye brahma jagatāt yattau sādhyāya na kumupakaraṇakamityevaṃ ca teṣāṃ dhyānānantaraṃ 
<l4.> tadīyā vidyā śaktidarśanopavāsaḥ samagacchate brahmaṇo jagatsṛṣṭau kiṃ sahakārīti sandihya svayaṃ nirṇayāśakyā 
brahmadhyāyatāṃ tatprasādādavaṭitaghaṭanāpaṭīyasīmāyā śaktiḥ sahakā<l5.>riṇīti teṣāṃ nirṇaya āsīditi tāvat 
paryavarṇanānañjasyāt anyathātra māyāśaktidarśanopavarṇanamasaṅgatameva syādityucyate evaṃ sahakārivicāraparatvakalpanāyāṃ 
kāraṇa<l6.>padaṃ tāvat sahakārilakṣaṇakaṃ kalpanīyaṃ syāt kutasmajātā ityādivimarśāśca nopapadyeran yadi 
kāraṇasāmānyopagamantabrahmānyadveti saṃśaya iti kalpyeta yadi vā kāraṇaṃ brahmetyabhyu<l7.>pagamapūrvakaṃ tacchivo devatāntaraṃ 
veti tadā brahmaṇo'nyasmādvā vayaṃ jātā ityādiprakāreṇa vā śivāddevatāntarādvā vayaṃ jātā ityādiprakāreṇa vā yujyeran 
brahmasaka<l8.>lajagajjīvanādikāraṇamiti niścaye tadviśeṣajijñāsānudaye ca tatsahakārimātrajijñāsāmānānāṃ kaḥ 
kutasmajātā ityādivicārasya prasaṅgaḥ tatra kiṃ sahakārikā(-)dītyādivyākhyā<l9.>ne bahvī kliṣṭakalpanā agre 
māyāśaktidarśanaṃ copavarṇanaṃ cāsiddhaṃ brahmavidyādhidevatāyāḥ paraśakterambikāyāḥ prasādādvimṛśyamānārthanirṇayo bhaviṣya(-)
tītyabhiprāye<p42a., f32b/36b., l1.>ṇa tāṃ dhyāyatāṃ teṣāṃ tatsākṣātkāropavarṇanaparatvāt te dhyānayogānugatā iti 
mantrasyāta eva tatra śaktiśabdasyāvidyā sādhāraṇyāt tadgrahaṇa(ṇaṃ)mābhūditi ātmeti viśeṣaṇaṃ ambikā hi deva<l2.>sya 
candramaulerātmabhūtāśakti(-)rācakṣate tayorbhedamajñānāt paramārthato bhedaḥ śivayoḥ siddhaḥ vahnidāhakayorivetyādismaraṇāt avidyā 
tu tasyānātmabhūtā mithyātvāduktaṃ ca saṃjñepa<l3.>śārīrake cicchaktiḥ parameśvarasya vimalacaitanyamevocyate| astyevāsya 
jaḍā parāparā bhagavataḥ śaktistvavidyocyata iti na cātmapadasya vepadena karmadhāraye śaktiśabdasyāvidyā<l4.>paratvamapi 
saṃbhavatīti śaṅkanīyaṃ tadā dīrghasomesantradye dhṛtyā ityatra somapadasya prakṛte jyotiṣṭome vratau samānādhikaraṇadīrghapadasyeva 
svetarūpeṇābhiniṣpadyata <l5.> ityatrātmīyaparatve svena padasyeva ca ihānyatarasya padasyāsyā vyāvartakatayā vaiyarthyā(-)
patterviśeṣaṇaviśeṣyabhāvāsaṃbhavena karmadhārayānupapatteśca na ca <l6.> dvandvatatpuruṣayoruttarapade nityaṃ samāsavacanamiti 
vārtikasya vāktvacapriyacitragavayana ityādisamāsa(-)kṛtavairūpyasaṃbhavasthalaviṣayatvāt bṛhadrathantara<l7.>sāmakārya itivadiha 
vinaivāyavatatpuruṣamanekapadasamāsa iti śakituṃ śakyate (.....)hītvādanekamanyapadārtha iti bahuvrīhibhāva 
evānekagrahaṇenānekapada<l8.>samāsajñāpanāt kathañcitasādhutvasaṃbhave'pi vaiyarthyasya vajralepāyitatvācca kiṃ 
cekṣaṇadhyānayorekakāryakāraṇabhūtayorartha autsargike iti kṣatikarmādhikaraṇo<l9.>ktarītyā darśanadhyānayoḥ 
kāryakāraṇayorekaviṣayatvaṃ vaktavyaṃ na ca tadupapadyate darśanasyā(-)vidyāviṣayatvapakṣe idānīṃ sahakāriṇī sandihānā(-)mekasmin 
<p42b., f33a/37a., l1.> sahakāritvanirṇayo bhaviṣyatītyavagacchatāṃ jaḍaśaktiviṣayameva nirṇayarūpajñānamuddiśya 
tadhyāge pravṛtyayogena dhyānam| brahmaviṣaya(.....)t <l2.> tasmādambikāprasādādasmākamayamartho nirṇayo 
bhaviṣyatītyabhiprāyeṇa pratyakṣīkaraṇāya tāṃ dhyāntastāmapaśyadityetadarthapara(.....)yogānugatā iti mantraḥ tat kṛtvā 
(....)kṣamahimnā <l3.> paramakāraṇaṃ mahādevaṃ paśyannityetadarthaparo yaḥ kāraṇānītyādyanantaramantrasandarbha iti 
yukta(.......)sarvamabhipretyohaṃ mahāde(.....)(-)ṣṭyā tvamiti manīṣāsīdyamavatāmiti yamavatāmiti yamādyaṅga<l4.>kaṃ 
yogamāsthitānāmityarthaḥ mahādevyā iti karmaṇi kartari vā ṣaṣṭhī tataśca taddarśanāt tatkṛpākaṭākṣāditi vārthaḥ evamevaṣāṃ 
mantrāṇāmarthaniṣkarṣaḥ kūrmapurāṇe saṃkṣipya spaṣṭīkṛtaḥ <l5.> sametya te mahātmāno munayo brahmavādinaḥ| vitedire bahūnvā 
dānātmavijñānasaṃśrayān| kimasya jagato mūlamātmā vāsmākameva hi| kopī syāt sarvabhūtānāṃ heturī<l6.>śvara eva ceti 
evaṃ manyamānānāṃ dhyānakarmāvalambinām| āvirāsīnmahādevī gaurī girivarātmajā ityārabhya nirīkṣitāste parameśapatnyā 
tadantare devamaśeṣahetum| paśya<l7.>nti śambhuṃ kavimīśitāraṃ rudraṃ brahmaṃ taṃ puruṣaṃ purāṇamityādinātra kimasya jagato 
mūlamiti kiṃ kāraṇaṃ brahma kutasmajātā ityetadartho darśitaḥ| ātmā vāsmākameva hīti jīvā<l8.>ma 
kenetyādivimarśajātārthaḥ ātmaśabdasyādhiṣṭhātṛparatvāt ko'pi syādityādinā kālasvabhāva 
ityādimantrapratipāditakālakāraṇatvādi vādinirāsasāmarthyasiddhasarvakāraṇatva<l9.>sarveśvaratvaviśiṣṭapuruṣasaṃpratipattyupanyāsena 
saṃśayānāṃ brahmadharmikatvaṃ spaṣṭīkṛtamityādi(-)vyaktaṃ śivapurāṇe'pyambikāmāhātmyaṃ prastutya| mumukṣayā purā <p43a., 
f33b/37b., l1.> kecinmunayo brahmavādinaḥ| saṃśayāviṣṭamanaso vimṛśanti yathātatham| kiṃ kāraṇaṃ kuto jātā jīvāmaḥ 
kena vā vayam| kvacāsmākaṃ saṃpratiṣṭhā vardhitāḥ kena vā vayam| kena vaktā <l2.>mahe śaśvat sukheṣvanyeṣu vā niśam| 
avilaṅghyā ca viśvasya vyavasthā kena vā kṛtā| kālasvabhāvo niyatiryadṛcchā vātra vartate| bhūtāni yoniḥ puruṣo yogo vaiṣāṃ 
puro'thavā| acetanatvā<l3.>t kālādeścetanatve'pi cātmanaḥ| sukhaduḥkhā(-)bhibhūtatvādanīśatvādvicāryate| te dhyānayogānugatāḥ 
prāpaśyacchaktimaiśvarīm| pāśavicchedikāṃ sākṣānnigūḍhāṃ <l4.> svaguṇairbhṛśam| tayā vicchinnapāśāste sarvakāraṇakāraṇam| 
śaktimantaṃ mahādevaḥ paśya divyacakṣuṣā| yaḥ kāraṇānyaśeṣāṇi kālātmasahitānyapi| aprameyo<l5.>nayā śaktyā 
sākamekodhitiṣṭhatītyādinā sphuṭīkṛtaḥ| tasmāduktavidhayā śivasya genmūlakāraṇatvanirṇayārthā e vai te mantrāḥ| nanvasatvevaṃ 
tathāpi śiva eva <l6.> kāraṇamiti kuto'vadhāraṇasiddhiḥ śrutyantarāmnāteṣu sṛṣṭiprakaṇādiṣu de(....)ntara(-)nāmnāmapi kāraṇe 
brahmaṇi yogadarśanādityāśaṅkyāha||17|| <l7.>

pravṛtteṣvanyārthaṃ prabhu tilakasargaśrutigaṇeṣvamukhyārthaṃ yuktaṃ matamapi padaṃ kāraṇaparam| iha tvannāmeśo hara iti ca taṃ 
nirṇayavacasya mukhyārthānītaṃ <l8.> yadi vatahatā nirṇayakathā|| ayamarthaḥ sṛṣṭiprakaraṇeṣu 
sṛṣṭrṛsadbhāvasraṣṭavyapadārthaviśeṣatatkramādipratipādanena kṛtā (.....)(....) ṇe brahmaṇi prayuktā devatāntaravācinaḥ <p43b., 
f34a/38a., l1.> śabdāḥ śaktyā mukhyārthatāt paryavidhunāma kalpayituṃ tathā svīkṛtāśca tadviṣayā 
prāṇākāśākṣarādiśabdā udāhṛtamantrajāte sraṣṭraśrutyantara(.....)ditaṃ sraṣṭrṛsadbhāvādikaṃ siddhaṃ kṛtvā <l2.> sraṣṭrabrahmaṇo 
devatāviśeṣarūpeṇa niṣkarṣārthaṃ pravṛtte ni(...)yavākye kāraṇe prayuktaṃ śivasādhāraṇaṃ nāma svavācyopasthāpanaika(....)janamananyaparaṃ 
na svārthatātparyavidhu <l3.>raṃ kalpayituṃ śakyamiti tathā ca paurṇamāsyāmāgneyāgnīṣomīyayoḥ krameṇānuṣṭhānāyāpekṣite 
smṛtikrame'nuṣṭheyārthasmṛtyaikaprayojanamantrapāṭhakrama<l4.> eva niyāmaka iti tadvirodhādvidhātena caritārthayoḥ brāhmaṇayoḥ 
pāṭhakramo na niyāmakaḥ tathācchāndogyabṛhadāraṇyakādiṣu sṛṣṭivākyādiṣu sāmā<l5.>nyato'vagatasadbhāvasya sraṣṭurapekṣite 
viśeṣa(-)paryavasāne viṣayopanyāsapūrvakaṃ śivasyākaraṇatva(-)nirṇayārthapravṛttaṃ kiṃśabdenaucityāt koṭyantaratvena <l6.> vimṛṣṭānāṃ 
devatāntarāṇāṃ kāraṇatvavyudāsaparyavasāyyudāhṛtamantra(-)jātameva niyāmakaṃ na tu prameyāntarapratipādanena caritārthāni 
sṛṣṭivākyānīti tatra sṛṣṭivā<l7.>kye kāraṇe śrūyamāṇamapi devatāntaranāmabṛndamaśvamedhanacatustraṃśaditi brūyāt 
ṣaḍviṃśatirityeva brūyāt ityasmin tat pratiṣidhya prakṛtirniyujyeta sā catustraṃśadvācyatvā<l8.>dityadhikaraṇanyāyena 
catustriṃśadvājino devabandhoriti vaiśeṣikādhriguvacana(-)pratiṣedhamātrapare vākye ṣaḍviṃśatirityeva brūyāt iti 
codakaprāptādhriguva<p44a., f34b/38b., l1.>canānuvādabhāgaṣaḍviśatiriti saṃkhyāviśeṣagrahaṇe tātparyavaidhuryāt 
ṣaḍviṃśatirabhyāsena paśupagaṇe tatprakṛtitvādityadhikaraṇoktanyāyaprāptasya purago mṛgayoraśvasya <l2.> ca vaṃkrīṇāṃ sasya 
vacanasya bādhena yathā prāptāddhriguvacanamātra iva mantropaniṣan mantrasamarpita eva viśeṣe paryavasānamarhatīti bhāvaḥ| etenedaṃ 
nirastaṃ yat pare prāhuḥ jagatkāraṇaṃ <l3.> vastuśchāndogyādiṣu sadbrahmātmādiśabdairuttarottaraṃ viśeṣaparyavasāyibhiścetanarūpāt 
paryantabuddhigṛhītaṃ mahopaniṣadādiṣu anitarasādhāraṇena nārāyaṇaśabdenābhi<l4.>dhānāt chāgo mantravarṇāditi nyāyena nārāyaṇa 
eva paryavasyati kvacit kvacit pradeśe kāraṇe śrūyamāṇānāṃ śivaśaṃkhādiśabdānāṃ śivāste santu panthānaḥ <l5.> 
śambhu(mbhuḥ) svayambhurdruhiṇa ityādidarśanādasādhāraṇyāditi yathāstinārāyaśabdasya viṣṇāvasādhāraṇyaṃ tathā śive haraśabdasyāpi 
anyatrānuśāsanādyadarśanāt tathā ca <l6.> paroktanyāyena nirṇayāsambhavādasmaduktarītyā haraśabdasya tātparyavatvāt tata eva 
nirṇayo yuktaḥ na ca kvacit kvacinnārāyaṇaśabdasya kāraṇe'bhyāsadarśanā<l7.>t tasyāpi tātparyavatvamavagamitamiti vācyaṃ 
tatra bahu śobhyastasyāpi tasya tadviṣayaprāṇākāśādiśabdavadvṛtyantarakalpanāsahī kutve nānyathā siddhatvādiha <l8.> 
svavācyataditaradevatāviśeṣakoṭikāraṇasaṃśaya(...)ntaranirṇayavākye śrutasya haraśabdasyāyaṃ sthāṇuḥ puruṣo veti saṃśayānantaramayaṃ 
puruṣa eveti <p44b., f35a/39al1.> śrutasya puruṣaśabdasyeva vyavacchedanīyyāyāḥ pratikoṭau vṛtyayogāt yattu 
śivādiśabdānāṃ śive sādhāraṇyaṃ nāstītyuktaṃ tatra śivaśabde tāvat pṛcchāmaḥ (.....)sya panthānaḥ santu te śivā <l2.> 
ityādiprayogaviṣayasādhāraṇaśubhatā rūḍi(ḍhi)vyatirekeṇa śive asādhāraṇarūpeṇa śaktireva nāstītyucyate uta tatsatve 
vyaktādiśabdavadanekārthakatvāt svato na nirṇāyakatvamiti <l3.> nādyaḥ kalyāṇaṃ maṅgalaṃ śiva(-)mityanuśāsanavyatirekeṇa 
śivaḥ śūlī maheśvaraḥ īśānaḥ śaśikhekharaḥ rudraḥ paśupatiḥ śūlī śivaḥ śaṅkaraḥ vyomakeśo mahādevaḥ pramathādhipatiḥ śivaḥ śivaṃ 
<l4.> mokṣe ca bhadre ca salile ca śive hare| śivo pe(pa?)le padmarāge hare kīle śivaṃ jale| śivaṃ bhadraṃ śivaḥ śambhuḥ śivā 
gaurī śivāhayetyādyananyathā siddhānuśāsanabalādvi<l5.>ṣṇurnārāyaṇaḥ kṛṣṇa ityādyanuśāsanabalāt kṛṣṇaśabdasya 
varṇaviśeṣarūḍhivyatirekeṇa viṣṇāviva śastaṃ cātha triṣu dravye pāpapuṇyasukhāni ceti smṛtāṃ sarva<l6.> 
dravyasādhāraṇīmarthavalliṅgatāṃ vinā nityapulliṅgatāyā asādhāraṇarūpeṇāpi tasya tatra śakterabhyupa(-)gantavyatvāt anyathā 
pathyādivadeva tatra pṛthaganuśāsanā<l7.>napekṣaṇena vaiyarthyāpatteḥ nāpi dvitīyaḥ kevalayogena prakaraṇādinā prayujyamānasyāsya 
paṅkajādiśabdasya yogarūḍhyubhayānugrahalābhena <l8.> padmaparatvasyeva śivaśabdasya 
śubhatvanīlakaṇṭhatvādiviśiṣṭarūpaviṣayakaśakti(-)dvayānurūpalābhena parameśvaraparatvasyautsargikatayā 
prakaraṇopapadādyanupapīḍitā<l9.>ttataḥ sarvatra parameśvarasya pratīte(teḥ) svata eva tasya nirṇāyakatvāt anekaśaktaikasya 
śabdasya sakṛcchrutasyānekaśakyaparatvaṃ na kvāpi dṛṣṭaṃ yugapadvṛttidvayasya (...) rūḍa(ḍha)tvādayu<p45a., f35b/39b., 
l1.>ktaṃ ceti vācyaṃ sabhaṅgasleṣasthale āvṛttiṃ vinā yagapadanekaśakyānusandhānāsaṃbhavāt saindhavamānayetyādau nānārthasthale 
kramādanusandheyabhaṅgaviśeṣānapekṣaṇena sāmagrīpauṣkalyāt <l2.> yugapadanusaṃhitaśaktidvayena cakṣuṣā 
yugapadutpannasaṃyogadvayenārthadvayaprakāśavadarthadvayasmaraṇopapattāvapi svatantrārthadvayasyāpi pratyekamānayānvayāpattyā 
vākyabhedaprasaṅgāccānyatra <l3.> tathātve'pyatra sabhaṅgatvā(-)bhāvenāvṛttyanapekṣaṇaṃ nikhilabhuvanakṣemaṅkare bhagavati nīlakaṇṭha 
eva pravṛttinimittadvayasyāpi viśrānteḥ svatantrārthadvayaparatvo'prasaṅgena vākyabhedāpatyabhāvācca <l4.>yugapa(-)
dunmiṣatāviruddhaśaktidvayasya yogarūḍi(ḍhi)sthala ivānugrāhyatayā 
saṃbhogasāhacaryādibhiranyatarāvacchedāyogenāsādhāraṇaśivarūpavācinaḥ śivaśabdasya 
nirūpādhiśiva<l5.>rūpatvaparatvasyābhyupagantavyatvāt| samābhavanti me sarve dānavāścāmarāśca ye| śivo'smi sarvaṃ bhūtānāṃ 
śivatvaṃ tena me surā iti karṇaparvaṇi śivavacanena tadvācinaḥ śivaśabda<l6.>sya nirūpādhiśivarūpatāparatvasyāpyavagamācca 
tasmācchivaśabdaḥ śaktidvayānugrahalābhenautsargikyākaśavatāparatvāt tadasādhāraṇa ityeva yuktaṃ etena yogenānya<l7.>trāpi 
prayujyamānānāmīśvaramaheśvareśānaśabdānāmapyasādhāraṇyaṃ vyākhyātam āhuścābhiyuktāḥ yasminnīśvara ityananyaviṣayaḥ śabdo 
yathārthākṣaraḥ iti maheśvaratryambaka eva <l8.> nāpara ityādi īśānaśabdasya tu asādhāraṇyaṃ śabdādeva pramita iti sūtreṇa 
bhagavatā bādarāyaṇenaiva sphuṭīkṛtaṃ (..........) śambhaśabdasya druhiṇasādhāraṇyaṃ śaṅkanīyaṃ tat <l9.> satyameva tathāpi 
śambhurākāśamadhyaga ityādau brahmaṇaḥ kāryakoṭau śravaṇena tatparatvāyoge śivaparatvameva (.......) na tāvatā <p45b., 
f36a/ 40a., l1.> vyavasthā(-)pattiḥ anyathā viṣṇupurāṇe brahmā nārāyaṇākhyo'sau kalpādau bhagavānyathā nārāyaṇākhyo 
bhagavān brahmā lokapitāmaha ityādyanekapradeśeṣu kaurme avāpya saṃjñāṃ <l2.> govindāt padmayoniḥ pitāmaha iti prastutya 
nārāyaṇākhyo bhagavān yathā pūrvaprajāpatirityāśvalāyanasmṛtau| tasmāddaṇḍādabhūt sṛṣṭa(...)śivātmā caturānanaḥ| sarvalokasya 
nirmātā brahmā viśvasṛjāṃ <l3.> patiḥ| sa cāpsu śayanādeva śivātmā svecchayā ciram| nārāyaṇākhyāmabhajacchaktirūpaḥ 
prajāpatiḥ iti ca brahmaṇo'pi nārāyaṇasaṃjñāṃ nidhānena nārāyaṇaśabdena nirṇaya iti parābhimatasyā<l4.>pi bhaṅgāpatteḥ 
tasmānniḥ sādhāraṇyaṃ nārāyaṇapadaviṣaye niścayaṃ yāntyabodhe sat brahmādyāḥ samānaprakaraṇapaṭhitā śaṅkitānyārthaśabdā iti 
paroktamasaṅgatam|| sākṣānmantra<l5.>varṇenaiva sarveṣāṃ kāraṇavākyānāṃ śive paryavasānasya darśitatvācca 
tadvirodhinyāyābhāsamātramavalambya paroktamasaṅgatamityāha||18||

amuṣminnāmnātaḥ<l6.> śikharitanayā vallabhayadā tamastannetyeṣa svayamupadiśan kāraṇagirām| aśeṣāṇāṃ mantro bhavati 
bhagavan paryavasatannayatyunmattānāmitaraparatoktiṃ vipha<l7.>latām|| asyāmevopaniṣadi| yadā tamastaṃ na divā na rātraṃ na 
sanna cāsañchiva eva kevalaḥ| tadakṣaraṃ tassaviturvareṇyaṃ prajñā ca tasmāt prasṛtā purāṇītyāmnā<l8.>yate mantraḥ ayaṃ ca 
sarveṣāṃ kāraṇavākyānāṃ śivaviṣayatvanirdhāraṇārthaḥ kathaṃ yadātama iti tamo vā idameka āsīnnā sadāsīnno sadāsīttadānīṃ 
tama āsīt prajāpatirvā <l9.> idameka āsīt nāharāsīnna rātrirāsīt so'sminnandhe tamasi 
prāsarpadityādiśrutyantarapratipannatamovaśeṣāṅkitakālaviśeṣānuvādena tadityādinā śivasya <p46a., f36b/ 40b., l1.> 
tatkālavartitvena vidhānāt puroḍāśādidravyasambandhatayā āgneyādivākyapratipannānāṃ yāgānāṃ caturavartaṃ juhotīti tattat 
puroḍāśādidravyāvadānasamachaṇḍi(-)homavidhi<l2.>balāt homarūpateva tattatkālavṛttitvena purovādapratipannasya parādiśabdoditasya 
brahmaṇa eva śivarūpatāparyavasyatītyevaṃ tāvat pūrvārdhaṃ keṣāñcitkāraṇavākyānāṃ viṣayavi<l3.>śeṣopasaṃhāraparyavasāyitayā 
tadakṣaramiti muṇḍakādīnāṃ tatsaviturvareṇyamityādityamaṇḍalavartini paramapuruṣe kāraṇatvākṣepakaliṅgaṃ 
sarvāntaryāmitvamupavarṇayantyāṃ gāyatryāṃ <l4.> prajñā ca tasmāt prasṛtā purāṇīti tadaikṣata bahu syāṃ prajāyeti sa īkṣatasrajā 
iti so kāmayata bahu syāṃ prajāyeyeti tapasā cīyate brahmeti ca sraṣṭurādisraṣṭa<l5.>pūkālīnaṃ sraṣṭavya(-)vastujātā locanaṃ 
pratipādayatāṃ chāndogyādiśrutakāraṇavākyānāmīkṣaṇādiśabdairupāttasya sraṣṭavya(...)locanasya tadanyatamaśabdena grahaṇe <l6.> 
tacchabda(-)yuktaśrutimātraviṣayopasaṃhāra(raḥ)syāditi sarvasādhāraṇena prajñāśabdena tadupāyaviṣayaviśeṣopasaṃhāraparyavasāyītyevamayaṃ 
kṛtsno'<l7.>smanmantrasakalakāraṇavākyaviṣaya(-)viśeṣanirdhāraṇārthaḥ evaṃ sākṣādvetopadarśitaviṣayaviśeṣanirdhāraṇaviruddhaṃ 
mūḍhajalpitamanādeyamityarthaḥ yattu<l8.>rairuktaṃ cāyaṃ mantraḥ svayaṃ kāraṇasya tamasaḥ prāpakaḥ yadeti kālaviśeṣaprāptānuvādāt 
prāptiścāvyaktamakṣare līyate akṣaraṃ tamasi līyate tamaḥ pare deve ekībhavatīti <l9.> subālopaniṣadvākyena tasyāṃ 
cāvyaktākṣarakrameṇa yasya śarīramityupakramya eṣa ātmāpahatapāpmā divye (...) deva eko nārāyaṇa iti 
pāṭhānnārāya<p46b., f37a/41a., l1.>ṇādhiṣṭhitasya tamasaḥ prāpakaṃ śrutyantara(-)miha(....)vādamiti 
tadanurodhādanuvādamantraśrutatamo'dhiṣṭhātṛparaḥ śivaśabdo nārāyaṇapara eva (......)| idamekamāsetyādiśrutyantarasya 
purovādatvā<l2.>śrayaṇe'pi tasyāpi sau balavākyapratipannaviśeṣaparyavasāyitvenāviśeṣādevaṃ ca (...)kṣaramityādināpi 
nārāyaṇasyaiva prakāraviśeṣopadeśa iti tatra yathā viśvajit sarvapraṣṭho bhava<l3.>tītyatra vidheyaparabahuviṣayasarvaśabdārthānurodhāt 
bṛhadarthatararūpaprākṛtapṛṣṭhatyāgena ṣāḍahikapraṣṭhānuvādaparatvaṃ kalpyate tayā yadā tama ityasyāpi śivavidhitātparyānuro<l4.>dhāt 
āpātato'nyaviṣayasaubalādi vākyatyāgena śrutyantareṣu virūddhānekaviśeṣaśravaṇāt 
kvacidapyaparyavasitamaitrāyaṇaśrutyādiprāpitārthānuvādapara<l5.>taiveti vaktuṃ śakyatve'pi paramate vṛddhilobhena mūlahāninyāyaṃ 
sūcayituṃ tanmate mantrasyaiva tāvadvaividdhyāpattiṃ darśayati||19||

puro vādaśrutyantaravi<l6.>ditarūpe yadi paraṃ niyacchedātmānaṃ paṭhitamiha mantre śivapadam| yadetyādyaṃ kālaṃ manurayamanūdya 
smara ripo vidhantāṃ kiṃ nāma sthitimavidadhānastava tadā|| ayamarthaḥ <l7.> satyaṃ yadā tama ityanuvādaḥ na tu 
saubalavākyameva purovādaḥ anyeṣāmapyanūdyamānārthasya prāpakāṇāṃ śravaṇenāviśeṣāt nāpi tannadive(-)tyādirapyanuvādaḥ <l8.> 
tadvṛttiyogena tatkāle kasyacidvidheyatāpratīteḥ vidheyaśca tatra na divā na niśā vibhāgābhāvaḥ sadasadātmakaprapañcābhāvo vā 
puro vādebhya eva tayoḥ <l9.> prāpteḥ na hi kiñcidanūdya kiñcidvidhātuṃ pravṛttaṃ vākyamanuvādāyāvaśyāpekṣitāt 
purovādādeva prāpte'rthe paryavasyat sāphalyamaśnuvīta atastatrāpi tadavetyādi<p47a., f37b/41b., l1.>ranuvādaḥ evaṃ ca 
śivaśabdo'pi yadi kathañci(-)dautsargikārthaparatāṃ hitvā puro vādaviśeṣaprāpte nārāyaṇa eva paryavasyet tadā yadā tamastaditi 
kiñcidvidhāyamudyamyārthapathe sthitaṃ <l2.> vākyaṃ kiṃ vidheyamāsādya viśrāmyatu na hi tasya nārāyaṇavṛttitve 
purovādādaprāptaṃ kiñcidarthaṃ paśyāmaḥ tasmāt paramate vākyameva tāvadvaiyarthyaṃ prāptamiti tataśca yathaikavāda vai <l3.> 
paśoravadānāni tāni dviradyatīti vidhivaiparyaparihārāya yadyapi caturavattīyajānaḥ pañcāvattaiva vapākāryetyatra vapāpadasya 
viśiṣya vapāgrahaṇena <l4.> tātparyaṃ kiṃ tu sāmānyataḥ paśuprakṛtikahavirmātragrahaṇa iti nirṇītaṃ tathātrāpyetat 
vidhivaiyarthyaparihārāya purovāde nārāyaṇapadasya viśiṣya viṣṇū<l5.>pādhau na tātparyaṃ kiṃ tu tatsāmānyena 
parabrahmamātropalakṣakatvamiti vyākhyeyam anyathā purovādāntaraśrutaprajāpatiśabdasyāpyeva svārthapara<l6.>tve śivapadasya kva 
paryavasānamityanirṇayāpātā ca| tasmāt tattatpuro(-)vādaśrutatamo'ṣṭhātṛparabrahmaprajāpatinārāyaṇādisakalaśabdārthanirdhāraṇedaṃ 
<l7.> paraitadvidhibalāt saubalaśruterapi śiva eva paryavasānaṃ syāditi bhāvaḥ| paryavasānaprakārastu sa dṛṣṭāntamagre 
vyutpādayiṣyate||20|| <l8.>

kiṃ ca mantropaniṣadaḥ kārtsnyena śivaparatvādapi tadantargatamantrasyānyaparatvoktirayukteti sūcayannetadeva vyavasthāpayati|| 
dayamānotkṛṣṭāharaśivamukhā(-)nanyaviṣaya<l9.>tvadākhāratnālaṅkṛtanikhilamantrā(......)rā| samastaṃ 
naivāstītyupaniṣadumāvallabhadṛḍhaṃ bhavatyevādhatte sakalama(.....)vaṃ guṇanidhau|| vedāntarūpatvāt <p47b., f38a/ 42a., 
l1.> sarvapramāṇamūrdhanyā hara śiveśarudreśānamaheśvaraśabdairlokaprasiddhaiḥ atha kasmāducyate sarvavyāpī| viśvedevāśca yattasmin 
viśvarūpaṃ tata(taḥ) smṛtaḥ| haṃso nāma sadāśivaḥ| athāṣṭabhi<l2.>rnāmabhirityādyatharvaśiro mahābhāratabodhāya na 
sūtrādyavagamitaśivanāmavibhāvitaivaḥ(va) sarvavyāpī viśvarūpahaṃsamahadādiśabdaiścānanyaviṣayairdevatā(-)
ntaraviṣayairanyade<l3.>vatāvāciśabdāntaravyatikararahitairvā śivanāmaratnairalaṅkṛtaiḥ kṣaraṃ pradhānamamṛtākṣaraṃ haraḥ bhāvābhāvakaraṃ śivaṃ 
bhūyaḥ sṛṣṭvā patayastvadheśa eko hi rudro na <l4.> dvitīyyāyatasthuḥ īśāno jyotiravyayaḥ| māyinaṃ tu maheśvaraṃ sarvavyāpī 
ca bhagavān taṃ viśvarūpaṃ bhavabhūtamīḍhyam eko'haṃ so bhuvanasya madhye mahān <l5.> prabhurva puruṣa ityādibhiḥ 
sarvamantrāvayavairmadhurānatatsamaścābhyadhikaśca dṛśyata iti kaṇṭhoktyaiva śivasadṛśapuruṣāntarapratiṣedhaṃ kurvatīyaṃ 
śvetāśvatarāṇāma<l6.>ntropaniṣacchandāṃsi yajñāḥ kratavo vratāni bhūtaṃ bhavyaṃ yacca vedā vadanti| asmānmāyī sṛjate 
viśvametat tasmiṃścānyo māyayā sanniguḍaḥ(ḍhaḥ)| māyāṃ tu prakṛtiṃ <l7.> vidyānmāyinaṃ tu maheśvaram| tasyāvayavabhūtaiśca 
vyāptaṃ sarvaṃ parāvaram| yo devānāṃ prabhavaścodabhavaśca viśvādhiko rudro maharṣiḥ| tamāhuragryaṃ <p48a., f38b/42b., l1.> 
puruṣamahāntaṃ sa eva kālo bhuvanasya goptā viśvādhipaḥ sarvabhūteṣu guḍhaḥ| svabhāvamekekavayo vadanti kālaṃ tathānye 
parimuhyamānāḥ| devasyaiṣamahimā tu loko <l2.> yenedaṃ bhrāmyate brahmacakram| tamīśvarāṇāṃ paramaṃ maheśvaraṃ taṃ devatānāṃ paramaṃ 
ca daivatam| patiṃ patīnāṃ paramaṃ parastāt vidāma devaṃ bhuvaneśamāḍyam| na tasya kaścit patirastu <l3.> lokena ceśitā 
naiva ca tasya liṅgam| sa kāraṇaṃ kāraṇakāraṇādhipo na cāsya kaścijjanitā na cādhipaḥ| sa viśvakṛdviśvavidātmayoniḥ 
jñaḥ kāla<l4.>kālo guṇī sarvavidyaḥ| pradhānakṣetrajñapatirguṇeśaḥ saṃsāramokṣasthitibandhahetuḥ| yo brahmāṇaṃ vidadhāti pūrvaṃ yo vai 
vedāṃśca prahiṇo<l5.>ti tasmai| taṃ ha devamātmabuddhiprakāśaṃ mumukṣurvai śaraṇamahaṃ prapadya ityādi mantreṣvatyantābhyāsa(saḥ) 
sphuṭīkṛtam| saka mūlaprakṛtyadhiṣṭhātṛtvasarvakāraṇa<l6.>tvasarveśvaratvasarvottamatvānanyādhipatvamumukṣū pāsyatvādiparabhāvaviṣayaṃ 
sarvaṃ bhāvamanekamantrābhyasyamānaśivarudrādiśrutisamarpite nikhila(-)<l7.>kalyāṇaguṇaratnākare bhavati sāmbaśiva eva nidhāya 
kātsnye(rtsnye)na tatraiva paryavasitetyarthaḥ| atra viśeṣaṇasāmyādaprastutanāyikāvṛttāntasya samāsoktyaiva <p48b., 
f39a/43a., l1.> gamyatayā tadvācipadāprayogaḥ spaṣṭīkṛtaṃ cāsyāḥ kārtsnyena śivaparatvaṃ kūrmapurāṇe suśīlo(......)ne 
athāsminnantare paśyāmi (....)yāntaṃ mahāmunim| śvetāśvatara<l2.>nāmānaṃ mahāpāśupatottamamityādinā suśālasya rājñaḥ 
śvetāśvatarasya maharṣerdarśanaṃ tadvadanādikaṃ śiṣyabhāvena parigrahaprārthanaṃ copyasya so'nugrāhyādirājāna(-)mityādinā 
maharṣesta<l3.>tprārthanasyāṅgīkāramuktvā dadau tadaiśvaraṃ jñānaṃ svaśākhoktaṃ hitaṃ padam| aśeṣavidasiddhaṃ tat 
paśupāśavimocanamiti paśupatijñānasya śvetāśvatara(-)śākhoktatva<l4.>kīrtanena uvāca śiṣyān saṃprekṣya etadāśramavāsinaḥ| 
brāhmaṇān kṣatriyān vaiśyān brahmacaryaparāyaṇān| mayā pradarśitāṃ śākhāmadhītyeveha yoginaḥ| samāsatamehā <l5.> deva 
dhyāyanto niṣkalaṃ śivam| iha devo mahādevo ramamā(........)homayā| adhyāste bhagavānīśo bhaktānāmanukampayeti 
tacchākoktamārgeṇa teṣāṃ <l6.> śiva(-)dhyānopavarṇanādinā ca iyaṃ hyupaniṣat śvetāśvatareṇa ma(.....)ṇā darśitā śākhā tapaḥ 
prasādāddeva deva prasādācca brahma viśvetāśvatarotha vidvān| <l7.> antyāśramibhyaḥ paramaṃ pavitraṃ provāca 
samyagṛṣisaṅghajuṣṭamityante śravaṇa(....) vāyusaṃhitāyāṃ caturthe'dhyāye paśupatinirṇayādhyāye śivaparatvamasyāḥ <l8.> 
prapañcenopadarśitam| yattvasyāḥ śivaparatva(-)masahamānaiḥ parairukta(....)tri(tṛ)tīyedhyāye vedāhametaṃ puruṣaṃ mahāntamiti 
puruṣasūktapaṭhitamantrāmnānena <p49a., f39b/43b., l1.> tat pratipādyasya nārāyaṇasya pratyabhijñāpanāt 
tatparatāsyāpyavasīyate na ca tenedaṃ pūrṇaṃ puruṣeṇa sarvamityantena tamanūdya tato yaduttarataramityādimantreṇa tataḥ parasyaiva 
<l2.> kasyacidvedanamamṛtatvasādhanamuktvā tadanantaramantre tasmāt sarvagataḥ śiva iti tatra śivapadaprayogāttato'pi 
śivaparatvena śivapratipādana evāsyāstātparyamiti vācyaṃ prathamameva vedāhametamiti <l3.> mantreṇa nārāyaṇavedanasyaiva 
mokṣahetutvasya yasmāt paraṃ netyantaramantreṇa tasmāt parābhāvasya ca pratipādanāt tadanantaraśrutamantrasandarbhasya tadviruddhe'rthe 
tātparya<l4.>kalpanāyogena tatrāpi sahasraśīrṣāpuruṣaḥ puruṣa evedaṃ sarvamiti pauruṣasūktamantradvayaprayabhijñānāt satvasyaiṣa 
pravartaka iti satvaguṇopādhi<l5.>liṅgopanyāsācca tasyāpi nārāyaṇaparatve niścayena ca tadanurodhena tacchabdadvayasya 
pūrvamantrārdhahetukaraṇe pūrvamantrāntanirduṣṭasya viśvasyāvadhīka<l6.>raṇe vā tātparyakalpanāditi tannirākaroti||21||

kvacit puṃsūktasya spṛśati śivamantrāniti kadhaṃ(thaṃ) jahātveṣā ke śrutiniyamitāṃ tvadviṣayatām| <l7.> api 
śrīrudrāṇāmiha bahuṣu mantreṣu bhagavannadhīte teṣvajñānāṃ kimiva ca tato nirṇayavacaḥ|| śrutayo hi pratyabhijñānāt 
sthaladvayaparāmarśāpekṣita<l8.>tvena vilambitāt balavattarāḥ 
tadhā(thā)copaniṣadupakramamārabhyānuvartamānātyantābhyastāneka(....)(-)dhānaśrutiprāptiṃ śivaviṣayatvamapodyanadevatāntara<p49b., 
f40a/44a., l1.>viṣayatvamāpādayatuṃ śaknoti puṃsūktamantrapratyabhijñāśchāndogyaśrutāyāmupaniṣadupakramaparyā(-)
locanālabdhodgīthāvayavaviṣayāyāmudgīthavidyāyāṃ <l2.> 
bṛhadāraṇyaśrutakṛtvenā(no)dgīyakartṛviṣayot(...)gīyavidyāprakaraṇapaṭhitadevāsurasaṃgrāmāsurātyayābhiprāyādyarthavāda(-)pratyabhijñeva 
tadekaviṣayatvaṃ paśukāma syāt <l3.> so'māvāsyāmiṣṭvā vatsānapākuryāt yedhyamāstānviṣṇave śapiviṣṭāya śrate caruṃ ye 
sthaviṣṭhā satānindrāya pradātre dadhaṃścarumiti viśiṣṭakarmavidhivākyebhyuda<l4.>yeṣṭiśrutadevatāsaṃbandhaparavākyacchāyāprayabhijñeva 
ca dadhipayoḥ pradeyadharmavatvamiti bhāvaḥ na ca tatra tatra pratipādyabhede'pi arthavādādimātra<l5.>sārūpyaṃ na viruddhamiha tu 
puṃsūktamantropaniṣadoḥ pratipādyabhede dvayoḥ sāyārthyādyayogāt puruṣa evedaṃ sarvamiti nānyaḥ pandhā(thā) iti <l6.> 
cobhayatra pātro viruddha iti vācyam aikātmyavāde vāstavaikyasatvena bhūmātmanoriva paramate 
puruṣasūktasāṇḍilyavidyayorvidyā<l7.>bhede'pi tadviṣayayoriva ca sārvātmyopadeśasya sarvamūrtyanusūtanirupādhicaitanyābhiprāyeṇa 
tadvedanasyaiva muktyupāyatvamityavadhāra<l8.>ṇasya ca tayoḥ pratipādyamūrtibhedepyupapannatamatvāt pararītyāśrayaṇe'pi 
śivasyāpi sarvo vai rudraḥ ahamekaḥ prathamā saṃvaktāmi ca bhaviṣyāmi ca <l9.> nānyaḥ kaścana matto vyatiriktaḥ jñātvā 
tanmṛtyamatyeti nānyaḥ panthā vimuktaya ityādiśrutiṣu sarvātmyādyupadeśadarśanenānyatarasārvātmyopadeśasya <p50a., 
f41a/45a., l1.> āpo va idaṃ sarvamityādivat gauṇatvasya dvayorapi krameṇa muktyarthaṃ bhajanīyatvena prāsādādhirohaṇe 
sopānaparvaṇoriva tayoḥ paryantaravyavacchedena muktyupāyopade<l2.>śasya ca samarthayitavyatayā śrutyantareṣvivātrapi śivasya 
sarvātmyādyupadeśasya śrutidvaye'pi pratipādyayorjagatkāraṇatvāvagamasya balānurodhinyā vyavasthāyā vakṣyamāṇanyāyena 
mūlakāraṇatvāvā<l3.>ntarakāraṇatvaviṣayatvasya copapannatvenānyathāsiddhapratyabhijñāmātreṇa prabalānekaśrutibādhanāyogāt anyathā 
mantropaniṣanmantrapratyabhijñayā puruṣasūktasyaiva parābhimatanārāyaṇavāci <l4.> puruṣaśrutyādivādhe(de)na śivaparatvamiti 
vaiparītyāpatteḥ duṣparihāratvātta(-)smādakiñcitkaramiha puruṣasūktapratyabhijñānaṃ paropanyastaṃ liṅgaṃ tu 
satvaśabdyānekārthatvādane<l5.>kaśrutiviruddhaikaliṅgānunmeṣārcanaśaṅkārhamityupekṣitaṃ kiṃ ca rudrādhyāyamantrāṇāmapīha paṭhitatvena 
tatpratyabhijñāyā apīha satvāt tāmanādṛtya puruṣasūktapratyabhi<l6.>jñaikapakṣapātena pareṣāṃ tathā nirṇayakathāvṛthetyāha api 
śrīrudrāṇāmiti paṭhyate hyasyāṃ tri(tṛ)tīyādhyāya eva yā te rudra śivā tanūḥ yāmuṣuṃ giriśantahasta iti mantradvayaṃ<l7.> 
na ca mā hiṃsīḥ puruṣaṃ jagadityetadanantaraṃ tataḥ paraṃ brahmaparaṃ bṛhantamityupakramya vedāhametamityādimantrapāṭhādrudrāt paratvena 
viṣṇoḥ pratipādane'syāḥ <l8.> tātparyamiti vācyaṃ prathamameva ya imāṃ lokānīśata īśanī(-)bhirityādimantraiḥ 
sarveśvaratvamuktipradatvasakalasṛṣṭisaṃhārasvātantryaviśvādhikatvādidharmavattayā śivasya pratipādanena tadviru<l9.>ddhe'rthe 
tadanantaramantrasandarbhasya tātparyakalpanāyogāt tatrāpi mānastoka iti rudramantrapratyabhijñānena rudra yatte dakṣiṇamukhaṃ tena mā 
pāhītyamiti rudramantrasamabhivyā<p50b., f41a/45a., l1.>hārānugṛhītadakṣiṇamukhasadbhāvasūcitaśrī 
sadāśivadakṣiṇāmūrtyanyataravigrahaliṅgabalena ca tasyāpi śivaparatvāvasāyācca tadanurodhenātrāpi tataḥ śabdo hetvādipara iti 
<l2.> paroktarītyaiva suvacatayā paro(...) vajreṇaiva prahṛtānāmiha śaṅkānavakāśāt tasmāt parasparapratipakṣite 
(....)bhijñādvaye śivarudrādyābhibhidhānaśrutibhireva devatāvi<l3.>śeṣanirṇayamiti bhāvaḥ pratyabhijñayorapi rudrādhyāyamantrāṇāṃ 
puruṣasūktamantrebhyaḥ prāk paścācca saṃdaṃśanyāyādubhayavata ātmānenāgnyādisādhāraṇye'pi 
śaṅkyamānaistacchru<l4.>tiviṣayabhāvadevatāntaravyāvṛttena rudreti lokaprasiddhena giritragiriśanteti vedaprasiddhena ca śivanāmnā 
ghaṭita(.....)śivāsādhāraṇāneka(-)nāmarūpāyudhādiprakāśanena <l5.> śivaviṣayatvasya spaṣṭa(....)na ca tatpratyabhijñāyāśca 
balavatvāt viṣayaviśeṣaṇasamarpaṇa(-)kṣamakṛtvācca tata evāsyāḥ pratipādyaviśeṣanirṇayo yukta ityāśayenāha||22|| <l6.>
 
manūnāṃ raudrāṇāṃ prathamamanucāmnānamiha yadyadapyetenādha(tha) sphuṭatarabhavaṃ nāmaghaṭitāḥ| dṛḍhaṃ rudrādhyā yo yadapi ca bhavatyeva 
niyatastatasteṣāmeva pramitikaramāmnā<l7.>namiha naḥ|| puṃsūktamantrāstu rudramantrasandaṃśamadhyapatitā na pṛthamamāmnātāḥ na ca 
devatāviśeṣāsādhāraṇapadaghaṭitāḥ puṃsūktasya śivādanyatra paryavasānamityatra na kiñcit <l8.> pramāṇamasti 
puruṣaśabdāsādhāraṇyasya prāgeva nirākaraṇāt tathañcidetat sūktapratipādyasyāsādhāraṇyena puruṣāsādhāraṇakalpanāyāmapi tāvatā 
śivādanyatra paryavasā<l9.>nābhāvādanyasya ca śrutyādīnāmanyatamasya pramāṇasyānupalambhāditi tatpratyabhijñāyā daurbalyaṃ 
viruddhaviṣayasamarpaṇākṣamatvaṃ cārthāt sūcitam| evaṃ <p51a., f41b/45b., l1.> puruṣasūktasya devatāntaraparatve'pi 
śrutīnāṃ rudropaniṣatpratyabhijñāyāśca prabalatvādvastuto devatāntaraparatvepramāṇānupalambhācca tatpratyabhijñānaḥ kiñcit karamiti 
<l2.> mantropaniṣadaḥ kārtsnyena śivaparatvamāsthitaṃ nirvyūḍhamadhunā tatprasaṅgāttasyāpi śivaparatvamevābhyupagantuṃ 
yuktamityupapādayati||23||

ūrīkartuṃ yuktā harapuruṣasūktasya ca <l3.> budhaistu yīśānaśrutyā samadhigamite paryavasatiḥ| bhavatvapyanyanye jyāvidhiṣu 
viniyogo vidhibalādado nirvāhārthānyapi vivaraṇāni smṛtikṛtām|| utāmṛtatvasyeśāna itīśānapa<l4.>daśrutiḥ| rūḍyā(ḍhyā) 
śivamupasthāpya sūktaṃ nayati tadvaśam| nanvamṛtatvasyeti śatavyopādānātta(-)daiśvaryarūpayaugikārthavidhitsāyā prayuktamīśānapadaṃ 
sarvasyaivā ca īśā<l5.> netyatraiva kevalalaukikatvānna rūḍyā(ḍhyā) śivapratipādakatvamiti cenna tadanupādāna iva 
tadupapādānepyavayavaśaktyā yaukikārthaṃ pratipādayata eva tasya samudāya<l6.>śaktyā śivasyāpi pratipādakatvasyautsargikasya 
durvāratvādiha kevalayaugikatvasyaivāsiddheḥ nahyavayavārtha(...)ti sambandhyānupādāna eva samudāyaśaktyunmeṣa <l7.> iti 
kaścit vyutpatti(-)siddho niyamaḥ śabdādeva pramita ityadhikaraṇe aṅguṣṭhamātraḥ puruṣa iti mantrapratipādyasya puruṣasya īśāno 
bhūtabhavyasyetīśatapopādāne<l8.>pīśānaśrutyā parabrahmanirṇayādanyathā tatrāpīśānaśabdādaiśvaryarūpaparabrahmaliṅgamātrapratītyā 
tadabhidhāna(-)śrutirūpaśabdānnirṇayābhāvāpātāt na ca tatra liṅgāde<l9.>deva nirṇayo'stviti vācyaṃ 
prathamaśrutālpaparimāṇarūpajīvaliṅgavirodhinā caramaśrutena liṅgamātreṇa nirṇaya(-)yogāttasya jīvaliṅgatvābhāve 
pūrvapakṣabījābhā<p51b., f42a/46a., l1.>venādhikaraṇā(...)rambhāyatteḥ sūtre śabdapadasyāsāmāñjasyāpatteśca 
yathāśrutārthasamarthana(-)saṃbhavena tasya kliṣṭārthāntarakalpanāsahiṣṇutvāt parairapi tatra <l2.> tasya sābhimate brahmaṇi 
śaktyabhimānena īśvarasambandhiliṅgānnirṇayaḥ kiṃtvīśvaravāciśabdādeve(-)tyevakārābhiprāya ityuktatvācca tasmādaṅguṣṭhamantravat 
puruṣasūktasyāpīśānaśrutasamarpite <l3.> parabrahmaṇi śrīsadāśive paryavasānamiti yuktam| nanvasya sāmavidhi(-)brāhmaṇe idaṃ 
viṣṇuḥ prakṣasya  viṣṇurityādinā vaiṣṇavyāṃ saṃhitāyāmupadeśāt ātharvaṇe'ṣṭādaśamahāśāntiprakaraṇe tattacchānti<l4.>ṣu 
tattaddaivatyamantraviniyogāvasareṇa vaiṣṇavyāṃ puruṣa(-)sūktamiti vidhānāt śaunakabodhāyanādismṛtiṣu viṣṇupūjādhyānahomādiṣu 
viniyogācca viṣṇuparatvaṃ <l5.> pratīyata ityāśaṅkyāha| bhavatvityayamāśayaḥ astitāvacchivārādhane'pi 
viniyogastadabhidhānaśrutyādyanukūlaḥ bodhāyanasūtre śivasaṅkalpādibhiḥ saha śrīrudrāṅganyā<l6.>mantreṣūpadeśācchāndogānāṃ 
keṣāñcidvājasaneyi(-)kānāṃ ca mahārudrajapamadhye viniyogāt| namakaṃ camakaṃ caiva puruṣasūktaṃ ca nityaśaḥ| japaṃ neti 
mahā<l7.>devaṃ grahaṃ grahapatiryatheti purāṇeṣvapi śravaṇādvāstuśāntā vā vāhya kumbhe deveśaṃ rudraṃ bhuvananāyakamityupakramya namakaṃ 
camakaṃ caiva pauruṣaṃ sūktameva ca| <l8.> ityādinā jape viniyojanāt laiṅgyādityapurāṇādiṣu sa kṛccena sapuṣpeṇa 
snāpayenmantrapūrvakam| mantrāṃśca te puravakṣmāmi śruṇu sarvārthasiddhaye ityupakramya jyeṣṭha<l9.>sāmnātrayeṇaiva tathā devavratairapi| 
rathantareṇa puṇyena sūktena puruṣeṇa veti śivā(-)bhiṣekamantreṣu parigaṇanācca evaṃ ca yathā udbudhyasvāgne agniṃ <p52a., 
f42b/46b., l1.> mūrdhādivaḥ kakudityādimantrāṇāṃ gṛhayajñe tattatgrahārādhane tattaddaivatya(-)mantravidhānāvasare 
budhabhaumādipu(pū)jāsu vihitānāmapi bahuśastadārādhanajapahomādiṣu viniyojyamānā<l2.>nāmapi viruddhaviniyogamātreṇa śruti 
tadanukūlaviniyogā(-)ntaraprāpitamāgneyatvādikaṃ na hīyate tathāsyāpyatha nārāyaṇāmupasthānaṃ yajet puruṣasūktena dhanadaṃ 
viśvarūpiṇamityā<l3.>pastambasūśātātapasmṛtyādi vā siddhaviniyogā(-)ntareṇaiva viṣṇusamārādhane viniyogenāpi śrutaprāptaṃ 
tadanurodhi viniyogānumoditaṃ tvaśivaparyavasāyitvaṃ na hīyata iti| <l4.> nanvastvevaṃ viniyogamātrasyānyāsiddhiḥ tathā 
viṣṇupurāṇeṣu keṣuṭit pāñcarātrasaṃhitāviśeṣeṣu ca nārāyamasya etatsūktapratipādyasya 
sahasraśīrṣatvādiviśi<l5.>ṣṭabrāhmaṇatvādyutpattisthānatattadavayavayuktarūpopa(-)deśaistatsūktasthatanmantrārthakadhanamukhena 
nārāyaṇaparatayā vivaraṇadarśanāt tatparatvamabhyupagantavya<l6.>mupabrahmaṇānurodhitvādvaidikārthāvyavasthāyā ityāśaṅkya mantra(-)
vivaraṇarūpo parabrahmaṇānāṃ śrutiviniyogāntaranirvāhakārthatvenānyathāsiddhasaṃbhavāt <l7.> naitacchruti 
tadanukūlaviniyogāvagamitam| dyaurmūrdhā vibhvostasya khaṃ nābhiḥ parameṣṭhinaḥ| vaiśyāścorupradeśāttu śūdraḥ pādāt pinākina 
ityādilaiṅgādidṛṣṭopabrahma<l8.>ṇāntarānumoditaṃ ca śivaparatvamasya hāpayituṃ śakyamityāśayenāhādhido nirvāhārthānīti idaṃ 
mantravivakṣitaṃ astvanyadaivatānāmapi mantrāṇāṃ vidhibalamabhevatāntaraya<l9.>jane'pi viniyogaḥ sa ca mantrādhikaraṇanyāyena 
mantraviniyogasya vākyārthapratipādanadvāratvānmantrasthitaṃ devatāpareṇa padena mukhyavṛttyabhāve <p52b., f43a/47a., l1.> 
aindryadhikaraṇanyāyena vṛtyantareṇāpi yajanīyadevatāyāḥ pratipādanena tatsamabhivyāhṛtaviśeṣaṇapadānāṃ ca (.....) rityagradarbhādiṣu 
haritatvavattatra saṃbhavadarthā<l2.>nāṃ tadviśeṣaṇaguṇādiprakāśanadvārā somaḥ pavatejanitāmatī(-)nāmiti mantre 
somalatāyāmindrādijanayitṛtvattatrāsambhāvitārtha(...)masavetasyāpi samavetaviśeṣaṇasyābhidhānaṃ 
mantra<l3.>śrutaviśeṣaṇaviśiṣṭarūpaprakāśana(-)mabhya(....)kārīti (....)mā dṛṣṭārthamatyavacanaṃ teṣāmitarārthaprayujyata iti 
nāvamikā(....)raṇe vyavasthāpanādabhyudayārtha(...)ma(...)nmasuvaḥ suvaraga<l4.>nmetyatra phalābhidhānavadādarātiśayajananārthaṃ vā 
tadasamavetasyāpi guṇajātasyābhidhānadvārā tatra paryavasānena nirvāhya iti viditametanmīmāṃsāparicayaśāli<l5.>nāṃ tadiha 
puruṣasūktasya śrutyādiniyamitaśivaikāntasyāpi śrutismṛtidṛṣṭaviniyogāntaranirvāhāya 
dhanadādipratipādanaprakāravannārāyaṇapratipādanaprakā<l6.>rasyāpi kasyaci(-)tpurāṇadyabhāve puruṣabudhyāpi kalpanīyatvāt sa eva 
tatsamārādhanatadaṅgatatphalādiprapañcapradhāneṣu purāṇāgameṣu niyamiti ityanyathā<l7.>siddhānyupabrahmaṇāni dṛśyante hi 
asa(.....)tārthaviśeṣaṇānāmapi mantrāṇāṃ tathaiva purāṇāgameṣūpabrahmaṇāni somaṃ sasarjayanhārthaṃ somassomādandhā<l8.>yata| dharā 
ca vahniḥ sūryaśca vajrapāṇiḥ śacīpatiḥ|| viṣṇurnārāyaṇaśrīmān sarvaṃ somamayaṃ jagat| ityādīni tasmānna tāni 
śrutyādiprācitaṃ śivaparatvaṃ hāpayitumīśata iti na <l9.> caivamekena mantreṇānekārthapratipādane kaścidvirodhaḥ ekasyaiva 
mantrasyānekaviniyojakapramāṇadvayopanipātenānekaviniyogavat tannirvāhānyathānupa<p53a., f43b/47b., 
l1.>pattikalpyasyānekārtha(-)paratvasyāpi pramāṇabalāyā tasya sarvasammatatvālloke'pyekasyaiva padasya 
prayogabhedenānekārthaparatvasyopalambhenātrāpi prayogabhedenānekārtha<l2.>pratipādanasya saṃbhavādvastuvirodhābhāvācca nanvevaṃ 
prayogabhedenāpyanekadevatāpratipādanaparamidaṃ sūktamanekatrāsaṃbhavānnānyaḥ panthā ayanāya vidyata ityādikaṃ pratipādayat kva 
vastu<l3.>vṛtyaitanmahimavastujātaṃ pratipādayati kva vārthasamavetamapi kevalamabhyudayādyarthaprakāśayatīti tathamavaseyamiti 
ceditthamanenakartṛviniyuktānāṃ mantrāṇāṃ yatra devatāyāṃ tadabhidhānaśrutyā<l4.>disadbhāve na svārasyaṃ tatra śrutaviśeṣaṇajātasya 
vastutaḥ pratipādanamityutsargaḥ abhidhānaśrutyānugrahāditi laṅghane kāraṇābhāvāttattaddevatotkarṣavādibhiḥ sarvai<l5.>rapi 
tāntrikairanyatrāpi tatra tatra viniyuktānāṃ tattaddevatāliṅgānāṃ mantrāṇāṃ tattaddevatotkarṣe pramāṇatayo(-)panyāsācca yatra tu 
śabdasvārasya viṣaye <l6.> prati(-)pādyaviśeṣaṇānāṃ mānāntareṇa bādhaniścayaḥ tatrotsargatyāgaḥ yathā mānaṃ 
kathañcidvṛtyantaropasthāpita evānyatra teṣāṃ vastutaḥ pratipādyatvenā<l7.>nvayaḥ anyatrāpyanvayāyogyānāṃ tu kṛtyādyarthavāda 
iti vastusthitiḥ tataśca bhedavāde yadyatrotsargonurudhyate yadi vā tadbādhaśaṅkayā śrutyantara (...) kṣyate ubhayathā<l8.>pi 
paramaśiva evaitanmahimajātaṃ vastuvṛttyā pratipādayatītyava(...)yaṃ tasyaivehābhidhānaśruteḥ pāṭhāttasyai(.....)paniṣadatharvaśiraḥ 
kaivalyavṛtyādiṣu nānyaḥ <l9.> (.....)vidyate'yanāya| yadvā carmavadākāśaṃ teṣāṃ śāntiḥ śāśvatī netareṣām| nānyapanthā 
(...)muktaya itya(.......)ṣu muktyupāyatvāvadhāraṇācca| <p53b., f44a/48a., l1.> etena viniyogopabrahmaṇābhyāṃ 
tasya sūktasya viṣṇuparatva(....)vasthāpanaṃ pareṣāṃ nirastaṃ (....) puruṣaśabda(....)dekasādhāraṇye'pi āruṇake tu ke 
pūrvamevā<l2.>(.....) miti kūrmākṛtiliṅgo(-)pasthāpitasya nārāyaṇasya ca (.......)tatpuruṣasya puruṣatvamiti tadarthaṃ tatra 
puruṣaśabdasya pravṛttinimittamabhidhāya sasahasrakarmā puruṣaḥ saha<l3.>srākṣaḥ sahasrapāt bhūtvodatiṣṭhadityanantaraṃ pāṭhāt 
sahasraśīrṣetyādimantrasthapuruṣaśabdasya tatpravṛttinimittakatvena nārāyaṇaparatvanirṇayāt tasya cātra sūtrādau śravaṇānmahā<l4.>devaṃ 
vā mahāpuruṣaṃ vārcayediti kalpasūtraprayogāvagamitatadasādhāraṇyasya mahāpuruṣaśabdasya vedāhametamiti mantre pāṭhāt hrīśca te 
lakṣmīśca patyau iti <l5.> lakṣmīpatitva(-)liṅgopanyāsena yamantaḥ samudre kavayo viśanti vidyutaḥ puruṣādadhīti 
samudraśāyitvavidyudvarṇapuruṣatvaliṅgitapurāṇādipradeśaviśeṣa<l6.>pratipādita(.....)ka(-)varṇanārāyaṇamūrtipratipādanapareṇāṃbhasya 
pāre iti sūktena smṛtiṣu tatsamārādhane havirnivedane viniyuktairhiraṇyagarbhaḥ samavartatāgra <l7.>ityādimantraiśca sahādbhyaḥ 
saṃbhūto hiraṇyagarbha ityaṣṭāviti tadanuvākaśrutavākyopapāditenaikavākyatvena ca nārāyaṇaparatayā siddhena samanantarānuvākena 
<l8.> svapratipādyamahāpuruṣamahimavarṇanapravṛt(-)tenaikavākyatvānnārāyaṇānuvāke nārāyaṇe pratipannasahasraśīrṣatvādidharmasya 
subālopaniṣadi cakṣuśca draṣṭavyaṃ ca nārāya<l9.>ṇa ityādinā nārāyaṇātmatvaṃ sarvasyoktvā ta(...)pasaṃhāre paṭhitasya puruṣa 
evedaṃ sarvamiti mantrasya ca pratyabhijñānāt puruṣeṇa nārāyaṇena yajamāna upa<p54a., f44b/48b., l1.>tiṣṭhata 
ityāpastambā(-)dibhistannāmnā sūktavyapadeśācca nārāyaṇaparatvamasya spaṣṭamiti paroktaṃ yuktaṃ sarvasyāpyasya 
gaganatalalekhāyamānatvādā(ddā)ruṇake tu ke kūrmaḥ puruṣonmatvodati<l2.>ṣṭhedityapūrvapuruṣasya puruṣabhāvāpattipratipādanena 
sahasraśīrṣe ḍādimantrasthapuruṣapadasyānantaravākyapratipannapravṛttinimittakatvavyatirekasyāvasāyādanyathā tena 
pravṛ<l3.>ttinimittena prāgapi tasya puruśabdābhilāpyatayā puruṣo hutvemyuktivirodhāpatteḥ| paroktarītyaiva puruṣo nāma 
saṃpūrṇamiva satyādilakṣaṇaḥ| sāmbamūrtidharo<l4.> nānyo rudro viṣṇurajopi veti skāndokteḥ| pūrṇatvena pravṛttinimittena 
puruṣaśabdasya śivāsādhāraṇatvāt yatra yatra karmabhreṣo(bhraṃśo) yajñabhraṃśo vā tatra puruṣaṃ<l5.> cintayan puruṣa(....)ktaṃ brūyāt| 
pūrṇatvāt puruṣa iti vijñāyate hīti vā dhūlasūtre puruṣasūktaśrutatatpratipādyaparapuruṣaśabdasya 
tatpravṛttinimittakatvā<l6.>vasāyāt| sarvo vai rudra ityuktyanantaramaucityāt puruṣa evedaṃ sarvamiti 
mantravirodhaśaṅkānirākaraṇārthāya puruṣo vai rudra iti śrutyā tasya rudraparatvena vyākhyānācca tasya <l7.> paramaśivaśruti(-)
tvasyaiva sūpapādatvānmahāpuruṣaśabdasyāpi kvacidapi nārāyaṇanāmatvenānuśāsanābhāvāt prayogamātrasya gautamasmṛtau kṛcchramantreṣu 
mahāpuruṣāyeti śiva<l8.>iva yoge(-)nāpyupapa(....)(patteḥ) abhithā(dhā)natvāttathātve'pi puruṣaṃ mahāntamiti syāt 
padayoreveha śravaṇādavayavārthasya vyavasthitisiddhau yogarūḍhipadapratipādyā<l9.>vayavārtha(-)padavākyasyānyatrāpi pratiyogasya 
durnivāratvādanyatra paṅkajādiśabdānāṃ yogarūḍa(ḍha)vādināṃ pratyanyatrāpi yogaprasaṅgasyāpādakoktau mūkībhāvāpatyāpādavi 
<p54b., f45a/49a., l1.>tu(kra)maśakyatvāpatteḥ bhavādiśivanāmāṣṭakamadhye paṭhitasyādhārabhinnā 
mahiṣityādibodhāyanasūtre tannāmatvena(.........)pūjyate yat surairnityaṃ mahāṃścaiva pramāṇa<l2.>(....) yāturmaheti pūjāyāṃ 
mahādeva tasmṛtaḥ iti sāmbapurāṇe tannāmatvena niruktasya mahacchabdasya puruṣa(ṣaṃ) mahāntamiti pāṭhena tataḥ śiva(-)
paratvamasyeva pratīteḥ ambhasya pāśa <l3.> iti sūkte yamantaḥ samudre kavayo vadanti vidyutaḥ puruṣādapīti 
upanyastaliṅgamayālliṅgamūrtirvā mahājvālā(.....)vṛttamasya vā liṅgasya madhye ruciraṃ candraśekharavigrahaṃ <l4.> vyomamārge 
tathā liṅge brahmāṇaṃ haṃsarūpiṇam| viṣṇuṃ varāharūpeṇa liṅgasyāthaḥ tvadhomukhaṃ brahmāṇanedakṣīṇatasya kṛtā(-)ñjalipuṭaṃ sthitam| 
<l5.> vāme viṣṇurmahābāhuṃ kṛtāñjalipuṭaṃ tathā| madhye liṅgaṃ aghoraṃ mahābdherambhasi sthitaṃ dhyātvā pradoṣakāle tu 
śivasāyujyamāpnuyāt| 

