pratipādite kālātmake bhagavadvigrahe sāmañjasyāt kātsnena śrīrudrāṅgamantratvena vidhānācca uttaranārāyaṇasya 
śivaparatvaniścayāt tadekavākyatayāpi tatparasyaiva <l9.> sukaropapādanatvāt śrutyantaraśabdārthapratyubhijñānurodhe'pi tadbāhulyena 
śivaparatvasyaiva yuktatvāt puruṣeṇa nārāyaṇena yajamāna upatiṣṭhata ityatrāsya <p56a., f46b/ 50b., l1.> 
pauruṣasūktasya ṛṣirnārāyaṇa smṛta iti śaunakasmṛteḥ devatādyotanāya puruṣeṇeti sūktapratipādyaparapadena vyapadeśānantaraṃ 
ṛṣisūcanāya nārāyaṇeneti tri japet aghamarṣaṇamitīva <l2.> dṛṣṭanāmnā vyapadeśopapatteḥ nārāyaṇadraṣṭrena 
puruṣasūktenopasthitāṃ citimupatiṣṭhamāna iha janmani puruṣo bhavediti vādhūlasūtreṇa tathaiva tvaṣṭīkaraṇācca| 
nārāyaṇasamākhyānenā<l3.>pi tatparatvāsiddho pratyutodāhṛtakalpasūtravacanena nārāyaṇasya ṛṣitvasiddheḥ 
vedāhametamityatrāhaṃśabdasya tatparatayā karmakartṛvyapadeśācceti sūtroktanyāyena sūktapratipā<l4.>dyatvasya svarasato 
vyatirekasyaiva pratīteśca tasmāt paroktanyāyairnārāyaṇaparatvasiddhestaireva śivaparatvaṃ sarva(-)susādhutvācca asmaduktarītyā 
śivamahimapratipādana<l5.>parameva puruṣasūktamityabhyupagantavyam||24||

kiṃ ca| vadan sarvātmatvaṃ vibudhasamupāsyatvamapi te viriñcopendrādīnapi tava vibhūtirupadiśan – nirutyā(ktyā) tenāstamapi 
ca <l6.> vigante viśadayan gurāṃ śumbhaśryaiṣṭhyaṃ prakāyati te'tharvaśirasaḥ| arpe śirasi prathamakhaṇḍe devāha vai svargaṃ 
lokamagaman tadevārudramaprasnannityupakramya ko bhavāniti pṛṣṭavato <l7.> da(u)vānprati so'bravīt ahamekaḥ prathamā sa 
(...) vartāmi ca bhaviṣyāmi ca nānyaḥ kaścinmatto vyatirikta ityādīnāṃ eva mamāṃ yo vedaḥ sarvāndevā(....)detyantena 
śivavacanena śivasya sarvātmatvaṃ <l8.> pratipāditamanantaraṃ tato devā rudraṃ nāpaśyante  (.......)ūrdhvabāhavarudrasyāyanti te 
devā urdhvabāhustunvanniti devairupāsya ena tvaṃ prati(....)ditaṃ stūyamānatvaṃ ca darśitam| tataśca dvitīyyakhaṇḍe <l9.> yo 
vai rudra(.......) ruśca vṛ(.....)tasmai (......) ityārabhya yaśca viṣṇuryaśca maheśvara ityādipra(.....)(-)brahma(.....)lakṣmī 
sarasvatīndrādīnāṃ mahābhūtānāṃ ca <p56b., f47a/51a., l1.> tadvibhūtitvaṃ (...........) kva ca tena (.......) 
nirūpita(.......-)caturthakhaṇḍayostadapyanāma(..........)mukhena(....)parabhāvaspaṣṭīkṛtaḥ pañcamakhaṇḍe tasyopā<l2.>sanādeva 
mokṣa ityuktvā pāśupatayogā(....)tadupāsanaprakāro darśitaḥ tadevamādita ārabhyāntaṃ vimṛśyamānamatharvaśiro'sya (........) 
vāmadeva yat śāstradṛṣṭīkarotītyarthaḥ <l3.> yattvatra paraikapralapitamatharvaśirasi vacanajātaṃ sa eva sarvatojyāyāni ta(tat) 
spaṣṭīkarotītyarthaḥ| yattvatra paraiḥ pralapitamatharvaśirasi rudra sarvāktyotyā sa deśāt na tasya sarveśvaratvasiddhirvāmade<l4.>vavat 
śāstradṛṣṭi tadupadeśāt ata eva tadanantaraṃ paramātmanaḥ khalu sarvākyaṃ prasiddhaṃ tat kathaṃ taveti śaṅkā(-)vyavacchedāya svasmin 
paramātmānupraveśāttaddṛṣṭyā sārvātmyokti<l5.>mupapādayituṃ tasyaiva vacanaṃ sontarādantaraṃ paramātmanaḥ khalu sārvātmyaṃ prasiddhaṃ 
tat kathaṃ taveti śaṅkā vyavacchedāya svasmin paramātmānupraveśāttaddṛṣṭyā sārvātmyokti<l6.>deśaparatve tatrāhaṃśabdasya 
paramātmaparyantatayā tasya prastutatvāt sa paramātmā antarāt prāṇāderapyantaraṃ svātmānadiśaḥ sakaladigvartivastujātasya 
<l7.> cāntaraṃ jīva(-)vargamantaryāmitayā prāviśaditi tasyārthaḥ na coktārthaparamidaṃ vākyaṃ rudrasyaiva sarvāntaryāmitayā 
praveśakathanaparaṃ pūrvavākyamapi <l8.> svarūpeṇaiva tasya sārvātmya(-)kathanaparamastviti vācyaṃ tathā satyasya 
rudravākyamadhyapātenāhaṃ praviśāmīti prayogāpatteḥ na ca nānyaḥ kaścinmatto vyatirikta itītyatreti <l9.> karaṇena 
rudravākyasya samāptyavagamāt so'ntarādityādi śrutivākyameveti vācyaṃ saṃprāviśadityetadanantaraṃ so'haṃ nityānitya 
ityādirudravākyānuvṛtyā tatsamāptyasiddhera<p57a., f47b/ 51b., l1.>ranyathāmadhye śrutivākyena śivavākyasandarbhena 
viccheda uttaratra sobravīdityadhyāhāraprasaṅgāditi kāraṇaṃ tu sontarādityantaramiti vākyānvayitayā paramā(-)tmānupraveśena 
prakā<l2.>reṇa hetunā vā sārvātmyamiti prakārādyarthatvenāpyavapannaṃ samāptyarthakatve tu tasya 
kṛtsnaśivavākyasamāptāvanvayostu adhyāhārādvyavahitānvayasya jyājastvāt dharmakalpanāta <l3.> iti nyāyāt yattu 
dvitīyyakhaṇḍe yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavānityādiśrutivākyaṃ tadapi ahamekaḥ prathamamāsamiti rudravākyānurodhitvena tadaikārthyāt 
tadantaryāmiṇa eva <l4.> sārvātmyaparaṃ tri(tṛ)cīyya(ya)caturthakhaṇḍayoroṃkārādimahādevāntanāma nirvacanaṃ tu 
praṇavaviṣayametadvācyaparaman paryavasāne'(-)pyuktarītyāntaryā<l5.>mi paraṃ yacca pañcamakhaṇḍe rudropāsanasya mokṣopāyatvena 
vidhānaṃ tadapyukte nyāyena tadantaryāmyupāsanāparaṃ madhu vidyāṃ vasvādibhogyādityo<l6.>pāsanasya vastvantaryāmiviṣayatvasya 
(.....) dṛṣṭisambhavādityadhikaraṇe vyavasthāpanādihāpi tathopapatteḥ evaṃ madhūpaniṣat pratipādyaḥ tadantaryāmī nārāyaṇa<l7.> 
eva eṣa sarvabhūtāntarātmāpahatapāpmādivyo deva eko nārāyaṇa iti saubāla(?)śruteḥ | tavāntarātmā mama ca ye cānye 
dehamāśratāḥ| sarveṣāṃ sākṣi<l8.>bhūto'sau na grāhyaḥ kenacit kvacit iti smṛteśca yadu tu so'ntarādityādiśrutivākyaṃ 
tathāpi cakṣuścandra(.....)nārāyaṇa(....)ñca śrotavyaśca nārāyaṇa ityādi<l9.>śrutyantaradarśanādanekasārvātmyāyo(-)gācca yasya 
yasya hi yo yo'vastena tena hi tanna(........)viśvamedhāṃ rakṣi pramātmavaśaṃ nayedityatraiva praveśaśabdasya budhyā<p57b., 
f48a/52a., l1.>nu(-)praveśa(........) samādhinā prāviśat (.....) śāstradṛṣṭyā tadīya 
sarvātmyopadeśopapādanaparaśrutivākyatayā yojanīyamiti <l2.> sarvathā pīyamapi śrutirnārāyaṇa(-)paraiva ata eva yo vai rudraḥ sa 
bhagavadityādau tadasādhāraṇabhagavatpadaprayogo'pīti tannirācikīrṣa svābhimānaṃ tāvat so'ntarādityāderarthamanvaya(...) <l3.>laṃ 
ca darśayi ||25||

amuṣminnantardhistava samudito yena vacasā 
     tvadukta(.....).te paramaśivayojyena vacasā|
yadasya svasthāne'nvayamalabhamānasya ghaṭate 
     khalānāṃ mauḍhyaṃ tatpariṇamati (*)pāṇḍityavidhayā||(*) <l4.>

ayamarthaḥ āyurāyuṣā satyaṃ satyena dharmam| dharmeṇa tarpayāmi svena tejasetyantaṃ tatra śivavākyamanantaraṃ tato devā rudraṃ 
nāpaśyantītyāde śrutivākyatvasya sphuṭa<l5.>tvāttatra ca śivavākyaparyavasānabodhanāyetikiraṇaṃ nāpaśyannityadarśanopapādanāya 
tadantardhānapratipādanaṃ cāpekṣitaṃ iti so'ntarādityādi ca saṃprāviśaditya<l6.>ntamatikleśaṃ vinā na svasthānānvayi 
tadantareṇaiva nānyaḥ kaścinmatto vyatiriktaḥ so'haṃ nityānityā ityādi svānvayamiti spaṣṭametat śaknoti ca 
tattatrāpekṣitaṃ pu(pū)rayituṃ <l7.> tena devadṛśyaṃ sthūlaṃ rūpaṃ vihāya tataḥ paraṃ sarvāntaraṃ sarvato rahasyaṃ paripūrṇaṃ rūpaṃ 
prāviśaditi tadantardhānapratipādanāpapatteḥ tataścānyonyākāṅkṣāva<l8.>śāt vyavahito'pyanvayo yuktaḥ ākāṅkṣāyāḥ 
sannidhānāt balīyastvāt yasya yenārthasaṃbandho dūrasthenāpine sahaḥ arthatopyasamarthānāmānantaryamakāraṇamiti 
vā<l9.>rtikokteḥ ānantaryamacodanamiti jaiminisūtrācca adhyāhārādvyavahitānvayasya jyāyastve pareṣāmapyavipratipatteśceti 
śivavākyamadhyapaṭhitasyāpi sontarādityā<p58a., f48b/52b., l1.>de(deḥ) śrutivākyatvena tadanta eva niveśo dṛśyate 
hi etamu evāhamabhyupagāsiṣaṃ tasmānmamatvamekosīti ha kauṣītakiḥ putramuvāca <l2.> raśvistvaṃ paryāvartayāt bahavo te 
bhaviṣyanti na vā ajīviṣyāmi māna khādanniti ho vāca kāmo ma udapānamityādiśrutiṣu kiñcit puruṣavaktṛkavākyamadhye 
śrutyāpītyāderanyonyākāṃ<l3.>kṣāyā tadante śrutivākyatvenānvayaḥ upabrahmaṇaiścāyamevā(-)nvayo'sya vākyasya nirṇītaḥ tathā hi 
sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ paṭhyate| 

purā viṣṇvādayo devāḥ sarve saṃbhūya (*)kāraṇam|(*) <l4.>
vicārya jagato viprāḥ saṃśayāviṣṭamānasāḥ||
atīva sukhadaṃ śuddhaṃ raudraṃ lokaṃ samāgaman|
teṣāṃ madhye mahādevaḥ saṃsāradrāvako haraḥ||
rudraḥ para(*)makāruṇyāt svayamāvirabhūdvijāḥ|(*) <l5.>
adṛṣṭapūrvaṃ taṃ dṛṣṭvā devā viṣṇupurogamāḥ||
praṇipatya mahādevaḥ pṛcchan ko bhavāniti|
so'bravīt bhagavānrudraḥ paśūnāṃ (*)patirīśvaraḥ||(*) <l6.>
sarvajñaḥ sarvatatvānāṃ tatvabhūtaḥ sanātanaḥ|
ahameko jagaddheturāsaṃ prathamamīśvaraḥ||
vartāmi ca bhaviṣyāmi na matto'nyo'sti kaścana|

manmāyāśaktisaṃkliptaṃ <l7.> jagatsarvaṃ carācaramityārabhya ityuktvā bhagavān rudraḥ pūrṇaṃ rūpaṃ samāviśat| nāpaśyaṃśca tato 
rudraṃ devā viṣṇupurogamā iti liṅgapurāṇe'pi śiva(vaṃ) prastutya <l8.> tamapṛcchan satato devāḥ ko bhavāniti mohitāḥ| 

so'bravīt bhagavān rudro hyahamekaḥ purātanaḥ|
āsaṃprathamadevāhaṃ vartayāmi ca (....)rottamāḥ||
bhaviṣyāmi ca (*)loke'smin matto nānyo'sti kaścana|(*) <l9.>
nityāni (.....)hamanagho brahmāhaṃ brahmaṇaspatiḥ||
ityupakramya dharmaṃ dharmeṇa sarvaṃ ca tarpayāmi|
(....)jasetyuktvā bhagavān rudrastatraiva (*)vāntaradhīyata||(*) <p58b., f49a/53a., l1.>

nāpya(....)ca tato devā ityādi tatrādhyāyatrayeṇa kṛtsnasyāpyadharvaśirasaḥ śivapara(...)mā vikṛtaṃ vistarabhayā(.....)prakhyate 
(.....) saṃhitāyām ādityapurāṇe ca paṭhita<l2.>mapyupabrahmaṇaṃ draṣṭavyam evaṃ svābhimatamanvayaprakāraṃ pradṛśya paroktaṃ 
dūṣayata||26||

ihātmīye rūpe varadaparipraṣṭe tava suraistva(.....)syaivoktaṃ taditi kimayaṃ granthaghaṭanā| (...) <l3.>mantaryāmīsan 
stamitaramavoca svayamiti pralāpo vā keṣāṃ viśati hṛdayānyapyaviduṣāya yuktaṃ pranardanākhyāyikāyā māmeva 
vijānīhītyāderindravākyasya śāstradṛṣṭyā brahmaviṣayatvaṃ tatra <l4.> tvameva varaṃ vṛṇīṣva yaṃ tvanmanuṣyāya hita(...) sa iti 
praśna(....) kyasya vastuto yaddhi taṃ tadviṣayatvenendraviṣayatvābhāvāt yuktaṃ cāhaṃ manurabhavaṃ 
sūryaścetyādivāmadevasārvātmyaka<l5.>dhanasyāpi śāstradṛṣṭyā brahma(-)viṣayatvaṃ tatra praśnavākyasyaivābhāvāt iha tu devānāṃ ko 
bhavāniti śivāsādhāraṇarūpapraśne taduttararūpasyāhamekaḥ prathamamāsamityā<l6.>diśivavākyasyānyasārvātmyaparatve 
praśnottarayorvaidhikaraṇyāpatteḥ neha tannyāyasañcaraṇāvakāśa iti sarvo vai rudro 
rudrohyevaitatsarvamityādi<l7.>śrutikalpasūtrādivacanānugrahītai tat śrutibalāt sarvaṃ khalvidaṃ brahmeti sarvātmatvena pratipannaṃ 
brahma śiva evādhyavasīyate ato yadyanekasya sārvātmyopadeśo <l8.> viruddha iti saubālaśrutāviha vā kvacicchāstradṛṣṭyā 
upadeśa iti netavyaṃ tadā vaidikaraṇyadoṣāprasaṅgāttatraiva tadupadeśastathā netavyatayā sati cakṣuśca draṣṭavyaṃ <l9.> ca nārāyaṇa 
ityādyanantaraṃ mantropaniṣadādau śivaparatayā pratipannena puruṣa evedaṃ sarvamiti mantreṇa tadupasaṃhāro'pi śobhatetarāṃ na 
cāhaṃśabdasya <p59a., f49b/53b., l1.> vaktari śiva eva paryavasāne tadanyasya śabdasannidhāpitatvā(-)bhāvāt sa 
ityanena tadaparāmarśānupapattisvapadena parāmarśa iti kudra(dṛ)ṣṭibhirvaktumapi śakyaṃ yatra yasyānu<l2.>pacaritāhaṃpadaprayogastatra 
tasyaiva tatpadaprayogasyo(-)papannatvābhyupagame so'ntarādityādervaktraśivaparatvasyaiva saṃbhavena tat pakṣe tatra dūṣaṇānavakāśāpatteḥ 
kiṃ ca <l3.> so'ntarādityādiśivavākyaṃ tatra sa iti padaṃ cāhaṃpadasannidhāpitaparāmarśīti parapakṣe'pi tasya vākyasya 
śivasyaiva sarvāntaryāmitvapratipādanaparatvaṃ yuktaṃ parairgītāsu <l4.> tameva śaraṇaṃ gaccha madyā jīmānnamaskuru ityādau 
tatpadāhaṃpadayorantarātmadṛṣṭiṃ vinā svātmanyeva paryavasānābhyupagamena svātmani tatpadaprayogo'nupapanna <l5.> iti 
śaṅkitumapyaśakyatvādahaṃśabdasya śrotra(tṛ)bhirvaktra(ktṛ)vyatiriktaparatvānavagamena sa ityasmānprati 
tadvyatiriktabodhakatvānupapatteśca na ca madhye kudṛṣṭikalpita<l6.>śaṅkayā tasya tadbuddhisthatvāt kathañcit bodhakatvaṃ 
śaṅkyaṃ śaṅkā vākyasya gamakasya cānupalambhena tathā duśśaṅakākalpanāyāḥ pramāṇaparāhatatvāt <l7.> śivasyaiva 
sarvāntaryāmitvena tenānyasya tadanta(-)ryāmitvamupadiṣṭamiti vākyārthakalpanāyā atyantamayuktatvācceti tātparyaniṣkarṣaḥ||27||

kuto'sya <l8.> sarvāntaryāmitvamadhigamyata iti cettatrāha|
 
tvamevāntaryāmītyadhigamitametat khalu 
     vibhoraśeṣādhiṣṭhaprakaṭanaparairaupaniṣadaiḥ|
tviṣāṃ patyurbimbe kṛtanivasatestasya bhagavan(-)
     numānetrānandaṃ vapurupadiśadbhiśca manubhiḥ||

śrūyante hi śivasyāśeṣādhiṣṭhāha(....)pādanaparāmantrāḥ mantropaniṣadi|| <p59b., f50a/54a., l1.> yo yo na 
(.......) pānamadhitiṣṭhatyekaḥ yasmin(......) ceti sarvam| evaṃ sa devo bhagavān reṇyo yonisvabhā(......)dhitiṣṭhatyekaḥ 
sarvametadviśvamadhitiṣṭhatyeko guṇāṃśca <l2.> sarvānviniyojayedyaḥ| ghṛtātparamaṇḍamivā(-)ti(....)kṣman jñātvā śivaḥ 
sarvabhūteṣu dṛḍham| eṣa devo viśvakarmā mahātmā sadā janānāṃ pradape sanniviṣṭaḥ| yo devo agnau yo apsu <l3.> yo viśvaṃ 
bhuvanamāviveśa| ya oṣadhīṣu yo vanaspatiṣu tasmai devāya namo nama ityādyāḥ rudropaniṣada ca namo bhavāyetyanuvākapañcake 
namaśrotasyāya ca dvīpyāya cetyādyāḥ <l4.> sarveṣu vastuṣu śivasya sadbhāvapratipādanaparāḥ mahopaniṣadi ca yo rudro agnau 
yo apsu ya oṣadhīṣu yo rudro viśvābhuvanāviveśetyādyāḥ api ca <l5.> ya eṣāntarāditye hiraṇmayaḥ puruṣo dṛśyata 
ityādiśrutipratipādyontarādityavartī puruṣastāvadantaryāmīti sarvasaṃpratipannametat bhedavyapadeśāccānya iti brahma<l6.>sūtreṇa 
jñāpanāttasya ca mahopaniṣadi ādityo vā eṣa etānmaṇḍalamityādi tatprakaraṇe sarvo vai rudra ityārabhya namo hiraṇyabāhave 
hiraṇyavarṇāya hiraṇya<l7.>pataye'mbikāpataya umāpataye namo nama iti mantraḥ| rudropaniṣadi asau yastāmro aruṇa iti 
prastutya asau yovasarpati nīlagrīvo vilohita iti mantraḥ <l8.> kṛcchrāṅgādityopasthānamantreṣu namo rudrāya paśupataye mahate 
devāya tryamba(-)kāyaikacarādhipataye haraye śarvāyeśānāyogrāyavajriṇe ghṛṇine kapardine namo namaḥ sūryāyādityāya namo namo 
nīlagrīvāya śitikaṇṭhāya namo namaścandralalāṭāya kṛttivāsase nama ityādimantrāśca umāsahāyatvanīlagrīvatvādiviśiṣṭaṃ 
rūpamupadiśanti|| <p60a., f50b/54b., l1.> na ca mahopaniṣadi sarvo vai rudra ityārabhya savitṛ(-)
maṇḍalavidyāprakaraṇavicchedaḥ śaṅkanīyaḥ| asambādhipadanicayavyavadhānādervicchedakasyābhāvādantarādityavartino 
hiraṇmayapuruṣasyopāsanārtha<l2.>mapekṣitarūpaviśeṣa(-)samarpaṇaparatvena ekavākyatāsamarthatvāt kūrmapurāṇe sūryahṛdaye| 

namaste ghṛṇine tubhyaṃ sūryāya brahmarūpiṇe| 
tvameva brahma paramamāpojyotistathāmṛtam|| <l3.>
bhūrbhuvasvastvamoṅkāraśarvo rudraḥ sanātanaḥ| 
puruṣaḥ sanmahotastvāṃ praṇamāmi kapardinam|| 
tvameva viśvaṃ bahudhā jātaṃ yajjāyate ca yat| 
namo nijāya rudrāya tvāmahaṃ śaraṇaṃ gataḥ|| 
pracetase namastubhyaṃ namo mīḍhu(*)ṣṭamāya ca|(*) <l4.>
namo namaste rudrāya tvāmahaṃ śaraṇaṃ gataḥ||
hiraṇyabāhave tubhyaṃ hiraṇyapataye namaḥ|
ambikāpataye tubhyamumāyāḥ pataye namaḥ||
 
iti sarvo vai rudra ityādyanuvāka<l5.>trayasya ghṛṇiḥ sūrya ādityādyanuvākaikavākyatayā antarāditye 
vidyāpekṣitarūpasamarpaṇaparatvasya sphuṭīkaraṇācca na kṛcchrāṅgamantreṣu haripadaprayogādviṣṇuparatvaṃ <l6.> śaṅkanīyam| 
pūrvāparabahuśrutiliṅgavirodhāt| yamānilendracandrārkaviṣṇusiṃhāsaśuvājiṣviti kośadarśanādādityanāmatvenaiva tadanta(-)ryāmiṇi 
prayogopapatteḥ <l7.> eṣa rudro mahādevaḥ kapardī ca ghṛṇī hariḥ| ādityo bhagavān sūryo nīlagrīva(-)strilocanaḥ| (......)ta 
sahasrāṃśuḥ sāmagādhvaryuhotṛbhiriti kaurme| ādityamaṇḍalāntarvartitvena <l8.> paramaśivasya pratipādakeṣu dakṣaṃ prati 
dadhīcivacaneṣu haripadaprayogasya tathaiva nirvāhatvācca (...)nucchandogopaniṣadi ya eṣo'(-)ntarāditye hiraṇmayaḥ puruṣa 
ityupa<l9.>kramya yathā kapyāsaṃ puṇya(...)kṣi eti puṇḍarīkākṣa(...)panyāsena tasya vaiṣṇavarūpa(......)ta iti (.......) 
iti cenna tāvat puṇḍarīkatulyanayanatvaṃ tasyā<l10.>sādhāraṇa(.......)gaṃ lokavedayoratrāpi (....) tat prasiddheḥ tasya 
sādhāraṇye'pi puṇḍarīkākṣaśabdasya yogarūḍhyā viṣṇāvasādhā(-)raṇyopapatteḥ <p60b., f51a/55a., l1.> ca nāpi tasya 
yathetyādiśrutiriti vaktuṃ śakyate(.......)rūḍhaśabdāvayavārthaparavākyasyāpi prayoganiyamo (.....)taṃ puruṣasūktārthavicāre tathāpi 
locanadvayopanyā<l2.>sastryaimbake rūpena sa gacchata iti cenna (....)rtyavikaraṇanyāyāduddeśyagatatatvasyāvivakṣitatayā api 
chedaka(....)ṭa(-)locanasya mukulitatvena locana tadvayasyaiva vikasita<l3.>nalinasādṛśyamiti tasya vakṣitatvepyavirodhācca 
chandogopaniṣadapi mahopaniṣadrudrādhyāyamantrābhyāṃ nirdhārite śaiva eva rūpe paryavasitīti na virodhaḥ ata eva <l4.> 
vāyusaṃhitāyām udāhṛtaśrutitrayasyāpi śivaviṣayatvenopasaṃhāro darśitaḥ| 

