ambikāpatirīśānaḥ pinākī vṛṣavāhanaḥ|

ityārabhya hiraṇyakeśaḥ padmākṣo hyaruṇastrāta eva ca| yo'yaṃ sarpatyasau devo nīlagrīvo <l6.> hiraṇmaya ityantena evaṃ ca 
yadāgneyapurāṇe viṣṇusamārādhanavidhānānte dhyeyaḥ sadā savitṛmaṇḍalamadhyavartītyādi paṭhyate tatsavitramaṇḍalasya 
hṛdayādi<l7.>vat sakaladevatopāsanāsthānatayā viṣṇupūjānte ca tatra tadupasthānaṃ kartavyamiti tāvanmātraparam| purāṇeṣvāgameṣu 
ca durgāgaṇapatyādipūja<l8.>kānāmapi sandhyāsamaye pūjānte ca tatra taddevatopāsanāvidhānadarśanāditi na kaścidvirodhaḥ| evaṃ 
śivasya sarvādhiṣṭhānapratipādanenāntaryāmiṇi śaivarūpopa<l9.>deśena ca śivaḥ sarvāntaryāmītyaupaniṣadā mantrāḥ 
samadhigamayantītyarthaḥ| nanveṣa sarvabhūtāntarātmeti nārāyaṇasyā(-)ntaryāmitvaṃ śrūyate| satyaṃ śravaṇamihā<p61a., 
f51b/55b., l1.>pyavaśiṣṭaṃ kiṃ tu ādityamaṇḍale śaivamadhiṣṭhanvapuḥ para antarniyacchatītyeṣa nirṇayo niravagrahaḥ| ataḥ 
kṛṣṇe daśāsyādihantṛtvavyapadeśavat tādṛśaṃ vedavacasāṃ yuktaṃ tātparyavarṇanam| <l2.> avatāreṣu bhinnānāṃ caritānāṃ ramāpateḥ 
anyathā na vyavasthā syādaparatrāpi kīrtanāt| anyāvatāracaritāni ca bhāratādau karmāṇi cādipuruṣottamasādhitāni 
gaṅgāsutaprabhṛtiḥ tadabhedadṛṣṭyā kṛṣṇastuti<l3.>prakaraṇeṣu hi kīrtitāni| tasmāt prabalapramāṇā(-)nurodhācchiva eva 
sarvāntaryāmīti nirṇaye tatraivāntaryāmi brāhmaṇāderapi paryavasānamityaṅgīkaraṇīyam| kecittu etāni hi vā amṛta<l4.>sya 
nāmadheyānīti jābāla(-)śrutiprayogadarśanena nirupapādāmṛtapadasya śivaparatvasvārasyāttata evāntaryāmibrāhmaṇasya śivaparatvaṃ 
vyaktamityāhuḥ| itaśca śiva eva <l5.> sarvāntaryāmīti vyakta(-)mityāha||28||

mahābhūtānyarkaḥ śiśirarurirātmeti bhaganna śeṣaṃ vastvetattava khalu tanutvena viditam| adhiṣṭhātṛtvante hara kimiyatā 
nādhyavasitaṃ <l6.> mudhā mūrkhānetān mukharayati mohastvitarathā|| aṣṭau pṛthivyādayastāvanmūrtayaḥ puravairiṇaḥ prasiddhāḥ 
śaivalaiṅgādipurāṇeṣu ca| antaryāmi brāhmaṇe'pi| <l7.> te'ntaryāmiṇa īśānniyamya bhāvamāpannaḥ śarīrāṇīti varṇitāḥ| 
atastadaikarūpyeṇa mūrtyaṣṭakaparā girā sarvāntaryāmitāṃ śambhoḥ sādhayeyurniraṅkuśam| <l8.> (...........) saha 
pṛthvījalādibhiḥ śarīratvena varṇyante vastūni sakalānyapi| aṣṭāveva tu pṛthivyādyā mūrtayo girijāpateḥ| prasiddhā te evāsau 
aṣṭa (..............) tasmādantaryāmayituḥ <l9.> samastacida(-)cittanoḥ| pṛthivyādyaṣṭakatanurbhūnne e (.......)te| 
ucyate'ṣṭāsu kāmārera(....)rbhavati mūrtiṣu| 
antaryāmi brāhmaṇokta(.....)sakalaṃ vapuḥ| 
bhūteṣu tadvikārāṇāmapyanta(*)rbhāvasaṃbhavāt|(*) <p61b., f52a/56a., l1.>
īśvaraḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ hṛddeśenduna tiṣṭhati||
(...) sarvabhūtāni yantrāṇīmāni māyaye kṛtismṛtyopakaraṇaṃ māyāntaryāmiṇo (...)bhoḥ| 
nirukteti niyatyeṣu naiva kalyaṃ (*)tadagrahāt|(*) <l2.>
ata eva ca kālasya yogasya śivamāyayoḥ| 
na saṃgrahaḥ kṛto'treti śaṅkāpi vinivartikā| 
ātmā tasyāṣṭamī mūrtiḥ śivasya paramātmanaḥ||
vyāpiketaramūrtīnāṃ śivaṃ tasmācchivātmakam| <l3.>
iti śaive samīreṇa ṣaṭkulīnānṛṣīnprati|| 
jīvavargastu kārtsnyena kathitā mūrtiraṣṭamī| 
evaṃ gṛhīte kārtsnyena varge cidacidātmage||
kiṃ nāma bhuvane vastu saṃgrāhyamavaśiṣyate|

nanu ca (-)
bhūmyambhogni(*)rmarudvyomabhāskarādīkṣitaḥ śaśī|(*) <l4.>
iti laiṅgavacasyātmasthāne yajvā niveśitaḥ|| 
ataḥ chāgapaśunyāyādau cityādupasaṃhṛteḥ| 
śaive śruto'pyātmaśabdo viśeṣe (*)paryavasyati|| naitadyuktam|(*) <l5.>
vyāpiketaramūrtīnāṃ viśvaṃ tasmācchivātmakam| 
ityādyāghaṭanāttāsāmananyaparatāṃ vinā|| 
vṛkṣasya mūlasekena śākhāḥ puṣyanti vai yathā| 
śivasya (*)pūjayā tadvat puṣyatyasya vapurjagat||(*) <l6.>
sarvopakārakaraṇaṃ sarvānugrahaṇaṃ tathā|
sarvābhayapradānaṃ ca śivasyārādhanaṃ viduḥ||
dehino yasyakā(ka)syāpi krī(kri)yate yadi nigrahaḥ| <l7.>
aṣṭamūrteraniṣṭaṃ tatkṛtameva na saṃśayaḥ||
ityanantarasandarbhe sarveṣāmeva dehinām|
aviśeṣeṇa bhagavanmūrtatvokteśca vaiśasāt||
sāmānyavidhiraspaṣṭaḥ saṃhriyateta (*)viśeṣataḥ|(*) <l8.>
spaṣṭo'yamityatopyasya yujyate nopasaṃhṛtiḥ||
laiṅge yadātmasāmānyasthāne dīkṣitakīrtanam|
lokopakārātiśayakhyāpanārthaṃ tu tat kvacit||
viśvarūpa(*)sya devasya sarojabhavasaṃbhava|(*) <l9.>
bhūmyambhognirmarudvyomabhāskarādīkṣitaḥ śaśī||
iti tatra hyupakramya mūrtīnāṃ saṃpradarśitā|
ekaikasyāḥ prapañcena sarvalokopakāritā|| <p62a., f52b/56b., l1.>
evaṃ tato'nyathā siddhaṃ tatra dīkṣitakīrtanam|
ātmāntarāṇā(ṇāṃ) mūrtitvaṃ na niṣedhayet pinākinaḥ||
yathāgnivākyekāsāṃñidvikṛtīnāmanukramaḥ|
prakṛtyaikavidhānārtho (*)nānyā svāgniṃ bodhayet||(*) <l2.>
yathā ca vidyābhedeṣu pathaḥ prāptasya kīrtanam|
stutyarthamādhyānārthaṃ vā natamanyāsu vārayet||
laiṅgye'pi tatkṛtā śeṣa(ṣaṃ)lākānugrahavarṇane| <l3.>
dīkṣitagrahaṇepyante sāmānyenopasaṃhṛtam||
ātmā tasyāṣṭamī mūrtiḥ sarvabhūtaśarīragaḥ|
ityādivacanaiḥ śaivapurāṇoktena vartmanā||
tadviśvamūrtirevetthamaṣṭamūrtiḥ prakīrtyate|
vibhakta(*)maṣṭadhā viśvamadhitiṣṭhatyayaṃ yataḥ||(*) <l4.>
yadyevaṃ ceṣyate sarvaṃ cetanācetanātmakam|
antarbhūtaṃ maheśasya jagadaṣṭāsu mūrtiṣu||
tadā tu śivamūrtīnāṃ na paricchedikāṣṭatā|
avayuktyānuvā(*)dyā sā vaiśvānarakapālavat||(*) <l5.>
yathā tatra kapāleṣu dvādaśasvaṣṭa kevalam|
avayuktyānuphaṇyante stutibhedavivakṣayā||
evaṃ stuteṣu lokeṣu mūrtibhūteṣu (*)śūlinaḥ|(*) <l6.>
anūdyante viśiṣyāṣṭau stutyarthamiti kalpyate||
yadvā mūrtiṣvasaṃkhyāsu hyaṣṭānāmiha varṇanam|
nāmabhedavidhānārcanā yeti kalpyate||(?)
śaivādiṣu purāṇeṣu (*)mūrtyaṣṭakanirūpaṇe|(*) <l7.>
aṣṭānāmapi mūrtīnāṃ nāmabhedānuśāsanāt||
dṛṣṭaṃ hi daśarātrādeḥ satsvahasva (....) samāptyainā(....) dārthaṃ sautyānāmanukīrtanam|| <l8.>
atha vaikādaśasveva saptaprāṇā iva kvacit|
dhyānāt mūrtayaḥ kaścit gṛhyanta iti kalpyate|| 
(.....)(.....) ye rudraṃ dhyāyanti praṇamanti ca|
teṣāmaṣṭatanurdevo dadāti paramaṃ padam| <l9.>
iti paurāṇikaistāsu viśiṣyāṣṭāsu mūrtiṣu||
viśvamūrtera(.....)pāsanāddevakīrtanāt|
athavā vājiśākhoktaṣaṣṭhānyanumatāvapi||

(...)ṭikāgnya(....)dṛṣṭaṃ pañcāgnikīrtana<p62b., f53a/57a., l1.> evaṃ ca mūrtīṣvaṣṭāna(....)vai śiṣṭyai (....) 
kenacit| aṣṭamūrtiriti khyātirapi devasya yujyate draṣṭā(....)śatāhobhiḥ samapādyasyāpi ca krutoḥ| pradha(dhā)natvena 
saumyā<l2.>nāṃ dvādaśāha iti prathā| sarvathāpi ca mūrtitvamantaryā(...) yā vibhoḥ| anupraveśādi vai teṣāmaṣṭānāmiti 
yujyate| aṣṭamūrtiprakriyāsu purāṇeṣvāgameṣu ca|| antaryāmi brāhmaṇārthapra<l3.>tyabhijñānadarśanāt pṛthivyāṃ 
ti(.....)vīve(....)naiva tam| rūpaṃ ca pṛthivī yasya tasmai bhūmyātmane namaḥ| ityādityapurāṇādiśruta(......)koṭiṣu| sphuṭaṃ 
tatpratyabhijñānaṃ na yuktaṃ <l4.> hyupabādhitum| tasmāt bhagavān paramaśiva eva sarvāntaryāmī| yattu tavāntarātmā mama 
cetyādi stutivacanam||
tanmahābhārate (–) 
bahavaḥ puruṣaḥ brahmannutāho eka eva tviti<l5.> praśne bahavaḥ puruṣā rājan sāṃkhyayogavicāriṇām| naitadicchanti puruṣamekaṃ 
kurukulodvaheti paramatamupanyasya bahūnāṃ puruṣāṇāṃ hi <l6.> yathaikā yonirucyate| tathā taṃ puruṣaṃ viśvamākhyāsyāmi 
guṇādhikamiti ślokena sa vā eṣa puruṣontarasamaya iti śrutidarśanāt puruṣaśabdābhilāpya<l7.>mānānāṃ śarkarāṇāṃ yathaikā 
pṛthvī yoniriti saiva sarvaśarīrabhāvenāvatiṣṭhate| tathaikameva paramaṃ puruṣaṃ viśvaṃ sarvaṃ 
yonibhāvenāvatiṣṭhamānamākhyā<l8.>syāmīti svamatapratijñānantaraṃ paṭhitā tvādaikātmyaparaṃ na tu 
kasyacidantaryāmitvavidhānaparam| apra(pṛ)ṣṭontaratvāpatteḥ| yacca viṣṇurātmā bhagavato bhava syāmitatejasa <l9.> iti 
karṇaparvavacanam| tatrātmaśabdo mokṣadharme| tasmādātmā na me vāgre rudraṃ saṃpūjayāmyahamiti kṛṣṇavacanasthitā(-)tmaśabdo bhava 
svarūpaparaḥ tatraiva svārasyāt| māyā(ya) yā <p63a., f53b/57b., l1.> guṇabhedena rudraṃ viṣṇuṃ pitāmaham| 
sṛṣṭvānuprāviśatteṣāmantaryāmitayā haraḥ iti skāndadarśanāt| paramaśivasyaiva karmavaśyasvāṃśabhūteṣu jīveṣviva tadavaśyasvāṃśabhūteṣu 
guṇa<l2.>mūrtiṣvapi anuvṛttisaṃbhāvāccetasyaiva sarvāntaryāmitvanirṇayenātrātmaśabdasyāntaryāmiparatvāyogācca| evaṃ ca śiva 
eva sarvāntaryāmītyyārthasya vyavasthiteḥ sontarādi<l3.>tyāderanyaparatvakalpanāyoge sthite yo vai rudra 
ityādernārāyaṇaviṣayatvakalpanaṃ rudreśānamaheśvaramahādevādināmanirvacanasya prasiddhiviruddhaṃ tadvi<l4.>ṣayatvakalpanaṃ rudropāsanā 
vidhānasya pare tairmadhuvidyānyāyena tatparatvakalpanaṃ ca pareṣāṃ nirastaṃ bhagavacchabdasyānyatrāpi pūjyamātre purāṇādiṣu <l5.> 
pracuraprayogadarśanāttadanvayi tadasādhāraṇyā siddheśca yattu nāma nirvacanānāṃ praṇavaviṣayatvamuktaṃ rudreśānamaheśvarādināma 
nirvacanānāṃ nāmito jagatsṛṣṭi<l6.>pālanasaṃhārasvatantratvapratipādanaparāṇāṃ praṇavaviṣayatvāyogāt| kathaṃ tarhi 
rudrādināmasamānaviṣayatvaṃ tatroṅkārapraṇavādināmanirvacanīyanāmnāṃ <l7.> nāma nāmitorabhedopacārāt| yathoktaṃ 
vāyusaṃhitāyām| śivā vā praṇavo hyeṣaḥ praṇavo vā śiva(vaḥ) smṛtaḥ| vācyavācakayorbhedo nātyantaṃ vidyate kvaciditi| 
tasmā<l8.>dekākṣaraṃ devamāhurāgamapāragāḥ| vācyavācakayoraikyaṃ manyamānā manasvina iti ca| tasmādatharvaśiro'pi śivasyaiva 
sarvotkarṣaṃ pratipādayantīti siddham||29|| <l9.>

