anyāśramasthaḥ sakalendriyāṇi nirudhya bhaktyā svaguruṃ praṇamya|| 
hṛtpuṇḍarīkaṃ virajaṃ viśuddhaṃ vicintya madhye viśadaṃ viśokam| <l2.>
acintyamavyaktamanantarūpaṃ śivaṃ praśāntamamṛtaṃ brahmayonim||
tadādimadhyāntavihīnamekaṃ vibhuṃ cidānandaḥ rūpamadbhutam|
umāsahāyaṃ parameśvaraṃ prabhuṃ trilocanaṃ nīlakaṇṭhaṃ (........)||
munirgacchati (*)bhūtayoniṃ samastasākṣiṃ tamasaṃ parastāt|(*) <l3.>
sa brahmā sa śivaḥ sendraḥ sokṣaraḥ paramasvarām|
sa eva viṣṇuḥ sa prāṇaḥ sa kālo'gniḥ sa candramāḥ||
sa eva sarvaṃ yat satyaṃ yacca bhavyaṃ sanātanam|
jñātvā na mṛtyumatye(*)ti nānyaḥ panthā vimuktaye||(*) <l4.>

iti kaivalyopaniṣadi| śivasya daharopasanāvidhiprakaraṇe saha brahmaviṣṇurudraiḥ sarvasyāsya jagatastadvibhūtītvāmnānena śivasya 
sarvotkarṣasphuṭī<l5.>kṛtirityarthaḥ| nanvatra sa brahmetyādau tatpadānāṃ sannihite prāpyatvenokte bhūtayānau vṛtterucitatvāt 
brahmādīnāṃ tadvibhūtitvamevāmnātaṃ sidhyati| na tūpāsyavibhūtitva<l6.>miti cenna| bhūtayoniśabdasyāpi yaugikasya 
sannihite śiva eva vṛtte tat kratunyāyāt tadupāsanayā tatprāptereva yuktatayā tasya śivānyavṛttitvakalpanāyāgā<l7.>cca 
kathaṃ jñātvā taditi tajjñānamiti tat jñānamuktipratipādanamiti cenna| saguṇabrahmavāde jñānādeva mukterupapannatvāt 
nirviśeṣabrahmavāde saguṇajñānānmuktirnopapadyata iti <l8.> jñātvā tanmṛtyumatyetītyatra tatpadasya 
nirviśeṣaparatvasyāvaśyakatayā pūrveṣāmapi tatparatvaṃ sidhyatīti cenna| sa deva somyedamagra āsīdityādiśrutatattejo 
sṛjatetyādivākya<l9.>śrutatatpadānāṃ saviśeṣe vṛttau api tattvamasivākyaśrutatatpadamātrasyaivānupapatyā 
nirviśeṣalakṣaṇāvadyatrānupapattistasyaiva jñātvā tamiti tatpadasya tatra <p64a., f54b/58b., l1.> lakṣaṇayānyāyatvena 
yojanaprāpyāyāṃ kāveryāmalamallabandhanasyāyuktatvāt evaṃ ca umāsahāyatvādiviśiṣṭarūpeṇa saguṇeṣūtkṛṣṭasya paramaśivasya 
dhyānāttamo'vaśyatvarahitamakhilaṃ jagat <l2.> kāraṇaṃ tameva paramaśivamupāsakaḥ prāpnoti| yadvibhūtayaḥ sarve brahmādayaḥ 
krameṇa ca niṣkṛṣṭacaitanyaikatanasya tasyaiva pratyakbhāvena jñānādapavargaṃ prāpnotīti śrutyarthaḥ saṃpadyata 
evamevā<l3.>syāśruterarthomānavapurāṇe ṣaṣṭhādhyāyena darśitaḥ| tatra hi kaivalyopaniṣatprakriyaiva| purāśvalāyanaḥ sākṣānmuniḥ 
satyaparāyaṇaḥ| bhagavantaṃ jagannāthamupetya parameṣṭhita<l4.>mityādināśvalāyanapraśnaṃ tatra parameṣṭhinaḥ 
prativacanamukhenācintyamavyaktamanantarūpamityādinā saprapañcaṃ śivadhyānaprakāraṃ ca pradarśya itthaṃ dhyātvā muniḥ 
sākṣātsākṣiṇaṃtamasaḥ <l5.> param|
 
bhūtayoniṃ purārātiṃ gacchanti svātmavidyayā| 
yo'yaṃ dhyeyatayā proktaḥ śivaḥ sāmbaḥ sanātanaḥ|| 
brahmaviṣṇvādirūpeṇa sa vibhakta iva sthitaḥ| 

sa brahmā sa śiva ityā<l6.>rabhya jñātvā tatra tyumatyeti pratyagātmatayaiva tu| antareṇa parijñānaṃ nānyaḥ panthā vimuktaya 
ityantenāsmadukto'rtha(rthaḥ) spaṣṭamādarśitaḥ| tathā brahmagītāsu caivamasyāśrutera<l7.>rthaḥ pratipāditaḥ| tasmāt brahmādīnāṃ 
prāpya vibhūtitvameva nopāsya vibhūtitvamiti na yuktam|| udāhṛtakaivalyaśrutyaikārthyena taittirīyāṇāṃ 
mahopaniṣadyāmnātasyā<l8.>raṇeraṇīyānityādyanuvākatrayasyāpi 
madhyamānuvākopavarṇitanārāyaṇamahimaprapañcaprasañjitānyaparatvaśaṅkonmūlanapūrvakaṃ śaivadaharopāsanāvidhiparatva<l9.>vyavasthāpanayā 
tato'pi tasya sarvotkarṣaṃ (...) bhāvayati||30||

tathā saṃkṣipyoktāṃ tava daharavidyāṃ 
     vidadhatī viśeṣairanyairappaniṣadumākāntamahatī| 
anudhyānārthaṃ (*)te hṛdi murariporantaratayā(*) <p64b., f55a/59a., l1.>
     prasajyainama[ntrasya] prabala(....)tamo'haṃ hatadhiyām||

evaṃ tāvadiha śaṅkottiṣṭhati na nārāyaṇānuvākaḥ śivopāsanaparaḥ| sahasraśīrṣaṃ devamityādinā nārāyaṇasya 
mahi<l2.>mānamupavarṇya padakośapratīkāśamityādinā tadupāsanāsthānahṛdayapuṇḍarīkasaṃsthāna(-)viśeṣādikaṃ pradarśya tasyāḥ 
śikhāyāmadhye paramātmā vyavasthita iti tasya ta(......)panyāsena tasya <l3.> daharāmbuje 
nārāyaṇopāsanādhipāyāvasāyādata eva kaivalyopaniṣadi ca brahmādivannārāyaṇasya nopāsya vibhūtiṣu parigaṇanaṃ kṛtam| 
nanvasmannanuvākenopāsanā<l4.>vidhiḥ kiṃ tu tasminyadantastadupāsitavyamiti 
(.....)nuvākavihitopāsanāpekṣitaguṇavidhimātraṃ tatra yat padasya gaganapadasya vā upāsya devatāsamarpaṇaparasya śabdasya yo 
<l5.> devānāṃ yadvedāviti pūrvāparamantrasamarpitarudramaheśvaraśabditaviśeṣaparyavasāyitayā utpattiśiṣṭakalpaśivānvayavirodhāt| na 
nārāyaṇasyopāsyatvenānvayo <l6.> yujyata iti cenmābhūttatrānvayaḥ ihaiva nārāyaṇaguṇagaṇavarṇanasāmarthyāt 
saṃbhūtyadhikaraṇanyāyena tadupāsanāvidhikalpanastu na ca padmakośapratīkāśamityādeḥ <l7.> 
pūrvānuvākavihitopāsanāsambandhihṛdayapuṇḍarīka(-)saṃsparśāt tadapekṣitaguṇavidhiparatvamavasīyyata iti vācyam| nivitpadaiḥ 
sāmidhenīprakaraṇasyeva nārāya<l8.>ṇaguṇagaṇakīrtanaparairananvayipadairvyavadhānena śivopāsanāprakaraṇasyāvicchinnatayā 
nivitpadāntarito(-)pavyānasya sāmidhenyaṅgatveneva tadantaritasya padmakośamityā<l9.>dimantrārthasya 
śivopāsanāṅgatvenānvayāsaṃbhavāt na ca jihvādīnāmavyabhicaritakratusambandhavat daharasyāpyavyabhicarita<p65a., f55b/ 
59b., l1.>śaivadaharavidyāsaṃbandho'sti| yena prakaraṇābhāve'pi juhvādidvāreṇa parṇatādīnāṃ kṛtvanvayavat hṛdayadvāreṇa 
taddharmāṇāṃ vākyapramāṇena tadanvayo bhavet| tathā <l2.> sati śukraṃ pravidhya hṛdayaṃ pravidhyetyādimantrāṇāmapi hṛdayadvāreṇa 
vidyāṅgatvāpattyā vedhādyarthabhedādityadhikaraṇavirodhaprasaṅgāt tasmāt pūrvānuvākasya śivopāsanāvidhiparatve'pi <l3.> 
padmakośetyādeḥ sannihitanārāyaṇaguṇagaṇa(-)kīrtanasāmarthyakalpyopāsanāntara evānvayo yukta iti| athavā paroktarītyā 
pūrvānuvāko'pi nārāyaṇopāsanā<l4.>vidhitayā tatpara eva te khalvarthamāhuḥ| na tāvadyo devānāmiti mantraḥ śivaparaḥ| tatra 
yo devānāmityādinā hiraṇyagarbhakāraṇatvenānuvādasya nārāyaṇāt brahmā jayatetyādipu<l5.>rovādānusāreṇa nārāyaṇaviṣayatayā 
rudrapadasyāpi tatraiva kathaṃ cidvṛtteḥ kalpanīyatvāt nāpi yadvedāviti mantraḥ| tasya hyayamarthaḥ| praṇavādyā mune vedāḥ praṇave 
<l6.> paryavasthitā iti smṛtervedānāmutpattilayasthānatayā tadādyantayoḥ pratiṣṭhito ya svara oṅkārākhyaḥ tasya akāro vai 
sarvā vāgiti śravaṇāt sarvavākprakṛtitayā <l7.> svaprakṛtāvakārelātyākārātmatāprāptasya yaḥ paro vācyaḥ idaṃ parastāt para 
ityādau vācye parapadaprayogāt sa maheśvaraḥ itthaṃ sarvaśabdajālaprakṛtibhūtākāravācyaḥ| <l8.> sa lokānāṃ mahānīśvara iti| 
evaṃ ca sarvaśabdajālaprakṛtitayā nikhilavācakotkṛṣṭākāravācyasya nikhilavākyotkarṣo yukta ityaucitimavalambyākāravācyasya 
sarveśvaratva<l9.>pratipādanaparo mantro'yamakāro viṣṇuvācaka iti darśanāt nārāyaṇaparatvapratipādanaparaḥ paryavasyati| tasmāt 
pūrvāparamantrayoḥ śaṅkatānyārthayorapi <p65b., f56a/60a., l1.> nārāyaṇaparatvānmadhye upāsanāntaraṃ tadviṣayameva 
niścīyate| anantaraṃ sahasraśīrṣaṃ devamityādimantrajātasya spaṣṭaṃ tadviṣayatvaṃ tacca sakalaparavikhyāyāsya viśeṣanirdhāraṇārthaṃ na 
tu <l2.> prakṛtadaharavidyāmātropāsyaviśeṣakpaṣṭīkaraṇārtaḥ| tasya tattadvidyāsu jagatkāraṇatvajagadantaryāmitvamukta(-)
prāpyatvamumukṣupāsyatvādinā pratipāditaṃ vastu tattat prakaraṇaśrutaiḥ parabrahma<l3.>paratatvaparaṃ jyotiḥ paramākṣaraśivaśaṃsādiśabdaiḥ 
pratyabhijñāpya tasya sarvasyāpi vākyapramāṇena nārāyaṇatvavidhiparatvāt| prakaraṇācca vākyasya balīyastvāt| evaṃ 
sarvapara<l4.>vidyopāsyanirdhāraṇārthasya prakṛtadaharavidyāsaṃsparśo'pyastīti tadanantaraṃ padmakośamityādinā tatguṇavidhānaṃ 
devatāntarāṇāmupasya nārāyaṇavibhūti(-)tvapratipāda<l5.>nena tasya sarvotkarṣakhyāpanaṃ cetyevamanuvākadvayamapi nārāyaṇaparamiti| 
tasmāt sarvathāpi nārāyaṇānuvākaḥ śivopāsanāpara ityuktamiti tatra tāvadā<l6.>dyānuvāke nārāyaṇopāsanā(-)vidhiriti 
parābhimānonmūlanaṃ hṛdi nidhāya iha tava daharavidyāṃ vidadhatītyayamāśayaḥ| na tāvadyo devānāmiti mantro nārāyaṇa<l7.>paraḥ 
atharvaśikhāyāṃ śivasya brahmakāraṇatvapratipādanāt tadanuvādagaṃ bhave rudrapadasyāmukhyārthatvakalpanāyogāt pratipādanaṃ kvāpi 
nāstītyabhimānavato yo <l8.> devānāmityāderanuvādatvaśaṅkāyā eva utthānānarhatvādetasyaiva mantrasya sadāśivasya 
brahmakāraṇatvavidhāyitvaparyavasānāt| na hi pratīyamānārthasya prāptimantareṇa <l9.> yadupabandhasahasreṇāpi śakyate 
kalpayutumanuvādakatvaṃ nārāyaṇasya brahmakāraṇatvaṃ śrutyantare'pi siddhamiti cenna| āho vyadhikaraṇottarakauśalamāyuṣmantaḥ yaḥ 
<p66a., f56b/60b., l1.> śivasya brahmakāraṇatvaparavacanasya purovādāpekṣāyāṃ nārāyaṇasya tatkāraṇatva(-)
śrutimupanyasyati| na hi yadāgneyavākye yadupabandhe'pi purovādābhāvāt vidhāyakatvoktau sauryādivākya<l2.>mastīti 
pratyavasthānaṃ śobhate| nārāyaṇe rudrapadasya lakṣaṇābhyupagamena vaiyadhikaraṇyamiti cenna agnyādiśabdānāmapi yatkiñcidarthe 
lakṣaṇāyāṃ tat prāpakaṃ yat kiñcit pramāṇaṃ saṃbhavatīti yadā<l3.>gneyādivākyānāmapyavidhāyakatvaprasaṅgāt 
anyonyāśrayāpātācca rudraśabdasya nārāyaṇe lakṣaṇāsiddhau vaiyadhikaraṇyābhāvāt nārāyaṇāt brahmā jāyata ityādeḥ 
purovādatvāsiddhiḥ| tasya <l4.> purovādatvasiddhe siddheśca tasmin purovādānusāreṇa na tasya tatra lakṣaṇeti tasmāt 
prāptyasaṃbhave yadupabandhādīnāṃ nānuvādaliṅgatvamiti na tadbalānuvādakatvakalpanaṃ yuktam| <l5.> yadi tu dvayorhiraṇya(-)
garbhakāraṇatvaṃ na saṃbhavet tadā śrutiviśeṣaśrutayorudranārāyaṇapadayoranyatarasya lakṣaṇāyā āvaśyakatvāt| yadupabandhanānugrahāya 
nārāyaṇāt <l6.> brahmā jayata iti śrutyanurodhādyo devānāmityatra rudrapadasyaiva lakṣaṇocyata iti śaṅkyetāpi saṃbhavati| 
tadvayorapi tatkāraṇatvaṃ kalpabhedeneti pradarśayiṣyāmaḥ| kiṃ <l7.> caikasminapi kalpeta tayostatkāraṇatvaṃ mātā pitṛbhāvena 
saṃbhavati nārāyaṇasya śivaśaktitva(-)vyavasthāpanāt tasmāt sarvathāyaṃ mantraḥ śivapara eva asya cāyamarthaḥ| maharṣirmahādraṣṭā 
<l8.> yaḥ sarvajñaḥ sa sarvavit aśeṣaviṣayāmoghaśuddhabuddhivijṛmbhaṇaḥ ityādi śrutismṛtipratipannāśeṣaviṣayabodhasamṛddhaḥ 
viśvasmāccidacidātmakaprapañcādadhikaḥ kṛtsnasya paśupāśavargasya <l9.> niyantṛtvādyo rudraḥ muktānāṃ saṃsāraduḥkhasya 
drāvako devaḥ devānāṃ madhye prathamaṃ hiraṇyagarbhaṃ purastāt kalpādau svasaṅkalpena svasmā(-)jjāyamānaṃ karuṇāparipūrṇayā 
<p66b., f57a/61a., l1.> sakalabhuvanasṛṣṭi(....) vitaraṇavicakṣaṇayā ājñādṛṣṭyā apaśyat| sa devo na asmān 
śubhayā paramā naṣṭaprāptikāruṇyā smṛtilābhe sarvagranthīnāṃ <l2.> vipramokṣa iti śrutiprasiddhayā svaviṣayayā smṛtyā 
suyojayatviti| evaṃ hyupabraṃhitaṃ laiṅgye| avyaktādabhavat sthāṇuḥ śivaḥ paramakāraṇam| satkāryakāraṇopeta ṛṣirviśvādhikaḥ 
<l3.> prabhuḥ| devānāṃ prathamaṃ devaṃ jāyamānamukhāmbujāt| dadarśa cāgre brahmāṇamājñayā tamavekṣata| draṣṭo rudreṇa deveśaḥ sasarja 
sakalaṃ jagaditi| kaurme ca| hiraṇyagarbho jagadantarātman <l4.> tvatto hi jātaḥ puruṣaḥ purāṇaḥ sa jāyamāno bhavatā 
niyukto yathā vidhānaṃ sakalaṃ sasarjeti| etenāsya mantrasya śivaparatvaṃ svīkṛtya yadavaidikānāmanyathā vyākhyānaṃ 
maharṣi<l5.> ryogabalena kālatrayavrātasākṣātkaraṇasamartho rudra svāvirbhāvāt prāgeva nārāyaṇājjātaṃ hiraṇyagarbhaṃ 
jāyamānāvasthāviśiṣṭaṃ yogabalātsākṣādakṛte<l6.>ti tamarpigalahastinam| śvetāśvatare hiraṇyagarbhaṃ janayāmāsa pūrvamityevāsya mantrasya pāṭha(-)darśanācca evaṃ caitadanurodhena| yasmāt paramityanantaramantro'pi śiva<l7.>para iti spaṣṭameva| ata evāśvalāyanasmaraṇam|
 
yasmāt parataraṃ nāsti nāparaṃ ca parātmanaḥ| 
na jyāyo'sti na cāṇīyo namastamai svayambhuve|| 
yenedama(*)khilaṃ pūrṇaṃ yanmāyāmūrtaya(yaḥ) smṛtāḥ|(*) <l8.>
tasmai śivāya mahate namaḥ sūkṣmākṣarātmanaḥ||

iti yacca yadvedāviti mantrasya nārāyaṇaparatvamutprekṣitaṃ tadapyayuktam| <l9.> paramate śabdānāṃ bhūtapañcakaguṇatvena tanmate'pi teṣāmanyonyamupādānopādeyabhāvāyogāt| prakṛtivācyatvavivakṣāyāṃ tasya yā prakṛtistasyāyaḥ <p67a., f57b/61b., l1.> para iti vaktavyatvena tasya prakṛtilīnasya yaḥ para iti śabdāyogācca kathañcittadubhayayoge'pi akārasya praṇavaprakṛtitve mānābhāvācca nanvakāro vai sarvā vāgiti śrutyākārasya sarvavā<l2.>ṅmayaprakṛtitvaṃ pratipādyāmahe tata eva tasya praṇavaprakṛtitvamapi sidhyati| na caivamoṅkāreṇa sarvāvaksantṛṇṇetyapi śravaṇādvaiparītyaśaṅkyam| akārasya praṇava iva tasyākāre <l3.> anugamādarśanena tasyā(syāḥ)stutiparatvakalpanāditi cenna| mātrāḥ prakṛtimātrāḥ kṛtveti śrutau akārokāramakārārdhamātrāṇāmuttarottarasya pūrvapūrvalayasthānatvavibhāvanenārdhamātrāyā<l4.> eva trimātrā prakṛtitvasphṛṭīkaraṇādaprakṛtau layāsambhavādakāro vai sarvā vāgiti śruteragniḥ sarvā devatā itivat stutiparatvenāpyupa(papa)tteḥ| bhāgavate| samāhitā<l5.>tmano brahman brahmaṇaḥ parameṣṭhanaḥ| hṛdākāśādabhūnnāda iti nādarūpāmardhamātrāṃ prastutya tato hitravṛdoṅkāra iti tasyāḥ praṇavaprakṛtitvasya kaṇṭharaveṇa bhidhānācca <l6.> tasmādasya mantrasya pararītyārthakalpane'pi yo'rdhamātrā vācyaḥ sa maheśvara iti paryavasyati| arthamātrāvācyaśca śiva eveti spaṣṭīkṛtaḥ atharvaśikhāvicāre yadi praṇavapra<l7.>kṛtirakāraḥ tathāpyakāro brahmaviṣṇvīśakamaṭheṣvakaṅkaṇeraṇaḥ| iti kośakārairanekārthā(...)śāsanādakāravācyasya maheśvaratvābhidhānaṃ na viṣṇāvaikāntena <l8.> paryavasyati na tu praṇavaprakṛtivācyasya maheśvaratvavidhānamihetyuktaṃ tatprakāraśca prathamamātrārūpokāraḥ tathā praṇavaprathamamātrarūpe<p67b., f58a/62a., l1.>ṇākāro yasyābhidhānaṃ tasya grahaṇena sāmānyatokāramātrāvācyeṣviti prasaṅga iti cenna tathā sati adhamaśikhottaratāpatrayādiśrutiṣu smṛtipurāṇāgameṣu ca brahmaṇasta<l2.>dvācyatvapratipādanena tasyaiveha grahaṇāpatteḥ api ca camasavadaviśeṣāditi sūtroktarītyā ajāmantranyāyenānekadhā yojayituṃ (.....)nā mantrāṇām ākaraṇopabrahmaṇādibhiraidaṃ<l3.>paryamāstheyam| anyathā arthavyavasthityasiddheḥ śakyate hyasya mantrasya vidhāntareṇāpyarthe yojayutum| agnimīle purohitam| yonaḥ samudre bandhuḥ| samānaṃ paramityeteṣu <l4.> śrutānāmakārokāramakārāṇāṃ vedādimadhyāntavarṇatvaprasiddheḥ akāre vedādau proktasvaraḥ sa eva tadante pratiṣṭhitaṃ samānaṃ paramityatra upāntyaṃ tataḥ paraṃ svara<l5.>syābhāvena tasyaivāntyasvaratvāt tasya prakṛtilīnasya prakṛtirviṣṇuḥ vāsudevaḥ parākṛtiriti śruteḥ| prakṛtistvaṃ pumānrudra ityādismṛteśca tasmin līnasya vācyavā<l6.>cakabhāvenābhedaṃ prāptasya vācyavācakayorbhedo nātyantaṃ vidyate kvaciditi vāyūkteḥ tasya yaḥ paraḥ vedādyantapāṭhagamitābhyarhitabhāvasyā<l7.>kāravācyasya prakṛtirūpasya viṣṇoryaḥ pradhānabhūtaḥ prakṛtistvaṃ pumānrudra ityādivacanasiddho rudraḥ tatastadālokanatatparāṇāmityādau paraśabdasya <l8.> pradhāne prayogācchabdaviṣayatatparavyavahāre'pi śabdaṃprati pratipādyasya prādhānyāt pradhānavācitvenaiva paraṃ padaprayogopapattau vācye <l9.> pṛthakkalpanāyogāt sa maheśvaraḥ sa rudro mahānīśvara iti| athavāsya mantrasya yajurvedagatatvāt vedo yajurvedaḥ tasyādau paṭhitaḥ svara ikāraḥ <p68a., f58b/62b., l1.> iṣe  tveti sa eva tadante'pi pratiṣṭhita aivatapatīti tasya prakṛtirlakṣmīḥ tatra śrīrabhavaddevītyupakramya mūlaprakṛtiravyayeti kaurme prayogāt| tasyāṃ vācyavācakabhāvena lagnasya ikārasya lakṣmī<l2.>nāmatvāddairghyāvasthāṃ prāptasyeti yāvat tasya yaḥ paraḥ pañcamīviṣaye ṣaṣṭhī tasmāt para uttaro'varṇa ukāraḥ sa maheśvaraḥ tadvācyaḥ śivaḥ sarveśvara iti tasmāt svatantrotprekṣaṇe <l3.> arthavyavasthityasiddheḥ edamparyāvadhāraṇāya prakaraṇādikamupanyasya nīyaṃ prakaraṇaṃ ca śivarāghavasaṃbhavāde tripuṇḍradhāraṇāṅgabhasmasaṃpādane śaive karmaṇi <l4.> viniyuktena dhātuḥ prasādānmahimānamīśamiti śivanāmāṅkite nāṇoraṇīyāniti mantreṇopakramāt| madhye yo devānāmiti mantrāmnātācca śivaviṣayamavasīyate yaḥ paraḥ <l5.> sa maheśvara ityatra maheśvaraśabdasya caturthīprābalyādanūditasya svavācyaśivarūpatāvidhau tātparyaṃ niścīyate ato niścīyate vidheyānurodhenaivānekadhā yojayutuṃ <l6.> śakyasyānuvādabhāgasya yojanamucitaṃ yasyobhāvagnī anugatāvahinītro cedabharadiyādvā punarādheyaṃ tasya prāyaścittiriti atra havirātryadhikaraṇanyāyenāgnidvitvasyāvivakṣa<l7.>yā ekaikāgnyanugamasyāpi punarādheyanimittatayānuvādapratīte vyavasthitatve'pi advayotpātakatayā vākyāntarāvagatādhānārthā sarūpasya vidheyasya punarādheya<l8.>sya ekāgnimātrotpādanā(-)kṣamatayānurodhenānuvādabhāge agnidvitvavivakṣāyāḥ punarādheyamodanavadityadhikaraṇe (....)tatvenāvyavasthā(-)nānuvādyarthapratītisthale vidhe<l9.>yānurodhenānuvādyarthavarṇanaucityasya kaimutikanyāyasiddhatvāditi sarvathā śiva vaibhavapara eva mantraḥ akṣara(....)pyasau yaṃ vedādau svaraṃ prāhumavācyavācaka<p68b., f59a/63a., l1.>bhāvataḥ| vedaikavedyaṃ yāthārthyādvedānte ca pratiṣṭhitam| sa eva prakṛtamālīnaḥ bhoktā yaḥ prakṛto mataḥ| tasya prakṛta(.....)(....)paḥ paraḥ sa maheśvaraḥ| tadadhītapravṛttitvāt prakṛteḥ <l2.> puruṣasya ceti vāyusaṃhitāyāṃ śravaṇāt| upabrahmaṇānurodhena vedādau ya svaraḥ proktaḥ praṇavaḥ pratipādyapratipādakābhedopacārāt lakṣaṇayā tatpratipādyaṃ <l3.> nirviśeṣaṃ brahma tadeva vedānte ca pratiṣṭhitaṃ vedāntabhāgapratipādyatvāttasya prakṛtāvavidyākhyāyāṃ pratibimbabhāvena lagnasya prakṛtisahitasya puruṣasya yo niyantṛtvena pradhāna<l4.>bhūtaḥ pradhānakṣetrajñapatirguṇeśa ityādiśrutiprasiddheḥ sa maheśvaraśabditaśrīsadāśiva eva na devatāntaramiti svīkāryam| evaṃ cāpakramopasaṃhāraparāmarśaiḥ śivapara<l5.>tvena nirṇīte aṇoraṇīyānityanuvāke vidhīyamānā daharavidyā śiva(-)daivatyeveti na tatropāsyatayā devatāntarānvayāvakāśa iti| api ca kaivalyopaniṣadāmnā<l6.>taguṇanikarapratyabhijñānādapyasyāḥ tadekaviṣayatvamavasīyate| tathā hi spaṣṭaṃ tāvadupāsanāsthānasāmyaṃ tathopāsya(-)rūpamapi tatromāsahāyamityādinā pratipāditamihāpi <l7.> tathaivopavarṇitaṃ ṛtaṃ satyamiti mantreṇa virūpākṣakṛṣṇapiṅgalapadayostrilocano mā sahāyapadasamānārthatvāt| ardhālakamavastrārdhamasthyutpaladalasṛjam| <l8.> ardhapuṃlakṣaṇaṃ vande puruṣaṃ kṛṣṇapiṅgalamiti bhaviṣyatpurāṇavacanena kṛṣṇapiṅgalaśabdasyomāśābalyaparatvena vivaraṇādvirūpākṣaviśvarūpaśrutibhyām| namaskuryānmahādevam| <l9.> ṛtaṃ satyamitīśvaramiti kaurme śivanamaskāre viniyogavidhānāt| bodhāyanasūtre athāto mahādevasya pādodakavidhiṃ <p69a., f59b/63b., l1.> vyākhyāsyāma ityupakramya ṛtaṃ satyamiti mantreṇa prāśayediti śivapādodakaprāśane viniyogācca śivaparatvena niścite'sminmantre śrutasya tathaiva <l2.> vivaraṇasya nyāyatvācca yattu kaścidanāghrātaśabdārthavyutpattigandhaḥ svakalpitakadadhnānurodhiśrutismṛtivacanā kalpanākulitanikhilavaidikamaryādaḥ sakalajanāpahāsyanijamarudavatāratvodghoṣaṇa<l3.>rudro vrate sthitaḥ| ūrdhvaretā iti hyeva śrutyartho'vasito bhavediti tadetanmantratātparyakadhanamābālamakhilāpahāsyaṃ nirākaraṇābhiniveśinamapi vaktāramaphalaṃ kuryādityupekṣate| <l4.> ūrdhvaretā ityatra tu ūrdhvajvālanātmakakuśānuretastvoktiḥ| na cāsya mantrasya śivavaibhavaparatve'pi daharopāsanāyāmupāsyarūpasamarpaṇaparatvena mānamiti vācyam| tasyā<l5.>mapekṣitopāsyarūpasamarpaṇakṣamasyākākṣānurodhenānvayasyāvaśyaṃbhāvāt| yogayājñyavalkye dhyānādhyāye| 

athavā paramātmānaṃ paramānandavigraham| <l6.>
gurūpadeśādvijñeyaṃ puruṣaṃ kṛṣṇapiṅgalam|| 
brahmabrahmapuregārgidaharābje kha madhyame| 
abhyāsāt saṃprapaśyanti hanta tvaṃ ca tathā kuru|| iti

tathaiva darśitatvācca tadevaṃ pratyabhijñā<l7.>viśeṣairanyairapīti samuccayārthenāpi śabdena dyotitā anyairhṛdayakamalasaṃsthānaviśeṣādibhiḥ| nanvevaṃ kathaṃ madhye nārāyaṇaparamantrāṇāṃ saṅgatirityāśaṅkyāha| anudhyānārtha<l8.>mityayaṃ bhāvaḥ| na tāvat paroktarītyā teṣāṃ sarvaparavidyopāsyanirdhāraṇaparatvam| sahasraśīrṣaṃ devamityādibhi(bhiḥ) dvitīyāntapadairnārāyaṇamanūdyata dviśca mupajīvatīti teṣā<l9.>mekavākyatayā tasya viśvopajīvyatvapratipādanaparatvaṃ svarasataḥ pratīyamānaṃ parityajya dvitīyānāṃ prathamārtatvakalpanasya pratyuddeśyaṃ vidhiparyavasānenānena ka vākyatva<p69b., f60a/64a., l1.>kalpanasya cāyuktatvāt paroktarītyā (....) sarvā vai rudra ityādivākyānāṃ spaṣṭabhedānāṃ viruddhavibhakti(-)tatsākāṅkṣakriyāsamabhivyāhārādipratibandhakarahitānāṃ sarvapuruṣādiśabdaiḥ śāṇḍi<l2.>lyavidyāpuruṣasūktasadvidyāvyāhṛtividyādisakalaṃ paravidyopāsyapratyabhijñānapūrvaṃ tasya rudrarūpatvanirdhāraṇaparatāyā durnirāsatvena atharvaśikhāyāṃ ca kaśca dhyeya iti vidyāviśe<l3.>ṣopakramābhāvāt sakalaparavidyāsu dhyeyā praśne śivasya dhyeyatvanirdhāraṇasya spaṣṭatvena ca sahasraśīrṣaṃ devamityādimantrāṇāṃ kliṣṭakalpya tadviruddhārthaparatvaśaṅkāyā utthāpa<l4.>nārhatvācca nāpi prakṛtadaharavidyopāsyanirdhāraṇaparatvaṃ sannihitamantrābhyāmeva rudramaheśvaraśabditaśivarūpatayā nirdhāraṇasya ṛtaṃ satyamiti mantreṇa taducitarūpa<l5.>samarpaṇasya ca siddhatvāt nāpi brahmajyeṣṭhā vīryā saṃbhūtānītyādimantrāṇāmiva guṇakīrtanasāmarthyakalpopāsanānta(-)raparatvam| prakṛtadaharavidyānaṅgabhūtasvatantranārāya<l6.>ṇopāsanāparatvakalpane samanantarānuvākasamāptiparyantamanuvartamānaitat prakaraṇe ananvayena tata utkarṣakalpanāpatteḥ| prakaraṇe saṃbhavati tatkalpanāyo<l7.>gādaṅgatvamapi daharavidyāṃ prati nārāyaṇadhyānasya āgneyādīn prati prayājādiyāgānāmivārādupakārakatvarūpaṃ na yuktam| padmakośapratīkāśa(-)mityādinā tasya madhye <l8.> mahānagnirityādinā tasya madhye vahniśikhetyādinā ca hṛdayakamalakuharavilasanmahāvahniśikhetyādinā ca hṛdayakamalamahāgnitacchikhāguṇakīrtanasāmarthyalabhyānāṃ taddhyānānāṃ hṛdaya<l9.>kamalakuharavilasanmahāvahniśikhāmadhyavartitvena śivopāsanānukūlatayā sannipātitvopapattau ārādupakārakatvakalpanāyogāt| kaurme śrīnandikeśvara<p70a., f60b/64b., l1.>gītāsu|
 
cintayitvā tu pūrvoktaṃ hṛdaye padmamuttamam| 
ātmānamatha kartāraṃ tatrānala
samaprabham|| 
madhye vahniśikhākāraṃ puruṣaṃ pañcaviṃśakam| 
cintayetparamātmānaṃ tanmadhye gaganaṃ param|| <l2.>
oṃkārabodhitaṃ tatvaṃ śāśvaraṃ śivamacyutam|
avyaktaṃ prakṛtau līnaṃ parātparamanuttamam||
tamasaḥ paramaṃ tatvamātmādhāraṃ nirañjanam|
dhyāyīta tanmadhyo nityamekarūpaṃ maheśvaram|| iti 

prathamaṃ svasthāne <l3.> hṛdayakamalasya tanmadhye mūlaśrutāvagnitvena nirūpitasya kartṛtvādiviśiṣṭasya 
vijñānamayakośarūpasyāhaṃkārasya tanmadhye niṣkṛṣṭacaitanyaikatānasyānandamayakośarūpasya tatra vahniśikhātvena <l4.> nirūpita(-)
pañcaviṃśasya tanmadhye sahasraśīrṣadevamityādinā upavarṇitasya tasyāḥ śikhāyā ityādinā śikhāmadhyavartitvenopadiṣṭasya 
nārāyaṇasya tadantaryaḥ paraḥ sa maheśvara <l5.> ityuktasya śivasyopāsanamiti upāsanāprakāraviśeṣaspaṣṭīkaraṇācca 
tasminneva dharmaprakaraṇe sandhyāsvagniviśeṣeṇa cintayet kratumīśvaramityupakramya kṛtvā hṛtpadma<l6.>nilaye viṣṇvākhyaṃ 
viśvasaṃbhavamityādinā hṛdayakamale viṣṇorbhāvanāma vidhāya tadantaḥ sarvabhūtānāmīśvaraṃ brahmarūpiṇamityādinā purāṇapuruṣaṃ śambhuṃ 
dhyāyenmucyatabandhanā<l7.>dityantena tadāntaratvena śivopāsanāvidhānasya dṛṣṭatvācca tasmādyathāntarādityavidyāyāmapi 
ādityo vā eṣa etanmaṇḍalaṃ tapati tatra tā ṛca ityādinā maṇḍalābhimānipuruṣakīrta<l8.>naṃ tadāntaratvena 
parameśvarasyopāsanavidhānārthameva daharavidyāmapi nārāyaṇakīrtanamiti na kiñcidasāṅgatyam| anye tu sa brahmā sa śiva 
ityādikaivalyaśrutiprayabhijñāna<l9.>rodhāt tasyāḥ śikhāyā madhye paramātmā vyavasthita ityādi prāgupāsyatvenopadiṣṭa(-)
maheśvaraparameveti manyamānā madhyamānuvāke nārāyaṇasya guṇakīrtanamanantaraṃ <p70b., f61a/65a., l1.> hṛdayakamalasya 
tato mahāgnestatastacchikhāyāstataḥ prāgupāsyatvena vihitasya paramaśivasyeti dhyānaprakāraṃ manyante evaṃ ca sa brahmā sa śiva 
ityādeḥ paramaśivavibhūtyupadeśaparatve <l2.> sthite kaivalyaśrutāviva vibhūtiṣu nārāyaṇasya(...) paragaṇanamupāsakaparātmana iti 
kramadarśanāt prathamaṃ nārāyaṇātmanā svātmānamanusandhāya svahṛdambuje vaiśvānara(rā)gniśikhā(-)madhyavartitvena na 
dhyāta<l3.>vyaḥ ko (....) vaśādeva tasya tadupasarjanasya spaṣṭatvādityāhuḥ| ayamapi prakāraḥ saṃmataḥ paurāṇikānām| 
tathāhyupabrahmitaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyām| athavāhaṃ hariḥ sākṣātsarvajñaḥ puruṣottamaḥ| saha<l4.>sraśīrṣā puruṣaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ sahasrapāt| 
viśvo nārāyaṇo devāhyakṣaraḥ paramaḥ prabhuḥ| iti dhyātvā|

puna(naḥ) svasya hṛdayāmbhojamadhyame (-)
prāṇāyāmairvikasite parameśvaramandire| <l5.> 
aṣṭaiśvaryadalopete vidyākesarasaṃyute|| 
jñānanile mahākande praṇavena prabodhite|
viśvārciṣaṃ mahāvahniṃ jvalantaṃ viśvato mukham||
vaiśvānaraṃ jagatyoniṃ śikhātanvinamīśvaram| <l6.>
tāpayantaṃ svakaṃ dehamāpādatalamastakam||
nivātadīpavattasmindīpitaṃ havyavāhanam|
nīlatoyadamadhyasthavidyullekhāvabhāsvaram||
nīvāraśūkavadrūpaṃ pītābhāsaṃ vicintayet|
tasya vahneḥ (*)śikhāyāstu madhye paramakāraṇam||(*) <l7.>
paramātmānamānandaṃ paramākāśamīśvaram|
ṛtaṃ satyaṃ paraṃ brahma sāmbaṃ saṃsārabheṣajam||
ūrdhvaretaṃ virūpākṣaṃ viśvarūpaṃ maheśvaram|
nīlagrīvaṃ (*)svamātmānaṃ paśyantaṃ pāpanāśanam||(*) <l8.>
brahmaviṣṇumaheśānairdhyeyaṃ dhyeyavivarjitam|
so'hamityādareṇaiva dhyāyedyogīśvareśvaram|| iti

evaṃ ca nārāyaṇasya yadyupāsakakoṭinive<l9.>śanaṃ śrutyā vivakṣitam| yadi vopāsakasya hṛdaye tasyāpyantaratvena 
śivasyānudhyānamubhayathāpi tasmācca svavibhūtitvena tadvibhūtitvena vopādiṣṭebhyo brahmādibhyaśca parama<p71a., 
f61b/65b., l1.>śivasyotkarṣaḥ sidhyatīti tasyaiva sarvotkarṣa iti niṣpratyūham| nanu cātraiva nārāyaṇaparaṃ brahmeti 
kaṇṭhoktyā parabrahmabhāvenopadiṣṭasya nārāyaṇasya kathamanyopasarjanabhāvaḥ <l2.> kathyate naiṣa doṣaḥ nārāyaṇaparamityasya 
samānapadatvena tatvaṃ brahmanārāyaṇāt paraṃ jyāyaḥ nārāyaṇastu paraḥ tadanya ityatraiva ṛtaṃ satyaṃ paraṃ brahmetyupāsyatvena 
nirdiṣṭasya parabrahmaṇaḥ <l3.> śivasya nārāyaṇasya ca vivakṣitapradhānopasarjanabhāvopapādanaparatayaiva tanmantravyākhyānopapatteḥ| 
yatvatra parairuktaṃ mahopaniṣadi samānaprakaraṇena nārāyaṇaḥ <l4.> paraṃ brahmeti padavicchaidenādhyayanadarśanāt tadanurodhādihāpi 
bhinnapadasya nārāyaṇetyasya supāṃ sulugityādinā prathamāvibhakterlugādeśasya kalpanīya<l5.>tvāt samastapadatve'pi 
niṣādasthapatinyāyena samānādhikaraṇyasyaivocitatvāt| ahameva paraṃ brahma paratatvaṃ pitā(-)maha| ahameva paraṃ jyotiḥ 
paramātmā<l6.>tvahaṃ vibhuriti laiṅgyopabrahmaṇadarśanācca nārāyaṇasyaiva parabrahmabhāvapratipādanaparo'yaṃ mantra iti tadayuktaṃ 
mahopaniṣadyetanmantrāmnātasyaiva tāvat saṃpradāyakra<l7.>māgateṣu pareṣvanupalambhāt tatra tatsatve'pi 
nārāyaṇa(ṇā)nuvākapāṭhānurodhena mahopaniṣatpāṭha eva supāṃ sulugityādinā pañcamyāspādeśakalpano<l8.>papattau 
prakaraṇādisvarasya bhaṅgāyogāt| samarthaparibhāṣāvirodhena samānādhikaraṇasamāsasyāpyasaṅgatvāt lakṣaṇaviruddhāt karmadhārayāt 
tadanurodhinaḥ <l9.> pañcamītatpuruṣasyābhyarhitatvāt tatparastāt kālasyeti sūtre taparasamāsadarśane tadvat pañcamīti yoga(-)
vibhāgāt ihāpi samāyopapattyā atra pañcamīsamāsasya <p71b., f52a/66a., l1.> 
lakṣaṇānurodhi(.........)sminmantre madhyamaparaśabdayoḥ pulliṅgayoḥ tatvajyotirviśeṣaṇatvasyāpyanyāyyatvāt ahameva paraṃ 
brahmetyādilaiṅgyaśrutanārāyaṇavacanasya mahāliṅgaprādu<l2.>rbhāvāt pūrvaṃ brahmanārāyaṇayoḥ parasparotkarṣavivādaprastāve 
paṭhitasyānantaraṃ tadvivādapraśamanārthodbhutamahāliṅga(-)madhyasannihitasya śivasya paśyāmo mahādevaṃ bhayaṃ sarvaṃ vimucyatām| 
<l3.> yuvāṃ prasūtau gātrābhyāṃ mama pūrvaṃ mahābalau| tridhā bhinno'stvahaṃ viṣṇo brahmaviṣṇubhavākhyayā| sarvarakṣālayaguṇairniṣakalaḥ 
parameśvaraḥ| saṃmohayasya jaṃ viṣṇotva(-)mityādibhirvacanaistatrai<l4.>vopoditasyārthatathātvāvyavasthāpakatvāt| tādṛśāpavādarahitena 
sa paraḥ sarvaśaktīnāṃ brahmaṇaḥ samanantara iti nārāyaṇaṃ prakṛtyaviṣṇupurāṇavacanena tasya brahmāparatvasyaiva <l5.> 
upabrahmitatvācca paroktārthagrahaṇe'pi nārāyaṇaparambrahma ṛtaṃ satyaṃ paraṃ brahmeti dvayoḥ parabhāvopadeśāsaṃbhavenāvaśyake 
kasyacidanyathānayane aṅgaguṇa<l6.>virodhādhikaraṇanyāyena guṇasya tasyaiva nārāyaṇasya parabhāvopadeśasya brahmocyate paramasau 
paraṃ ca tatvamiti ślokena sudarśanācāryairupadiṣṭayā <l7.> rītyānyathā netavyatvena tatbalādupakramādipratiṣṭhāpi 
nārthavyākulīkaraṇāyogācca aṅgaguṇavirodhe ca tādarthyādityadhikaraṇe hi ekāhādidīkṣāpekṣeṣu <l8.> dīkṣaṇīyā 
somayāgayoranyatarasyāsaṃbhavādyadiṣṭyādivākya(-)prāptaparvakālatvasyāvaśyake tyāge pradhānānugrahasyocitatvāt dīkṣaṇīyā eva 
tyāga iti nirṇītaṃ <l9.> tasmānna kaścidupapāditerthe virodhagandhaḥ vastutastu nārāyaṇaparaṃ brahmetyādeḥ 
nārāyaṇasyānupacaritabrahmabhāvanapratipādanaparatve'pi tasya śivopasarjanabhāvaḥ saṃghaṭata<p72a., f62b/66b., l1.> iti 
purastānnipuṇataramupapādayiṣyate||31||

śrutīnāṃ mūrdhānaḥ śubhadabṛhadāraṇyakamukhāḥ 
     prabhāvaṃ hārdasya praṇijagaduranye'pi bhavataḥ| 
guṇānāṃ boddhāraḥ sakalamupasaṃhāra(*)niyamaṃ(*) <l2.>
     vidustvayyaivaiṣāṃ hṛdayamiti kiṃ mūḍhavacanaiḥ||

buhadāraṇyakaśrutistāvat ya eṣo'ntarhṛdaya ākāśaḥ tasmin cheta iti haravidyopāsyaṃ parameśvaramupakramya sarvasya vaśī 
sarvasyeśānaḥ <l3.> sarvasyādhipatiḥ sa naḥ sādhunā karmaṇā bhūyānto evāsādhunā kanīyāt eṣa sarveśvara eṣa 
bhūtādhipatireṣabhūtapāla eṣa setirvidharaṇa eṣāṃ lokānāmasambhedāyeti <l4.> tasyānanyasādhāraṇaṃ prabhāvamavarṇayat| tathā 
chāndogyaśrutirapi atha yadidamasmin brahmapure daharaṃ puṇḍarīkaṃ veśma daharo'sminnantarākāśa ityupakramya eṣa 
ātmāpahatapāpmā<l5.> virajo vimṛtyurviśoko vicikitso'pi pāsaḥ satyakāmaḥ satyasaṅkalpa iti tadguṇakīrtanenādhaya 
ihātmānamanuvidya vrajanti etāṃśca satyān kāmān teṣāṃ sarveṣu <l6.> lokeṣu kāmacāro bhavatītyādinā tadupāsakānāṃ 
mahāphalakīrtanena ca tasya mahimānamaprakāśayat tathā athāto mahopaniṣadamevāpakramya mahopaniṣadapi 
nārāyaṇānu<l7.>vākaprakriyayā sahasraśīrṣaṃ devaṃ sahasrākṣaṃ viśvaśaṃbhuvamityādinā upāsakatadātmyenānusandheyaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ tasya 
hṛdayakamalaṃ tatra vaiśvānarāgniśikhāṃ ca varṇayitvā <l8.> tasyai śikhāyai madhye puruṣaḥ paramātmā vyavasthita iti hārdasya 
śivasya tanmadhyavartitvapradarśanena sa brahmā sa śiva ityādinā itareṣāṃ tadvibhūtitvakhyāpanena ca tasya vaibhavaṃ vyadyotayat 
<l9.> yadyapi nārāyaṇānuvāke tasyāḥ śikhāyāmadhya ityādeḥ nārāyaṇaviṣayatvapakṣe tatpratyabhijñānurodhādiha tasyai śikhāyai 
madhya ityādestadviyatvādiyamu<p72b., f63a/67a., l1.>paniṣannārāyaṇaparopāsanāparaiveti kvacit karmaṇyupasarjanatvena 
yaṣṭavyāyā devatāyāḥ karmāntare pradhānatvena yaṣṭasyatvavat daharopāsanasūpasarjanatvena dhyātavyasya <l2.> hṛdayapuṇḍarīkasya 
pātañjalaśāstraktaphalaviśeṣārthaṃ prādhānyena dhyātavyatvavacca śaivadaharopāsanāyā(-)mupasarjanatvena upāsyasya nārāyaṇasya 
etadbalāt prādhānyenopā<l3.>syatvaṃ labhyate| tathāpi tasyāḥ śikhāyā madhya ityādi śivaparamiti sūtasaṃhitādyabhimatapakṣe 
tadvadiyamapyupaniṣat śivopāsanāparaiva paryavasyati| evamanyā api śrutayo yathā<l4.>saṃbhavaṃ draṣṭavyā syādetat bṛhadāraṇyake 
nirviśeṣaprakaraṇe tasyaiva stutyarthaṃ vaśitvādayo dharmāḥ samāmnātāḥ na tatra kaivalyaśākhādiśrutadaharavidyopāsyasya śivasya 
kaści<l5.>tprasaṅgo'sti| chāndogya yadyapi upāsanāvidhānamasti tathāpi tatra śivopāsanamiti na kiñcit 
pramāṇamupalabhyate| na ca kaivalyaśrutopāsanaikyāt tathātva<l6.>siddhiḥ| ātmaprabodhopaniṣadi atha yadidaṃ brahmapuramidaṃ 
puṇḍarīkamityārabhya śokamohavinirmuktaṃ dhyāyannasīdatītyantena tahara(-)puṇḍarīke viṣṇūpāsanasyā<l7.>pi vihitatvena 
tadaikyasyaiva niyantumaśakyatvāt| yattu mahopaniṣanmantrajātamudāhṛtaṃ tatra nārāyaṇānuvāka iva pūrvaṃ śivaprastāvābhāvāt na 
tadupāsanāparatvaṃ vaktuṃ <l8.> śakyate| eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīdityupakramamārabhya nārāyaṇasya prastāvena 
tadupāsanāparatvasyaiva pratīteḥ| na ca nārāyaṇānuvākaprakriyāpratyabhijñānāt śivopāsa<p73a., f62b/66b., l1.>nāparatvaṃ 
eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīdityupakramavirodhenāntaraṃ tat pratyabhijñānasya chāndogye omityetadakṣaramudgīdha(ya)mupāsīdeti 
upakramānurodhena udgīthabhaktyavayavaviṣayā<l2.>yāmudgīdha(ya) vidyāyāṃ 
vājasaneyakaśrutakṛtsnodgīthabhaktikartṛviṣayodgīyavidyārthavādādipratyabhijñānasyaivākiñcitkaratvāt etat prakriyāpratyabhijñānāt 
tasyaiva nārāyaṇopāsanā<l3.>paratvamiti vaiparītyasyaiva parābhimatatvāccetyāśaṅkyāha| guṇānāmiti ayamāśayaḥ 
bṛhadāraṇyakevaśitvāmnāyanaṃ yadyapi nirguṇaprakaraṇamadhyapātitayāpi nirviśeṣavaśitvā(-)dyabhāvāt| <l4.> 
saguṇopādhiviśeṣagaganaguṇakīrtanadvāraiva stutau paryavasānasya vaktavyāt hṛdayakośamadhyagatasya īśāna(-)sarveśvara(-)
bratādhipatiśabditasya śivasyaiva guṇakīrtanasya <l5.> stutidvāratvena pratīteḥ śivaviṣayameva vaśi(-)tvādiguṇāmnātam| tathā 
chāndogye daharo'sminnantarākāśa iti daharādhikaraṇoktanyāyāt brahmapareṇākāśapadena <l6.> upāsyaṃ brahma prastutya 
tasminyadantastadaneṣṭavyamityādyuktatvā kiṃ tatra vidyate yadanveṣṭavyamityādinā svayameva paricodyāsmin kāmāḥ 
samāhitā iti taduttaravākyena tadantarvarti<l7.>tvenopadiṣṭāṃ satyakāmādiguṇānāṃ bṛhadāraṇyake vaśitvādiguṇaiḥ sahopasaṃhārasya 
sarvairabhyupagatatvācca tathā mahopaniṣadi sahasraśīrṣaṃ devamityādyāmnānamapi <l8.> śivopāsanāprakāraviśeṣaparākāstena 
nārāyaṇānuvākaprakriyāpratyabhijñānāt| yattvatrāpakramarodha iti śaṅkitam| takṣa pṛcchāmaḥ kimupakrame<p73b., f64a/67a., 
l1.> nārāyaṇasyopāsanā vihiteti tadvirodhaḥ| uta tadvibhūtyupṛnyāsāt tadupānāvidhitsonnīteti athavā upakrame 
sarvotkarṣeṇopavarṇitatvāt anyopasarjana<l2.>tayā upāsanānupraveśakalpanamayuktamiti virodhaḥ| na tāvadādyaḥ mahopaniṣadi 
upāsanāvidherevāśravaṇāt nāpi dvitīyaḥ nārāyaṇānuvākapratyabhijñayā nārāyaṇāntaratve<l3.>naiva śivopāsanā prāpteḥ 
nārāyaṇasyāpyupāsanāviṣayakoṭāvanupraveśena tat pratyabhijñāderapyupakramavirodhābhāvena tadādarasya yuktatvāt| <l4.> chāndogye 
tasminyadantastadanveṣṭavya(-)mityupakrame satyakāmādiguṇamātropāsanāpratītāvapi chāndogyapratyabhijñānurodhāt 
guṇopasarjanaguṇyapā<l5.>sanābhyupagamācca chāndogyaśrutodgīyavidyāyā vājasanīyodgīyapratyabhijñāne tu 
prāṇadṛṣṭyodgīyakartṛrupāsanāyāṃ kathañcidviśeṣaṇatvena <l6.> udgīyāvayavasyoṅkārasyānupraveśasaṃbhave'pi atha haya evāyaṃ 
makhyaḥ prāṇastadudgīyamupāsāñcakrira ityādi chāndogyaśrutipratipannasya <l7.> prāṇadṛṣṭaupāsanaṃ virudhyateti yukto bhedaḥ| 
nanvastu tarhi tri(tṛ)tīyaḥ kalpaḥ tadasmi(-)nyadantastadanveṣṭavyaṃ 
tasminayadantastadupāsitavyamityanayorupasaṃhārā<l8.>nurodhena yattat padayoḥ tyadādīni sarvairnityaṃ napuṃsakamanapuṃsakenaiva 
cāsyānyatarasyāmiti vidhānādākāśatadgataguṇajātobhayaparatvaṃ <p74a., f64b/67b(?)., l1.> parikalpya 
tadubhayopāsanāvidhiparatvasya varṇayituṃ śakyatvāt| eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīdityādinārāyaṇasya 
sarvotkarṣapratipādanasyānyopasarjatvakalpanā<l2.>sahiṣṇutvācceti cenna| eko ha vā ityādeḥ śivopasarjanatva(-)
kalpanānukūlatvenaivāgre nipuṇataraṃ vyākhyāsyamānatvāt etena mahopaniṣadanurodhena nārāyaṇānu<l3.>vāka eva 
nārāyaṇopāsanāmātrapara iti parābhimāno galahastitaḥ tathā sati ekopāsanāśrutyanurodhena ubhayopāsanāśruternayane chāndogyaśrute 
<l4.>rapi taittirīyaśrutyanurodhena guṇamātropasanāparatvāpatteḥ bṛhadāraṇyakādyudāhṛtaśrutayo daharavidyānvayiguṇādhikathanena 
śivasya niratiśa<l5.>prabhāvaṃ khyāpayantīti sādhūktam||32||

kiṃ ca| 
vidhatte māṇḍūkyaśrutirapi samastādhipatitāṃ 
     samānārthaśrutyantaravivṛtabhāvā tava vibho|
tathai(*)śāno mantrasmaramayanarudropaniṣadi(*) <l6.> 
     pratatā mantrāśca prakaṭataramanye ca bahavaḥ||

atreyaṃ viṣayaśuddhiḥ| adhadaivatamādhyātmaṃ cātmano nirviśeṣasya upādhi<l7.>bhirvibhaktāni trīṇi trīṇi santi rūpāṇi 
vaiśvānaro hiraṇyagarbha īśaścetyadhidevataṃ viśvaśca taijasaḥ prājña ityadhyātmamiti śrutiḥ dehayosthūlarūpayostatra vyaṣṭi <l8.> 
samaṣṭyādvā abhimānividhāyinau vaśvavaiśvānarāviṣṭau sūkṣmayostu prakathitau taijasahiraṇyagarbha(.....)

prājñeśvarāvupahitā vṛttāvajñānamāyābhyām| 
viśvo (*)jāgradavasthāyāṃ jīvasvapne syātai(ttai)jasaḥ||(*) <p74b., f65a/69a., l1.>
avidyāmātrasākṣitvāt saṃprasāde prājño bhavet| 
vaiśvānaro'tra (*)bhagavān rāṭpuruṣa ucyate||(*) <l2.> 
śarīraṃ yasya nikhilaṃ trailokyaṃ sa carācaram|
hiraṇyagarbho jagatāṃ sūkṣmadṛṣṭervivardhayitā||
yadupāye prāṇakalpaṃ sākṣmamāhurvedavidaḥ| <l3.>
viśuddhasatvavilasanmāyādhiṣṭhānarasikaḥ||
īśvarastveṣabhagavānambikārdhāṅgaruciraḥ|
māyā vidyopādhibhedāprakalpyaivātra kecit|| 

avidyayā jīvabhāvamāhuḥ pratibimbi<l4.>śvamīśa etatsarvaṃ śāstroditaṃ vyaktaṃ tacchīkṣāśālinām| tasmādasminmūlasthitā 
gīrobhirasmābhirnodāhṛtāḥ| tatra viśvavaiśvānarau taijasahiraṇyagarbhau prājñe <l5.> pratipatnisaukaryāya soyamātmā 
catuṣpādityādinā catuṣpādamātmānaṃ nirūpayanti māṇḍūkyaśrutirjāgaritasthāna ityādinā pādadvayanirūpaṇānantaraṃ <l6.> 
suṣuptisthāna ekībhūtaprajñānaghana evānandamayo hyānandabhuk ceto mukhaḥ prājñastṛtīyaḥ pāda iti tṛtīyapāda(-)nirūpaṇāvasare eṣa 
sarveśvara eṣa sarvajña <l7.> eṣo'ntaryāmī eṣo'gniḥ sarvasya prabhavāpyayau hi bhūtānāmiti tasya sarvādhipatyaṃ vidadhāti| na 
nu yadyapi prājñasya svataḥ sarveśvaratvādyasaṃbhavāt tasya tat pratipādanaṃ <l8.> māyopahitena brahmaṇā tasyaikyavivakṣāṃ 
gamayati| tathāpi tasya devatāntararūpasyāpi saṃbhavāt naiṣā śrutirīśvarapareti niyantuṃ śakyata iti 
mandaśaṅkānirāka<p75a., f65b/69b., l1.>raṇāyāha samānārtheti| uttaratāpanīye māṇḍūkyaprakriyaiva so'mātmā 
catuṣpādityādinā catuṣpādamātmānaṃ nirūpayantyāṃ pājña īśvarastri(stṛ)tīyaḥ pādaḥ eṣa sarveśvara ityādinā <l2.> 
tri(tṛ)tīyapādanirūpaṇe prājñasyaiśvaraikyamukttvaiva sarveśvara(...)dyāmnānāt tadaikāryāya māṇḍūkyaśruterapi tadhaiva bhāva unnīyata 
ityarthaḥ| īśānassarvavidyānāmityādīśāno mantraḥ <l3.> rudropaniṣat śatarudrīyam| ekaśataṃ yajuḥ śākhāstāsu 
rudropaniṣadāmnāyata iti caraṇavyūhe prayogāt| tadāmnātā namo hiraṇyabāhava ityārabhya ekaviṃśatimantrāḥ te hi śivasya 
<l4.> digādyekaikādhipatyopanyāsamukhena sarvādhipatyaṃ sphuṭayati anye mantrāḥ yuṣyasūktaśivasaṃkalpādipaṭhitāḥ||33||

ananyaprāpyaṃ te kamapi mahimānaṃ (*)prakaṭaya(*) <l5.>
     ntyasaṅkhyeyāmantrā niravadhinamaskāraghaṭitāḥ|
svayaṃ śūdrādīnāmapi śivapatantaścaraṇayo(-)
     rnamaskāre bhāraṃ na vidadhati mūrkhā na tu budhāḥ||

catuṣṭaye'pi vedā<l6.>nāṃ candraśekharā mantrāḥ prāyeṇa dṛśyante| (...)maskāraśekharāḥ| dviruktaiḥ sakṛdāmnātairādyantapaṭhitairapi| 
alaṅkṛtā namaskārairasaṅkhyāsta iti sphuṭam| <l7.> anyeṣāṃ vibudhānāṃ tu mantrāśrutiṣu viśrutāḥ| kvacit kvacinnamaskāre 
yoge'pi na tathā vidhāḥ| tathā ca svaviṣayotkarṣaliṅganamaskārabāhulyenānitaradevatāsādhā<l8.>raṇena 
ritarudrādharvaśivorudrādhyāyadevavratādayaḥ śivasyānanyasāmānyaṃ mahimānaṃ khyāpayantīti sphuṭametat| yattatra paraiḥ pralapitaṃ 
namaskāro na svaviṣa<l9.>yotkarṣe liṅgaṃ kutaścit svahiṃsāśaktāt bhayādapi tannamaskārasya loke darśanāt vede'pi 
namaste astu māmāhiṃsī<p75b., f66a/ 70a(?)71a., l1.>rityubhayaprayuktanamaskāropalambhācca iha tu tadbhūyastvaṃ 
bhayaprayastvādupapannamiti tannirāsamabhipretyāha svayamiti| ayaṃ bhāvaḥ yadīha bhayabhūyastvāt bhūsastvaṃ <l2.> 
namasāmidāntadevānanyasāmānyaṃ brahmatāṅgamaye (....) mahadbhayaṃ vajramiti kaṭhavallīṣu darśanāt| kampanāditi sūtre ca tasya 
talliṅgateraṇāt| bhayādapi namaskāro <l3.> naivotkarṣaṃ vanā śrutau| rudrā vandavalloke ko vā nāsti vyatikramaḥ| namaste 
astu mā mā hiṃsīriti namaskārasya bhayapravṛttatve'pi tatastadviṣayasyotkarṣasiddhiḥ| namaste <l4.> harasecociṣa iti 
mantraśrutanamaskāra(-)tulyarūpasyaiva namaste harase śociṣa ityāha (–) namaskṛtya hi vasiyāṃ samupacarantīti 
tanmantrabrāhma<l5.>ṇena autsargikasvaviṣayotkarṣaprayuktatvātyāgokteḥ| kiṃ ca sarvo vai rudra ityādime(ma)ntreṣu 
bhayaliṅgarahiteṣu kevalaṃ śivasya <l6.> sāvdhārthādipratipādanāyaiva pravṛtteṣu nibadhyamānā namaskārāmaviṣayagauravaikaprayuktā 
iti te'tra kācidanyathāsiddhirvaktuṃ <l7.> śakyate uktaṃ ca laiṅgye – sarvaṃ rudreti vai prāhuma(huḥ) – munayastatvadarśinaḥ| 
namaskāreṇa sahitā gauravāt parameṣṭhina iti tasmādanye sāmānyena nama<l8.>skāramālālaṅkṛtāstvaritarudrādayo niraṅkuśaṃ 
śivasya niratiśayamahimānamevedayantīti vajralepāyate| ato lokavedavidviṣṭadurmatapraviṣṭa <p76a., f66b/70b., 
l1.>vṛṣalādicaraṇapatanāpatat nijanaicyanihnapāyaiva paraṃ pareṣāṃ namaskāro notkarṣaprayukta iti pralāpaḥ nāsau viduṣāṃ 
hṛdayaṅgama<l2.> iti ||34||

kiṃ ca (–) 
namasyānāmekaṃ viṣayamakhilānāṃ ca vacasā 
     mama hā viṣṇvādīnāmapi janayitāraṃ diviṣadām| 
vadantastvāmanye varada tava śaṃsanti vibhavaṃ 
     gurū kurvantaste (*)girīśagaṇanāthānapi bhṛśam||(*) <l3.>

yasmai namastasmai tvāṃ juṣṭaṃ niyana(nyūna)jīmentrastāvat śivasya sarvanamaskāraviṣayatvaṃ darśayati 
svasvoddeśyakanamaskāraviṣayatvasya <l4.> sarvasādhāraṇatvena tenāsādhāraṇaśivarūpasamarpaṇāyagena tasya 
sarvanamaskāraviṣayatvaparatvā(-)vaśyabhāvāt (–) na ca namaskārabhūmaviṣaya<l5.>tve tasya tātparyamastu tasya rudrādhyāyādimantrāṇāṃ 
namaskārabhūmnāṃ śivāsādhāraṇatvena tatsvarūpasamarpaṇakṣamatvāt sarvanamaskāraviṣayatvasya <l6.> śive pramāṇāntarāt 
anavagnametairūpeṇa tadanuvādāyogācceti vācyaṃ devatāntaranamaskārebhyo bāhulyarūpasya śiva<l7.>namaskāra(....)bhūmno'tra 
pracodasya śabdasya abhāvāt namaḥ śabdasyaiva tattātparyakalpane lakṣaṇāpatteḥ sarvanamaskāraviṣayatvasya namaśśabdena 
jātyākhya<l8.>balāt (....)eva me iti (.....)miti sāmānyavyutpattisiddhocitasthalānvayāvadhāraṇabalāt vā sidhyupapatteḥ 
tasya śive śrutyantarā<l9.>danavagamepi yo brahmāṇa(...)mantre parameśvarasyādhyāpayitṛtvavarja anuvāda(...)marthādve siddhisaṃbhavāt 
daharavidyānvayiparameśvara(-)guṇapratipāda<p76b., f67a/71a., l1.>napare (....) miti mantre viśva (....) ya vai nama 
iti bhāgasyāpi sarvanamaska(.....)ṣaṇatadanvayi tadguṇaviśeṣaparatvaucityena purovādasyā<l2.>pi saṃbhavācca evaṃ yasmai (....) 
ityādikamapyatrodāharaṇe tathā imā rudrāya sthiradhanvine gira iti mantraḥ kṛtsnasyāpi śabdarāśeḥ pratipādyaṃ śivaṃ darśayate 
<l3.> tadanantara(....)rudrasūkte (...) girā śivaparasya spaṣṭatveśvarapade ślataye mā iti idaṃśabdasya pratyakṣādisannidhāpita(-)
sakalaśabdaparatvāt yadyapi namo <l4.> brahmaṇe namo brāhmaṇebhya ityādi yānyaviṣayā api namaskārāścopalabhyante 
tathāpi tama(?) ime vīṇāyāṃ gāyantyetatante gāyantīti sa vikramaṇḍalamadhye <l5.> vartinaḥ puru(....)la saka(....) vibhāgeṣu 
gīyamānatvavyapadeśavat sarvanamaskāraviṣayatva sarvaśabdajālapratipādyatvavyapadeśaḥ parameśvarasya <l6.> sārvātmyābhiprāya iti 
yasmai nama ityādayaḥ sarvātmatvāviṣkaraṇena tasya parabhāvaṃ prakaṭayantīti bhāvo draṣṭavyaḥ|

kānicidvedavākyāni brāhmaṇā veda (*)vittamāḥ|(*) <l7.>
rudramūrtiṃ samāśritya śive paramakāraṇe||
paryavasyanti viprendrāḥ tathā vākyāni kānicit|
sūryamūrtiṃ muniśreṣṭhāḥ tathā vānyāni kānicit||
evaṃ mūrtyabhidhā(*)nena dvāreṇaiva munīśvarāḥ|(*) <l8.>

pratipādyo mahādevaḥ sthitaḥ sarvāḥ mūrtiṣvityādiskāndoktidarśanāt stomaṃ vo adya rudrāya śikvase kṣayadurāya me 
sādiriṣṭaneti <l9.> mantrabalenānyaviṣayatvena pratīyamānānāmapi stutinamaskārāṇāmantaryāmaṇi śive paryavasānakalpanāt 
śvabhyaśvapatibhyaśca vai nama ityādīnāṃ tatparyavasāna<p77a., f67b/71b., l1.>kalpanāvaśyaṃ bhāvācca yasmai nama 
ityādikaṃ sarvāntaryāmitvābhiprāyamiti kecidācāryāḥ tathā somaḥ pavata iti mantro mahāviṣṇvādīnāmapi devānāṃ janakamīśvaraṃ 
<l2.> prapodayati janito'ta viṣṇorityupadeśena janitāgnerityādyuktārthebhya utkarṣadyotanena viṣṇupadasya jagatpālake 
mahāviṣṇau tātparyāt tadavatārajanaka<l3.>tvasya daśarathādāvapi satve nāgnyādijanakatvāt tasyotkarṣatvābhāvāt ekaḥ 
purastādya idaṃ śvabhravayato vāñca bhūva bhuvanasya bhopāḥ| yamapyetiṃ puruṣaṃ sāṃ parāya <l4.> iti āyuṣyasūktamantre śivasya 
jagatkāraṇatvatatpālakatvatatsaṃhartṛtvapratipādanapare yato babhūva bhuvanasya gopā ityasya jagatpālanasvātantryasphuraṇā<l5.>ya 
satvopādhikamahāviṣṇumūrtiparatvāvaśyaṃbhāvācca tvaramatītānāṃ ca divaḥ pṛthivyā vahneḥ sūryasya vajriṇeḥ sākṣādapi mahāviṣṇo 
somena janayitā <l6.> īśva(īśvaraḥ) iti rudrasaṃhitāyāmupabrahmaṇā ca nanva(...)mamantraḥ pavamānaviṣayaḥ satyaṃ tathāpi 
tatrāgnyādikāraṇatvasya vastutaḥ pratipādyatvena ddedhā yogāt upa<l7.>braṃhyaṇācca (...)deka(....)be umāsa(....)tānvayaṃ 
etacca puruṣasūktārthavicāre nirūpitaprāyaṃ na caivaṃ sati mantrasthasomapadasya sakhaṇḍatvāpalāpāda<l8.>ttyayasaṃ prada(.....)rodhiḥ 
viniyogārte la(...)paratvasyāpi satvena tadviṣayatayā padādhyanopapatteḥ umayā sahiḥ śambhusoma ityucyate pudhaiḥ sa eva 
<l9.> janakasākṣāt tadviṣṇorapi (....) purāṇavacanadaśitena yogena śivaparatvasyāvaśyakatvācca (....) 
devatyatarudrādhyāyādayaḥ śisya(ṣya)(-)pāṣadānaci<p77b., f68a/72a., l1.> (...) bhirbahukurvastathāpara(.....) māṭhekhyā 
(..........) dvitīyaṃ tu prati gāṇāpatyamavāpnoti tri(tṛ)tīya(...)ptvādevamevānupraviśati bhītijño <l2.> yatiyogena na 
bha(.....)caro bhūtvā tenaiva saha modata ityādiśrutismṛtibhirapavargasya (.....)tvenāvagamitam evameka eva rudro na 
dvitīyā<l3.>yanasthe ityādayo mantrāḥ śiva(...) vabhavaparā(...)ndāhāryāḥ yattu karmaviśeṣe eka eva rudro devatā na tvaneka 
iti tadvyākhyānaṃ tadayuktaṃ śvetāśvataro<l4.>paniṣadi vināpi karma prasaṅgam eka eva rudro na dvitīyā tastham| ya imāṃ 
lonīśatīśanībhiḥ iti śravaṇāt| tasmādeka eva rudra ityekamevādvitīyamityanena <l5.> samānārtham||35||

evaṃ vedāntabhāge ca karmakāṇḍe ca kānicidudāharaṇāni vākyāni vai bhave vā vratīpateḥ| atha tatra purāṇāni 
śiva<l6.>śāstroktāni ca bhāratādīni cānyāni pramāṇamiti (....) asaṅkhyābhiḥ śākhāvitatibhirupanstamakhilaṃ susūkṣmā(-)
bhirnyāyāvalibharavaseya ca bhavataḥ| <l7.> prabhāvaṃ niṣkṛṣya sphuṭamiha purāṇāni bahudhā kapardiṃ nāñcālaṃ muravadarakalpaṃ 
vidadhate|

śrī śivapurāṇe tāvat (–)
munīnāṃ ṣaṭkulīnā<l8.>nāṃ śruṇvatāmitaretaram| idaṃ paramidaṃ neti vivādaḥ sumahānabhūt parasya durnirūpatvāt jayatastatra na 
niścayaḥ| ityupakramya teṣāmṛṣīṇāmanyonyaṃ vivādamānānāṃ brahmasabhopasarpaṇamuktvā bhagavanandhakāreṇa mahatā vayamāvṛtāḥ| 
khinnā vivandamānāśca na paśyāmo'tra yatparamityādinā teṣāṃ sāmānyena saka<p78a., f68b/72b., 
l1.>lakāraṇabhūtasya paradaivatasya praśnamutthāpya evaṃ pṛṣṭastadā brahmetyārabhya utthāya suciraṃ dhyātvā rudra ityuccaran giram|
 
ānandaklinnasarvāṅgaḥ kṛtāñjalirabhāṣata| <l2.> 
yasmāt sarvamidaṃ brahma viṣṇurudrendrapūrvakam|| 
saha vratendriyaiḥ sarvaiḥ prathamaṃ saṃprasūyata|

ityādinā brahmavākyenānvitarasaḥ sādhāraṇenāvāṅmanasagocarā<l3.>nekaśākhāviprakīrṇabahuvidhavaibhavaniṣkarṣapareṇa prapañcena śiva 
eva paradevateti vyavasthāpitam|

enaṃ pradeśamakhilaśrutisimarāśi(-)
     sārārthasaṃgraha(*)paradruhiṇopadeśam|(*) <l4.>
adhyāpitāḥ sukṛtino na galanyamīṣāṃ 
     janmāntare'pi paradevatadhīrmaheśe||

tathā pādme (–)
śrutāni sarvaśāstrāṇi purāṇā(*)nyakhilāni ca|(*) <l5.>
dharmaśāstrāṇi sarvajñatvaṃ naḥ sūtamahātmane||
asmākaṃ suśayaḥ kaścit sumahān hṛdi vartate|
yenārtā iva sa jātācchet kṛntaṃ ca tvamahasi|| <l6.>
ko devaḥ paramo jyāyān kathaṃ cāśādhyate hi saḥ|
ārādhite phalaṃ kiṃ syāt etat satyaṃ bravīhi naḥ||

iti śruticarannekapurāṇādiprade<l7.>śeṣu nānādevatotkarṣapratipādanānāṃ kiṃ tatvavivakṣāyā pravṛttaṃ kiṃ vā śrotṛbudhyanusārāditi 
svayaṃ nirdhārayatumaśaknuvatām ṛṣīṇāṃ <l8.> praśumupanyasya|

atra vaḥ kathayiṣyāmi itihāsaṃ purātanam| 
viṣṇoḥ sanatkumārasya saṃvādaṃ pāpanāśanam|| 
imameva purā praśnaṃ pṛṣṭavānviṣṇumavyayam| <l9.> 
sanatkumāro bhagavān parāparavibhagakṛt|| 
munestasya vaca(caḥ) śrutvā viṣṇuḥ sa(...)vidāṃ paraḥ|
yaduvāca mahābhāgaḥ tacchruṇutamatantritāḥ||

iti sūtasya pratipavacanaṃ <p78b., f69a/73a., l1.> copanikṣipya (–)

eka eva śivo jyāyān dvidhā ca bahudhā śrutaḥ| 
vedeṣu ca purāṇeṣu sāṅgopāṅgeṣu gīyata||

ityādinā viṣṇuvacanena śivasya sarvotkarṣa<l2.>pratipādanena (–)

sāṅkhyaṃ yogaḥ pāñcarātraṃ vedāḥ pāśupataṃ tathā| 
jñānānyetāni pañcaiva jñeyaśceko maheśvaraḥ||

ityādinā sa praśāstrāṇāṃ śive paryavasyā<l3.>naprakārasya śāstrāṇāṃ prasthānabhedapravṛttiprayojasya copapādanena| 

sarvākāro nirākāro mahātmā pārvatīpatiḥ| 
tasmāt parataraṃ nāsti jñānajñe(*)yayāt sadāśivāt||(*) <l4.>

ityādinā tasmāt parābhavavyavasthāpanena evaṃ vilapatokyuccai ye śṛṇvanti na me vacaḥ sandhukṣyante muniśreṣṭhāstadarthaṃ <l5.> 
narakāgnayaḥ|(?) iti kṛtopadeśānādare pratyavāyavarṇanena ca dṛḍhīkṛto'yamarthaḥ brahmāṇḍa(-)purāṇe'pi| purā pitāmahaṃ devaṃ 
meruśri(śṛ)ṅge maharṣayaḥ <l6.> procuḥ praṇamya deveśaṃ kimekaṃ tatvamavyayamiti tāvat praśnenopakramya sa māyayā maheśasya 
mohito lokasaṃbhavaḥ| avijñāyaṃ śaṃbhāvaṃ svātmam| <l7.> naṃ(naṭha) prāha carṣiṇām| ityādinā brahmaṇa(ṇaḥ) svasya 
parabhāvopadeśaṃ tamākarṇyā(rṇya) sahamānasya yajñātmano nārāyaṇasya svasya parabhāvapratipādanaṃ cāvatārya evaṃ <l8.> vivadato 
me ślāhāt parasparajayaiṣiṇoḥ| 

ājaśmustatra tau devau vedāścatvāra eva hi| 
anvīkṣya devaṃ brahmāṇaṃ yajñātmānaṃ ca saṃsthitā|| 
procyaḥ saṃvigna(*)hṛdayā yāthārthyaṃ parameṣṭhinaḥ| ṛgvedaḥ|(*) <l9.>
yasyāṃ tatsthānibhūtāni yasmāt sarvaṃ pravartate| 
yadāhuḥ tatparaṃ tatvaṃ sa devasyā(ssyā)nmaheśvaraḥ|| yajurvedaḥ| <p79a., f69b/73b., l1.>
yo yajñairakhilairi(rī)śo yo (....)na ca samarpyate| 
yamāhurīśvaraṃ devaṃ sa devasyāpi nāmudhṛt|| sāmavedaḥ|| 
yenedaṃ bhrāmyate cakraṃ yadākāśāntaramāmahat| 
yogabhivedyante (*)tatvaṃ mahādevaḥ sa śaṅkaraḥ|| atharvavedaḥ|(*) <l2.>
yaṃ prapaśyati deveśaṃ yatantoyanayaḥ param| 
maheśaṃ puruṣaṃ rudraṃ sa devo bhagavān bhavaḥ|| 
evaṃ sa bhagavān (*)brahmavedyanāmīritaṃ śubham|(*) <l3.>
śrutvā vihasya viśvātmā yajñaścāpi vimohitaḥ||
kathaṃ tatparamaṃ brahma sarvasaṅgavivarjitam|
ramate bhāryayā sārdhaṃ pramathaiścātigarvitaiḥ|| <l4.>
itīrite'tha bhagavān praṇavātmā sanātanaḥ|
amūrto mūrtimān bhātvā vacaḥ prāha pitāmaham|| 
praṇavaḥ|
na hyeṣa bhagavān patnyā svātmano vyatiriktayā| <l5.>
kadācidramate rudraṃ tādṛśo'pi maheśvaraḥ||
ayaṃ sa bhagavānīśa sva jyotiḥ sanātanaḥ|
svānandabhūtā kathitā devi nāgassukiśiveti||

vedānāṃ sa praṇavā<l6.>nāmupadeśena tamapyavigaṇayya sthitasya brahmaṇastatkālā visṛ(stṛ)tasaṃhārarudrakāritapañcamaśiro 
lavanānantaram atha savitṛbimbamāvirbhūtasya <l7.> sākṣātparamaśivasya upadeśena ca tasya parabhāvaspa(sspa)ṣṭīkṛtaḥ| kaurme 
ca| kārtsnyena ukte tadarthe pavarṇanena bahudhā śivotkarṣavyavasthā<l8.>panānantaraṃ vyāsagītānte|
 
ityeṣa mānavo'dhamo yuṣmākaṃ tathito mayā| 
maheśārādhanārthāya jñānayogaśca śāśvataḥ||
anena vidhinā yukto jñānayo(*)gaṃ samācaret|(*) <l9.>
sa paśyati mahādevaṃ nānyaḥ kalpaśatairapi||
sthāpayedyaḥ paradharmaṃ jñānaṃ tatpārameśvaram|
te'smādadhiko loke sa yogī (*)paramo mataḥ||(*) <p79b., f70a/74a., l1.>
yaḥ saṃsthāpayituṃ śakto na kuryānmohito janaḥ|
sa yogayukto'pi puna(....)tyarthe bhagavatparaḥ|| iti

śivotkarṣavyavasthāpayatvavidhānena ca <l2.> spaṣṭīkṛto yathā| ādityapurāṇe ca| varṇāśramadharmavivecane (-)
viśveśvaramukākāntaṃ viśvāntaryāmiṇaṃ śivam|
na brahmādyaiḥ samaṃ brūyāt śaktibhiścāpa (*)pārvatim|(*) <l3.>
brūyādyadi samaṃ śambhuṃ brahmaviṣṇvādibhiḥ suraiḥ||
yaḥ kaścittamasāviṣṭaḥ kadācinnaiva taṃ spṛśet|
sarvasmādadhikaṃ brūyāt bhagavantamumāpatim||

ityādinā <l4.> śivasyetarasāmyoktiniṣedhe te dāyitvapratipādanavidhānena cāveditaḥ tadutkarṣaskānde ca| yo māṃ 
brahmādibhistulyaṃ yekāṃ lakṣmyādiśakti<l5.>bhiḥ| guruṃ ye prākṛtaiḥ tulyaṃ saṃsmaraṇyalpabuddhayaḥ| teṣāṃ pāpāni naśyanti 
śivarātripūjāgarāt| itītaradevatāsāmyasmaraṇena prāyaścitto<l6.>padeśena tadudbhāvitaḥ evaṃ sarveṣvapi purāṇeṣu māyopahitasya 
parabrahmaṇasturīyasya paramaśivasya utkarṣaḥ pratipāditaḥ vidvadbhirālocanīyaḥ <l7.> tatvavidapi niṣkarṣo(-)ktiśaṅkābhāvāt| 
kvacit kvacidadruhiṇānnārāyaṇādvā nikarṣavibhāvanasya saṃhārarudratadavatāraviśeṣanīlalohitādivibhūti<l8.>viṣayatvāt| 
vārāhabhāgavatavaiṣṇavagāruḍādiṣvaṃśebhya eva khalu kevalamantakāreḥ| viṣṇorvidhāturapi samyayikatvavādāḥ sākṣānna kṛtva ca na 
sāṃśca śivā<l9.>turīyāt| anupadaṃ caitat prapañcathiṣyāmaḥ||39||(???)

prabhāvaṃ te bhīmaprakaṭataramāvedayatī namaprabhūṇāmādyānāṃ prathamabhagavanbhāratyapi| mukundaṃ yamṛtvaccaraṇa<p80a., f70b/74b., 
l1.>nalinārādhanaparaṃ bhavantaśca brahmācyutaharaparaṃ nātha śruṇumaḥ| mahābhārate bahuṣu sthaleṣu nārāyaṇasya śivārādhanaparatvaṃ 
pratipāditam| <l2.> udāhṛtaṃ ca namaślokavivaraṇe| tacca sarvaṃ tena paraṃ brahmamūrtyantararūpeṇa śivasya svārādhyatvena 
svasyāpi mūlabhūtatvakhyāpanayā sarvārādhyatvakhyāpanayā ca <l3.> lokānugrahārthamādimū(....)daiva(-)mānuṣāvatāraviśeṣaiśca nityatva 
adhyā tattat phaloddeśena ca śivārānamanuṣṭhīyata ityetat paraśivasya viśvādhi<l4.>katvaviśvārādhya apratipādane 
paryavasyatīti vaktavyaṃ maharṣerbahuśastannibandhaprayāsasya prayojanāntaradarśanāt laiṅgye sarve viṣṇumayā devāḥ sarve <l5.> 
viṣṇumayā gaṇāḥ| na hi viṣṇusamākā kācit gatiranyā vidhīyate| ityevaṃ satataṃ vedā gāyante nātra saṃśayaḥ| sa eva 
bhagavān devastava liṅgārcane rataḥ| <l6.> tava pūrṇāmaikarataḥ kathaṃ devo hyabhūt prabho iti pṛṣṭavantaṃ pitāmahaṃ prati (-)
 
bhavān nārāyaṇaścaiva śakraḥ sākṣātsureśvaraḥ| 
munayaśca sadā (*)liṅgaṃ saṃpūjya vidhipūrvakam||(*) <l7.>
svaṃ śivapadamanuprāptāḥ tasmāt saṃpūjayanti te|

iti śivavacanasya brahmaṇā viṣṇunā vāpi rudreṇānyena kena vā| liṅgā<l8.>rādhanamutsṛjya kriyate 
svapadasthitirityādiśivapurāṇā(...)ca nānāṃ ca nārāyaṇasya paraṃ brahmamūrtyantaratayā karmasaṃpādanīyaiśvaryatvena 
tadīyaśivārādhana<l9.>sya svapadasthityarthatvāyogāt| arthavādam|| kṛtvā (....)vatāraistvadārādhanena tava khyātiṃ 
saṃpādayiṣyāmīti viṣṇunā rudrāya varo datta iti vārāhe prati<p80b., f71a/75a., l1.>pādanāt| 
(...)dattaparaparipālanāya tarhi kṛṣṇādyavatārarūpaiḥ paraṃ tadārādhanamiti pareṣāṃ tadanyathāsiddhivacanasya ca| tato'nvapaśyat 
girīśasya <l2.> pārśve vāme svātmānamavyaktamanantarūpam| stuvantama(....)śaṃ bahubhirvacobhiḥ śaṅkhāsi 
cakrārpitahastamādyamiti kṛṣṇatapaścaryāyāṃ śivapratyakṣīkaraṇasamaye <l3.> viṣṇorādimūrtyāpi śivārādhanaparatvapradarśanāt 
vārāhavacanasyāpi vastusadutkarṣakhyāpanārthaṃ viṣṇoḥ śivārādhanamiti etat paratvopa<l4.>patteḥ tatra varadāraka(....)syāpi 
pakṣyamāṇanyāyena pāśupatyavaradānakīrtanavat anyathāsiddhisaṃbhavāccāyuktatvāt tāmasajanavyāmohārthaṃ <l5.> tasya 
śivārādhanamiti mūkhapralāpasya ca sarvapramāṇaviruddhasya nirākaraṇānarhatvāt kṛṣṇasya nityaśivaliṅgārcanaṃ nirīkṣya kaḥ 
samārādhyate <l6.> devo bhavatā karmabhiḥ śubhaiḥ brūhitvaṃ tarmabhiḥ pūjyo yogināṃ dhyeya eva ceti kṛtapraśnamamārkaṇḍeyaṃ prati|
 
bhavatā kathitaṃ sarvaṃ tathyameva (*)na saṃśayaḥ|(*) <l7.>

tathāpi devamīśānaṃ pūjayāmi sanātanamityādinā na vai paśyanti tadevaṃ mahitā mama māyayā| tato'haṃ svātmano kulaṃ jñāpayan 
pūjayāmi| <l8.> tamityantena kaurmapaṭhitakṛṣṇavacanena tadīya śivārādhanasya svasyāpi mūlabhūtatayā śivasya 
viśvādhikatvajñāpanārthatvasya mokṣadharme yadyahaṃ nārcaye<p81a., f71b/75b., l1.>yantamīśvaraṃ varadaṃ śivam|
 
ātmānaṃ nārcayet kaścit iti me bhāvitaṃ manaḥ| 
maryāpramāṇaṃ hi kṛtaṃ lokastadanuvartate|| <l2.> 
yo'sti kaścin me varaḥ pāṇḍavanandana| 
iti sañcintya manasā purāhaṃ viśvamīśvaram||
putrārthamārādhitavānahamātmānamātmananaḥ| iti

tadvivecanena <l3.> tasya śivasya sarvārādhyatvajñāpanārthatvasya ca karṇataḥ pratipādanācca| janmakarmatapo yogamatayostava ca 
puṣkalāḥ| ābhyāṃ liṅge'rcito devaḥ tvayā<l4.>rcāyāṃ yuge yuga iti droṇaparvaṇi aśvatthāmānaṃ prati liṅgārcanādeva 
kṛṣṇārjunayorutkarṣaṃ pratipādayato bādarāyaṇasya vacanena <l5.> kliśyamāneṣu bhūteṣu taistairbhāvaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak| 
durgataṇyatitaredyenaṃ tanme brūhi pitāmaha iha paratra ca durgātitaraṇo<l6.>pāyaṃ pṛṣṭavantaṃ yu(pu)ṣṭhira(.....)rṇāśramadharmādi(-)
krameṇa ya enaṃ saṃśrāyantīha bhaktyā nārāyaṇaṃ harim| te tarantīha durgāṇi na me 
(..)dhivi<l7.>cāraṇetyādinānā(....)pitāmahaśakakratubhajanānāṃ durgātitaraṇopāyatvapratipādanānantaraṃ yaṃ viṣṇurindraḥ śambhuśca 
brahmalokapitāmahaḥ| <l8.>
 
stuvanti vividhaistotrairdevadeva maheśvaram| 
tamarcayanti ye śaśvat durṇāṇyatitarantita|| iti
 
śāntiparvaṇi bhīṣmavacanena yasya brahmā ca viṣṇuśca kva<p81b., f72a/76a., l1.>ñca śatrasabhāmaraiḥ| arcaye 
(..........)chaṣṭha(.........)śuśādharike indraṃ pratyupamanyuvacanena ca śivasya viṣṇvādyārādhyatvena 
nirati<l2.>śayotkarṣasya sphuṭīkaraṇācca tasmānmahābhārate bahuśaḥ śivasya (....) 
tādyanekapradeśapratipāditaparamatamamahimaviśiṣṭanārāyaṇārādhyatvanibandhanena <l3.> tasyāpi mūlatvaṃ tataḥ sarvārādhyatvaṃ ca 
vibhā(...) tamavasīdhate| tathā sa eṣa bhagavānīśaḥ sarvatatvādiravyayaḥ| sarvatatvavidhānaḥ pradhānapuruṣeśvaraḥ| 
(...)sāsra<l4.>jaddakṣiṇādaṅgāt brahmāṇa (.......) saṃbhavam| 

vāmapārśvāttathā viṣṇuṃ lokarakṣārthamīśvaram| 
yugānte caiva saṃprāpte rudraṃ prabhumathā(*)srajat||(*) <l5.>
ityādyanuśāsanikavacanaprapañcena īśānaścetaraḥ kartā puruṣaḥ kāraṇaṃ śivaḥ| 
viṣṇubrahmāśaśīsūryaḥ cīkro devāśca (*)sānvayāḥ|(*) <l6.>
sṛjyate'grasya te caiva tamo bhūtamidaṃ yathā||
aprajātaṃ jagat sarvaṃ tadā hyeko maheśvaraḥ|

ityādiśāntiparvavacanaiśca brahmaviṣṇvādisakala<l7.>prapañcaprapañcamūlabhūtatvaṃ śivasya kaṇṭhato'pi pratipāditaṃ dṛśyate| ato 
gītādiṣu kṛṣṇasya sarvakāraṇatvādivacanānāmapi tanmūrtāvasambhavādārthikatayā kvacinmū<l8.>lamūrtam| paryavasānasāpekṣāṇāṃ 
pradeśāprasiddhasarvādimūlabhūtaśaivamūrtāveva paryavasānamagre prapañca<p82a., f72b/76b., l1.>yiṣyamāṇaṃ sukhena saṃghaṭata iti 
kṛtsnamapi bhāratamavirodhena śivotkarṣa eva viśrāmyati yattu namratve cittakarṣavacanamiva pratīyate tatsarvaṃ <l2.> 
viṣṇuviriñcābhyupabhūtatadavatārabhedaviṣayameva tathā hi yatra yatra bhārate purāṇe vā kvacit kvacit| viṣṇorvidhāturvā rudrādutkarṣaḥ 
pratīyate pāpastatra <l3.> sarvatrāpi sa rudrastamoguṇopādhikyasaṃhārakāritva(-)
harikrodhaprabhavatvaviriñcalalāṭasamabhavatvānyatamaparamaparamaśivavyāvṛttaviśeṣaṇopā<l4.>dānena tadvibhūtiviśeṣarūpo jñāpyate yatra 
na tādṛgviśeṣaṇopādānaṃ yathā mahābhārate brahmāsuragurusthāṇurmanuśca parameṣṭhija<l5.> ityādau ca brahmasthāṇumanurdakṣa ityādau 
ca prajāpatināma parigaṇane yathā ca sundopasundaṃ khyāne tatra viṣmurmahādevastatrāgnirvāyunā <l6.> sahetyā(....) ṛṣayaḥ sarva 
evai te pitāmahamupāsata ityantena viṣṇvādikā sakaladevatānāmṛṣīṇāṃ ca pitāmahamupāsinānāṃ tat <l7.> sa 
bhāvasthitivarṇanānantaraṃ indrasthāṇuśca bhagavān dhairyaṃ tyaktvā pratiṣṭhitāviti eñca(evaṃ ca) caturmukhasthāṇurmahādevo bhavatpureti 
ca tilottamā<l8.>darśanāyā rudrasya mukhacatuṣṭayasṛṣṭikīrtane yathā vā mṛtyusamabhavopākhyāne tato haro jagasthāṇuriti 
prakṛtya tasya brahmāṇaṃ prati bhavatā hi <p82b., f73a/77a., l1.> nāyukto'haṃ prajānāṃ 
pāṇipāla(....)divaca(.......)sthaleṣvapi viṣṇuśabdagrahaṇasya prāthi(yu)katvāte(tte)naiva svaṃ prati viśeṣa(....) <l2.> 
khyāpyate savā(rvā)tma(.....)nantaru (....) ṣṭhita stha(.....)tvāntena tasyāsa(...)deva devasya śūlina| iti kaurme tataḥ 
prabhṛti devo'sau na prasūte śivāḥ <l3.> prajāḥ| udhva(ūrdhva)retā sthitasthāṇu(-)ryāvadā bhūtalaplavamiti (....)| na tatprabhṛti 
viśvātmā na prasūte śivāḥ prajāḥ sthāṇuvanniścalo yasmāt sthitasthāṇuratasmṛta <l4.> ityādityapurāṇe ca brahmāṅgabhuvaṃ 
śivasyāvatārarūpamaṃśaṃ bhuvaṃ prastutya sthāṇuśabdasya tarāmatvapratipādanāt mahābhārate bhīṣmaparvaṇi <l5.> sa bhā(.......) yatra 
bhūtapatiḥ sṛṣṭvā sarvalokān sanātanaḥ| upāsyateti brahmato vrato bhūtaiḥ sahasraśa iti maināke upāsyasya śivasya <l6.> 
sannidhānamuktvā naranārāyaṇau barhmā yamasthāṇuśca pañcamaḥ| upāsate yatra paraṃ sahasrayugaparyaya iti dupāsakaparigaṇanapare 
ananta<l7.>raśloke śivopāsakeṣu parigaṇanena rājadharme bhūyasva bhagavān dhyātvā ciraṃ śūlavarāyudhaḥ kasya tasya nikāyasya 
cakāraikakamīśvaram| <l8.> devānāmīśvaraṃ cakre devaṃ daśaśatekṣaṇaṃ yamaṃ vaivasvataṃ cāpi pitṝṇāmakarot patim| itarapakramya 
rudrāṇāmapi ceśānaṃ goptāraṃ vidadhe prabhuṃ <l9.> mahātmānaṃ mahādevaṃ viśālākṣaṃ sanātanamiti śivaniyameṣu parigaṇanena ca 
sthāṇuśabditasya paramaśivamūrti(-)vyatiriktāvatārarūpamūrtyantaratvasphuṭi(ṭī)<p83a., f73b/77b., l1.>karaṇācca 
rājadharmavacane hi viśālākṣaśabdo sthāṇurevocyate tatraiva pradeśāntare brahmaṇitāntitima prastutya tata(taḥ) stambhagavānniti 
pūrvaṃ ca grāha <l2.> śaṅkaraṃ bahurūpo viśālākṣaḥ śivasthāṇurumāpatiriti tasya tatra prayogāt anantaraṃ sa devaḥ sarvabhūtātmā 
mahādevaḥ sanātanaḥ| 

asaṃkhyātaḥ sahasrā(*)ṇāṃ rudrāṇāṃ sthānamavyayam|(*) <l3.>
yugānāmāyuṣo hrāsaṃ vijñāya bhagavān śivaḥ||
sañcikṣe patataḥ śāstriṃ mahārthamabrahmaṇākṛtam|
vaiśālākṣamiti proktaṃ (*)tadindra pratipādyate||(*) <l4.> iti

tatpraṇīte nītiśāstre vaiśālākṣasamākhyakīrtanācca yatra tādṛśasyāṃśaviśeṣanāmno'pi agrahaṇaṃ tatrāvidhāturvi<l5.>ṣṇorvā 
paramaśivādutkarṣasyāsaṃbhavāt parerapi trimūrtyuttīrṇasya tasyābhyupagame ca rudranikaṣavibhāvanānāṃ saṃhārarudra(-)
tadavatā<l6.>rādiviṣayatvasyāvaśyavaktavyatvāt vaiṣṇaveṣu purāṇeṣu yopakarṣastu dṛśyate| rudrasyāsau harasyāsya vibhūtereva 
kevalamityādipa<l7.>rāśarapurāṇādivacanadarśanācca tathāvasīyate na ca śivasya viṣṇorviriñcādvā udbhavādivacanādapi 
nikarṣasūcanā śaṅkanīyam|
 
ahaṃ candravato <l8.> vakrāt kalpānte ghorarūpadhṛt| 
śūlapāṇiṃ bhaviṣyāmi krodhajastava putrakam||
anādinidhane devadacaitanyādisamanvitaḥ|
jñānāni ca vaśe yasya tārakā(*)dīnyaśeṣataḥ||(*) <p83b., f74a/78a., l1.>

aṇimādiguṇopeta(....)ryaṃ ca na kṛtrima kuśrṛṣṭyarthaṃ brahmaṇaḥ putro lalāṭādutthitaḥ prabhurityādi kaurmarājadharmādivacanaistasya 
lokānu<l2.>grahārthamaicchikāvatāratvokte tasmāt sarvathāpi virodhe mehābhārataṃ śivotkarṣa eva viśrāntamiti bhāvaḥ| 
sarvotkṛṣṭāya paramaśivāya namaḥ||37|| <l3.>

prabandho vālmīkera(.....)vaparatvaṃ dṛḍhayati sphuṭaṃ yatra brahmācyutaharaparatvaṃ tava vibho| yiyakṣorbhāvoktyā bhavatīyamedhe 
raghupatestadārabhya tvaṃ te <l4.> dṛḍhamapi ca yatra prakaṭitam| rāmāyaṇe| yuddhakāṇḍe tāvadādityahṛdaye brahmeśānācyuteśāya 
sūryāyādityavarcase bhāsvate sarvabhakṣā<l5.>ya raudrāya vapuṣe namaḥ| iti brahmācyutahareśvaratvaṃ śivasya pradarśitam| 
maṇḍalābhimāninyā kārike tadanvayāyogāt raudrāya vapuṣa iti <l6.> viśeṣaṇasāmarthyācca tasya tadantarvartini śive 
pakīryavasānāt eṣa brahmā ca viṣṇuśca śivaskandaprajāpatirityādi<l7.>nā kṛtsnyāpi stotrasya tatparatvāvagamācca api 
cottararāmāyaṇe aśvamaidhārambhāt prākkartavyakratuviśeṣavicārasamaye aśvamedhena <l8.> viṣṇumārādhya śatakraturbrahmahatyantarati 
aśvamedhe lakṣmaṇena ślāghite tasya ślāghyatāmaṅgīkṛtya svayamilopākhyānakathanena tasya śivaprītikaratvaṃ pratipādayato 
<p84a., 74b/78b., l1.> rāmacandrasya nānyaṃ paśyāmi bhaiṣajyaṃ antareṇa vṛṣadhvajam| nāśvamedhāt paro yajñaḥ 
priyaścaiva mahātmana iti tadupākhyānāntargatatadīyavacasā tena śiva <l2.> evārādhanīya iti bhāvasūcanena rahasi 
samamantrāṇānantaraṃ vasiṣṭhādīnāhūya cikīrṣite khyāpite te tu rāmasya tacchrutvā namaskṛtvā vṛṣadhvajam| aśvamedhaṃ <l3.> 
dvijāḥ sarve pūjayanti sma nityaṃ śivasambandhitvenaiva aśvamedhya ślāghyo'pi nyāsena cāśvamedhena rāmacandraḥ śivamārirādheti 
rāmo'pi <l4.> pālayāmāsa rājyaṃ paramadhārmika iti ārasya paṭhitena viśeṣāt brāhmaṇān sarvān pūjayāmāsa ceśvaram| 
yajñena yajña(-)hantāramaśvame<l5.>dhena śaṅkaramiti| kaurmavacanena abhivṛktastato rājye rāmo rājīvalocanaḥ| pālayan pṛthivīṃ 
sarvāmadharmeṇa munipuṅgavāḥ| <l6.> ayajaddevadeveśamaśvamedhena śaṅkaramityā(-)dityapārāṇena ca kaṇṭhoktaṃ śivasya tadārādhyatvaṃ 
vibhāvitaṃ tathā hyāraṇyakāṇḍe kṛtā<l7.>bhiṣekaḥ sa rarāja rājaḥ sitā dvitīyaḥ saha lakṣṇena| 
kṛtābhiṣekastvagarāja(...)tryā rudra(....)viṣṇubhagavāniveśa ityupamānibandhava(.....)nā(-)<l8.>pyādikavi(....)śivotkarṣa(rṣaḥ) 
sphuṭīkṛtaḥ| vāsiṣṭharāmāyaṇe ca devaḥ puṇḍarīkākṣo na ca devastrilocana ityādinā(.......)syaiva pājaye(....)pa<p84b., 
f75a/ 79a., l1.> (....) prakaṭīkṛtam| kathaṃ (...........) pūjanīyatvenopatiṣṭa i(...) pūjayeccetanaṃ 
śiva(....)jyā ye (.....)raṃ śiva(....) <l2.> paraśivamiti vyavahārāt manonmani(.........)cākṣarakalpaprasiddha(....) 
śivapīṭhastha (.........)sāt unmanā(...)stapadā(...) unmanāntasya sakalaloka(....) <l3.>talokāvasthānapratipādanācca 
(.......) bālakāṇḍe śivanārāyaṇayoḥ sama(........)helayikaṃ me nirerviṣṇa(..........)tāṃ nārāyaṇa(..........) 
<l4.> dhikyapratipattiva (....) tadbhāratādiṣu śivena tasmai svādhikaṃ śauryaṃ dattamiti pratipādanāt svadattavaraparipālanārthaṃ 
śivasya (........) <l5.> latvābhimānai nānyathāsiddhaṃ na viṣṇorutkarṣaṃ gamayitumī(mi)ṣṭa iti na virodhaḥ||38||

prasiddhāsmattāraḥ śubhadamanayorīśvara<l6.>mukhāḥ patañjalādyāśca prathitamatayo darśanakṛtaḥ| prabhindānāṃ mārgānapi ca 
vividhānanyaviṣaye bhavantaṃ viśvasmāt adhikamupagacchanti <l7.> bhagavan| manustāvaddharmaśāstropasaṃhāre| praśāsitāraṃ 
sarveṣāmaṇīyāṃ samaṇorapi| rukmābhaṃ svapnayigamyaṃ vidyākṣapuruṣaṃ <l8.> parimiti sarvāntaryāmitvādiguṇakaṃ 
paramātmānamupadiśya enameke vadantyagniṃ maruto'nye prajāpatiṃ indrameke pare prāṇamapare brahmaśāśvatamiti tatra <p85a., 
f75b/79b., l1.> vaidikavyavahāraṃ ca bahuvidhaṃ pradarśya eṣa sarvāṇi bhūtāni pañcabhirvyāpya mūrtibhiḥ janmavṛddhikṣayairnityaṃ 
saṃsārayati cakravaditi muktipañcakena <l2.> sarvavyāptiliṅgapradarśanena śiva eva paramātmeti svamataṃ spaṣṭī cakāra| 
pratipāditā hi taittarīyopaniṣadā savitṛmaṇḍalāntarvṛttinaṃ śivaṃ prastutyā<l3.>sya mūrtipañcakena savyabhūtavyāptiḥ sa vā eṣa 
puruṣaḥ pañcātmā yena sarvamidaṃ protamityādinā yadapi pañcātmetyaviśeṣeṇa śrutaṃ tathāpi tatra <l4.> prāk sadyojātādi(-)
mūrtipañcakasya pratipādanāttadeveha vyāptyupadeśāyopanyastamatigamyate ata eva liṅga(-)purāṇādiṣu mūrtayaḥ <l5.> pañca 
vikhyātāḥ pañcabrahmāhvayāḥ parāḥ| sarvalokaśaraṇyasya śivasya paramātmanaḥ| iti tasya sadyojātādi(-)mūrtipañcakaṃ vidhāya 
<l6.> pañcabrahmātmakaṃ sarvajña tat svāvarajaṃ gamyamiti samānyata īśānādikrameṇa teṣāṃ 
kṣetrajñapradhānamahadahaṅkāramanaśrotratvakcakṣujihvāghrāṇa<l7.>vākpāṇipādapāyūpasthavi(..........)pañcabhūtatanmātrātatkār(-)
yābhūtapañcakasvāṣṭhāmratvapratipādanena viśeṣataśca tasya sarva(.......)vyāpinaḥ <l8.> pratipāditaṃ yatva(....) pareṣā 
(.......)dharmaśāstropakrame tataḥ saṃbhūrbhu(.......)kṛtya tena nārāyaṇasya(...)stutyantena nārāyaṇasya sarva(....) <p85b., 
f76a/80a., l1.> (....)tāramityādyapi yojana (.........)praśāsitāraṃ sarveṣāmiti nārāyaṇasya sarvāntaryāmitvaṃ 
enameka iti (...........) <l2.>na tasya sarvāntaryāmitvala(.......)mabhidhānabhāvairatyādi(-)śabdairekaikeṣu vedabhāgeṣu 
parasparāvirodhena pratipādyatvam eṣa sarvāṇīti <l3.> ślokana svādhiṣṭhitai(...)yadādibhiḥ sarvaprā(....)vyāpitvaṃ ca 
pratipādyata iti tatropakrama(......)dhaśaṅkā tāvat tasya śivasyaiva śivotkarṣavibhāvane(...)t <l4.> paryavyavasthāpanena 
(....)hopaniṣadupakramārthanirna(rṇa)ye nipuṇatamunmūlayiṣyate (......)yasya sarvāntaryāmitvaṃ 
tallabdhasvābhidhanabhāvairaśmyādiśabdai<l5.>rekaikeṣu dehabhāgeṣu vyavahāraḥ svamūrtibhūtairviyadādibhiḥ sarvabhūtavyāpitvaṃ ca sa 
paramātmatvena nirdhārita iti pareṣāmapi saṃprati<l6.>panno'rthaḥ evaṃ sati śiva eva tathā nirdhārita iti tai(taiḥ) śakyaṃ 
nirnetuṃ sa eva sarvāntaryāmītyadhastādvyasthāpanāt agniṃ purātanayimanuraci<l7.>ttāt rudro vā eṣaḥ yadagniḥ tasyaite tanuvau 
ghorānyā śivānyetyādivedabhāgeṣu tasyāgniśabdena vyavahāradarśanāt| kimebhiramarairanyaiḥ pūji<l8.>tairadhvare phalam| rājā 
cedadhvarasyāsya na rudraḥ pūjyate tvayā| dve tanū tasya devasya vedajñāḥ brāhmaṇā viduḥ| ghorā cānyā śivā cānyā te caiva 
<p86a., f76b/80b., l1.>śatathā(dhā) punarityādibhirvāyusaṃhitāmahābhāratādyupabrahmaṇaiḥ| āvo rājānamadhvarasya rudraṃ 
hotāraṃ satyayajaṃ rocyoḥ rudro vā eṣaḥ yadagni<l2.>rityādiśrutīnāṃ śivaparatvanirna(rṇa)yāt| vedastvāmabhatadhatīṃ ha rudramagniṃ 
tvāmekaṃ śaraṇamupaimi rudramīśamiti kaurme vadatyagniṃ mahādevaṃ tathā deva <l3.> maheśvaram| ekākṣaratryambakaṃ ca viśvarūpaṃ śivaṃ 
tathetyānuśāsanike ca <l4.> śivasya vedābhāgeṣvagniśabdena vyavahāra(-)pratipādanāt| abhitvā śūrano nama iti mantre| 
atharvaśirasi īśānanāmanirvaca<l5.>nānantaraṃ paṭhite śivasyendraśabdena vyavahārāt prajāpatiścarati garbhe antariti 
prajāpatiśabdena yo brahmā brahmaṇa ujjabhā(hā)ra brahmā <l6.> śivo me astīti ca tātparyeṇa ca vyavahārāt ārudrā sa 
iti mārutasūkte marut sukatamo rudra ityādibṛhadāraṇyakaśrutau ye rudrāste <l7.> khalā praṇā ye prāṇāste tadātmakā iti 
vāyusaṃhitāyāśca prāṇeṣu ca rudrapadaprayogasya rudrādhiṣṭhita(-)tatvābhiprāyatvena rudrasya tadantaryābhāve<l8.>na tannāmavyavasāyāt 
