vāyukoṇe brahmāviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ layasāmyepyuttarottaramadhikakālāvasthāyitvamuktaṃ brahmā viṣṇvādine caiko viṣṇurudradine tatheti 
yaṃ tavacanaṃ <l6> śā(.......)ṇi nityaṃ (.........)ti bhūtaṃ sthāvarajaṅgama(........)tametaṃ puruṣaṃ vāsudevaṃ sanātanamiti 
tadviṣṇo svarūpanityatvamātraparaṃ vigrahasya māyikatvena <l7> nityatvāyogāt tada(..........)nityatvapratipādanaṃ ca 
bhaktaśabdasya vastumātra(-)paratvavanenātmaikyāt jaḍavargamithyātvācca yuktam ata eteśvaraṃ tāsu api <l8> vijñāya viducyata 
ityantena guṇapratipādanāt anantaraṃ pravacanaṃ nityahitāstijagati bhūtaṃ sthāvarajaṅgamam| ṛte māmekamavyaktavyomara iti 
mahe<p92b., f83a/87a., l1>śvara(......) pareṣāmeva nitya(.......) vibhūtyādyabhyupagamādaṣṭarūpapādaṃ saguṇabrahmavāde 
tu ajāta ityevetyādimantropaniṣat mantrasvārasya <l2> virodhāt upacaritamidaṃ sūtravacanaṃ (......)miti| na 
kiñcidvirodhaḥ evaṃ deśakālaparicchinnāsu brahmaviṣṇurudramūrtiṣu atiśayaiśvaryābhivyaktibhāvāttu<l3>rīyakoṭāpañcikā(....)tte 
svadbhāve'pi śaktirūpeṇa śivopasarjatvācca śivamūrtāveva pāriṣeṣyāṃ niratiyeśvaryābhivyaktiḥ ata eva niścityo<l4>padiṣṭaṃ 
vāyusaṃhidatāyāṃ brahmāṣṭa(da)yo'pi lokānāṃ sargasthityantahetavaḥ| nigrahānugrahaṃ prāptāḥ śivasya va śaktīnāṃ śivaḥ punaḥ na 
kasyāpi nigrahānugrahā<l5>spadam ato'natiśa(..........)ryantasyeveti suniścita(-)miti||44||

kiṃ ca viruddhārthāni vākyāni vīkṣya bhranna cetasāṃ yukto bahūnāṃ <l6> saṃvādādekasmādeva nirna(rṇa)yaḥ| anyathā vedamārge 
vinadhyet brahmakāraṇam| abrahmakāraṇatve viśrutileśasya darśanāt| ataḥ pramāṇabāhulyāt ādhikyādgi<l7>rijāpateḥ| 
yukternirdhārayitum ityayamarthaḥ pradarśyate| alaṃ mānenānyairakhilagatīnāmadhipate tavādhikyaṃ śakyamavaditumiyavataiva sphuṭamiti kva 
drṛk<l8>karṣaṃ bhūyāt prathayati yadāmrāya nicayastadarthaṃ vyakurvan nyandapi ca purāṇādīni karaḥ| devā na bhāgeṣu tāvat 
atharvaśikhādayaḥ śivotkarṣaparābhūyasya śrutayaḥ tathā karmakā<p93a., f83b/87b., l1>ṇḍe'pi mantrārthavādaḥ yathā caivaṃ 
tathātraiva pūrvāparaślokavyākhyāneṣu sphuṭam| āhuścābhiyuktāḥ mantrā bhavanti varalā vibudhāntarāṇāṃ sadbhāva <l2> eva tava 
darśitaśaktayaste| tvaṃ na sma(sva)rūpaguṇavarṇanalabdhavarṇā mantrā śakyamavagantumiyattayāta(tha) iti tathā śivotkarṣaparāṇi 
śivapurāṇādīni granthasaṃkhyayā viṣṇu<l3>purāṇādibhyo bhūyāṃsīti tāvat sphuṭam| purāṇasaṃkhyābāhulyāpi prabhāsakhaṇḍe darśitam| 
catu(...) bhagavānviṣṇu(ṇuḥ) dvābhyāṃ brahmā tathā raviḥ| aṣṭādaśapurā<l4>ṇeṣu śeṣeṣu bhagavān śiva iti tathā 
upapurāṇaśivāgamādibāhulyaṃ visphuṭameva viduṣāṃ tadarthaṃ vyākurvannityanena vedārthāya <l5> svayaṃ jñāta ityādivyāsokteḥ 
śivotkarṣaparaśrutināmnā śaṅkanīyārthā tatvatvenānanyathāsiddhatvarūpam śivotkarṣaparaṃ purāṇādīnāṃ <l6> sāṅkhyādismṛtibhyo 
manvādismṛtīnāṃ (....)pratyakṣaśrutyanusāralakṣaṇaṃ ca prābalyaṃ sūcitam||45||

evaṃ śivotkarṣaparaśrutipurāṇādī<l7> (....)hitraprābalyadhvananapūrvakaṃ śivasya (...)ne parabhāvanirdhāraṇamupapāditam atha 
paroktatteṣāṃ dorbalyaṃ parāyaṇotkarṣaparaśrutipurā<l8>ṇādīnāṃ prābalyaṃ ca (....)śakrayate śruti(........)ratāvatītthaṃ 
balābalavaiparītyaṃ kalpayanti yadyapi nārāyaṇasyeva devatāntarāṇāmapi taistaiśruti<p93b., f84a/88a., l1>(...) 
pratyā(....)ṇitā nārāyaṇasya parabhāvastamanyārthai(rthaiḥ) śrutivākyaiḥ pratipādita iti tadanusāreṇaiva (...)tārtha<l8>dhāraṇāyuktam 
agnimīḍe pra(....) hitāya (...)sya devamṛtvijam| staumyagniṃ nātha tejo havīmi abhi tvāśrīranonuma ityādīnāṃ 
svavākyenaiva arhan <l3> bibharṣi sāyakāni yat yo vai rudra(.....)tyādinānte devā ūrdhvabāhavastvanmahi arhan babharṣi 
sāyakānidhanvetyāha| stautye(mye) vai <l4> na me tat| ityādivākyanvantareṇa ca śrutiparatvo mentaḥ 
rudrādhyāyādinānnamaskāraliṅgayogena iṣṭāniṣṭaprāptinivṛttiprārthanāliṅgena <l5> ca stutiparatvāvasāyāt śivasya 
jagatkāraṇatvapratyāyakānāmapi kāraṇaṃ tu dhyeya ityādi ṛgatsargapralayakāraṇamadhyapāditvābhāvāt <l6> upāsanā vā 
viśeṣatvenānyaparatvāvasayāt nārāyaṇaparabhāvapratipādanaparāṇāṃ puruṣasūktādīnāṃ nānyaparatvāvadhāraṇācca puruṣasūktaṃ <l7> hi 
tāvat puruṣasya nārāyaṇasya sarvakāraṇatvasarveśvaratvādipratipādakamanyaparaṃ liṅgena vākyena vākena cittasya stutiparatvāpratīteḥ 
anuvādatyo(dyo)taka<l8> ha vai śabdādyabhāvena anuvādarūpatvasyāpyapratipādite pratatyuta(-)tadetadṛcābhyanuktaṃ tāvānasya 
mahimeti chāndogyopaniṣadasvopaniṣṭārthasākṣitvena <p94a., f84b/88b., l1> tat sūktamantrapāṭhāt asya 
nārāyaṇamahimānaṃ pratipādakatvasyaiva nirdhāraṇācca evaṃ sarve vedā yatpadamāmanantīti mantreṇa sarvaveda vedasya kathanaṃ 
pratijñā<l2>nasādhyakaṃ paramāpnoti tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padamiti pratipādayat kāṭhaka(.....)dāpnoti paramiti brahmavedanāt 
muktiṃ prajñāya satyaṃ jñānamanantaṃ brahmeti <l3> mumukṣubhirvedyaṃ brahmānandaśabdavācyanārāyaṇa(-)rūpamiti 
darśayatte(ttai)ttiryopaniṣadvacanaṃ subālopaniṣadādiṣu jagatsṛṣṭipralayakāraṇamadhyapāti nārāyaṇa<l4>sya 
jagatkāraṇatvādipratipādanaṃ cānanyapi mavadharyata iti tannirākaroti| ananyārthai(rthaiḥ) śabdaiḥ śrutiṣu parabhāvaḥ prakaṭitaḥ| śriyo 
devyāḥ <l5> patyuṃ na tu taditareṣā(....)ṣadāḥ| atastairevārtha vā dhṛtiriti mantropaniṣadādyadhyo yo mūḍhāṃ mukharaya iti 
mṛtyuñjayamudhā| advaita<l6>paradevasaguṇa(-)nirguṇaśrutyopāsanā(....) tathā śrutidvāratayā niṣprapañcabrahma(-)pratipatyupāyatayā vā 
sarvathānyaśeṣameva sarveśvaratva eva <l7> kāraṇatvādiśravaṇamiti nādvaitavādānāṃ pratyekakāryaviṣaye 
ananyaparakatipayaśrutivacanasiddhamatkaraṇe'nubalāśvalavibhāgaḥ saṃbhavatīti tāvat <l8> sāṅgaṃ saguṇaṃ brahma(-)
padamalaṅkurivatīṣṭhamāne (.....)ya niṣadādyudāharaṇe pratibodhani vā| tathā hi mantropaniṣattāvat kiṃ kāraṇaṃ brahmetyāravidyā 
<p94b., f85a/89a., l1>(....)saprakaraṇasa(...)ka(......)pateḥ paramaśivasyaiva tatvanirna(rṇa)yāya pravṛttiti sphuṭaṃ 
<l2> (.......)yattu yajñā(.......)mirāpaṇaṃ tattatraiva paramakāraṇatvādinā vyavasthāpitasya paramaśivasya sākṣātkāre <l3> 
muktyupāye (...)pradhanopa(.........)ra tatpareṇa pravṛttamiti te tatraivopaniṣadaṃ kārtsnyena paryavasanaṃ śaṅkī(ṅki)tuṃ śakyate 
tadā hyantrāpi <l4> brahmana(........)prādhānyena pravṛtta(...)pi (....)karaṇeṣu madhye nididhyāsanādividhyupalambhāt 
teṣāmapi brahmaṇi tātparyāvasānaṃ sarvānumataṃ na <l5> si(......)t ca yāte rudra(.........)mantreṇa ṣṭa(?) prārthanādi 
tadapyupakramādiparāmṛśāvagataparabrahmanirūpaṇaprādhānyasya kṛtsnasya <l6> (.........)sya stutiparatvaṃ na gamayet 
āpādakābhāvāt tathātve sannidhyanuguṇaśabdārthapratyabhijñāpāditamahāpuruṣaviṣa(-)yaikaprakaraṇā<l7>bhāva(...) 
rānuvākamantraviśeṣaśrutanamaskāreṣṭaprārthanāliṅgābhyāṃ puruṣasūktasyāpi kārsnyena stutiparatvaṃ patyā 
puruṣasūktamananyā<l8>parābhimānasyā(....)bhaṅgāpatteḥ evamatharvaśiro'pi devānāṃ paramaśivasvarūpapraśne taduttaratvena tat 
svarūpopadeśarūpatayā pravṛttatvāt <l9> vastu yāthātmyakathanaparamavasīyate yattu yo vai rudra ityādidevānāṃ śivopadeśena tat 
sārvātmyabodhānantaraṃ stotraṃ na tena tat pūrvaṃ yāthā<p95a., f85b/89b., l1>tmo(-)padeśabhāgasyāpi 
stutiparatvamupapadyayituṃ śakyamaticetasyāpi stutimā(.....)ratvaṃ upadeśāvagatasārvātmyāvalambanena pravṛttatayā 
tatprapañcanarūpa<l2>tvāt evaṃ śatarudriyarudrasūktādiṣvapi laiṅgikaṃ vācakaṃ vā yasya mantrasya stuti(-)paratvamavasīyate tatraiva 
tadavyavatiṣṭhatena tāvatā ekasūktāntargatimātreṇa <l3> mantrāntarāṇāmapi stutiparatvāpattiḥ| yattu śivamantrāṇāṃ prāyikaṃ 
namaskārarūpaṃ stutiliṅgamukta(ta?) tatstutimātre liṅgaṃ kiṃ tu staviṣayokaṣanānta<l4>ri(.....) yathā caitattathā 
sthāpitamadhastāttathā cānitarasādhāraṇena namaskārabhūyastvena liṅgena sarvotkarṣaḥ śivasya śidhyantana(nama)skāra 
<l5>(........)śabdārthābhūtasarvādhipatyādirūpa(paḥ) san sidhyati liṅgavaśādavaśyakalpanīye sarvotkarṣe śabdārthībhūtamutkarṣaṃ 
parityajya vidhānta<l6>reṇa utkarṣakalpānāyogāt dine(...) hiraṇyaścābhave senānya ityādimantrajātapratipannasya 
sarvāsvādhipatyāderna stutiliṅgasadbhāve'pi <l7> paratyāgo yujyate (..........)rva(-)śikhāya devatāntarāṇāṃ śivasya ca 
kāryakāramabhāvena tāratamyapradarśanam upāsanāvidhiḥ śeṣa ityuktaṃ <l8> tadapyuktaṃ 
saucālaśrutimantre(...............)ra(........)sya jyavikaraṇatvapratipādakeṣvapi upāsanāvidhe pareṣāmapi sanmatatvena 
taulyāt atharvaśikhā<p95b., f86a/90a., l1> (...........) iti śivasya (.........) darśanāntasyātra 
sakalakāraṇatvopavarṇaṃ na syāt varṇastasya śritārthavadatvāvasāyācca na hi <l2> stutya(..........)ta rūpeṇaiva 
vidvā(...........)te yattu puruṣasya kṛtādikamananyaparamatimuktaṃ tatra puruṣasūktasya tāvat śivaparatayā 
vyavasthāpitatvā<l3>ttadanu ṛ(....)mevānanya(-)paratvaṃ (..........).tayā kṛtānda(.........)pasthāya brahmā 
sahasraśīrṣāpuruṣādadhiṣṭhite bṛhaṇīvṛtyabhyupagame'pi tasyātharvaśikhāyāṃ <l4> vyāpārādvyāpi mahādeva ityante 
mahādevanāmāvalinirvacanaprakareṇena sarve devāḥ saṃviṃśaliṅgapurāṇe| bhagavān bhagasadbhāvāt nirmalatvā<l5>(........) 
svāmisvamasya yat sarvaṃ viṣṇupraveśanāditi vāyusaṃhitāyāṃ śivatatvādibhūmyantaṃ śarīrādighaṭādi ca vyāpyādhiṣṭhiti śivastu 
smādviṣṇu<l6>rudrā(....) iti śivanāmatvenāpi nirvacanadarśanāt nārāyaṇaikātmyā siddheḥ tadaikātmye'pi prākdarśitanyāyaiḥ 
mantropaniṣadi jagatkāraṇa<l7>brahmaparaṃ taraśabdastasyānanyathāsidhyabhāvena tadanurodhi mṛ(smṛ)tyantarasahiṣṇutvācca na tatra 
pareṣāṃ pratyāśaśāvakā etena satyaṃ jñānamanantamiti śrutyu<l8>dāharaṇamapi nirastaṃ brahmavidā boti(dhi)paramityukterkaṃ tat 
brahmeti jijñāsāyāṃ tat svarūpalakṣaṇapare'smin vākye satyādiśabdavacanaṃ tasyāpi prathamāntatayā <p96a., f86b/90b., 
l1>napuṃsakaliṅgatvena viṣṇuvācitvāsaṃbhavācca ananto nāgarāsviṣṇuranantaṃ kha nirateyoriti pulliṅgasyaiva 
tadvācitvānuśāsanāt na ca po(?) vedanihi<l2>tam| guhāyāmiti anantaravākyoktavedanasya karmasākāṅkṣatvādvitīyānta eva 
satyādiśabdā iti vācyam| tatraiva guhāyāṃ nihitamityasya sannihitatvāt brahmavacana<l3>sya karmasamarpaṇaparasya satvena 
tadanurodhāt satyādivākyasya bubhutstilakṣaṇapradarśanaparatvabhaṅgāyogāditi dik| tasmāt paroktarītyā śrutīnāṃ 
balābala<l4>vibhāgayogāt asmadupapāditainyā(rnyā)yaiḥ śivaparaśrutīnāmeva prābalyamiti sthitam||46||

nirastaśrutīnāṃ para(rā)bhimatabalābalavibhāgaḥ atha <l5> purāṇānāṃ sātvikādivibhāgakalpanāvapuramūrtya[ssara]nirākriyate| evaṃ 
tāvat pare kalpayanti kalpeṣu keṣucit brahmā satvodiktaḥ prabudhyate <l6> (........)keṣucit grastastamo'grastaśca 
keṣucit te ca kalpāsto hetestadekaikanitātmakajaḥ| sātvikādisamākhyābhirākhyāyante maharṣi<l7>bhiḥ| tatra mantreṇa kalpeṣu 
satvādiṣu padya(....)eva brāhmaśaivāni purāṇānyapi nirmate| tata eva purāṇānāṃ sātvikadivyava(vyavyava)sthitiḥ| 
balābala<l8>(..........)teṣāṃ vaktraguṇocita(........)śca mātrasya purāṇavacanaṃ mūlaṃ saṃgirante tatra hi saṃkīrṇam| 
sātvikādiścaivetyādinā kalpānā<p96b., f87a/91a., l1>(...) ka rājasatā(....)de cāturvidhyaṃ pradṛśya yasmin kalpe 
tu yat proktaṃ purāṇaṃ brāhmaṇā purā| tasya tu māhātmyaṃ tatsvarūpeṇa <l2> (.....)tīti tatpurāṇānāṃ tattat brahmaṇā 
nirmitaṃ coktvā (....)taḥ| atrāgniḥ śivasya māhātmya(tmyaṃ) ma(mā)tāmahyeṣu prakīrtyate| rājaseṣu māhā(.....) <l3>kaṃ 
brahmaṇo vidusaṃ(ṣaṃ) karṇe svatyā pūrṇaṃ ca nigadyate| sātvikeṣvadhikalpeṣu mātmyadhi(māhātmyamadhi)kaṃ hareḥ| 
teṣvavayogasaṃsiddhāḥ gamiṣyanti parāṃ <l4> gatimiti atra kalpānāṃ rājasādivibho(bhā)gastattat kalpeṣu 
brahmaṇastadguṇaprācuryādeva tathā vibhāgasya tattatkalpeṣu tena praṇītānāṃ purā<l5>ṇānāṃ 
parasparaviruddhatattaddevatotkarṣāpakarṣaprakhyāpanavarāṇāṃ (...)tstyena prāṇāṇyāyoge sati teṣu heyopādeya<l6>viśeṣaparijñānāya ca 
vakraguṇānuguṇabalābalasūcanārthatvena saprayojanatvāt prakārāntareṇa rājasādivibhāgasya niṣprayojanatvāt| <l7> ataḥ teṣāṃ 
pramāṇāpramāṇavyavasthānukūlavaktraguṇadoṣotpādanaparyavasāyitvāvasāyācca tathā ca kalpānāṃ rājasādivibhāgena pūraṇa<l8>nāṃ 
tatkalpeṣu brahmaproktatvopavaṇatane ca sāmānyataḥ purāṇānāṃ vaktraguṇānugaṇabalābalavibhāge sūcite kīṃ(kiṃ) devatāparaṃparāṇaṃ 
kīṃ(kiṃ) guṇa<p97a., f87b/91b., l1>kena brahmaṇā proktamiti viśiṣya jijñāsāyām agneḥ śivasya 
māhātmyamityādi kena ca tamoniruktatatvāvabodhena nirmitatvāt tāmasāni śaivapurāṇā<l2>ni apramāṇatvena khyāpitāni na 
tveteṣāmaprāmāṇyamāpādayatīdameva vacanaṃ taivādhyaṃ kiṃ na syāt bhūyasāṃ bili(balī)yatvāt brahmaṇa(.......)vaśyakatve 
purā<l3>ṇānāṃ ca keṣāṃcit tadavasthāyāṃ tena nirmitatvena tāmasatve idameva ca vacanaṃ tāmasaṃ kiṃ ta syāt| ucyate (–) tadeva 
vacanavirodhāt teṣāṃ bādhaḥ <l4> kiṃ tu parasparavirodhādeva kṛtsnapurāṇā(ṇānā)marthanirnā(rṇā)yakatvaśaktivarahe sati kiṃ 
tāni kasyetyojyāni iti kānicit svīkāryāṇītyapekṣā<l5>yāṃ satvādimūlatvalakṣaṇavaiṣajyaparamidaṃ vacanam atetānaya 
bhūyasāṃ balayastayāsyādhaḥ udāhṛtavacanasyā(-)pavādakābhāvāt yo <l6> ha khalu vā vāsyetyādimaiddhāyaṇāya śrutyā tattat 
guṇatvena hi hitasya tattaddevatāviśeṣasya pratipādakānāṃ prabandhānāṃ tattat guṇamūlatva<l7>(..........)rūpeṇa (....) 
sāmarthyo svatassiddhasya prāmāṇyasya stha(sthi)rīkaraṇācca nāpprāmāṇyahetubhūtatamomūlatvaśaṅkāpīti atrodāhṛtamātsyava(-)
<l8>(...........)sarvatra purāṇānāṃ virodhena prāmāṇyopapādana[pādana]paratvavyavasthāpanayā 
tadvirodhāddevatāvatparamaśivasaṃhārarudravivekāva <p97b., f88a/92a., l1> (....)ṣā(..........)purāṇānāmaprāmāṇyātto 
na iti sva eva (.......)ṇaiva putravat pareṣāṃ  gatimabhipretyāha| <l2> (.....)nyādhikya(.....)ṇāṃ vidadhīta| 
purāṇānāmamātsyagatimabhidadhau kalpabhidayā| tadaprāmāṇyatvaṃ mahimavacasāṃ vakti vaca ityasabhyā<l3>nasthāne mukharayati me 
(....) paśupate| ayaṃ bhāvaḥ udāhṛtaṃ vacanajātaṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ parasparasmāt utkarṣaṃ vibhāvya<l4>tāṃ purāṇānāṃ 
