pasa<l4>(...)dvipapṛthivyāstu rājarājo bhavettu sa iti varāhapurāṇādiṣu taddānapraśaṃsanāt dvayena vyavasthāpayati||47||

mahābhogābhogaśriyamiha manaḥ śuddhiḥ <l5> hitāṃ maheśatva(...)pūjāphalamupāśantyāgamavidaḥ| paratra brahmendraprabhṛti padamāstāṃ 
tadakhilaṃ tava sthāne divye sahajagaṇanādhai (thai)rviharaṇam|| atha niśreyase <l6> abhyudayavat utkarṣā(-)pakarṣāsaṃbhavāt tatra 
śivārādhanasyantaraṅgopāyatvadarśanena (...)tāntarārādhanādviśeṣamapi vyavasthāpati|| <l7> paraṃ yattat brahmāvyayasume śeṣau 
pariṣadaśrutivyūhodgītaṃ tadapi ca tavopāsanaphalam| upāye'tra jñānaṃ khalu śivaviśuddhātmaviṣayaṃ prasādāde<l8> vai tat bhajati 
sukṛtī ko'pi bhavataḥ|| iha yadyapi| aśubhakṣayakartāraṃ phalamuktipradāyakam| yadi yo'nyāṃ pramuñcāmi taṃ prapadye maheśvaram| 
yo brahmāṇaṃ vidadhā<l9>tīmāṃ (.....)māṃśca prahi(......)| taṃ ha deva devamātma(-)buddhiprakāśaṃ mumukṣurvai śaraṇamahaṃ prapadye| 
ajāta ityeva kaścit bhīruḥ prapate| <p103b., f94a/98a., l1> (...........)| sadyojātaṃ prapadyāmi 
sadyojātāya vai namaḥ| bhave bhave nātibhave bhajasva māṃ bhavodbhavāya namaḥ| ityādi śrutiṣu śivaprati<l2> (.....)nasya 
adha(tha) haimanaṃ bra(......)hmaucuḥ kiṃ japyenāmṛtatvaṃ brūhīti sahovāca yājñavalkyaḥ śatarudrīyeṇati| etānīha vā amṛtasya 
nāmadheyāni| etairhavā <l3> amṛto vai tīti jābālaśrutau tannāmārta tasya tvameva sarvajagatāmīśvaro baddha(ndha)mokṣayoḥ| 
tatvā(ttvā)marcanti kuśalāḥ prapannārtiharaṃ gurum| iti bhāgavate'ṣṭamaskandhe tadadvacanasya <l4> yat 
pādapadumahatāmanolibhirniṣevyate brahmara(....)vārthabhiḥ| iti caturthaskandhe tadupāgatasya| yasyānavadyaṃ caritaṃ maharṣiṇo 
gṛṇantyavidyāpaṭalaṃ <l5> pibhitsava(...)tīti tṛtīyaskandhe puravarjayakālakūṭasaṃharaṇāditaccaritopalālanasyāpi mokṣahetutvaṃ 
pratipāditaṃ tathā śruti(-)smṛti(-)purāṇeṣu viṣṇvarcana<l6>tannāmakīrtanāderapi tatra taddhetutvaṃ pratipāditaṃ dṛśyata iti vikalpo 
viśiṣṭaphalatvāditi nyāyena vikalpaṃ prāpteti tathāpyavidyāstamayarūpe mokṣe <l7> vidyaiva sākṣāt sākṣātsādhanena ca 
tāmantareṇa kasyāpi mokṣa iti śrutinyāyābhyāmavadhāritatvāt tadanyeṣāṃ tatsādhanatve pramāṇāni 
paraṃparāsādhanatvābhiprā<l8>yāṇi varṇanīyāni tatra ca śivārādhanaṃ vidyādvārā tatra hetuḥ atra hi jantoḥ prāṇeṣūtkramamāṇeṣu 
rudrastārakaṃ brahma vyācaṣṭeti jābālopaniṣadāditva<p104a., f94b/98b., l1> vimuktopāsanā prasāditācchivāt 
saṃsāratārakapraṇavarūpamahāvākyārthajñānalābhapratipādanāt sa no devaḥ śubhayā smṛtyā saṃyunaktviti mantravarṇena 
mocakasākṣātkārasya <l2> tatprasādalabhyatvadarśanācca atra hi smṛtiśabdena mocakaḥ sākṣātkāra eva vivakti 
smṛtipratibhedasarvagrandhī(thī)nāṃ vipramokṣa iti śrutyantare tatra tasya prayogadarśanāt| <l3> 
vismṛtaka(....)vāmīkarapratibodhakavākyajñānajanyayat tasya prāptārthaviṣayatve namaskāraye tvānna śikṣaya idyādāviva tatra 
smṛtiśabdasya lakṣaṇopapatteśca viṣṇvārādhanaṃ tu <l4> jñānasādhane'pi vārāya na pravartanadvāreṇa mokṣopayogī| oṅkāraṃ 
rathamāruhya viṣṇuṃ kṛtvā ca sāratham| brahmalokapadānveṣī rudrāya na tat paraḥ| iti <l5> amṛtaupaniṣamantravarṇanāt 
oṅkārābhiprasādena viṣṇoścaiva prasādaḥ| rudrārādhanavāñcanā syāt tadārādhanatatparaḥ| jñānamānandamadvaitaṃ paraṃ 
brahmādhi<l6>gaccha tatastvāṃde ta(...)pabrahmaṇācca| (...) tvāmanāśritya viśva(....)nna yogī māmupeṣyatīti krame viṣṇuṃ 
prativacanācca yasyāhamanugṛhṇāmi hariṣyetatdhanaṃ śanaiḥ| ato dhanaṃ <l7> tyajantyena sthāno duḥkha(........)tādivacanairapi 
viṣṇuprasādasya nirvedatvāya sāmānyato mocakajñānasādhanapravṛtyupayogitvopadeśācca iti| <l8> (....)sāda(....) paryaṅka(-)
nyā(.....) kāma(.....)pravartate mahāśāstraḥ kuṇḍādīnāṃ hitāvaham| iti strīśūdrādi ukāro bhāgavate daśamaskandhe darśitaḥ| 
<l9> (......)bhavet| yatra strīśūdradāsānāṃ saṃskāro vaiṣṇava smṛtaḥ| evaṃ sūtasaṃhitādiṣu ca tantrā(-)ṇāmadhikāri<p104b., 
f95a/99a., l1> viśeṣapratipādanaṃ draṣṭavyam| yattu (....)ṣṭha laiṅge| matta(.....)ṇenaiva matpūjā ca kṛtā tvayā| tayā 
na prītavānasmi tava śāṇḍilya me priyaḥ| kumārgeṇāpi śāṇḍilyakṛtā <l2> pūjā ma(........)ataḥ 
(........)gamiṣyasīti pāñcarātradīkṣā praviṣṭaṃ śāṇḍilyaṃ prati bhagavato nindāvacanam| taccaturvedeṣu paraṃ śreyo labdhvā 
śāṇḍilya imaṃ <l3>śā(......)tavātitipa(......)śravaṇāt| sati vaidikamārgādhikāre taṃ vihāyānyatra praviṣṭa 
ityaucityābhiprāyaṃ na tu tadaprāmāṇyābhiprāyam| ko vā varṇāśramācāraṃ <l4> śrauta(.....)vinā raktaḥ pāpabalātyakto nāsti 
te niṣkṛti śrutau| iti tatraiva sphuṭīkaraṇādityalamatiprasaṅgena|  etenāgameṣu pāñcarātrasya balīyastvaṃ <l5> brūvā(....) 
pratyuktarītyā(....)dārthasārasaṃgrahātmakānāṃ kvacitapi doṣaśaṅkākaluṣarahitānāṃ śaivāgamānāmeva sarvāgamebhyo balavatvavyavasthite| 
<l6> eva(.....)pavarṇi(......)rnyaiḥ śivapurāṇānāmeva śrutismṛtyāgamānāṃ sarvataḥ prābalyasya yajñalepāyitatvena taistasyaiva 
sarvakāraṇatvasarvāntaryāmi<l7>tvā(....)sthitau tadanurodhena devatāntarotkarṣaparāśrutyādayo netavyāḥ| na tvatra 
vaiparītyacodyāvakāśa iti siddham|| syādetat bhavatu prabalaśrutyādyanu<l8>rodhena sarvaṃ tadindra te vaśe ityādyarthavādamātrasya 
tāvakatvenānyadhā (dhā)nayanam| subālopaniṣadādiśrutiṣu gītāviṣṇupurāṇādiṣu ca sṛṣṭiprayogādi<p105a., f95b/99b., 
l1>prakaraṇeṣveva nārāyaṇasya yat sakalabhuvanasargapralayasvatantra(-)tvasarvāntaryāmitvādirūpaparamaiśvaryapratipādanaṃ tasya 
kadha(tha)manyadhā(thā)nayanaṃ kartavyamiti tat prakāraṃ vyutpādayati||48|| <l2>

tavaiśvaryaṃ ca trīṇyapi tadavatāreṣvapi paraṃ daṃśatvenaikyāt paramupadiśanti śrutigiraḥ| amūṣāmetāvanmunibhiruditaṃ bhagavanna budhvaike 
maugdhyāt bhramatamasi majjanti vividhe|| <l3> ayaṃ bhāvaḥ brahmaviṣṇugīrīśaśca śrīśambhorakhileśvarāt| na bhidyante 
tadaṃśatvādavatārā hareriva| evaṃ satyavatārasya kṛṣṇādeḥ kīrtane yadhā(thā) tadīyatvena kīrtyante <l4> mahāviṣṇo guṇā(....) 
evaṃ śivasya kīrtyante tadaṃśe(....)ṣvakathādhipāḥ| sarvakartvasarvāntaryāmitvapuramukhā guṇāḥ| sarvabhūtāni kaunteya prakṛtiṃ yānti 
māmakīm| kalpakṣaye <l5> punastā na kalpādau visṛjāmyaham ityādayo'bhitādipaṭhitā kṛṣṇasūktayaḥ| tasmiṃstenaiva rūpeṇa 
na yujyante tadha(tha)ñcana| tasmāttasya jaganmūlamūlamūrtyai<l6>katādhipā| imāḥ sūktaya(.....)svīkartavyaṃ parairapi| tathā ca 
prabalairmānairjaganmūle viniścite| śāmbhave rūpa evāsāṃ bhāvaviśrāntiriṣyatām| <l7> evaṃ ca sati sat (............) 
jñānaṃ tadaiśvaraṃ(śvaryaṃ) divyaṃ yathāvadviditaṃ tvayā| svayameva hṛṣīkeśaḥ prītyo vā ca sanātanaḥ| gaccha gaccha svakaṃ sthānaṃ na 
<l8> śākaṃ kartumarhasi bhajasva parayā(.....)śivamiti bhagavān bādarāyaṇo bhagavadgītāmaiśvaraṃ jñānamabhyayāt| yacca sa 
nārāyaṇo'pi <p105b., f96a/100a., l1> (......)tanayo hariḥ| ajñāna(......)kṣāt dattavānidamuttamam| 
itīśvaragītānte bhagavadgītāṃ tadarthagradha(tha)nātmakāmācaṣṭaṃ yacca bhagavadgītāsu bhagavān nijamūla<l2>(...)rūpapradarśanaṃ 
(......) śivaṃ viśvātmakaṃ rūpaṃ pradarśayat| yadapi kāmaistairhṛtajñānāḥ prapadyante'nyadevatāḥ| antavattu phalaṃ teṣāṃ tat 
bhavatya<l3>pati medhasām| a(............)ye janāḥ paryupāsate| ityādivacanānvitaṃ gītāśāstramāntaṃ śrutvāpi 
sthito'smi gatasandehaṃ kariṣye vacanaṃ tavediśā<l4>strānte guruṃ pratyuktvāpi pārthaḥ śivabhaktirato yāvajajīvam avartata 
yadapi bhāratayuddhamadhye pārthaḥ śaṅkarāyopakalpitaṃ nityapūjopahāraṃ <l5> vā deve'rpayitvā kailāsagatau adhi śivapārśve 
paśyattadetatsarvaṃ saṃgacchate rājavat gītopavarṇitajagatkāraṇatvādimahimajāta<l6>sya (..........)vasāyitve 
tasyaiśvarajñānatvasya īśvaragītārthagradha(tha)narūpatvasya cidrūpābhiprāyeṇa jagatkāraṇatvādivarṇitaṃ tadrūpapradarśa<l7>naprārthane kṛṣṇasya 
śaivarūpapradarśanaṃ ca śiva(....)ryavastimeva jagatkāraṇatvādikaṃ vāstavabhedadṛṣṭyā kṛṣṇenāhaṃ sarvasya prabhava ityādinā 
svakīya<l8>tvena nirduṣṭamiti tadabhiprāyaniścayena śivasya sarvotkarṣāvadhāraṇādarjunasya yāvajjīvaṃ tasmin dṛḍhabhaktiyogasya 
cābhedaniścayasatvena śivabuddhyaiva <p106a., f96b/ 100b., l1> vāsudeve śivapūjādravyārpaṇāt tasya nijābhāvānurodhena 
karābhyāśe'rdarśanasya ca sāmañjasya syātispaṣṭatvāt tadevaṃ gītopavarṇitasya parabhāvasya śiva(-)paryavasāyitva<l2>niścaye 
anenaiva nyāyena subālopaniṣannārāyaṇānuvākādiśrutiṣu ca varṇitasyāpi parabhāvasya śivaparyavasāyitvaṃ draṣṭavyaṃ nirṇītaṃ ca 
vaiṣṇavaśrutipurāṇādiṣvapi <l3> jagatkāraṇatvādiparabhāvapratipādanasya śive paryavasānaṃ bhagavatā parāśareṇa utkarṣo yaḥ purāṇeṣu 
dṛśyate vaiṣṇaveṣu tu asau tatvātmanā viṣṇorna <l4> svarūpeṇa sattamaḥ|
 
sarvakāraṇamīśānaḥ sāmbaḥ satyādilakṣaṇaḥ| 
na viṣṇurna viriñciśca na rudro nāparaḥ pumān|| iti| 
śrutayaśca purāṇāni bhāratādīni sattama|
śivameva sadā(*)sāmbaṃ hṛdi kṛtvā bruvanti hi||(*) <l5>
 
iti ca evaṃ sūtasaṃhitādiṣvapyukto'rtheṣu vacanāni draṣṭavyāni| subālopaniṣadi nāya(nārāya)ṇasya 
mahāsargādikārikatvopa<l6>varṇana...paryavasāyitvaṃ tu paroktarītyā tat prāpitaṃ sargādyasamayamadhye śivasya 
tatkālavartitvavidhāyinā yadātama iti śvetāśvataraḥ <l7> (....)ṇāpi(......)prāgeva tadevamṛṣibhirapyanumodikaṃ 
sukhenāvirodhanayanamārgamapaśyatāmevānyadhā(thā)kalpanāvijñābha(pa)ṇānī<l8>(......)laśloke śruti(....)ṇāyāmapyupalakṣaṇam|| 
(....) sarvatraivaṃ nārāyaṇasya jagatkāraṇasyādyupavarṇitasya <p106b., f97a/ 101a., l1> (..........)tohaṇārāṇa 
āsīnna brahmāne(.....)tyādinā brahmeśānādisarvetaravyavacchedena ekasyaiva nārāyaṇasya sargādau <l2> (...)va tato 
bhūtendriyādiprapañcotpattiṃ ca pratipādya adha(tha) punareva nārāyaṇa(...)nyatkāmo manasā dhyāyata tasya dhyānāntasthasya 
lalāṭātsvedopatattā imā āpa<l3>stāsu tejo hiraṇmayamaṇḍamabhavatta(.....)brahmā caturmukho jāyatetyādinādha(tha) punareva 
nārāyaṇaḥ so'nyatkāmo manasā dhyāyata| tasya dhyānāntasthasya lāṭāt tryakṣaḥ <l4> śūlapāṇiḥ puruṣo jāyatetyādinā ca 
brahmaśivayorapi tatsraṣṭṛtvopavarṇanasya śive paryavasānāsaṃbhavāt| na cātra śivasṛṣṭyukteḥ saṃhārarudra(-)viṣaya<l5>tvenāvirodhāt 
nārāyaṇasya sraṣṭṛtvopavarṇanasya paramaśive paryavasānaṃ saṃbhavatīti vācyam| upabrahmaṇavirodhāt tadhā(thā) hi 
āsīdanta(nti)mo bhūtamaprajñā<l6>tamalakṣaṇam| avṛttakamanīrdeśyaṃ prasuptamiva sarvataḥ| tata(taḥ) svayambhūrbhagavānavyakto 
vyañjayantīdam| mahābhūtādivṛttau jāmaprādurāsīttamonudaḥ| yo'sāvatīndriyo'<l7> grāhyaḥ sūkṣmo vyaktaḥ sanātanaḥ| 
sarvabhūtamayo cāntyaḥ sa eva svayamudbabhau| so'bhidhyāya śarīrārdhāt sisṛkṣurvividhāḥ prajāḥ| apa eva sasarjādau tāsu 
vīrya<l8>mavāsrajat| tadaṇḍamaveddhaimaṃ sahasrāṃśusamaprabham| tasmiñjajñe svayaṃ brahmā sarvalokapitāmahaḥ| āpo nārā iti proktā 
āpo vai narasūnavaḥ| tāyada<p107a., f97b/101b., l1>syāyanaṃ proktamanena nārāyaṇa smṛtaḥ| 
ityādimānavavacanametacchrutimūlakam| atrodāhṛtopaniṣatprakriyaiva kariṣyamāṇanāmanirvacanasūcitaṃ nārāyaṇa svayaṃbhu<l2>diśabditaṃ 
prastutya tasya mahadādipariṇatavīryatvoktyā pradha(tha)maṃ bhūtendriyasargaṃ saṃkṣepeṇa pradarśyānantaraṃ sṛṣṭiprakārādyabhidhyānaṃ 
svaśarīrāt salilasṛṣṭiṃ tanma<l3>dhye'ṇḍasṛṣṭiṃ tatra brahmasṛṣṭiṃ coktvā tanmukhebhyaścaturbhyastu viśeṣotpattipratipādanadarśanena 
mūlamūlibhāvasya spaṣṭatvāt||

nanvatra nārāyaṇanāmanirvacanaṃ sannihi<l4>tatvājjalamadhye aṇḍotpannatvena kliptāvayavaśaktikatvācca brahmaṇyevānveti na 
tu sraṣṭani svayaṃ bhuvīti nodāhṛtopaniṣanmūlatvaṃ yujyate na ca sanni<l5>dhānāt prakīraṇa(.....)balīyastvāt| prakaraṇini 
sṛṣṭaryevatadanvayastatrāpi mahājalaughasṛṣṭyuktisāmarthyasiddhatanmadhyanivāsasadbhāvādavayavārthakli<l6>pteriti vācyam| tasyātra 
praka(...)ṇitve pradhānena tat pratipādayiṣyayāṃ liṅgādyadarśanāt| bhūtagrāmasya sarvasya hyutpattiṃ pralayaṃ tatheti maharṣīṇāṃ 
<l7> prapañcoktiṃ pralayapraśne hi tannirūpaṇāya āpīdidamityādi pravṛttaṃ na tu ya(...)bhūtagrāmasyotpattiryasmiṃśca prabhavastaṃ 
sraṣṭārāvadeti praśne <l8> tanni(.......) sannidhānena nārāyaṇanāmanirvacanasya brahmaṇyevānvayo yuktam| tasyāpi purāṇeṣu 
tannāmaprasiddheḥ <p107b., f98a/102a., l1> (.......) na vyavasthānānna brahmaṇaḥ sannidhānamasti kiṃ ca 
(.....)pāvaināsūnava ityatra naraśabda tasyāpāṃsraṣṭustato'pi sannidhānāt <l2> tatraiva tannirvacanāyo yuktaḥ na 
brahmaṇāyattatkāraṇamavyaktaṃ nityaṃ sadasadātmakam| tadvisṛṣṭaḥ sa puruṣo loke brahmeti kīrtyata iti tadanantaraṃ śloke 
tatsaṃjñāvidhāyake <l3> saṃjñiviśeṣaṇavaiyyarthyāpanneścātra saṃjñāvidhānasraṣṭuviṣayatve ānantaryā(-)dvitīyasaṃjñāpi tadviṣayeti 
śaṅkā vāraṇāya saṃjñiviśeṣaṇamitivat saṃjñā <l4> dvayasyāpyekaviṣayatve tat prayojanāsaṃbhavāt|
 
mahāpralayakāle tu sṛtadāṇḍittamomayam| 
prasuptamiva cātakyam aprajñātamalakṣaṇam|| 
tata(taḥ) (*)svayambhuravyaktaḥ prabhavaḥ puṇyakarmaṇām|(*) <l5>
vyañjayannetadakhilaṃ prādurāsīttamo nudaḥ||
atīndriyaḥ paro vyaktāt antaryāmī sanātanaḥ|
nārāyaṇa iti <l6> khyātaḥ sa eva svayamudbhabhau||
svaśarīrādabhidhyāyan sisṛkṣurvividhāḥ prajāḥ|
apa eva sasarjādau tāsu vīryamapāklajat||

tadevāṇḍaṃ saṃbhavaddhema<l7>rūpamayaṃ jagat| tatra brahmā saṃbhavikṣvāda(...)tsyavacane samānārthe sṛṣṭaryeva nārāyaṇapadaprayogasya 
nissaṃśayatvācca| bahvarthaikarūpadarśa<l8>nena mānavavacanānāṃ mahopaniṣanmūlatvaniścayena tadanurodhenāpi nārāyaṇapadanirvacanasya 
tatratyanārāyaṇapadaprayogaviṣayaviṣayatvā<p108a., f98b/102b., l1>vaśyaṃbhāvācca tathā ca tata(taḥ) svayambhu(-)
rbhagavānityādinā prastute deve apa eva sisarjādau tāsu vīryamapāsṛjadityetadvacana(-)
sāmarthyasiddhajalanivāsapravṛttinivṛttanārāyaṇapadanirva<l2>canaṃ nārāyaṇapadavācyārthena prasiddha eva sṛṣṭatvapratipādanasya paryavasānaṃ 
gamayati| anyatra paryavasāne pravṛttinivṛttānurodhena nārāyaṇapadasyāpi tatraiva paryavasānāva<l3>śyaṃ bhāvena prakṛtivirodhāpatteḥ| 
evaṃ copabrahmaṇānurodhādudāhṛtopiniṣadi sraṣṭṛtvapratipādanasyāpi nārāyaṇa eva paryavasānamabhyupagantavyam| ahaṃ 
catvatmu<l4>khāmbhojāt kalpānte ghorarūpadhṛk| śūlapāṇirbhaviṣyāmi krodhajastava putraka iti kaurme nārāyaṇaṃ prati 
śivavacanadarśanāt tadanusāreṇa tasya lalāṭā<l5>tryakṣaḥ śūlapāṇirityatra tasyetyasya nārāyaṇa eva paryavasānāvaśyakatvācca 
nanvatvevaṃ tathāpyavāntarasargaviśeṣe kasmiṃśca caturmukhasyaiva nārāya<l6>ṇasyāpya(....)saṃbhavāt udāhṛtopaniṣṭastadviṣayatvena 
caritārthatvāt na paramaśivasya mūlakāraṇatvavirodha iti cenna asya nārāyaṇāt bhūte <l7> (....)disṛṣṭerapi 
pratipādanadarśanena mahākalpādisargaviṣayatvāt eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīditi sarvetaravyavacchedena 
sargādyasamaye'vasthānapratipā<l8>(.....) rasa(..)sya kalpanāyāsāmañjasyācca nanu sarvāṇyākhyānāni pāriplave śaṃsatīti 
sarvākhyānakhasaṃsavidhervārthaśeṣaśrā<p108b., f99a/103a., l1>nteṣu manu(.......) dvyākhyāna(.....) eka ityasya na 
brahmā neśāna ityādivākyaśeṣopāttabrahmeśānādimā (....)vyavacchede paryavasānasaṃbhavā<l2>(...)kiñcidasa(...)miti cenna 
prathamaśrutasya vākya(....)nārthena saṃkocāyogāt eṣa vāvaprathamo yajño yajñānāmityatra jyotiṣṭoma(-)
syānyasarvayajñaprā<l3>dha(tha)myasyā(......)nāṃ jyotiṣṭomapa(......)sya vā vidheyasya yo vai trivradanyāyajñā kratūpi 
māpadyate sa tandrīpayatītyādivākyaśeṣeṇa ka stoma<l4>kratumātrasaṃkīrtanānurodhena saṃkocasya kiṃ lakṣaṇe nirākaraṇāt 
pāriplave sarvāṇyākhyānānītyādividhyanantaraṃ pāriplavamācakṣateti punarvidhāna<l5>rthakaṃ parihārāya 
vākyaśeṣaśrutaviśeṣaniyamārthamityavacchedakapunarvidhiśrutyanurodhāt saṃkoco na tu vākyaśeṣe viśeṣasaṃkī<l6>rta(...)mātrānurodhena iha 
tu sarvetaravyavacchedena siddhasyāpi brahmādivyavacchedasya punaḥ saṃkīrtanastāvat kṛtvenopapadyata iti na tasya 
saṃkocapāda<l7>nasāmarthyam| tasmādeko ha vā ityādimahāsargādyasamaye sarvetaravyavacchedenāvasthānapratipādanaparasya nārāyaṇā(-)
danyatrāparyavasāyitvānna sārvatri<l8>kastvadīyākastvadīyā dharmavirodhanayanaprakāra ityāśaṅkya tannayanaprakāramapi 
vyutpādayati||49||

samutpannastvattaḥ prathamamasahāyastatayituṃ <p109a., f99b/103b., l1> jagatsaṃhartāraṃ puruṣamaravindāsanamapi| purā 
śrākṣīllakṣmīpatiriti mahatyopaniṣadā yaduktaṃ tādṛkkṛtvayi na bhajate paryavasatim|| satyamiha nārāyaṇasya sraṣṭṛtvapratipādanaṃ 
<l2> tat svarūpābhipāyeṇaiva pravṛttaṃ paramaśivamūrtau na paryavasyati kiṃ 
tvastidhātorutpatyavasthāntargatasattākhyadvitīyabhāravikāravācitvena mīmāṃsakairvyavasthāpanāt <l3> lohito 
rohitādvāsukīyuddhyustasya suto bhavadityādiprayogadarśanācca eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīditi vākyaṃ brahmeśādyutpatteḥ pūrvaṃ 
sargādyasamaye nārāyaṇa<l4>sya kākinaḥ (....) śiva(..)prādurbhāvaparamiti vyavasthāpitasya tasya sakalajaganmūlakandatvasya na 
kaścidvirodhaḥ brahmādīnāṃ nārāyaṇasṛṣṭatvena pratipādayiṣyamāṇatayā <l5> pāriśeṣāt paramaśivasyaitadutpattau 
hetukartṛtvenānvayalābhāt āsīdityasyotpatyarthatve eka ityavadhāraṇasya utpattimaditaramātravyava<l6>cchedakāritayā (...) 
paramaśiva(-)sadbhāvapra(....)kṣapāsāmarthyāt kathañcitsāmarthyasadbhāve'pi eṣa vāvaprathamo yajña iti jyotiṣṭomasya 
sarvayajñaprā<l7>(.....)rṇadā sāhyāmiṣṭvā so(.......)taradarśanāt saṃkocavat trimūrtyuktirnasarvamūlabhūtaparamaśivamūrtisadbhāva(-)
pratipādanaparā<l8>neka śrutiviro(....)saṃkoce tu (......) paramate'pi nityasūrisamarthanasaṃrakṣaṇāya 
tasyānādimuktetaramātravyavacchedaparatvasya <p109b., f100a/104a., l1>vaktavyācca ya(....) tasmāt tatra tatra 
kālasaṃsargādiparo'pi loke vede ca prayo[go] dṛśyate tathāpi prabalādekaśrutyantarānurodhādihāpyupasaṃhāre nārā<l2>ya(....)prakriyā 
pratya(......)na prāptibra(....) yaṇādi(....)viśiṣṭaparaḥ śivopāsanā tātparyānurodhāccātra paramaśivāt prādurbhāvapara eva tat 
prayogaḥ| <l3> ata evopa(........)āsīdityasya sthāne prādurāsīttamonuda iti tamo'dhiṣṭhātuḥ paramaśivāt prādurbhāva 
uktaḥ| na ca tamo'nudaya ityetā digupalakṣaṇaka<l4>pratyayāntakena prādurbhavitraviśeṣaṇameveti śaṅkyam| āsīdidaṃ tantamo 
bhūtamiti ślokena sargādau tamorūpeṇa jagadavasthānaṃ pratipādya tata(taḥ) svayaṃ<l5>bhurbhagavānityādinā 
ta(........)prādurbhūtatvenocyamānasya rūpasya pūrvasiddhatamo'(-)dhiṣṭhātṛtvāyogāt| tasya prādurbhavitṛtvaviśeṣaṇatvayo 
sāvityā<l6>dyanantaraślokasya saṅgatyāpatteśca| sa hyatīndriyā grāhyatvādidharmaviśiṣṭatvāt parameśvarāt prastutasya 
svayambhuvo bhedavyavacchedaparaḥ| ṣaḍviṃśatiri<l7>tyeva brūyāditi evakāropahatavidhiśaktikatayā tasya svayaṃ 
bhavitṛtvādyavidhāyakatayā tatra svayamudbabhāvityaṃśasya svayambhuriti pūrvaślokaparāmṛṣṭasvayaṃ bhavitṛtvadharmeṇa dharmānuvādaparatvāt| 
na ca likhilaprapañcaprakṛtibhūtamāyākhyatamo'dhiṣṭhātṛtvaparasya tamo'nuda ityasya svambhuviśeṣaṇatve <p110a., 
f100b/104b., l1> tasya parameśvarāt bhedaprasaktirasti na tadabhāvavyutpādanasye saṅgatirasti kācit| asmin pakṣe tu 
tamo'dhṭhāturīśvarāt svayaṃ bhuvaḥ prādurbhāvoktyā tato <l2> bhedaprasaktiḥ jīvasya svayaṃbhutvānupapatteḥ 
tasyāpīśvarābhāvenekeśvaravāda iti śaṅkā vāraṇāya tadabhāvaśca vaktavya iti tamo'dhiṣṭhātā  parameśvara eva 
upā<l3>dhiviśeṣakṛtena nārāyaṇamūrtyātmanā rūpāntareṇa sargādāvabhivyakta ityetada(-)bhiprāyānantaraślokaḥ saṃgacchatetarāṃ 
tasmāttamo'nuda iti pañcamī<l4> vivayaktatvena pañcamyantaṃ prādurbhāvayitṛparameva prādurbhāvāyitā ca 
praśaṃsitāramityādiśāstropasaṃhāraśrutaparabrahmanirṇayānurodhāt para<l5>maśiva eva pryavasatī(-)tyupasaṃhārasyāpyevamaikārthyaṃ labhyate| 
na ca svayaṃ bhuvaḥ prādurbhāvoktau na prādurbhāvayitrārti vyujyate viro<l6>dhāditi vācyaṃ taṃ pāraśyaṃ vinā 
svecchā(...)nāvibhāvatvaṃ hi svayaṃbhutvaṃ tacca prādurbhāvayitṛsadbhāve'pi na virudhyate| anyadhā(thā) ādityādibhyaḥ 
prādurbhū<l7>sya (.....) svayambhutvāpattaḥ evaścaikārthyāttasya vacane'pi damo nuda iti pañcamyantaṃ śivaparameva tadevaṃ 
nyāyopabrahmaṇābhyāṃ mahopaniṣado <l8> mahā(-)devā(......)pannasya nārāyaṇasya bhūtendriyapramukhasakala(-)
prapañcasargakāritvapratipādanaparatvānna kaścidvirodha eva nārāyaṇo <p110b., f101a/105a., l1> pa/yataṣadādiṣu 
ta(............)pi iyameva gatidṛṣṭasyā(...)nvevamapi kadhaṃ(thaṃ) sarvāvirodhopapādanaṃ yo brahmāṇamiti mantre yo 
devānāmiti mantraiśvaryade<l2>vānāmiti mantre vasa(...)la devotpatteḥ pūrvaṃ brahmaṇaḥ paramaśivādutpattipratipādanāt| ebhyo'tha 
viṣṇumiti śrutāvaṣṭamūrti brāhmaṇe ca tenaiva punarviṣṇurudrayo<l3>statsraṣṭrutvābhidhānāt| aṇḍaṃ hiraṇmaya(....) samudraṃ rudrasya 
vīryāt pradha(tha)maṃ babhūva tatra brahmā viṣṇurjāto jātavedā ityādiśrutau rudrasaṃjñasya devasya rūpe mūrtiḥ <l4>prajāyate| 

bhedakṣiptaṃ rase vīryaṃ paramūrtyabhimāninā| 
tadaṇḍamabhavadvīryaṃ sahasrakiraṇaprabham|| 
viṣṇustatprāviśatsākṣāt mama śaktestu vaibhavāt| 

punarnā<l5.>rāyaṇākhyāṃ meniyogāt prāptavānasāvidyādivāsiṣṭhalaiṅgadṛṣṭatadupabrahmaṇe ca brahmanārāyaṇayorudrasraṣṭrutvokteśca 
mahopaniṣadādi<l6.>prakriyayā brahmarudrayostaditaraprapañcasya nārāyaṇasṛṣṭatvanirdhāraṇāyogādityāśaṅkyāha||50||

kvacit kalpe vedhāḥ kvacidapi <l7.> hariḥ (...)pi ca haraḥ samutpannaḥ tvattaḥ pradha(tha)mamitarau nātha sṛjati| 

anenādhikyaṃ vā kadha(tha)mapi ca kaivalyamapi vā na| 
kasyāpītyāhurniyamagaṇaniṣkarṣanipuṇāḥ|| <l8.> atra bhagavān vāyuḥ| 
tapasā toṣayitvā taṃ pitaraṃ parameśvaram| 
brahmanārāyaṇā pūrvaṃ rudraḥ kalpāntare sṛjat||
kalpāntare punarbrahmā rudraviṣṇujaganmayaḥ|
viṣṇuśca (*)bhagavāṃstadvat brahmāṇamasṛjatpunaḥ||(*) <p111a., f101b/105b., l1.>
nārāyaṇaṃ punarbrahmā brahmāṇaṃ ca punarbhavaḥ|
evaṃ kalpeṣu kalpeṣu brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ||
paraḥ parasmājjāyante parasparajaye(*)ṣiṇaḥ|(*) <l2.>
tattatkalpāntavṛttāntamadhikṛtya maharṣibhiḥ||

prabhāvaḥ ka(dhya)thyate teṣāṃ parasparasamudbhavāditi teṣāṃ nyūnādhikabhāvavāde pratyavāyo'pi tenaiva darśitam|
 
ayaṃ <l3.>parastvayaṃ neti (...)hārābhiniveśinaḥ|
yātudhānā bhavantyeva piśācāśca na saṃśayaḥ|| iti

evaṃ ca yathā yadmuhyāṃ gṛhṇāti prayājebhytadyadupāgrati prayājānbhūyā<l4.>jebhyastaditi juhavasyaupabhṛtasya 
cājyasyāviśeṣaṇaprayājārthatvaśravaṇamatihāyetīrtho barhiḥ prati samānayate jihyāmaupabhṛtamiti juhyāmaupabhṛtājya<l5.>samāna(-)
yana(...)lasa(...)lāttat pūrvottaraprayājaviśeṣaviṣayatayā vyavatiṣṭhate evaṃ tatra tatra śrutipradeśe vidhāturviṣṇorasya ca 
sraṣṭrutvaśravaṇamudāhṛ<l6.>topabrahmaṇabalāt (.......) vyavatiṣṭhata iti na kiñcidvirodhaḥ| etena katipayaśrutipurāṇāni 
paṭhitāni| viṣṇorbrahmarudrakāraṇatvādivaca<l7.>nānyavalambya pa(..........)nteṣu viṣṇo(.......)samarthanaṃ nirastam| 
brahmarudrayorapi svasvetaraguṇamūrtikāraṇatvavacanānāṃ sadbhāvāt| yattu teṣāṃ tasya <l8.> satvopādhi(.........) 
tadapyayuktam| satvodatastato brahmā śūnyaṃ lokamavaikṣatetyanekapurāṇeṣu| yasya māyāgataṃ satvaṃ <p111b., f102a/106a., 
l1.> (...........) sa rudrasya na cāpara iti sūtagītā satvaṃ devā harādaya iti vasiṣṭharāmāyaṇe| tamūcurbhrātaro rudraḥ 
sevitaḥ sātvikairjanaiḥ| moca<l2.>(.....) pūjaye(........)brahmarudrayorapi satvayogapratipādanāt etena tāmasatvena rudrasya 
nikarṣapralāpo'pi mūrkhāṇāṃ galahastitaḥ| nirantaraṃ <l3.> dumukhāyaṃ saṃsāradvicira(...) raparivṛtti(....)tānāṃ jīvānāṃ 
kiñcit kālavikṣepavigamasamullasadātmānandānubhavena viśrāntuṃ saṃpādayitukāmasya tasya saṃhārāya me| graha<l4.>ṇasya 
duśca(.....) pīḍitānāṃ (...)ṇāśiśamayiṣoḥ śastragrahaṇasyeva nidānajñasya bhiṣajo rugṇe hiṃsāṃ prayuñjataḥ| na kiñcidapi 
naipuṇyaṃ ghṛṇaivātra <l5.> prayojiketi śivapurāṇoktanyāyena niratiśayakaruṇāmbudhitvaliṅgāt brahma(.....)dau 
guṇavaśyatvāsaṃbhavāt nidrālasyādestamaḥ kāryasya tatrāprasiddheśca <l6> tatra tamo (.....)mātreṇa tatpāravaśyasya 
śaṅkitumaśakyatvācca| yattu vārāhagāruḍādiṣu purāṇeṣveva guṇamūrtiṣu 
viṣṇorbrahmaśivakāraṇatva<l7.>sātvikādiviśeṣapradarśanenotkarṣasamarthanaṃ na tatrātīva hāraḥ kāryaḥ anyadhā(thā) kālikā(-)
khaṇḍādiṣu anilādapramukhairmaharṣibhisteṣu rudrasyotkarṣā<l8.>nirdhāraṇāt| yattāmasakalāleśagrahītastvaṃ payonidhau| nidrāparavaśaḥ 
śeṣa kathaṃ tvaṃ sātviko'bhavat| ityādi brahmāṇḍapurāṇādivacanācca| rudrasyāpyut<p112a., f102b/106b., 
l1.>karṣanirdhāraṇāpatteḥ| tasmāt sarvaṃ praśaṃsāmātraparamityalamalakṣyalakṣīkaraṇena na tasmāt trayo'pi phalāttulyā eveti 
sāram|| atha trayāṇāṃ taulya<l2.>samarthanaprasaṅgāt rudrotkarṣapakṣamapi sopapatti(-)mupanyasyati||51||

haraṃ kecit prāhurdruhiṇamadhujitbhyāmapi paraṃ kvacittābhyāmasyodbhavakathanamapyaṃśaviṣayam| <l3.> tvadaupamyaṃ 
nāmākṛticaritaveṣaprabhṛtibhi(.......)bhagavan|| kecinmaharṣayaḥ| parātparataro brahmā tatparāt parato hariḥ| tat parāt parato 
<l4.> īśa ityādiśrutipradeśajñāḥ| padmaviṣṭarādviṣṭaraśravasaśca smaraharamadhikamāhuḥ| tadhā(thā) hi bhagavān parāśarastāvat|
 
devatābhyaḥ samastābhyaḥ hraṣṭā brahmā (*)parasmṛtaḥ|(*) <l5.>
brahmaṇaśca mahāviṣṇuḥ puruṣassarvapālakaḥ|| 
viṣṇorapi paraḥ sākṣādrudraḥ saṃhārakārakaḥ| iti smṛtigītāsu|
sūto'pyāha (–)
paramātmavibhāga tvaṃ (*)brahmādīnāṃ dvijarṣabhāḥ|(*) <l6.>
sāmānamapi rudrastu variṣṭho nātra saṃśayaḥ|| iti

evaṃ brahmaṇo hṛdaṃ viṣṇurviṣṇorapi śiva smṛtaḥ| śivasya hṛdayaṃ sandhātenopāsyā<l7.> (....) tu pūrako muktayaḥ kumbhako 
viṣṇurucyate| recakastu tathā jñeyaḥ kṣarākṣaraparaḥ śiva ityādiṣu kāśyapasmaraṇagītāsārādiva ca <l8.> (.....) ṣṭavyāni| 
yattu kvacit kvacit brahmaṇaśrīpatervā tasya āvirbhāvavarṇanaṃ tadapi tadaṃśaviṣayaṃ vadantītyāha| kvaciditi <p112b., 
f103a/107a., l1.> (.........) mamaṃ ghoraṃ tate| viprāścaturmukhaḥ| 

sṛṣṭyarthaṃ brahmaṇastasya bhruvo ghrāṇasya madhyataḥ| 
avimuktābhidhāddeśāt svakīyāttu viśeṣataḥ|| <l2.> 
(...........) vedāntavittamāḥ| 
aṃśabhūto mahādevaḥ sarvadevanamaskṛtaḥ||
ardhanārīśvaro bhūtvā prādurāsīt kṛpānidhiḥ| iti

amumevārthaṃ saṃgraheṇāha| <l3.> rājadharme bhagavān parāśaraḥ| sṛṣṭyarthaṃ brahmaṇaḥ putro lalāṭādutthitaḥ prabhṛtiriti laiṅge ca 
śilādaṃ prati śaṅkaraḥ| 

tasya hṛtkamalasthasya niyogādaṃśajo (*)vibhoḥ|(*) <l4.>
lalāṭaṃ tasya nirbhidya prādurāsīt prabhormukhāt||

iti aṃśaḥ paramaśivasya saṃhārarudrastato jātastadekadeśavibhāgarūpa iti yāvat| <l5.> evaṃ ca yadvāyusaṃhitāyām| 

nirdiṣṭaḥ parameśena maheśo nīlalohitaḥ| 
putro bhūtvānugṛhṇāti brahmāṇaṃ brahmaṇo'nujaḥ|| iti

paramaśivaniyogā<l6.>drudrasya brahmaṇaḥ putrabhāvenāvirbhāvavarṇanam| yaccādityapurāṇādiṣu tvāmeva putramicchāmīti prārthayamānāya 
tasmai dattavaraparipālanāya na <l7.> tastadāvirbhāvavarṇanaṃ tadaṃśaviśeṣāvirbhāvābhiprāyamevaṃ draṣṭavyaṃ teṣveva mahākalpādau 
paramaśivādutpannatvena mahāsaṃhāraparyantasthāyitvena na ca varṇitasya <l8.> tasyāvāntarakalpeṣu pādmavārāhādiṣu punaḥ 
punarupasaṃbhavena teṣu pratyavāntarakalpaṃ tadāvirbhāvavarṇanasya tadaṃśaviśeṣaviṣayatvasyāvaśyavaktavyādevaṃ <p113a., f103b/ 
107b., l1.> tasya lalāṭatryakṣaḥ śūlapāṇiḥ puruṣo jāyata bibhratsatyaṃ brahmacaryaṃ tapa iti pratipāditasyāpi raudrāvirbhāvasya 
droṇaparvaṇi tatā pārśve vṛṣāṅkasya brahmacā<l2.>ryapyavartata piṅgākṣastapasā śreṣṭho bhagavānnīlalohita iti kailāse 
śrīkaṇṭhapārśve'vasthānoktyā paurāṇikavyavahāro'pi aṃśāvatārābhiprāya eva| evaṃ ca yat <l3.> kvacit kvacidrudrasya 
pitāmahānnārāyaṇādvā nikarṣavarṇanaṃ tadapi tattadāvibhūtasyāṃśaviśeṣasya sthāṇvādiśabditasya rāmakṛṣṇādyavatārāṇāṃ 
tadarathavasudevādibhya iva lokadṛṣṭyā <l4.> nikarṣābhinayaparam| viṣṇupitāmahayostu mūlarūpeṇāha| rudrānnikarṣaḥ kaurme 
kṛṣṇāt kṛtā cetthaṃ vyavasthā| <l5.> sūtasaṃhidhāraṇarūpataḥ| svavibhūtyātmanaḥ cāvikriyātāmeva sevanaṃ rudra(draḥ)svenaiva rūpeṇa 
viṣṇośca brahmaṇatayāni kuryāt sevanaṃ viprā vivṛte vātayo na <l6.> ca kevalaṃ kṛpayā rudro lokānāṃ hitakāmyayā| 
svavibhūtyātmanā viṣṇorbrahmaṇaśca parasya vā| karoti sevāṃ he viprāḥ kadācitsatyamīritamiti <l7.> kvacidaupamyamiti 
ekādaśaślokavyākhyāne etadarthaḥ prapañcitaḥ| tadevaṃ trayāṇāṃ madhye rudrovika ityaparaḥ pakṣaḥ| ayameva nikhilaśaivāṅgīkṛtaḥ 
<l8.> pa(.........)rudrayorapi vyavasthitā(-)nāmapi guṇacaritānāṃ pratyāsakti(-)viśeṣadṛṣṭyaiva paraḥ parasminvyapadeśaḥ sarvatra 
dṛśyate ye <l9.> (...........)janti (...........) ayaṃ parastvayaṃ cetyādivacanam| yo brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ 
bhedamuktamabhāvataḥ| sādhaye <p113b., f104a/108a., l1.> (............)kasmṛtivacanādaikārthyāt 
parāparabhāva(.....)kabhedavyavasthāpanavyasane pratyavāyodghāṭanaparaḥ na tu vāsu<l2.>devasaṃkarṣaṇādīnāmiva satye vā bhede 
(....)vyaktiviśeṣakṛtatāratamya(-)pratipādane'pi na kaścidvirodhaḥ||
āstāṃ prasaṅgāgataviśeṣaṇāntaravicāraḥ| sarvadhā(thā)pi <l3.> bhagavānumāsahāyaḥ paramaḥ śivaḥ sarvo(...)raḥ siddha iti sa eva 
sarvairniṣe(...) iti sarvottaratvasya sdhā(sthā)panaṃ tatsādhyamarthamupadarśayannevopasaṃharati||52|| <l4.>

trayāṇāṃ devānāṃ bhavatu samamaiśvaryamadha(tha)vā bhavetveṣāṃ madhye bhavabhayaharasthāṇuradhikaḥ| prasannaḥ tvaṃ tāvat paramaśivasarvottara 
iti tvamevaikaḥ <l5.> sevyo bhavasīti khilasyāpi jagataḥ|| iti śrīśivatatvaviveke śrīsadāśivasya viśvādhikatva(-)
vyavasthāpanam||| syādetadastvevamuktayā rītyā kāmaṃ sarvottaraḥ <l6.> śivaḥ| tathāpi sarvasevyatvaṃ nāsya sidhyati tāvatā 
vidhānāt phaladānādvā kaścitsevyata kenacit| yathā kalatreṇa patiryathā bhṛtyena bhūpatiḥ| yasya sevā na <l7.> vihitā na 
ca viśrāṇane ratiḥ| tasya sannapi notkarṣaḥ sevyatve syāt prayojakaḥ| na hyutkṛṣṭa iti strīṇāṃ bhavet sevyaḥ paraḥ pumān| 
na vā lubdho'rthināṃ rājā <l8.> satyanyasmin bahuprade| iti mandadhiyāṃśaṃ kārmukhajalpairdṛḍhīkṛtām| śche(che)ttuṃ 
vyavasthāpayati sarvasevyatvamiti tu||53||

tvamekaḥ sarveṣāṃ puramadha(tha)na(*)sevyo janimatā(-)(*) <p114a., f104b/108b., l1.>
     majānantastve tat bataviphalayantyāyuradhamāḥ| 
manuṣyā(ṣyāḥ) devānāmiva tava sadevāsuranarā(-)
     śrutāsyete jīvāḥ paśuvadupabhogyāḥ paśupate||

evaṃ sa devāsura<l2.>manuṣyādīnāṃ sarveṣāmapi svasvocitena karmaṇā śivārādhanamāvaśyakamiti sthāpitam| adhunā teṣvapi 
surāṇāṃ nareṣu varṇānāṃ ca liṅgārcārūpaṃ sāmānyato manuṣyāṇāṃ svasvā<l3.>dhikārānurodhena stutinamaskāra(-)
pūjādhyānahomādilakṣaṇabhajanarūpaṃ ca śivārādhanamāvaśyakamiti darśayati||54||

maheśa tvalliṅgārcanamapi ca nityaṃ diviṣadāṃ 
     caturṇāṃ <l4.> varṇānāmapīha munivacobhiḥ praviditam| 
manuṣyāṇāṃ dharmaḥ para iti yathā svādhikṛti te 
     padāmbhojadvayā paricaraṇamityapyadhigatam||

manuṣyeṣvapi sarveṣu viśeṣeṇa (*)dvijanmanām|(*) <l5.>
śaraṇaṃ śambhupādābjamityetat saṃpradṛśyate||55||

dvijānāṃ gāyatrī khalu paramupāsyā niyamitā 
     prasiddhastasyāśca tvamasi <l6.> bhagavaddaivatamiti|
akurvāṇasyātastavacaraṇasevāṃ dvijapaśo(-)
     ravastrālaṅkāraḥ sakalamapi satkarmacaritam||

dvijātiṣvapi brāhmaṇānāvidhāntareṇa <l7.> śivabhajanāvaśyakatvaṃ darśayati (....)dagnau viprāṇāmupadiśanti śivaṃ 
yada(.....)tadantaryāmitvaṃ taruṇaśaśibhūṣaṃ pra(......)śrutismṛtyāmnātaṃ vacananiku<l8.>rumba(.........)bhūyatvā(-)
ṅgiri(.......)daivaṃ vadati naḥ|| antaryāmitvena rūpeṇa (.....)hmaṇānāṃ śivabhajanamāvaśyakamityuktam atha 
svarūpeṇāpi<p114b., f105a/109a., l1.> teṣā(..........)kaliyugotpannānamiti darśayati||57||

gatistvāprāptānāṃ puraharajaniṃ brāhmaṇakule viśeṣādetasminyuga iti <l2.> purāṇeṣu viditam| atastyaktvaiva tvāṃ 
(......)matirupāseyamaparaṃ sa vipra(........)pīyān bhavatamapi daivaṃ na labhate|| evaṃ dharmādhikṛtasaṃsāritvopādhinā 
śrutyādibahi<l3.>jñāsiddhayāvat sva sva kṛtyānuṣṭhānena śi(.......)prīṇanalakṣaṃ varṇopādhinā liṅgārcanalakṣaṇaṃ 
manuṣyatvopādhinā yathādhikāra(-)stutinamaskārapūjādirūpa<l4.>bhajanalakṣaṇaṃ dvijanmatvopādhinā kaliyuge (....)natvo(-)pādhinā 
ca prapadanalakṣaṃ ca śivārādhanamasmadādīnāmāvaśyakamiti vyavasthāpitam| atha yo yatkiñcit phalamarthāyate tasyāpi tadarthaṃ 
śivārādhanameva kartavyamiti sāmānyatastadvyavasthāpayati||58|| <p115a blank)

<p115b., f110a.,) (in sideheading gaṇādhipataye namaḥ, śivajñānabodhavyākhyānam, 
l1.> (................) ca gaṇeśāya kārtikeyāya dhīmate||

||prathamasūtram||

strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvājjagataḥ kāryadarśanāt|

asti kartā sa hṛtvaitatsṛjatya<l2.>(............)puṃ napuṃsakādītyatra ādiśabdena prakāravāci bhuvādayo dhātava ityatra 
vyākaraṇasūtreṇa śabdasya prakāravācitvenāpi vyākhyānāt| prakāraścātra śabdasyārtha<l3.>prapañcavicitvapakṣe saṃsthānaviśeṣaḥ 
avayavasanniveśaviśeṣa iti yāvat| śabdaprapañcavācitvapakṣe tu prakāratvena svarūpaṃ vivakṣitam| atra pañcamī lyablope 
prāsādamāruhya <l4.> praikṣata ityarthe prāsādāt prekṣata iti prayogavat| strīpuṃnapuṃsakādisaṃsthānatvaṃ prāpya pratīyamānasya 
jagato'rthaprapañcasya kartāsti| atra jagadviśeṣaṇajagato <l5.> vaicitryapratipādanena tatkarturvicitrajñānavatvasiddhyarthaṃ 
jagacchabdasya śabdaprapañcaparatvapakṣe strīpuṃnapuṃsakasvarūpaṃ prāpya pratīyamānasya nādabindvātmakasya jagataḥ <l6.> kartāsti 
ādivaktāstītyarthaḥ| yadvā| pañcamī tṛtīyārthe strīpuṃnapuṃsakarūpapratīyamānasya jagataḥ kartāstītyanvayaḥ| yadvā 
strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvājjagata ityekaṃ padaṃ <l7.> strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvāt prāpnotīti strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvāt| strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvācca 
jagacca tattathā tasyetyarthaḥ| yadvā strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvāditi hetuṃ dvitīyā jagataḥ saṃsthāna<l8.>viśeṣatvāt kartāstītyarthaḥ| 
hetvantaramāha kāryadarśanāditi| kāryapadaṃ kāryatvaparaṃ kāryatvaṃ hi aṅkurādau dṛśyata eva tathāpi jagataḥ kāryatvāt 
kartāstītyarthaḥ| athavā <p116a., f110b., l1.> strīpuṃnapuṃsakāditvena sāvayavatvena hetunā prathamaṃ jagataḥ kāryatvaṃ 
prasādhyate na sakartṛkatvaṃ prasādhyata iti bodhyam| atra parārthanumāne vyāptaḥ prasiddhatvena <l2.> sādhakānumāna 
ivodāharaṇapradarśanam| sa ca kartā etadubhayavidhaṃ jagaddhṛtvā sṛjati yat asmāddharaḥ haraśabdavācyaḥ prabhuprabhavanaśīlaḥ patiriti 
yāvat| patirhi śaktyātmanāvasthitasya vṛttirūpeṇa rakṣaṇaṃ karoti| <l3.> satkāryavādasvīkārāt| śaktyātmanāvasthānaṃ ca 
jagataḥ pralaya eva| tadānīmevopādāne vilayāt| pralayo hi pañcavidhaḥ nivṛttikalāsthitatvatvabhuvanalayarūpa ekaḥ 
pratiṣṭhākalāsthitatatvabhuvanalaya <l4.>rūpo'nyaḥ vidyākalāsthita(-)tatvabhuvanalaya itaraḥ| śāntikalāsthitatatvabhuvanalayarūpo 
paraḥ| śāntyatītakalāsthitatatvabhuvanalayarūpo mahāsaṃhāro nāma pañcamaḥ pralayaḥ| evaṃ pañcavidha<l5.>pralayānāṃ kartā hara eva 
paraśiva eva kartā san patiriti kadhya(thya)te ityarthaḥ| patitvaṃ hi svato jagati pañcavidhakṛtyakāritvam| tatra 
sṛṣṭisthitisaṃhārarūpatrayakāritvaṃ prathamasūtre uktam| <l6.> puṃsāṃ tirodhānānugraharūpakṛtyadvayakāraṇatvaṃ tu dvitīyasūtre 
vyaktam| ataścarācarātmake prapañce pañcavidha(-)kṛtyakāritvāddhara eva patiḥ| na brahmā na ca nārāyaṇa iti nirgalitārthaḥ| 
<l7.> evaṃ coktānuguṇyena yojanā jñeyeti prathamasūtram||

dvitīyasūtre tu harasya cetanācetanaprapañcāpekṣayā tirodhānānugrahalakṣaṇakṛtyadvayakāritvaṃ pratipādyate|| <l8.>
(.........)sārataḥ| 
karoti saṃsrataṃ puṃsāmājñayā samavetayā||

anya iti vyāptito'nanyaḥ cetaneṣu vya(...)neṣu svarūpavyāptivaśādananyaḥ abhinnatayā pratīyamānaḥ ka ityatra hi 
<l9.> (............)traka eva pratīyate| vyañjanayogena nādhikamtrakaḥ| evaṃ śivopyaṇuṣu tadabhinnatvena ca pratīyata 
ityarthaḥ| ayamanyaḥ sanneva kevala<p116b., f2a/111a., l1.>(..........)vyāptyā nityo bhavati| tādṛśaḥ kartā 
puṃsāṃ sakalapralayākalavijñānakalabhedabhinnānāmaṇūnāṃ saṃsratiṃ bhoktṛtvalakṣaṇatirodhānaṃ 
<l2.> (...............)rūpasahakārikāraṇenājñāparaparyāya svasamavetavicchittirūpakaraṇena ca karoti| bhuktiṃ muktiṃ ca 
prayacchatītyarthaḥ| evaṃ ca vyāptito nanyaḥ sa <l3.> na kartā karmānusārataḥ| samavetayājñayā ca puṃsāṃ saṃsṛtiṃ karoti| 
saṃsṛtigrahaṇamupalakṣaṇaṃ mukterapi| evaṃ ca bhuktimuktiṃ ca karotīti phalita ityarthaḥ| sahakārikāraṇaṃ <l4.> karma hi 
dvividhaṃ dharmādharmabhedena| tadapi kāyikavācikamānasikabhedena trividham| punarapi karma trividhaṃ sañcitaṃ prārabdhamāgāmi ceti| 
pūrvajanmasvanekeṣu ārjitaṃ sañcitam| <l5.> tanmadhye pakvadehāvārambhakaṃ karma prārabdham| tadapi trividham| icchāprārabdham, 
anicchāprārabdham, parecchāprārabdhaṃ ceti| punarapi prārabdhaṃ trividham| janakaṃ, dhārakaṃ, bhogyam| <l6.> prārabdhabhogakāle kartāraṃ 
śivaṃ vinā svakartṛtābhimānenānuṣṭhitamāgāmikarma| evaṃ trividham| karma prakārāntareṇa pañcavidham| laikika(-)vaidikā(-)
dhyātmikā(-)timārgika(-)māntrikabhedena pañcadhā| tatra <l7.> laukikaṃ 
nivṛttikalāsthitabhuvanabhogaprāpakamiṣṭāpūrtādismārtakarmajanyam| pratiṣṭhākalāvyāptabhuvanabhogaprāpakaṃ vedavihitayāgādijanyaṃ 
vaidikam| vidyākalāvyāptabhuvanabhogaprāpakaṃ <l8.> vedoditopānājanyamādhyātmikam| śāntikalāvyāpta(-)bhuvanabhogaprāpakaṃ 
yogābhyāsajanyamārgikam| śāntyatītakalāvyāptabhuvanabhogaprāpakaṃ jñānābhyāsa<p117a., f111b., 
l1.>viśeṣajanyamāntrikamiti bodhyam| ājñārūpā cicchaktiśca vastuta ekaiva kāryabhedādādiśaktiriti parāśaktiriti 
icchāśaktiriti jñānaśaktiriti kriyāśaktiriti pañcadhā vyavahrīyate| tathā vāmā jyeṣṭhādi<l2.>bhedenāpi vyavahrīyate| tathā 
paraśive śaktiriti vāgīśvare vāgīśvarīti sadāśive manonmanīti īśvare maheśvarīti rudre raudrīti viṣṇau śrīriti brahmaṇi 
sarasvatīti vyavahrīyate| patipadārtho hi layāvastho bhogāvastho'<l3.>dhikārāvastha iti eka eva tridhā vyavahrīyate| para(-)
nādapara(-)bindupara(-)nādāparabindusadāśiveśvararudraviṣṇubrahmarūpeṇa nava bhedo vyavahrīyate| catvāra ādito bhedā niṣkalāḥ 
pañcamastu niṣkalasakalaḥ| <l4.> anye catvāraḥ kasalāḥ| nanvekasya sadāśivasya sakalaniṣkaladvairūpyaṃ kathayati cet 
satyam| udyogakalāsāhityena sakalatvasya adhikāramalarāhityena niṣkalatvasya virodhāsambhavāt|| paśupadārthaśca <l5.> 
prasāryate||

neti ta iti indriyaviśiṣṭāyāntanvāmaṇurastīti yojanā tata hetavaḥ|| neti tomamatodrekādakṣoparatibodhataḥ| svāpe nirbhogato 
bodhe boddhṛtvādastyaṇustanau|| <l6.> netītyādinā kathyate| neti naḥ nāstīti niṣedhāt niṣedhajñānādvā ite iti padaṃ hi 
uṇśaktinindupañcamyantāttasilajñānavāci| niṣedhe hi niṣidhyamānasaṃsargātiriktapratiyogītvacidastyeva| tathā <l7.> ca 
jīvaśārīre aṇuniṣedhe anyatra tatsattayā bhāvyamityaṇusiddhiṃ ca bādhāddeha eva sidhyatīti bhavāḥ| mamato(-)drekāditi mamatāyā 
madīyatābuddhe rudrekādutkarṣāt mamaśabdādavyayāttasilamama <l8.> (..........) prati yogyaṇurāvaśkam| akṣoparatibodhataḥ 
akṣāṇāmindriyāṇāmuparatervigamanasya bodhato jñānāt svayaṃ cakṣurnaṣṭaṃ śrotraṃ ghrāṇaṃ <l9.> ve(..........)ndriyavattā ca| 
indriyoparatigrāhake indriyādarśanāt| ātmanaścetanatvena svaparaprakāśatayā tat bodhaḥ sulabha iti <p117b. f3a/112a., 
l1.> pratha(..........)bhinnatayā cāṇusiddhiḥ| jīvaśśarīre bhūtasaṃghāta(-)viśeṣeṇa vādibhyo 
(...)daśaktivaccaitadbhūtisvīkṛtirapyuktai vā<l2.>(........)patteradarśanena tathā kalpanāyogāt iti| svāpe nirbhogata iti 
svāpe suṣuptau vaiṣayikasukhasya duḥkhasya tu anubhavābhāvāt| dehasyātmatve <l3.> hi puṣpatalpaśayānasya kāminayāśliṣṭasya 
tadā bhoga(gaḥ) syāt| atīndriyasya indriyasya dehātmavāde anaṅgīkāraṇena tat sahakārivirahāt| bhogavirahasya 
vaktumayuktatvāt| aṇordehabhinnatve hi svāpe sukha<l4.>mahaṃ svapsyāmīti sukhabhogo'styeva| vaiṣayikasukhādyanubhūtistu 
atīndriyendriyādisahakārivirahādeva na sañjāyate| na hi dehabhinnātmavāde prayakṣadṛṣṭagolakāderevendriyatvamiti| <l5.> bodhe 
boddhṛtvāditi| ukta evārtho'nvayamukhenaiva prasādhyate| tasmāddehendriyabhinno'ṇurjīvaccharīre āvaśyaka iti sa 
cāntaḥkaraṇādapyaṇuranya iti prasādhayannaṇusvarūpaṃ <l6.> vivṛṇoti||

ātmāntaḥkaraṇādanyopyanvito mantri bhūpavat| 
avasthāpañcakasthasyānmalaruddhasvadṛkkriyaḥ||

ātmeti malaruddhasvadṛkkriyaḥ malenāṇavamalena śakyā ruddhe svasya dṛkkriye <l7.> jñānakriyāśaktī yasya saḥ tathā 
malaśabdena māyikakārmikayorapi grahaṇaṃ bodhyam| tayorarpadṛktayāvaraṇadragandhīkāratvāttādṛśa ātmā antaḥkaraṇā(-)
nmanobuddhyahaṅkāralakṣaṇādvidyā <l8.> lakṣaṇādantaḥkaraṇāccānyaḥ mama manaḥ mama buddhiḥ mamāhaṅkāraḥ mamāvidyeti 
teṣvapi mamatodrekadarśanāt| evaṃ tadanyo'pi mantribhūpavadanvitaḥ antaḥkaraṇānvita eva sva sva kṛtyeṣu <l9.> pravartate| 
jāgare hi bāhyendriyairantaḥkaraṇaiśca saṃyukto bhogāya pravartate| svapne tu bāhyendriyaparityāgenāntaḥkaraṇasaṃyuktaḥ suṣuptau tu 
buddhipari<p118a., f3b/112b., l1.>tyāgena sūkṣmāvasthā manorūpādviviktena prāṇādiprarakeṇāhaṅkāreṇa saṃyuktaḥ 
turyāvasthāyāmatītāvasthāyāṃ ca sarvendriyasaṃvalato rājeva śuddhāntakakṣyā nidrākārayannirvṛttiriti vaktuṃ 
mantri<l2.>bhūpavaddṛṣṭāntoktiḥ malaruddhasvadṛkkriyātmā antaḥkaraṇādanyo'pi mantribhūpavadanvitaḥsan avasthāpañcakastha syāt| 
jāgratsvapnasuṣuptituryaṃ turyātītokhyāvasthāpañcakavat bhavediti nirgalato'rthaḥ| atrā<l3.>malaruddhasvadṛkkriya iti padena na 
malarodhaśaktikarmamāyābindvākhyapañcavidhapāśasvarūpaṃ sūcanayā nirūpitaṃ bodhyam| malo hi tuṣakambuka(-)tāmrakālikāsamāno 
nāditare koṇuḥ dṛkkriyācchādako nīhārā<l4.>ndhakārā(-)jñānādipadavācyaḥ| aṇurhi ātmatvāt sarvajñaḥ īśvaravat| tatsārvajñaṃ 
kenacidācchannaṃ sadaprakāśamānatvāt| sa cācchādakomala eva| sa ca nānāśakti(-)bhinnātmāvārakaḥ| māyā tasyāḥ <l5.> 
kālaniyatikalāvidyārāgādihetunānyathāsiddhatvāt sa ca malaḥ muktisamaye'pi dīkṣayā na nivartate| ekamukteḥ 
sarvamuktiprasaṅgāt| kiṃ tu tacchaktaya eva nivartante| adha(tha)vā mantreṇa viṣaśaktivat <l6.> kuṇṭhitāṃ nīyate| evaṃ 
malasvarūpam||

rodhaśaktistu bhagavacchaktireva| sā ca svabhāvato'nugrahakāriṇyapi pāśānuvartanādeva rodhaśaktyupacaryate|| karma tu dharmādharmalakṣaṇaṃ 
buddhiga<l7.>taṃ tacca śuddhādhvani(-)baindava(-)puryaṣṭakavṛttisat śuddhakarmetyucyate| śuddhetarādhvani māyeya(-)kalādyānyātmā 
śuddhapuryaṣṭakavṛttibhogaprāpakatvāt pāśaḥ|| māyātvaśuddhā jaḍā<l8.>(..........)rā āvārakatvāt pāśaḥ| māyāto hi 
bhūtabhaviṣyadvartamānavyavahārahetuḥ kālo jāyate| śuddhādhvani tu śuddho baindavaḥ kālaḥ| kālā<p118b., f113a., 
l1.>nantaraṃ māyāto niyatiḥ| sā ca karmāṇi kartureva phalapradā nītādyeṣāmiti niyamanahetuḥ| tadanantaraṃ māyātaḥ kalā 
jāyate| sā pāṇoḥ kriyāśaktyabhivyañyañji(....)tadanantara(.....)ṇo jñānaśaktyabhivyañjikā vidyā|| <l2.>

tadanantaramicchāśaktyabhivyañjako buddhidharmavilakṣaṇo viṣayābhiṣvaṅgajanako rāgaḥ kalāto jāyate| tadanantaraṃ 
kālādirāgāntapañcakamadhyayogādātmāpuruṣatatvākha(khya)(....)labhate| tato māyātaḥ kalādvārā prakṛti jā<l3.>yate| tasyāḥ 
satvarajastamolakṣaṇāḥ sukhaduḥkhamohajanakāstrayo guṇā(ṇāḥ) jāyante| te ca guṇāḥ prakṛteratyantābhinnatvāt putrapratigrahaṇenāpi 
gṛhyānte| guṇataḥ prakṛtito buddhiradhyavasāyikā mahadākhyā <l4.> jāyate| tasyāśca bhāvāṣṭakaṃ dharma tatra 
dharmajñānavairāgyaiśvaryāṇi sātvikāni| avairāgyaṃ rājasam| adharmajñānānaiśvaryāṇi tāsamāni| evaṃ hi 
dvicatvāriṃśacchaktivaryabhedabhinnāḥ pratyayā api <l5.> taddharmāḥ| tato buddheḥ sātvikarājasatāmasabhedena taijasa(-)vaikārika(-)
bhūtādi(-)nāmāsvahaṅkārāḥ tatra taijasāhaṅkāre śrotra(-)tvak(-)cukṣuḥ(-)jihvā(-)ghrāṇanāmāni pañca jñānendriyāṇi 
manaścāntarindriya<l6.>mupapadyate| vaikārike tu vāk(-)pāda(-)pāṇi(-)pāyuḥ(-)upasthākhyāni pañca karmendriyāṇi prāṇavāyuśca 
jāyante| bhūtādya(-)haṅkārāttu tanmātra(trā)ṇi jāyante| tatra śabdatanmātrādākāśaḥ| sparśatanmātrādvāyuḥ| <l7.> 
rūpatanmātrāttejaḥ| rasatanmātrājjalam| gandhatanmātrāt pṛṣvī| tatrākāśasya śabda eka eva guṇaḥ| vāyostu śabdasparśau| tejasaḥ 
śabdasparśa(-)rūpāṇi| jalasya śabdasparśarūparasāḥ| pṛthivyāḥ śabdasparśarūpa<l8.>rasagandhāḥ pañcāpi guṇāḥ| evaṃ 
kālaniyatikalāvidyārāgapuruṣaprakṛtiguṇabuddhyahaṅkāracittakarmendriyapañcajñānendriyapañcatanmātrapañcabhūtātmakānyekatriṃśattatvāni 
jāyante| tatra nivṛtti<l9.>kalāsthe pṛthvītatve aṣṭottaraśatasaṃkhyāni bhuvanāni| pratiṣṭhākalāstheṣvaghvādiprakṛtyantatatveṣu 
ṣaṭpañcāśatsaṅkhyāni bhuvanāni| vidyākalāstheṣu puruṣādikalāntatveṣu saptaviṃśati<p119a., f113b., l1.>bhuvanāni| 
evamuktabhuvanatatvātmikā śuddhādhvopādānā māyā|| mahāmayā bindurucyate| sā ca śuddhātmikā nityā śuddhādhvopādānabhūtā sā ca 
śabdātmikā|| mahāmāyātaḥ śāntyatītā śāntirvidyā pratiṣṭhā<l2.>nivṛttayaḥ pañcakalā jāyante| nādabindvakṣaramātṛkāśca| 
tatra bindoḥ śivatatvaṃ prathamamutpadyate| tatra catvāri bhuvanāni| śivatatvādanantaraṃ bindoḥ śaktitatvamutpadyate 
tatraikādaśabhuvanāni| śaktitatvādanubindoḥ <l3.> sādākhyatatvam| tatraikaṃ bhuvanam| sādākhyā(-)danantaramīśvaratatvam| 
tatrāṣṭabhuvanāni| īśvaratatvādanantaraṃ śuddhavidyātatvam| tatra nava bhuvanāni| iyaṃ ca mahāmayā aparamuktyanuguṇāpi 
paramuktyananukūlatvāt pāśa <l4.> ityucyate| evaṃ pañcapāśasvarūpanirūpaṇaṃ saṃgraheṇa bodhyam| evaṃ sūtradvayena paśupadārthaḥ 
pāśapadārthenasaha pratyavādi| atha uktapaśupadārthaprerakatayā <l5.> patipadārthasya vikāritvamāśaṅkya nirākaroti pañcamasūtreṇa 
vindantīti||
 
vindantyakṣāṇi puṃsā tu na svayaṃ so'pi śambhunā| 
tadvikārī śivaścenna kānto yo vatsa tannayet|| 

akṣāṇīndriyāṇi <l6.> puṃsādhiṣṭhitāni santi śabdādiviṣayān vindanti jānanti| sa pumānapi tu svayamadhiṣṭhitāna| 
kiṃ tu śambhunā prerita eva| nanu śambhuścet paśuprerakaḥ| tarhi śivo'pi vikārī syāt| <l7.> na caivamavocaḥ| śivo hi 
karaṇānna prerakaḥ| kiṃ tu saṅkalpamātreṇa vastutastu sannidhimātreṇaiva kāntaḥ ayaskāntaḥ oyovadyathā 
svasannidhimātreṇaivāyamaprerayati| tathā sa śivo'<l8.>pi taṃ pumāṃsaṃ nayet prerayet sannidhimātreṇa na vikāritā bhavedityarthaḥ| 
evaṃ vikāritvanirākaraṇaṃ pañcamasūtreṇa| atra cendriyāṇāmadhiṣṭhātṛtvena paśusiddhiḥ| tatsiddhyā śivasiddhiśca <p119b., 
f5a/114a., l1.> (........) te cedīśvarāsiddhireva syāt| anumāne vedya(...)ścavasya ja(...)tā syāt 
(......)maṇorapi tatrānumānatocyate cedīśvarā(.....) syāt| nigamāgamā hi tatra mānaṃ <l2.> bha(......)roktatayā 
āptavākyatvena prāmāṇyaṃ vācyam| tacceśvarāsiddhau na saṃbhavati| īśvarasiddhirhi nigamāgamānāntaduktatvena prāmāṇyam| prāmāṇye 
ca tatprāmāṇyata īśvarasiddhirityanyonyā<l3.>śrayaśaṅkāṃ pariharati|| adṛśyaścedasadbhāvo dṛśyaścejjaḍimā bhavet| atrottaraṃ 
budhāḥ śambhorūpaṃ jñeyaṃ tathā viduḥ|| adṛśyaścediti| śivasyāṇorvā sva sva rūpamadṛśyaṃ cet pramā<l4.>ṇāgocarabhūtaṃ cet| 
asadbhāva syāt| dṛśyaṃ cecchivasyāṇorvā kvarūpaṃ labdhapramāṇavedyaṃ cejjaḍimā jāḍyaṃ bhavedityāśaṅkā tatrottaraṃ budhāḥ śmbho 
rūpaṃ tathā tadubhayado<l5.>ṣaparihāreṇa jñeyaṃ nigamāgamāditabuddhivṛttibhi(-)rvyaktacicchaktijñeyatayā viduḥ jānanti 
nigamāgamaprāmāṇyaṃ ca mahājanaparigrahādeva sugrahamiti nānyonyāśrayaśaṅketi bhāvaḥ|| <l6.> śivasvarūpaṃ hi 
dīkṣāpūrvakagurvanugrahanigamāgamaśravaṇapūrvakamanananididhyāsanasahakāreṇa bhāvanāt svānubhūtyā sākṣāt kurvantīti jñeyatvāt 
svaprakāśatvācca na tucchajapatvaśaṅketi <l7.> ṣaṣṭhasūtreṇa  pratyavādi|| evaṃ jñeyasya śivasya jaḍaprapañcasya jñātṛtvenāpi 
paśupadārthasiddhiṃ draḍīkaroti|| nāviccitsannidhau vetti na vittaste ubhe midhaḥ(thaḥ)| prapañca<l8.>śivayorvettā yaḥ sa ātmā 
tayoḥ pṛthak|| nāciditi| prapañcaśivayoryo vettā sa ātmā sa ca tayoḥ pṛthak tābhyāmanyarūpo bhavati| sadrūpaśivajñātṛtvāt 
sadrūpa ityasadrū<p120a., f5b/114b., l1.>paprapañcajñātṛtvādasadrūpa iti sadasadrūpatayā tābhyāṃ pradha(tha)k(g)bhūta 
ityarthaḥ| nanu śivasyācideva jñātrī bhavatu kathameva tat jñātṛtetyatrāha| nāciccitsannidhāviti| citsannidhau tejaḥ sannidhau 
tama ivācijjanyatvā<l2.>devāciccitaṃ na jānīyāt ityarthaḥ| evamacidīśvaro na vetti savikalpanayā na jānāti| 
yatsarvajñātṛtvaṃ tat prakṛtānupayogi tacca kālānavacchinnaṃ vivakṣitamiti bhāvaḥ| nanu śiva eva śivasyajñātā bhavatu kimiti 
tat jñātṛtā<l3.>ṇoreveti cenmaivam| nigamāgamajanyadhī vṛttibhirvyaktacicchaktyā jñātavya prakṛtatvāt| tādṛśajñānaṃ ca 
śivasya sva sva rūpe'pi nāsti| evaṃ svaprakāśatve'pi tādṛśacicchaktyā svajñātṛtvābhāvāt| tasmāt <l4.> pāriśeṣyāt 
prapañcaśivajñātṛtayātmana eva siddhiriti| citsannidhau śivasannidhau acinnāstyeva kuto vetti aciccataṃ te ubhe 
aciccitau jaḍeśvarau midhaḥ(thaḥ) parasparaṃ na vittaḥ na jānītaḥ| uktaprakāreṇa <l5.> prapañcaśivayorvaktā yastayoḥ pṛthak 
sa ātmetyanvayamukhatortho vijñeyaḥ| evaṃ saptamasūtreṇāpi pāriśeṣyādātmasiddhiḥ pratyavādītyevaṃ kevalāvasthāyāṃ <l6.> 
sakalāvasthāyāṃ ca paśusvarūpaṃ nirūpya śuddhāvasthāyāṃ paśusvarūpaṃ nirūpayitumupakramate||

sthitvā sahendriyavyādhaistvāṃ na vetsīti bodhaḥ| 
tāni tyaktvā śivā(*)nanyo dhanyaḥ prāpnoti tatpadam||(*) <l7.>

sthitveti guruṇācāryamūrtyavaṣṭaṃbhena śivena tacchaktipātānurodhena cākṣuṣīṃ sparśanīṃ mānasīṃ vai jñātrīṃ śāstradīkṣāṃ 
yogadīkṣā(.........)tatrā<l8.>(..........)sabījāṃ nirbījāmapi sadyo nirvāṇadāmasadyo nirvāṇadāṃ śivadharmiṇīṃ 
lokadharmiṇīṃ samayadīkṣāṃ viśeṣadīkṣāṃ ṣaḍadhvaśodhinīṃ nirvāṇadīkṣāṃ ca kṛtvā he vatsa<p120b., f6a/115a., l1.>tvaṃ 
vyā(..........)rāvadriyaiḥ saha sthitvā tvāṃ na vetsi na jānāsīti bodhitaḥ sannadhaguruṇā bodhito rājakumāraḥ 
kirātānivendriyāṇi tyaktvānanyaḥ śivohamasmīti tadātmyabhā<l2.>vanā vāddhanye śrutvā tatpadaṃ tādṛśaśivasamānarūpaṃ 
rājakumāro rājabhāvami(...) śivabhāvaṃ prāpnoti| śivabhāvo hi asaṅkucitajñānaiśvaryalakṣaṇaḥ| ataḥ śivajñātā śivatvaṃ 
pratipādyata iti <l3.> nirgalito'rthaḥ| evamaṣṭamena sūtreṇāṇoḥ śuddhāvasthā pratyavādīti bodhyam||

śuddhāvasthāmāpannasya karaṇīyamāha navamena sūtreṇa|| cidraśātmani dṛṣṭveśaṃ tyaktvā vṛttimarī<l4.>cikām| labdhvā 
śivapadacchāyā dhyāyet pañcākṣarīṃ sudhīḥ|| ciddraśati sa sudhīściddraśā cicchaktyā dṛṣṭyātmanīśaṃ dṛṣṭvā sākṣātkṛtyavṛtti(-)
marīcikāṃ saṃsāramarīcikā(......) <l5.> tīrtvā śivapadacchāyāṃ śivapadayormantramayayoḥ śaktimayayorvā 
caraṇayocchāyāmanātapabhavanaṃ labdhvā śivānugrahaṃ prāptveti yāvat pañcākṣarīṃ dhyāyet|| <l6.> śivohamasmīti bhāvayet| 
yadyapi svasmin śivatādātmyaṃ nāstyeva tathāpi so'haṃ bhāvanayā garuḍaikyabhāvanā mantrairviṣaśaktimiva malaśaktiṃ nirbhañjet 
sa sudhīriti bhāvaḥ| <l7.> pañcākṣaryārthadhyānamevam| namaḥ śabdena prabhavatvavācinā tādātmyabhāvanāmabhidhīyate| śivaśabdena 
śivaḥ tathā ca śivohamasmīti pañcākṣaryā dhyānaṃ bodhyam| evaṃ navamena sūtreṇa śuddhāvasthā<l8.>māpannasya  
karaṇīyamākhyāti||

daśamena sūtreṇa tatkaraṇīyaṃ samyagvivṛṇoti śivenaikyamiti|| śivenaikyaṃ gataḥ siddhastadadhīnasvavṛttikaḥ| malamāyādyasaṃspṛṣṭo 
bhavati| <p121a., f6b/115b., l1.> svānubhūtimān|| śivenaikyamiti| paraśivenaikyaṃ gataḥ jñātavān gatyarthetyādinā 
kartari ktaḥ gatyarthaśca dhātujñānārtho bhavatīti| nanvatraikyaśabdena tadevamiti| candrabimbapratibimba(-)vannirū<l2.>patvaritamaikyaṃ 
kiṃ jīvaśivayorhi vivakṣitam| athavāyaṃ corasthāṇuriti sthāṇucorayoriva bādhayaikyam| yadvā kanakakuṇḍalamiti 
kanakakuṇḍalavat pariṇāme(-)naikyam| kiṃ vā nīlamutpalamiti <l3.> nailotpalavat samavāyenaikyam| 
āhosvidayamapiṇḍāgnivadanyonyadharmasaṃkarādaikyam| vāpīvālajalaghṛtakṣīrakṣīranadīsamudralavaṇa(-)sasyavadapṛthagbhāvasaṃyogenaikyam| 
yadvā tilataila<l4.>vadanādisaṃyoge naikyam| athavā garuḍamāntrikayoriva tādātmyabhāvanayaikyam| kiṃ vā 
taptalohajalaplavallayavaśādaikyam| athavā mṛtpiṇḍayoriva vihitayojatakarmaṇaikyam| <l5.> yadvā 
araṇipāvakayorivānabhivyaktāvasthitayoraikyam| api vā dīpālokasaurālokayorivābhibhavavaśādaikyam| kiṃ vā kāmukakāminī 
vadānandānubhavavaśādaikyam| <l6.> athavā mitrayoriva mathasnehādaikyam| na tāvaccaturdaśsvamīṣu pakṣeṣu prathamapakṣaḥ saṃbhavati| 
māyāvādimatapraveśāpatteḥ| na ceṣṭāvāptiḥ| tanmatakhaṇḍanapravṛtta(-)bahyā<l7.>gamavirodhaprasaṅgāt| na dvitīyaṃ 
jīvaśivayoraikyatarabādhānaṅgīkārāt| na tṛtīyaḥ| ubhayoḥ pariṇāmānaṅgīkārāt| na caturthaḥ dvayoḥ samavāyasya śivaśāsane 
aprasiddheḥ| na pañcamaḥ <l8.> dvayoḥ dharmasaṅkarasya siddhāntairanaṅgīkārāt| nāpi ṣaṣṭhaḥ (.....) vibhyorakriyayoḥ 
saṃyogānupapatteḥ tata eva na saptamaḥ tadeva kadācidvibhāga(-)syāpi prasaṅgāt| nāpya<p121b., f7a/116a., 
l1.>ṣṭamaḥ tadva(...........)patteḥ| asatyaikyajñānasādhanaṃ tatvajñānatvenāpuruṣārthatvaprasaṅgāt| jīva(-)śarīraikyabhramasyāpi 
mokṣahetutvāpatteśca| nāpi navamaḥ asmiṃcchāsane <l2.> jīvaśivayorekalayasyānaṅgīkārāt| nāpi daśamaḥ 
saṃyogajanakarmaṇasāmyāpādakatve'pi aikyā(-)pādakatvānupapatteḥ| nityāsambandhayoḥ saṃyojanānupapatteśca| nāpyekādaśa|| <l3.> 
anabhivyaktasyābhivyaktimātreṇaikye khananābhivyaktakūpajalasya bhramyāsahaikyaprasaṅgāt| araṇau ca pāvakasyeva jīvasya 
kiñcidapi prakāśalopāpatteśca| nāpi dvādaśa| <l4.> jīvaśivasamānatvenānyonyābhibhavāyogāt| nāpi trayodaśa| 
ānandānubhavamātreṇa sphuṭabhedayoraikyānupapatteḥ| sadānandānubhave śive tadviparītadṛṣṭāntāyogācca| <l5.> na ca caturdaśa| tatra 
bhadasyātispaṣṭatvena aikyābhāvāt| carācareṣu sarvatra sadā snehavati śive kadācit snehamitradviṣā(dhā) yogācca| tasmāt 
kiṃ mānamiti ceducyate| <l6.> gaureva gavaya itivacchiva evāyaṃ jīva iti jīvaśivayoratyantasādṛśyamevaikyam| na ca 
sarvātmanā sādṛśyena upacaritaikyamevaikyaṃ syāditi vācyam| mukto'sau śivavadbhāti śiva <l7.> eva (...)nudvidha iti 
mataṅgādyāgamavarṇitanirmalacicchaktiyogasādṛśyasyaiva vivakṣitatvāt| yadyapi muktasyāpi sarvajñatvādiyogena 
pañcakṛtyakāritvāpattiḥ| tathā cānekeśvaravāda<l8.>prasaṅgeti cenna| na ca sṛṣṭyādi kurvanti svātmaniṣṭhāhite yataḥ| 
ityādyāgameṣu teṣāṃ sṛṣṭyādikartṛtvābhāvaśavaṇāt| na ca tarhi kṛtyādhikārīṇaśivādhikārarahitānāṃ muktātmanāmādhikyameva 
<p122a., f7b/116b., l1.> jātamiti vācyam| ānandānubhavasāmye'pi nigrahānugrahā kṛtyaṃ śivasyaiva| tatra hi 
muktapuruṣādādhikyam| rājadattamahāsaṃpadaḥ puruṣasya rājñaśca svamahābhogānubhavasāmye'pi vyāpti(-)rahi<l2.>tājñasya rājña 
evādhikyadarśanāt| yadyevaṃ rājña iva śivasyāpi paranigrahādikaraṇavyāpāreṇa duḥkhaprasaṅgo'pi syāditi cenna| līlayaiva 
prayāsarāhityena sannidhimātreṇaiva sakalādhikā<l3.>rakāriṇaḥ śivasya rājaduḥkhaprasaṅgānupapatteḥ| nanu śivasyevaṃvidhalīlākaraṇaṃ 
vā kimarthamiti cet prāṇiṣu paramakṛpayaiveti brūmaḥ| na ca svayameva malinānāṃ paśūnāṃ <l4.> punaḥ sṛṣṭyādinā malinīkaraṇe 
śivasya kathaṃ kṛpālutvamiti vācyam| sahajamalaśodhanāyāgaṃ tu malayojanasyādoṣatvāt| svato malinavastraśodhanakarajakādau 
<l5.> punargomayādināpi malinīkaraṇaprayogādarśanāt| paśūnāṃ prapañcasṛṣṭau saṃbhāvitabhogena karmakṣaye malaparipāke śaktipātena 
dīkṣayā paśūnāṃ malaṃ <l6.> nirasyataḥ śivasya paramakṛpārutve saṃśayābhāvāt| na ca mukteṣu kasyacidīdṛśīkṣatirastviti 
vācyam| tasya pūrvaṃ duḥkhamudramagnottīrṇasya punaḥ sukhāmbhodhimagnasya <l7.> līlākaraṇe'pyaprasaṅgāt| na ca 
niratiśayanityaśuddhaparamānandamahāsamudranimittasya śivasya līlākaraṇamaprasaktameveti vācyam| 
tasyānādipāramparya<l8.>pravṛttasṛṣyādilīlāvyāpārasyāparyanuyojana(-)tvāt| loke vai (.....)puruṣeṇa pāramparyakriyamāṇe karmaṇi 
tannāśe tadasannidhānena sāmarthyasaṃbhave <p122b., f8a/117a., l1.> tādṛ(....)nyasya vyāpāraḥ saṃbhavati| na hyatra 
śivasya nityavyāpakatvasya sadā śaktasya nāśasānnidhyaśaktayaḥ saṃbhāvya(....) tasmācchivasyaiva <l2.> 
sṛṣṭyādikartṛtvam| na tu muktasya| tathā ca muktaśivayornirmala(-)cicchaktiyogasādṛśyamevaikyam| vastutastu 
jīvaśivayoranādyantasamavāya elaityam| na cānayorjīvaśivayorvibhvo<l3.>ghaṭayorivādisaṃyogo vā tuṣataṇḍulayorivānādisaṃyogā 
vā ghaṭate| nāpi sasya lavaṇayorivādisamavāyo vā tilatailayorivānādisamavāyo vā <l4.> ghaṭate| kiṃ tu 
śivaśaktyorivādyantarahitasamavāya eva ghaṭate| anayorjīvaśivayoḥ samavāyasadbhāve anyaḥ san vyāptito'nanyaḥ puṣpe 
gandhavat, tile tailamiva sthita <l5.> ityādyāgamavacanaṃ pramāṇam| tathā caitadaikyajñānasvasvānandānubhūtimānityarthaḥ| 
tadadhīnasvavṛttikaḥ śivādhīnasvavṛttikaḥ tathā jñānavāniti yāvat| siddhaḥ śivayogī malamāyādyasaṃspṛṣṭassan <l6.> 
jīvanmukto bhūtvā svānubhūtimān bhavati| svakīyayā cicchaktyā paramaśivānandānubhūtimānapi bhavatīti kecit| jīvanmukto 
hi paramaśivānndamevānubhavatīti kecit| <l7.> ānandajalamagnatayā asaṅkucitasvātmadṛkkriyā(-)tmakaṃ 
svātmānandamevānubhavatītyanye| sarvadhā(thā) jīvanmuktaḥ paramānandānubhūtimān bhavediti tatvam| vastutastvādimuktasya 
svānandānubhava <l8.> evābhyupagantavyaḥ| na tu śivānandānubhavaḥ| śivatvānandasya svabhāvavimalasya 
svabhāvavimalaśivenānubhavayogyatvāt| malaruddhamuktajīvaśaktyānandasya malaruddhamuktajīvenaivānubhavo <p123a., f8b/117b., 
